		["Affraid not. Your days as a sanitation engineer are coming to an end"] = "别怕。你当环境卫生工程师的日子结束了。",
		["After the fall of Dalaran, I took my leave from the Kirin Tor. I spent years watching over Atiesh, only to have my purpose amongst the Kirin Tor taken from me in one fell swoop. I would find the staff, though it might take a lifetime. That is how I came to join the Argent Dawn and why I am here now."] = "达拉然陷落后，我离开了肯瑞托。我曾多年守护埃提耶什，却在顷刻间失去了自己在肯瑞托的使命。即使要花上一生，我也要找到那根法杖。我就是因此加入银色黎明，并来到这里的。",
		["Agent Skully, I need you to use the banshee's magic mirror on me again!"] = "史考莉探员，女妖的魔镜再对我用一次!",
		["Ah yes, Sironas. I had nearly forgotten that Sironas was here. I served under Sironas back on Outland. I hadn't heard of this abomination, though; those damnable draenei captured me before I even fully materialized on this world."] = "啊是的，赛罗娜斯。我几乎忘记赛罗娜斯在这里了。我以前在外域时为赛罗娜斯效命过。不过，我没听过这个憎恨的事那些该死的德莱尼在我根本还没完全成形前就俘虏了我。",
