		["Can you send me to Theramore? I have an urgent message for Lady Jaina from King Wrynn."] = "能替我捎个信吗？乌瑞恩国王有一封紧急信件要交给塞拉摩岛的吉安娜女士。",
		["Can you spare a drake to take me to Lord Afrasastrasz in the middle of the temple?"] = "你能借我一头飞龙，带我到神殿中央，阿弗拉沙斯塔兹的地方吗?",
		["Can you spare an orange?"] = "能给我一颗橙子吗？",
		["Can you spread the reflective dust again?"] = "你可以再一次散布镜映之尘吗?",
		["Can you tell me about this shard?"] = "告诉我关于发光的裂片的事情。",
		["Can you tell me how I can get a Videre Elixir?"] = "你能告诉我怎样才能得到一份视灵药剂吗?",
		["Can you tell me what became of Sif?"] = "你能告诉我希芙发生了什么事吗?",
		["Can you tell me where Brine is?"] = "你能告诉我布瑞恩在哪里吗？",
		["Can you tell me where they have Chancellor Amai caged?"] = "你能告诉我他们把大法官亚迈关在哪吗?",
		["Can you train me how to use rogue skills?"] = "你能训练我使用盗贼技能吗?",
		["Cannon?"] = "告诉我更多关于大炮的事情。",
		["Capital Portals"] = "主城传送门",
		["Captain, I've somehow lost my command insignia."] = "上尉，我不知道怎么地弄丢了我的指挥徽记。",
		["Care to learn how to turn the ore that you find into weapons and metal armor?"] = "想学怎么把你采到的矿石做成武器和金属护甲吗？",
		["Caught unaware? How?"] = "不知情被抓的？怎么回事？",
		["Cemetery"] = "墓地",
		["Chapter on Arcane Crystals and Arcanite."] = "关于奥术水晶和奥金的章节。",
		["Chapter on Enchanted Scarlet Thread."] = "关于魔化红线的章节。",
		["Chapter on Frayed Abomination Stitchings."] = "关于磨损的憎恶缝合线的章节。",
		["Chapter on Frostwhisper's Embalming Fluid."] = "关于莱斯·霜语的防腐液的章节。",
		["Chapter on Skin of Shadow."] = "关于暗影之皮的章节。",
		["Cheers!"] = "干杯!",
		["Cheese, eh? Is it perhaps... aged cheese?"] = "起司，是吗?或许是...陈年的起司?",
		["Chief Ashtotem, I have misplaced the token that you gave me."] = "灰烬图腾酋长，我弄丢了你给我的硬币。",
		["Chief Bloodhoof, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy. You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your hoofprint."] = "血蹄酋长，也许这请求听起来有些奇怪……但是我正在照顾一个非常害羞的孩子。对他来说，你就是个英雄，是他请求我来拿到你的蹄印。",
		["Chromie, you and I both know what's going to happen in this time stream. We've seen this all before. Can you just skip us ahead to all the real action?"] = "克罗米，你和我都知道在这条时间流会发生什么事情。我们都亲眼见过这一切。$B$B你能不能把我们跳到实际采取行动的时间点去?",
		["Class Trainer"] = "职业训练师",
		["Clear me for the teleporter, I'm ready to go!"] = "替我净空传送器，我已经准备好了!",
		["Cloth Armor"] = "布甲",
		["Clothing"] = "服装",
		["Cold Weather Flying Trainer"] = "寒冷气候飞行训练师",
		["Come again."] = "再说一次。",
		["Come on, Budd. Time to play with the ice trolls!"] = "来吧，霸德。该跟这些寒冰巨魔玩玩了!",
		["Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That's right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!"] = "来吧，去荆棘谷奇妙绚丽的热带丛林来一趟旅行吧！没错，你也可以在水晶般湛蓝的海水边悠闲地晒日光浴，而我却只能站在这难以忍受的酷热里，整天除了我的兄弟 Frezza 之外什么也看不着！祝你旅途愉快！",
		["Confirmed."] = "确认。",
		["Continue please."] = "请继续。",
		["Continue please..."] = "请继续……",
		["Continue reading..."] = "继续读……",
		["Continue with your story please."] = "请继续讲你的故事。",
		["Continue with your story."] = "请继续你的故事。",
		["Continue, please."] = "请继续。",
		["Continue..."] = "继续……",
		["Cooking"] = "烹饪",
		["Crafty, I lost my Warsong orc disguise."] = "沃比斯波基，我弄丢了战歌兽人伪装。",
		["Crafty, I need another Warsong banner."] = "沃比斯波基，我需要一面战歌旗帜。",
		["Crimson Templar! I hold your crest of beckoning. Heed my summons!"] = "赤红圣殿骑士！我手中握着你的召唤纹章。响应我的召唤吧！",
		["Crossbow"] = "弩",
		["DIE!"] = "死吧！",
		["Dagger"] = "匕首",
		["Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly."] = "达丽安娜很有潜力，但她精力太旺盛，很难安静下来听讲。她既强壮又敏捷，我担心她很快就会被召去参战。我们得尽快教会她。",
		["Dark Iron Dwarf Attacks"] = "黑铁矮人袭击",
		["Dark Lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you're going to do, do it quickly."] = "黑暗女士，我似乎听到了阿尔萨斯的声音。无论您要做什么，请快点。",
		["Darkspear Champion's Pennant"] = "暗矛冠军的旗帜",
		["Darnassus Champion's Pennant"] = "达纳苏斯冠军的旗帜",
		["Dealer Dunar, I wish to browse your wares."] = "商人杜那尔，我想看看你的商品。",
		["Dealer Hazzin, what do you have to offer?"] = "商人海辛，你有什么东西要卖?",
		["Deeprun Tram"] = "矿道地铁",
		["Demon Soul?"] = "恶魔之魂？",
		["Did you see where they took Sanitation Engineer Burke?"] = "你知道他们把工程师波奇带去哪里了吗?",
		["Director Riddlevox put me in charge of the Union's shredder development program. Few months on the job and I'm already in hot water! I could use your help, $n!"] = "瑞德沃克斯主管让我负责工会的粉碎机研发计划。上任才几个月，我就已经焦头烂额了！我需要你的帮忙，$n！",
		["Disco Ball"] = "迪斯科球",
		["Disturb the stone and summon Lord Ahune."] = "用这块石头召唤埃霍恩大人。",
		["Do I get a free mount?"] = "我会得到一只免费坐骑吗?",
		["Do I need to go into all the gory details? I think we are both well aware of what Lord Illidan does with those that would oppose his word. Now, I must be going! Farewell, Ruusk! Forever..."] = "我需要详述令人恐惧的执行细节吗?我认为我们俩完全知道伊利丹王会怎样处理违抗他命令的那些人。现在，我必须离开!再会了，鲁斯克!永远...",
		["Do it... Do it now."] = "做吧……现在就做。",
		["Do other decks exist?"] = "还有其它套卡吗?",
		["Do you actually sell anything?"] = "你真的有在卖东西?",
		["Do you believe that?"] = "你相信这个吗?",
		["Do you have any items I can test?"] = "你有什么我可以测试的东西吗?",
		["Do you have any mithril casings?"] = "你有秘银外壳吗？",
		["Do you know someone... or something, rather, by the name of Eranikus?"] = "你知道有关伊兰尼库斯的事吗?",
		["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?"] = "你知道在哪儿能找到水兽敏捷坠饰吗？",
		["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance?"] = "你知道在哪儿能找到水兽耐力坠饰吗？",
		["Do you really want to bribe Olga?"] = "给，你可以用这枚金币买给自己想要的东西。",
		["Do you really want to unlearn your Gnomish Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"] = "我想要忘掉侏儒工程学分支的知识！",
		["Do you really want to unlearn your Goblin Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"] = "我想要忘掉地精工程学分支的知识！",
		["Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?"] = "我想要遗忘龙鳞制皮专精！",
		["Do you sell any of this stuff?"] = "这玩意你有卖吗?",
		["Do you think I could take a ride on one of those flying machines?"] = "你的意思是我可以坐这些飞行器?",
		["Do you understand me? We should be able to understand each other now."] = "你明白我的意思吗？现在我们必须了解彼此。",
		["Do you? Perhaps you should tell me what it is that is bothering you"] = "是吗?或许你该告诉我是什么让你烦恼。",
		["Doesn't matter, I'm invulnerable!"] = "没关系，小意思。",
		["Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain..."] = "别想着传送到敌对的城市去。那行不通——我们在这里或许都能友好相处，但回到家乡，旧日的宿怨依然还在……",
		["Done, done, and done."] = "完成了，全部完成了。",
		["Dragonhawk Master"] = "龙鹰管理员",
		["Dreadlords? Perhaps you mean Lord Banehollow. He sends his regards, and has a message for you..."] = "惊惧领主?也许你是说贝恩霍勒领主。他向你问好，并有一个消息要给你...",
		["Dreams?"] = "是梦境吗？",
		["Druid"] = "德鲁伊",
		["Drums of War"] = "战争之鼓",
		["Duke of Cynders! I hold your signet! Heed my call!"] = "灰烬公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！",
		["Duke of Fathoms! I hold your signet! Heed my call!"] = "深渊公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！",
		["Duke of Shards! I hold your signet! Heed my call!"] = "碎石公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！",
		["Duke of Zephyrs! I hold your signet! Heed my call!"] = "微风公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！",
		["Dwarves!!! Now you're telling me that dwarves originally came from the Earthen?!"] = "矮人!!难道矮人是起源于土灵的?!",
		["Earthen Templar! I hold your crest of beckoning. Heed my summons!"] = "土色圣殿骑士！我手中握着你的召唤纹章。响应我的召唤吧！",
		["Eastern Sewer Entrance"] = "东下水道入口",
		["Elder Sandrene has traveled to Lakeside Landing in Sholazar Basin."] = "杉德林长者已前往索拉查盆地的湖畔营地。",
		["Emblem Gear"] = "会徽齿轮",
		["Empoor, you're going to tell me what I want to know, or else!"] = "安普尔，你要告诉我所有想知道的一切，否则后果自负!",
		["Enchanting"] = "附魔",
		["Enchanting is the art of improving existing items through magic."] = "附魔是通过魔法强化现有物品的艺术。",
		["Engineering"] = "工程学",
		["Engineering is very simple once you grasp the basics."] = "一旦掌握了基础知识，工程学其实很简单。",
		["Enter 3vs3 Solo Queue"] = "加入 3v3 单排队列",
		["Epic Purple Shirt"] = "史诗紫色衬衣",
		["Er... that's how I found them. I wanted to show the king that they were a threat! Say Captain... I overheard Guard Fengus calling you a fat, useless gnoll lover!"] = "呃...我就是这样找到他们的。我想告诉国王他们是个威胁!首领...我无意中听到守卫芬古斯叫你肥胖无用的豺狼人嗜好者!",
		["Ethereal Summoner"] = "以太召唤者",
		["Eva, I have lost the Spectral Essence. I need another."] = "伊娃，我的鬼灵精华不见了。我需要另外一个。",
		["Exalted"] = "崇拜。",
		["Examine the remains."] = "检查遗骸。",
		["Excuse me? We've been \"rescheduled for visitation\"? What does that mean?!"] = "什么？我们的世界“被安排了新的探访计划”？这是什么意思？！",
		["Exodar Champion's Pennant"] = "埃索达冠军的旗帜",
		["Ezekiel said that you might have a certain book..."] = "伊斯奇欧说你会有某本书...",
		["FINE! And how, dare I ask, am I supposed to acquire an arcanite buoy?"] = "很好!现在，容我发问，我需要协助取得奥金浮标吗?",
		["Falthir, I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Madcap's outfit."] = "法希尔，我需要重新获得一件狂妄者套装。",
		["Falthir, I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Predator's outfit."] = "法希尔，我需要重新获得一件捕猎者套装。",
		["Fascinating. Continue, please."] = "真令人着迷啊。请继续。",
		["Fascinating. Please, tell me more."] = "太有趣了，请和我再多说一些吧。",
		["Feed the grub to the Rock Falcon."] = "<把幼蛆喂给石隼吃。>",
		["Feeling underpowered"] = "感到动力不足",
		["Fields of Honor"] = "荣誉原野",
		["Fight"] = "战斗",
		["Fine, then how about some training?"] = "很好，要来训练一下吗?",
		["Fires of Outland"] = "外域之火",
		["First Aid"] = "急救",
		["Fish? You gave a piece of what could be the key to saving all life on Kalimdor to a fish?"] = "鱼?你是说你把这件可能关系到整个卡利姆多命运的东西交给了一条鱼?",
		["Fishing"] = "钓鱼",
		["Fishing Chair"] = "钓鱼椅",
		["Fist Weapon"] = "拳套",
		["Flight Master"] = "飞行管理员",
		["Flowers"] = "鲜花",
		["Foam Sword Rack"] = "海绵剑架",
		["Food & Drink"] = "食物与饮料",
		["For Lordaeron!"] = "为了洛丹伦!",
		["For the Horde! Arm yourself from the crates that surround us and report to Agmar's Hammer, east of here. Your first trial as a member of the Horde is to survive the journey. Lok'tar ogar!"] = "为了部落! 从周遭的木箱里拿出装备武装自己，然后向东边的阿格玛之锤回报。你身为部落一员的第一个试炼，就是活着完成这趟旅行。 (兽人语)不胜即亡!",
		["Forge camps?"] = "炼冶场?",
		["Forgetting your knowledge is an expensive endeavor. Are you willing to pay the cost?"] = "我下定决心了。让我遗忘炼金专精吧！",
		["Forsaken Champion's Pennant"] = "被遗忘者冠军的旗帜",
		["Friendly"] = "友好。",
		["Fruit"] = "水果",
		["GOSSIP_OPTION_OUTDOORPVP"] = "户外PVP",
		["GOSSIP_OPTION_QUESTGIVER"] = "告诉我可以飞到哪里去。",
		["Game? Are you crazy?"] = "游戏？你疯了吗？",
		["Garrosh is beyond redemption, Greatmother. I fear that in helping the Mag'har, I have convinced Garrosh that he is unfit to lead."] = "加尔鲁什是无可救药的，主母。我惧怕在帮助玛格汉的过程同时，我已经使加尔鲁什认为他不适合成为领导人。",
		["Gem Merchant"] = "珠宝商人",
		["General Goods"] = "杂货商",
		["Get out there and make those Scourge wish they were never reborn!"] = "马上出发，让天灾军宁愿自己没有被唤醒!",
		["Get your people to safety, we'll keep the Blue Dragonflight's forces at bay."] = "带你的人撤到安全的地方去吧，我们不会让蓝龙军团突破防线的。",
		["Give me a bomber!"] = "给我一架轰炸机!",
		["Give me a situation report, Captain."] = "上尉，请给我一份战况报告。",
		["Give me some pointers on my fishing technique."] = "给我的钓鱼技巧一些指点。",
		["Give me the flag!"] = "把旗子给我！",
		["Give me the vessel, Highlord."] = "给我一艘船，大领主。",
		["Give the signal! We're ready to go!"] = "给我发信号！我们准备好继续前进了！",
		["Glad to help, my lady. I'm told you were once the guardian of a fabled sword. Do you know where I might find it?"] = "很荣幸能帮得上忙，女士。我听说您曾是一柄传说之剑的守护者。请问您知道我可以在哪里找到它吗?",
		["Gloom'rel, tell me your secrets!"] = "杜姆雷尔，告诉我你的秘密！",
		["Gnomeregan Champion's Pennant"] = "诺莫瑞根冠军的旗帜",
		["Go on, please."] = "请继续。",
		["Go on, you're free. Get out of here!"] = "去吧，你自由了。离开这里!",
		["Go on."] = "请继续。",
		["Goblin Gumbo Kettle"] = "哥布尔烩肉罐",
		["Goblin Weather Machine - Prototype 01-B"] = "哥布尔天气机 - 原型机01 - B",
		["Good day, Hulfdan, I am looking for training."] = "霍夫丹，你好，我要接受训练。",
		["Good ol' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg. I'm good as new I tell ye! I'm sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage."] = "前几天我遇上凶恶的穴居人时，老萨姆纳给我包扎了伤口。听我说，我现在好得跟新的一样！我敢说萨姆纳很乐意教你怎么包扎伤口。",
		["Goods & Gear"] = "物品和工具",
		["Gordo like picking flowers. Pick flowers kind of like killing."] = "葛尔多喜欢采花。采花这事儿有点像杀人。",
		["Gorebag has shown me the Drakkari Empire. I am eager to help you conquer it!"] = "血袋向我展现了达卡莱帝国。我急着要协助你征服它!",
		["Gorzeeki, I wish to make a purchase."] = "戈瑟奇，我想买点东西。",
		["Got anything interesting for sale, Zorbin?"] = "有没有什么好玩的东西卖，索尔宾？",
		["Grasp the Eye of the Lich King and focus your will upon it to scry for important information."] = "抓住巫妖王之眼并集中你的意志以侦查重要信息。",
		["Great and powerful Har'koa, please call for one of your children that it might stealthily carry me into the Altar of Quetz'lun."] = "伟大的哈克娅，请接受您子民的召唤，悄悄的把我送往奎丝鲁恩祭坛吧！",
		["Great job collecting resources for the war,\" they said, \"Have a promotion,\" they said. What they really meant is \"You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!\" Thanks for the promotion, Captain!"] = "“你为战争收集物资干得真不错，”他们说，“升你做上尉！”他们真正的意思却是：“卡恩斯，你要被派到希利苏斯的虫巢外，和一群汗流浃背的矮人待在一起！”谢谢你提拔我啊，上尉！",
		["Greatmother, I never had the honor. Durotan died long before my time, but his heroics are known to all on my world. The orcs of Azeroth reside in a place known as Durotar, named after your son. And... <You take a moment to breathe and think through what you are about to tell the Greatmother.>"] = "主母，我从未有此荣幸。杜洛坦早在我之前已死，但是他的英雄事迹在我的世界上为人所熟知。艾泽拉斯的兽人们居住在一个称为杜洛塔的地方，以你的儿子之名所命。并且... <你花费片刻呼吸，并且彻底考虑你将要告诉主母的事。>",
		["Greatmother, you are the mother of Durotan?"] = "主母，你是杜洛坦的母亲吗?",
		["Greer, I need a gryphon to ride and some bombs to drop on New Agamand!"] = "格锐尔，我要搭一头狮鹫兽到新阿加曼德投弹!",
		["Greetings High Chief. Would you do me the honor of accepting my invitation to join the Horde as an official member and leader of the Taunka?"] = "您好，坦卡大酋长。我有荣幸邀请您加入部落，正式成为我们的一员以及牦牛人的领袖吗?",
		["Greetings! Can I teach you how to turn beast hides into armor?"] = "你好！要我教你如何把兽皮制成护甲吗？",
		["Greetings! Can I teach you how to turn found cloth into cloth armor?"] = "你好！要我教你如何把采集来的布料做成布甲吗？",
		["Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Lok'delar."] = "你能切换罗克迪洛尔吗？",
		["Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Rhok'delar."] = "你能切换伦鲁迪洛尔吗？",
		["Greetings, elder. It is time for your people to end their hostility toward the draenei and their allies."] = "你好，长者。该和你的人民一起取消对德莱尼及其盟友的敌意了。",
		["Grek, will you try out this new weapon oil Rakoria made?"] = "葛利克，你要不要试试瑞蔻莉雅制造的新武器油呢?",
