		["Gubber, I don't have a fishing pole."] = "古博,我没有钓鱼竿。",
		["Gubber, I don't know how to fish."] = "古博，我不知道怎么钓鱼。",
		["Guide me back to the Alliance landing camp."] = "带我回到联盟登陆营地。",
