		["I seem to have misplaced your Shredder Control Device... might you have another?"] = "我弄丢了你的伐木机控制装置...也许你还有一个?",
		["I shall scour the earth for this Earthshaper. What of the essence?"] = "我要为辟地打扫出来一片地方。那是什么？",
		["I shall."] = "我会的。",
		["I should return to the world of shades, Koltira. Send me back."] = "我必须要回到暗影的世界，寇尔提拉。送我回去。",
		["I slay the man on the spot as my liege would expect me to do, as he is nothing more than a thief and a liar."] = "我会当场杀了他，因为我的主人一定会要我这么做，反正他不过是个小偷跟骗子。",
		["I submit myself for further training my master."] = "我听从安排，只为得到更多训练。",
		["I submit myself for further training, my master."] = "我听从安排，只为得到更多训练。",
		["I think I have heard of this magic."] = "我想我听说过这种魔法。",
		["I think I understand now. Can I help with any of this? The Ethereum and void creatures are a threat to our survival as well."] = "我认为我现在了解了。我能帮上任何忙吗?复仇军和虚无生物同时也是对我们生存的一个威胁。",
		["I think I understand the Creators' design intent for the Earthen now. What are the Earthen's anomalies that you spoke of earlier?"] = "我想我现在明白造物者设计土灵的意图了。你之前说的土灵的变化是指什么?",
