		["I won't challenge you, but I'd like to see your wares."] = "我不会向你挑战的，但是我想看看你的东西。",
		["I would create some surreptitious means to keep my brother out of the order. I can keep him out without him being any bit wiser, thereby saving our familial bonds."] = "我会想办法让他不参加危险的任务，完全不需要他做任何事情，以此来保存我的家族的血脉。",
		["I would like to browse your goods, Illusia."] = "我想看看你的商品，伊鲁希雅。",
