		["I would like to go to the battleground."] = "我想去战场。",
		["I would like to take a look at your wares, Sid."] = "我想看看你的商品，希德。",
		["I would like to train further in the ways of the Light."] = "我想接受更多的关于圣光的训练。",
		["I would like to train."] = "我要接受训练。",
		["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive Tyrael's Hilt."] = "我想偷偷告诉你验证码以领取泰瑞尔之柄。",
		["I would like training."] = "我想要接受训练。",
		["I would remain silent about the kill and allow the knight to claim the reward to aid his family."] = "我会对这件事情保持沉默，并允许那个骑士领取奖品来救助他的家人。",
		["I would show my liege the beast's ear and claim the beast's death as my own - after all, I did slay it. I would then offer some of the reward to the destitute knight to help his family."] = "我会把这只野兽的耳朵拿给我的主人看，并且说这只野兽是我杀死的－毕竟，我确实杀了牠。我会把奖品的一部份分给那个贫困的骑士，好帮助他的家人。",
		["I would show my liege the beast's ear and claim the beast's death as my own, taking the reward for my own use. It is wrong to claim a deed as your own that someone else in fact did."] = "我会把野兽的耳朵给我的长官看，并把击杀野兽归功于我，我自己花赏金。把别人的所作所为当做自己的行为是无耻的。",
		["I would speak against my brother joining the order, rushing a permanent breach in our relationship. He would be a danger to himself and those around him, and that is too great a risk hoping he would improve over time."] = "我会反对我的兄弟加入军队，即使我们的关系会因此产生永久的裂痕。对他自己和周围的人来说，他无疑是个危险，要想指望他会逐渐进步可就太冒险了。",
		["I would speak for my brother joining the order, potentially risking the safety of the order. I could help him with the order's regimens, and I'd have faith in his ability to adapt and learn."] = "我会支持我的兄弟加入军队，虽然这或许会威胁到军队的安全。我和军队的其他成员会帮助他，我相信他能够适应这儿的生活并且学会生存之道。",
		["I''ll go get SOME help. Hang IN there."] = "我去求救。撑着。",
		["I''m sorry that I didn''t get here sooner. What happened?"] = "我很抱歉来的太慢了。发生什么事情?",
		["I'd like a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit."] = "我想要一个可爱符咒收集工具组。",
		["I'd like a drink."] = "我想要一杯饮料。",
		["I'd like a new invitation to the Lunar Festival."] = "我想要一个新的春节邀请函。",
