		["I'd like to purchase more Tharlendris seeds."] = "我想购买更多的萨伦迪斯种子。",
		["I'd like to see what you have to sell."] = "我想看看你出售的货物。",
		["I'd like to stable my pet here"] = "我想要寄存宠物",
		["I'd like to stable my pet here."] = "我想将我的宠物存放在这里。",
		["I'd like to take a flight around Stormwind Harbor."] = "我想要绕着暴风港飞一趟。",
		["I'd like to train in cooking."] = "我想进行烹饪训练。",
		["I'd like to train."] = "我想接受训练。",
		["I'd like to use the stables."] = "我想要使用兽栏。",
		["I'd like you to make me a new Cache of Mau'ari please"] = "我把玛艾里的容器弄丢了。我该怎么办?",
		["I'd love to get one of those written fortunes you mentioned! I've got the space in my inventory for it."] = "我很乐意得到一张你所说的手写签诗!我的背包里有足够的空间。",
		["I'd love to learn more."] = "我想多学一些。",
		["I'll be back once I straighten this mess out."] = "等我把这些搞定了就会立刻回来。",
		["I'll consider that the next time I run into one of these things."] = "下次再遇到这种事情的时候我会好好考虑一下的。",
		["I'll have you out of there in just a moment."] = "我很快就会帮你脱离那里了。",
		["I'll show you! Give me that practice parachute!"] = "我来做示范！把练习用的降落伞包递给我！",
		["I'll take the flight."] = "带我飞过去吧。",
		["I'll... take a look."] = "我会...看一看。",
		["I'm a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events."] = "我是个囚犯，那看起来像什么?德莱尼垃圾在我出了太阳之门后就俘虏了我。他们毁了我们的传送门控制器并摧毁了入口。这样的转折会让太阳之王很生气。",
		["I'm affraid not. Schneider. Your time has come!"] = "恐怕不能，施耐德。你的死期到了!",
		["I'm all ears."] = "我洗耳恭听。",
		["I'm as ready as I'll ever be."] = "我从没像现在这样十足的准备妥当。",
		["I'm fine, thank you. You asked for me?"] = "我很好，谢谢。 你找我吗?",
		["I'm going to have to kill something, aren't I?"] = "我要杀一些东西，是吗?",
		["I'm here for cooking training."] = "我是来接受烹饪训练的。",
		["I'm in need of your skill as a blacksmith, Koren."] = "我想要学习你的铁匠技术，库雷恩。",
		["I'm interested in purchasing a new drake."] = "我想要买一只新的龙。",
		["I'm interested."] = "我很感兴趣。",
		["I'm listening."] = "我正在听。",
		["I'm lookin' for rogue trainin'."] = "我想接受盗贼的训练。",
		["I'm looking for a lost companion."] = "我要寻找失踪的伙伴。",
		["I'm neither slim nor shady. As a matter of fact, I find both references insulting. Now, get out of my sight before I plant my staff up your backside."] = "我既不苗条，也不阴险。说真的，我觉得这两种说法都很冒犯。趁我还没把法杖捅进你屁股里，赶紧滚出我的视线。",
		["I'm not a journeyman herbalist -- am I able to still assist you in your work?"] = "我对草药学没什么了解，那么我还能帮上忙吗?",
		["I'm not a laborer. I'm here to free you from servitude in the mines."] = "我不是这里的劳工。我是来让你们从奴役中解放的，从矿穴中解放。",
		["I'm not fighting, so send me in now!"] = "我还没加入战斗，将我传送进去！",
		["I'm not into any of that creepy stuff you like, Brazie. Just show me the \"legal\" wares."] = "我对你喜欢的那些怪东西不感兴趣，布雷泽。只管拿给我“合法”的东西。",
		["I'm on a bombing mission for Forward Commander Kingston. I need a gryphon destroyer!"] = "我正在执行前线指挥官金斯顿下达的轰炸任务。我需要一头武装狮鹫！",
		["I'm on a bombing mission for Forward Commander To'arch. I need a wyvern destroyer!"] = "我在执行一项前线指挥官吐阿奇所赋予的轰炸任务。我需要一个双足翼龙毁灭者!",
		["I'm ready - lets get you out of here."] = "我准备好了，让我把你弄出去。",
		["I'm ready for my test flight!"] = "我准备进行好我的飞行试验!",
		["I'm ready to battle the dreadlord, sire."] = "殿下，我已经准备好与恐惧魔王作战了。",
		["I'm ready to begin. What is the first ingredient you require?"] = "我准备好要动手了。你需要的第一种材料是什么?",
		["I'm ready to deliver the tome, Arcanist Tybalin."] = "我已经准备好运送那本书了，博学者哈索瑞尔。",
		["I'm ready to deliver the tome, Magister Hathorel."] = "我已经准备好运送那本书了，博学者哈索瑞尔。",
		["I'm ready to enter the Sunwell."] = "我已经准备好进入太阳之井了。",
		["I'm ready to fly to Sholazar Basin."] = "我已经准备好飞往索拉查盆地。",
		["I'm ready to fly! Take me up, dragon!"] = "我准备起飞了！带我飞翔吧，龙！",
		["I'm ready to go to Durnholde Keep."] = "我准备好前往敦霍尔德城堡了。",
		["I'm ready to go, Walt."] = "渥特，我准备好出发了。",
		["I'm ready to start the distillation, uh, Tipsy."] = "我准备好开始蒸馏了，嗯，醺醉。",
		["I'm ready to work for you today! Give me the good stuff!"] = "今天我要为你干活了！都拿出来吧！",
		["I'm ready, Akama."] = "我准备好了, 阿卡玛。",
		["I'm ready, Brann. Let's make the keystone."] = "我准备好了，布莱恩。来完成拱心石吧。",
		["I'm ready, Gymer. Let's go!"] = "我准备好了，基默，出发吧!",
		["I'm ready, Highlord."] = "我准备好了，大领主。",
		["I'm ready."] = "我准备好了。",
		["I'm ready. Take me to the Chamber of Command."] = "我准备好了。带我去命令大厅吧。",
		["I'm sure Arthas will be back any day now, soldier. Keep your chin up!"] = "我确定阿尔萨斯随时都会回来，士兵。收下巴!",
		["I'm sure everything will work out, footman."] = "步兵，情况会好转的。",
		["I'm the new king? What are you talking about?"] = "我是新国王？你们在讨论什么？",
		["I'm with you, Thorim."] = "我会跟随你，托里姆。",
		["I've been meaning to ask you about that monkey."] = "我想要问问你关于那只猴子的情况。",
		["I've heard that vrykul women cannot fight at all. If you wish to prove me wrong, you can try."] = "我听说维库女人都不会打架。要是你想证明我错了，可以尝试一下。",
		["I've heard your name spoken only in whispers, mage. Who are you?"] = "我只有在私语中听过别人提起你的名字，法师。你是谁?",
		["I've lost Archmage Vargoth's Staff. Can you replace it?"] = "我已经遗失大法师瓦戈斯之杖。你能找回它吗?",
		["I've lost Miniwing."] = "我把迷你鹦鹉搞丢了。",
		["I've lost Nass..."] = "我找不到纳斯了...",
		["I've lost Spectrecles."] = "我弄丢了幽灵眼镜。",
		["I've lost The Eye of Haramad."] = "我把哈拉迈德之眼弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my Blood Knight Tabard."] = "我把我的血骑士外袍搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Brann's Communicator"] = "我把布莱恩的通讯器弄丢了，我想要一个新的。",
		["I've lost my Essence-Infused Moonstone. Can you replace it?"] = "我遗失了灌注精华的月亮石。你能再给我一个吗？",
		["I've lost my Green Trophy Tabard of the Illidari."] = "我把我的伊利达瑞绿色战利外袍搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Jubling."] = "我把我的小啾啾搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Kor'kron Flare Gun, sir. May I have another?"] = "我弄丢了我的库卡隆信号枪，先生。可以再给我一支吗?",
		["I've lost my Kor'kron Flare Gun."] = "我弄丢了库卡隆信号枪。",
		["I've lost my Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet."] = "我弄丢了瓦塔拉克饰品的左半边。",
		["I've lost my Loremaster's Colors."] = "我弄丢了我的博学大师彩袍",
		["I've lost my Prairie Chicken."] = "我把我的草原小鸡搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Purple Trophy Tabard of the Illidari."] = "我把我的伊利达瑞紫色胜利外袍搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet."] = "我弄丢了瓦塔拉克饰品的右半边。",
		["I've lost my Shadowforge Key."] = "我把我的影炉钥匙搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Signet for Path of the Conqueror."] = "我把征服者之路丢失了。",
		["I've lost my Signet for Path of the Invoker."] = "我把祈求者之路丢失了。",
		["I've lost my Signet for Path of the Protector."] = "我把保护者之路丢失了。",
		["I've lost my Smolderweb hatchling."] = "我把我的烟网小蜘蛛搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Tabard of Summer Flames."] = "我弄丢了我的夏日烈焰外袍。",
		["I've lost my Tabard of Summer Skies."] = "我弄丢了我的夏日晴空外袍。",
		["I've lost my Tabard of the Achiever."] = "我把我的成就者外袍搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Tabard of the Explorer."] = "我弄丢了我的探险者外袍。",
		["I've lost my Tabard of the Hand."] = "我把我的阿古斯之手外袍搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my Tabard of the Protector."] = "我的保卫者外袍掉了。",
		["I've lost my Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet."] = "我弄丢了瓦塔拉克饰品的上半边。",
		["I've lost my Violet Signet of the Archmage."] = "我把大法师的紫罗兰徽记弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my Violet Signet of the Grand Restorer."] = "我把治愈者紫罗兰徽记弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my Violet Signet of the Great Protector."] = "我把庇护者紫罗兰徽记弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my Violet Signet of the Master Assassin."] = "我把王牌刺客的紫罗兰徽记弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my Whistle."] = "我弄丢了我的哨。能再给我一个吗？",
		["I've lost my ensorcelled choker!"] = "我把我的蛊惑颈饰搞丢了!",
		["I've lost my key to Karazhan."] = "我把卡拉赞的钥匙弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my key to Scholomance."] = "我把通灵学院的钥匙搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my key to Searing Gorge."] = "我把灼热峡谷的钥匙弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my key to The Arcatraz."] = "我把禁魔监狱的钥匙弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my key to The Shattered Halls."] = "我把破碎大厅的钥匙弄丢了。",
		["I've lost my key to the Violet Hold."] = "我丢掉了紫罗兰要塞的钥匙。",
		["I've lost my sprite darter hatchling."] = "我把我的精龙宝宝搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my wolpertinger."] = "我把我的鹿角兔搞丢了。",
		["I've lost my worg pup."] = "我把我的小座狼搞丢了。",
		["I've made no mistakes."] = "我从不犯错。",
		["I've made up my mind. Make me forget my alchemy mastery!"] = "我下定决心了。让我遗忘炼金专精吧！",
		["I've misplaced the Brazier of Beckoning!"] = "我把召唤火盆弄丢了！",
		["I've trained as an alchemist once again. I wish to specialize in elixirs."] = "我打算重新接受炼金师训练。我希望在药剂制作方面有所专精。",
		["I've trained as an alchemist once again. I wish to specialize in potions."] = "我打算重新接受炼金师训练。我希望在药水制作方面有所专精。",
		["I've trained as an alchemist once again. I wish to specialize in transmutations."] = "我打算重新接受炼金师训练。我希望在元素转化方面有所专精。",
		["I... I did not think of it that way, Warchief."] = "我……我可不这样想，战争之王。",
		["I... I think so..."] = "我...应该有吧...",
		["Icecrown"] = "寒冰皇冠",
		["Id like a pair of Synthebrew Goggles."] = "我想要一副模拟醉眼护目镜。",
		["If it please you, King Jokkum, may I know what has become of Krolmir?"] = "如果您愿意的话，约库姆国王，可以让我知道克洛米尔的状况吗?",
		["If it's any consolation, I'll be leaving the cell door open. How you get out is your problem. Good bye, Kharan."] = "我会把门开着的，你怎么逃出去是你的问题。再见，卡兰。",
		["If there is anything you would have of me..."] = "要是你能从我这儿拿走什么的话...",
		["If you need keys, talk to Walter Soref in the Rogues' Quarter, but watch yourself."] = "如果你需要钥匙，就去盗贼区找 Walter Soref，不过自己多加小心。",
		["If you really trust some undead with your pets, you can talk to Anya Maulray at the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter."] = "如果你真敢把宠物托付给亡灵，可以去贸易区上层环廊的旅店找安雅·玛尔雷谈谈。",
		["If you're looking for an Arcane Reforger, there is a blood elf mage inside the Drag's enchanting shop, Godan's Runeworks."] = "如果你在找奥术重铸师，暗巷区的附魔商店——Godan's Runeworks——里就有一位血精灵法师。",
		["Imp in a Ball"] = "球中的小鬼",
		["Impressive. When do we attack?"] = "令人印象深刻。我们什么时候攻击?",
		["In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull."] = "你一心追求荣耀，以为整个游戏的节奏都由你的行动左右。你能想象在我这样的存在看来，这有多么荒唐吗？只要我愿意，便能让你那微不足道的念头碾碎你颅骨里那团花生大小的灰质。",
		["Incredible. How did Sironas accomplish such a thing?"] = "不可思议。赛罗娜斯怎么能办到这样的事?",
		["Indeed."] = "确实如此。",
		["Inessera is a sharp woman who carries various gems as well as jewelcrafting supplies. You can find her shop in the northern part of Aldor Rise."] = "Inessera 是一位精明的女子，带着各式各样的宝石和珠宝加工材料。她的商店就在奥尔多高地的北部。",
		["Inn"] = "旅店",
		["Inscription"] = "铭文学",
		["Insert 35 Apexis Shards, and begin!"] = "插入35枚埃匹希斯碎片，开始！",
		["Insert an Apexis Shard, and begin!"] = "插入一枚埃匹希斯碎片，开始！",
		["Instant Statue"] = "速成雕像",
		["Insult Coren Direbrew's brew."] = "搞臭科林·烈酒的酒。",
		["Interesting crew you've got here..."] = "有趣的队伍你们来到这里了...",
		["Interesting, continue please."] = "很有意思，请继续。",
		["Interesting."] = "很有趣。",
		["Ironforge Champion's Pennant"] = "铁炉堡冠军的旗帜",
		["Is there a difference between ooze and slime?"] = "软泥怪和泥浆怪有何不同？",
		["Is there anything I can do for you, Greatmother?"] = "有没有什么事是我可以帮忙的呢，主母?",
		["Is there anything else?"] = "还有别的吗?",
		["Isn't Shattrath a draenei city? Why do you allow others here?"] = "沙塔斯不是一座德莱尼的城市嘛？为什么允许其他人在这儿？",
		["It is a greater knowledge of the ways of the warlock that I crave."] = "我追求高超的术士之道。",
		["It is good to see the Burning Blade is taking over where the Shadow Council once failed."] = "很高兴看到燃刃接管了那些暗影议会无力接管的地方。",
		["It is my warchief, Greatmother. The leader of my people. From my world. He... He is the son of Durotan. He is your grandchild."] = "它是我的大酋长，主母。我族人的领导人。来自我的世界。他...他是杜洛坦的儿子。他是你的孙子。",
		["It is you who honor me, High Chief. Please read from this scroll. It is the oath of allegiance."] = "这是我莫大的荣幸，大酋长。请看这个卷轴，这是盟约的誓词。",
		["It needn't end this way."] = "这不需要这样结束。",
		["It requires a steady hand to remove the leather from a slain beast."] = "从猎获的野兽身上剥皮需要一双稳健的手。",
		["It will be done."] = "我们会完成这个任务的。",
		["It won't."] = "不会的。",
		["It's a pleasure to meet you as well, Arch Druid. I am on a task from Tirion and time is short, might I trouble you for a portal to Moonglade?"] = "我也很高兴见到你，大德鲁伊。我肩负着提里奥所赋予的任务而时间有限，能麻烦你将我传送至月光林地吗?",
		["It's good to be the king! Now, let's get back to what you were talking about before..."] = "成为了新国王是不是美滋滋！现在，让我们回想一下你以前都说了什么……",
		["It's just ice. Why all the fuss?"] = "这只是冰啊，干嘛大惊小怪?",
		["It's no lie, traitor. Banehollow wants your heart, and I'm going to get it for him."] = "叛徒，我可没骗你。魔王贝恩霍勒想要你的心脏，我现在就取给他。",
		["It's over, Spark. The admiral knows it was you who betrayed the Alliance. Now you're either going to cooperate with me and tell me everything that you know or we're going to engage in some fisticuff."] = "结束了，火花。上将知道是你背叛了联盟。现在你不是要和我合作，就是要告诉我你所知道的一切，否则我们就要来硬的了。",
		["Jewelcrafting"] = "珠宝设计",
		["Jewelry"] = "珠宝",
		["Jho'nass, let me see what you have to offer."] = "乔那斯，让我看看你可以提供什么。",
		["Jin'rokh, I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Freethinker's outfit."] = "金罗克，我需要重新获得一件思考者护甲。",
		["Jin'rokh, I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Vindicator's outfit."] = "金罗克，我需要重新获得一件辩护者战装。",
		["Jungle Fever"] = "丛林热",
		["Just bring them out again, then watch."] = "尽管把她们带出来，然后好好看着吧。",
		["Just show me the way, Franclorn."] = "弗兰克罗恩，告诉我该怎么做。",
		["Kalaran, I have misplaced my torch. I require another."] = "卡拉然，我把火炬的位置放错了。我还要一个。",
		["Kalaran, please enchant the torch."] = "卡拉然，请为火炬附魔。",
		["Kara, I need to be flown out the Dens of Dying to find Bixie."] = "卡拉，我需要飞到垂死兽穴去找碧西。",
		["Kazum! I hold your scepter! I command you to enter this world!"] = "卡苏姆！我手中握着你的节杖，我召唤你进入这个世界！",
		["Keep it together man! What about Zangarmarsh?"] = "振作点老兄!赞加沼泽怎么样?",
		["Kel'Thuzad is my answer."] = "我的答案是克尔苏加德。",
		["Keristrasa, I am finished here. Please return me to the Transitus Shield."] = "克莉斯塔萨，我这里的任务完成了。请让我返回隘境之盾。",
		["Kil'jaeden is my answer."] = "我的答案是基尔加丹。",
		["King Stormheart sent me to be tested as a frostborn would. I am ready for my test, Fjorlin"] = "风暴之心国王派我来接受霜脉矮人应有的考验。我已经准备好接受试炼了，弗尤林。",
		["Kite"] = "风筝",
		["Koltira... this might sound strange, but I keep seeing some kid's ghost. Matthias Lehner... does the name mean anything to you?"] = "寇尔提拉...这或许听起来很奇怪，我一直看到一个小孩的鬼魂。米希阿斯·萨尔奈...你听过这个名字吗?",
		["Korfax, where can I find Dark Iron scraps?"] = "柯菲斯，我要到哪去找黑铁碎块?",
		["Krasus' Landing"] = "克拉苏斯飞行平台",
		["Kronk, tell me about the charged crystal foci."] = "克朗克，告诉我有关充能水晶体的事。",
		["Lady Jaina told me to speak to you about using a gryphon to survey Alcaz Island."] = "普罗德摩尔女士让我借用你的狮鹫去调查奥卡兹岛。",
		["Lady Jaina, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy. You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your autograph."] = "吉安娜女士，这听起来像是个奇怪的请求……但是我正在照顾一个非常害羞的孩子。对他来说，你是个英雄，他想要你的签名。",
		["Lady Proudmoore, I am ready to go to Orgrimmar. Please open a portal."] = "普罗德摩尔女士，我准备好去奥格瑞玛了。请打开传送门。",
		["Landro's Gift Box"] = "蓝卓的礼物盒",
		["Landro's Pet Box"] = "蓝卓的宠物盒",
		["Larion, I want to help you fight these pests!"] = "拉瑞安，我想帮助你打败这些家伙！",
		["Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar. Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest."] = "Laurna Morninglight 为居住在多兰纳尔附近的人们提供治疗。也许她能教你牧师之道。",
		["Lay your hand on the Ice Stone."] = "把你的手放在石头上。",
		["Lead the way, Prince Arthas."] = "请带路，阿尔萨斯王子。",
		["Learn about Dual Talent Specialization."] = "我要怎么学习双天赋专精?",
		["Learn the recipe."] = "学习配方。",
		["Leather Armor"] = "皮甲",
		["Leatherworking"] = "制皮",
		["Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are."] = "别烦我，$c。我还得去履行与忧日大使相关的职责，尽管这些差事无聊得很。",
		["Left? How can you choose to leave?"] = "离开?你怎么可以选择离开?",
		["Legion?"] = "军团?",
		["Lend me a Windrider. I'm going to Spinebreaker Post!"] = "借我一只双足飞龙。我要去断脊山脊!",
		["Lend us your aid, keeper. Together we will defeat Yogg-Saron."] = "我们需要你们的帮助，冒险者。团结一致！我们会打败尤格-萨隆。",
		["Let me browse your goods."] = "让我看看你的货物。",
		["Let me browse your reagents and poison supplies."] = "让我看看你的试剂和毒药补给。",
		["Let me browse your seasonal fare."] = "让我看看你携带的食物。",
		["Let me browse your selection of fireworks."] = "让我看看你的烟火。",
		["Let me browse your wares, Calypso."] = "让我看看你的商品，卡利比索。",
		["Let me browse your wares, Cookie."] = "让我看看你的商品，厨师。",
		["Let me confer with my colleagues."] = "让我跟同伴交换一下意见。",
		["Let me see what hatchlings you have for sale."] = "让我看看你有哪些幼兽出售。",
		["Let me take a look at what you have to offer."] = "让我看看你提供的东西。",
		["Let me think about it, Zamael."] = "让我考虑一下，萨麦尔。",
		["Let the event begin!"] = "活动开始了!",
		["Let us consult the omens."] = "让我们寻求预兆的指引。",
		["Let's do this, Thassarian. It's now or never."] = "动手吧，萨萨里安。否则就再也没机会了。",
		["Let's do this, sister."] = "姊妹，上吧。",
		["Let's finish this!"] = "让我们解决这件事吧!",
