		["My lord, I need to get to the top of the temple."] = "大人，我需要前往神殿的顶端。",
		["My people ask that you pull back your Boulderfist ogres and cease all attacks on our territories. In return, we will also pull back our forces."] = "我的人民要求你撤退你的石拳巨魔并停止所有对我们领土的攻击行动。然后，我们才会撤退我们的军队。",
		["My programming will not allow me to lower the cost of any items."] = "我的程序不允许我降低任何物品的售价。",
		["Myranda, do you have enough eyeballs to make another amulet? I have lost the old one."] = "麦兰达，你有足够的眼珠再制作一个护身符吗？我把先前那个弄丢了。",
		["NO!"] = "不!",
