		["Ner'zhul is my answer."] = "我的答案是耐奥祖。",
		["No no... I had no intentions of betraying your people. I was only defending myself. It was all a misunderstanding."] = "不不...我没有打算要背叛你的同胞。我只是自我防卫。这全是误会。",
		["No restraints? Just a circle?"] = "没有任何限制?就在一圈鲜血之中?",
		["No snooping around, friend. If you're looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you'll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city."] = "朋友，别在这里东张西望。$B$B要买王冠化学制药公司的节日商品，请去城里的可爱商品商人那里。",
		["No, Ulathek. He knows your secret. He knows you plot with Lord Hel'nurath of Xoroth."] = "不，乌拉泰克。他知道你的秘密。他知道你跟克索诺斯，赫尔努拉斯领主的阴谋。",
		["No, Vaelan, I do not."] = "不，维埃兰，我不清楚。",
