		["Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?"] = "好，让我先弄清楚。你把令牌裂片委托给你的安纳克罗斯，叫他把裂片放你制作的小鱼身上。然后现在你要我去做一个...一个奥金浮标之类的东西...让你的小鱼现形?而且还有可能引起元素之王的愤怒?我有漏掉什么东西吗?或许我应该连衣服都不要穿，在日蚀、闰年的时候去?",
