		["The Burning Inn."] = "烧毁的旅店。",
		["The Darkmoon Faire has already arrived, you say? Where is it located?"] = "你是说暗月马戏团已经来了?它在哪里?",
		["The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed. Be sure to visit it today!"] = "暗月马戏团只开放很短的一段时间，幕布很快就要落下了。今天一定要去看看！",
		["The Dragonmaw are corrupt. They are strip-mining this island of all natural resources and using those resources to supply Illidan's armies out of the Black Temple. They take much for themselves, however, and sell whatever they have hidden away to the highest bidder."] = "龙喉氏族已经堕落。他们正在掠夺这座岛上的全部自然资源，用这些资源供养驻扎在黑暗神殿的伊利丹军队。不过，他们也把不少资源据为己有，再把藏起来的东西卖给出价最高的人。",
		["The Drakkari Chieftains have been captured! What more would you have me do?"] = "我抓到了达卡莱酋长!您还要我做点什么?",
		["The Eventide"] = "日暮区",
		["The Eye led me here, Eris."] = "眼睛指引我来到这儿，艾瑞斯。",
		["The Felsworn Gas Mask was destroyed, do you have another one?"] = "邪誓防毒面具被摧毁了，你还有其它的吗?",
		["The Firelord and all who dare stand in my way shall reel from my wrath."] = "火焰领主和胆敢阻拦的人都会被我的愤怒所摧残。",
		["The Fruit of Fertility?"] = "丰饶之果？",
		["The Horde Quarter"] = "部落区",
		["The Lady Mehley"] = "梅利女士号",
		["The Maiden's Fancy"] = "少女之爱号",
		["The Ruins of Eldarath."] = "埃达拉斯废墟。",
		["The Silvermoon City Inn."] = "银月城旅店",
		["The Tapping of the Keg"] = "开桶仪式",
		["The Timbermaw furbolgs."] = "木喉熊怪",
		["The Vector Coil is massive. I hope we have more than one abomination guarding the numerous weak points."] = "旋绕导航器十分巨大。我希望我们有一个以上的憎恨来守卫那为数众多的弱点。",
		["The Violet Citadel"] = "紫罗兰城塞",
		["The Violet Hold"] = "紫罗兰监狱",
		["The Wayfarer's Rest tavern."] = "旅人休憩小酒馆",
		["The auction house"] = "拍卖场",
		["The bank"] = "银行",
		["The bat handler"] = "蝙蝠管理员",
		["The battlemaster"] = "战场军官",
		["The cipher fragment is to be moved. Have it delivered to Zuluhed."] = "这个密码碎片需要移至他处。将它送交给祖鲁希德。",
		["The day of judgement has come, fiend! I challenge you to battle!"] = "审判之日已经来临了，恶魔！我向你挑战！",
		["The door is open, Kharan. You are a free man."] = "卡兰，门开了。你自由了。",
		["The east."] = "东边。",
		["The eastern zeppelin tower"] = "东部飞艇塔",
		["The forest sings with the seeds of change. Our new friends, the draenei, are here, and we will help them to build a place of their own."] = "变革的种子让森林唱起了歌。我们的新朋友德莱尼已经来到这里，我们会帮助他们建立自己的家园。",
		["The guild master"] = "公会注册员和商人",
		["The inn"] = "旅店",
		["The inn - if you can call it that - is on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. They don't even have beds."] = "旅店——如果那也算旅店的话——就在贸易区的上层环廊。那里甚至连床都没有。",
		["The land of Azshara."] = "艾萨拉地区。",
		["The mage tower to the north."] = "北方的法师塔。",
		["The mailbox"] = "邮箱",
		["The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers."] = "达拉然最受欢迎的旅店是戏法旅舍，就在城中心以北。联盟区和部落区也各有自己的旅店；我还听说，城市下方的下水道里另有一家。",
		["The officers' lounge"] = "军官的休息室",
		["The pleasure is mine, madam. Might I ask what it is that you are doing here?"] = "我也很高兴遇见你们，女士。我能问问你在这儿干什么吗?",
		["The presence of blue dragons."] = "蓝龙现身",
		["The situation is rather complicated, Thrall. It would be best for you to head into the mountains now, before more of Blackmoore's men show up. We'll make sure Taretha is safe."] = "情况有点复杂，萨尔。你最好在布莱克摩尔的人来之前去往山那边。我们会保证塔蕾莎的安全。",
		["The stable master"] = "兽栏管理员",
		["The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring. He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances! Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures. Seek him out above."] = "欺诈者法师领主伊洛姆守护着第三道环。他会独自现身，看起来毫无防备，但千万别被表象蒙骗！伊洛姆是位强大的召唤师，能驾驭一群幻象生物。到上方去找他。",
		["The weapon master"] = "武器大师",
		["The west."] = "西边。",
		["The western zeppelin tower"] = "西部飞艇塔",
		["The wind rider master"] = "双足飞龙管理员",
		["The word is given. The Lich King will die by our hands!"] = "我们言出如山，巫妖王必将败倒在我们脚下！",
		["The zeppelin master"] = "飞艇管理员",
		["Then listen well, $r. Several months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes. Princess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire."] = "那就听好了，$r。几个月前，湖畔镇的治安官派使者前往铁炉堡，请求国王协助抵御从赤脊山和燃烧平原袭来的黑石氏族入侵。茉艾拉公主不顾我的劝阻，自愿前去援助。我奉命率领二十名精锐卫兵，护送公主踏上从洛克湖前往湖畔镇的危险旅程。",
		["Then repeat after me: \"Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde. I give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command. From this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!\""] = "跟着我说一遍:“(兽人语)Lok'tar ogar!不胜即亡 - 就是这几个字让我跟部落连结在一起!对任何一个部落的战士而言，这几个字是最神圣且基本的真理。 我将我的血肉无条件献给大酋长，我将完成所有大酋长的意志，我就是大酋长命令下的武器。 从此刻到世界末日为止，我活着，我牺牲 - 为了部落!”",
		["Then what?"] = "然后呢？",
		["There is a scholar, Arunel, who can assist you. You will find him in the Temple of the Moon, often conversing with one of the returned Highborne."] = "有一位名叫 Arunel 的学者可以帮你的忙。你可以在月神殿里找到他，他经常在那里与归返的上层精灵交谈。",
		["There is only one Warchief, Eitrigg!"] = "只有一个大酋长，伊崔格！",
		["There was something else I wanted to ask you, Altruis."] = "我还想问你其它的事情，奥翠司。",
		["There was something else I wanted to ask you."] = "我还有其它事情想要问你。",
		["There will be plenty of time for this later Brann, we need to get moving!"] = "以后有的是时间啊，布莱恩。我们必须立即转移！",
		["There's a chemical inside the rocket. What is it?"] = "火箭中有一种化学药剂。那是什么?",
		["These dwarves are the same ones today, yes? Do dwarves maintain any other links to the Earthen?"] = "这些矮人和现在的矮人是同一种生物吗?矮人和土灵还有其它的关联吗?",
		["They?"] = "他们?",
		["This brings Frostwyrm to the ground and put an end to her."] = "那条冰霜巨龙一降落，我就能杀死她。",
		["This is a lot to think about."] = "这些讯息真是要好好思考啊...",
		["This is all very interesting but what is it that you want?"] = "这很有趣，但是你到底想说什么？",
		["This is an atrocity."] = "这真是残忍的行径。",
		["This is disturbing. Please continue."] = "打扰了，请继续。",
		["This means war, Lump! War I say!"] = "这代表战争，浪普!我说战争!",
		["Those days are over, Eris."] = "这么多天过去了，艾瑞斯。",
		["Through the Dark Portal"] = "通过黑暗之门",
		["Thrown"] = "投掷武器",
		["Thunder Bluff Champion's Pennant"] = "雷霆崖冠军的旗帜",
		["Ticket Exchange"] = "奖券兑换",
		["To Malyfous, I assume."] = "我想，你应该去玛雷弗斯那里。",
		["To the east."] = "到东边。",
		["To the west."] = "到西边。",
		["Tokens & Souvenirs"] = "奖品章和纪念品",
		["Tonks?"] = "什么是坦克控制器？",
		["Touch the Suntara stone and call forth Lathoric the Black and his guardian, Obsidion."] = "触摸桑塔拉之石，召唤出黑衣拉索里克和他的警卫，需要黑曜石。",
		["Toys"] = "玩具",
		["Trade District"] = "贸易区",
		["Trade Supplies"] = "交易商品",
		["Tragic..."] = "真是悲惨啊……",
		["Train me"] = "请让我接受训练。",
		["Train me!"] = "训练我！",
		["Train me."] = "请让我接受训练。",
		["Trainers"] = "训练师",
		["Transcribe the tablet."] = "抄录在板上。",
		["Travel well, hero of the Alliance!"] = "一路好走，联盟的英雄!",
		["Treelos, I know that the truth is somewhere inside you. Tell me what it is."] = "崔洛斯，我知道真相就在你心里的某处。告诉我吧。",
		["Trick or Treat!"] = "不给糖就捣蛋!",
		["Trinkets, Relics & Off-hand Items"] = "饰品、圣物与副手物品",
		["Troggs?! Are the troggs you mention the same as the ones in the world today?"] = "穴居怪?!你说的穴居怪难道就是现在的那种穴居怪?",
		["Turn the key to start the machine."] = "转动钥匙，启动了机器。",
		["Tuskarr Kite"] = "巨牙海民风筝",
		["Uhh, can you send me on the tour of Zul'Drak?"] = "呃，你能送我一程前往祖尔德拉克吗?",
		["Ultris?"] = "奥崔斯?",
		["Um, I'm taking some prisoners we found outside before the king for punishment."] = "嗯，在国王下令惩处囚犯之前，我救出了一些人。",
		["Um, no... no, I don't want that at all."] = "嗯，不...不，我一点都不想要那样。",
		["Um... what was that?"] = "呃...那是什么?",
		["Umm... Pebblebitty... the gate is open."] = "嗯……贝波蒂……门已经打开了。",
		["Ummm... the frog says you're a traitor, \"matey.\""] = "嗯……青蛙说你就是叛徒，我的“朋友”。",
		["Unbelievable! How dare they??"] = "不可思议!他们怎么如此大胆??",
		["Unchain and control Flamebringer."] = "松开并且控制火焰使者。",
		["Underground..."] = "地下……",
		["Uni-brow"] = "独眉",
		["Unless?"] = "除非？",
		["Until what, Eva? I must know."] = "直到什么时候，伊娃?我必须知道这一点。",
		["Until what?"] = "直到什么?",
		["Use engineering to access hidden schematics!"] = "用工程学访问私密文件！",
		["Use the Bash'ir crystalforge to make another purchase."] = "使用巴什尔水晶熔炉。",
		["Use the fel crystalforge to make another purchase."] = "使用邪能水晶熔炉。",
		["Use the outhouse."] = "使用厕所。",
		["Usurper?"] = "篡位者？",
		["Vaelastraz, no!!"] = "瓦拉斯塔兹，不!!!",
		["Vaelastraz,, no!!"] = "瓦拉斯塔兹，不！！！",
		["Val'kyr? We're ready for them."] = "华尔琪？我们已经准备好了。",
		["Vanira told me to speak to you about borrowing a bat."] = "凡妮拉要我跟你谈谈借一只蝙蝠的事情。",
		["Vendors"] = "商人",
		["Very well, Chromie."] = "好吧，克罗米。",
		["Very well, let me see what you've got."] = "非常好，让我看看你有什么。",
		["Very well. I will return to the Black Temple and notify Lord Illidan of your unwillingness to carry out his wishes. I suggest you make arrangements with your subordinates and let them know that you will soon be leaving this world."] = "非常好。我会回去黑暗神庙报告伊利丹王你不愿意执行他所期望的任务。我建议你可以跟你的下属交代一下，让他们知道你很快就会离开这个世界了。",
		["Very well. I'll take part in this competition."] = "很好。我要参与这场竞争。",
		["Visit a bank"] = "前往一家银行。",
		["Visit a mailbox"] = "访问邮箱。",
		["Visit a trader"] = "拜访一名商人。",
		["Wait! I want some coffee!"] = "等等!我想要咖啡!",
		["Wait, back up. What was that last thing you said?"] = "等等，退回刚说的话。你最后说了什么?",
		["Waken the slumbering mjordin to see if it is really the ancient hero, Iskalder."] = "唤醒休眠的默约丁以确认是否为远古英雄，伊斯卡德。",
		["Walk free, elder. Bring the spirits back to your tribe."] = "自由地走吧，长者。把精灵们带回你的部族。",
		["Walt sent me to pick up some dark iron ingots."] = "渥特派我来捡一些黑铁锭。",
		["Warchief Mor'ghor runs the show here. Don't forget it."] = "这里由大酋长莫戈尔当家做主，别忘了。",
		["Warlock"] = "术士",
		["Warrior"] = "战士",
		["Watcher Analysis: Freya"] = "分析观察者：芙蕾雅",
		["Watcher Analysis: Hodir"] = "分析观察者：霍迪尔",
		["Watcher Analysis: Mimiron"] = "分析观察者：米米尔隆",
		["Watcher Analysis: Thorim"] = "分析观察者：托里姆",
		["Watcher Leesa'oh, why are you out here?"] = "看守者里萨欧，你为什么在这里?",
		["We are honored by your presence, friend. How can we serve you today?"] = "朋友，能有你的光临，我们深感荣幸。今天有什么可以为你效劳？",
		["We are prepared, Highlord. Let us battle for the fate of Azeroth! For the light of dawn!"] = "我们准备好了，大领主。让我们为艾泽拉斯世界的命运战斗！为了黎明之光！",
		["We are ready to get you out of here, Thrall. Let's go!"] = "我们已经准备好要救你出来了，萨尔。来吧!",
		["We are ready to go, High Overlord. The Lich King must fall!"] = "我们准备好了，大王。巫妖王必须死！",
		["We are ready to help!"] = "我们这就来帮忙！",
		["We could use a healer."] = "我们需要一位治疗者。",
		["We do wish for you to stand down, your Highness."] = "我希望您退后，陛下。",
		["We have much in common, night elf. I can't help but feel that perhaps it was fate that brought us together. Let me help you, Cowlen. Let my people help. We will right the wrongs. This I vow."] = "我们有很多共同点，夜精灵。我不由自主的觉得或许是命运把我们连结在一起。让我来帮你，科伦。让我的人民来帮忙。我们会让一切恢复正常。我发誓。",
		["We have the purified ashes of Vordrassil's sapling. If we can subdue Ursoc, we might be able to heal his soul."] = "我们有了净化过的沃达希尔树苗灰烬。如果我们能够压制住厄索克，也许我们就可以治疗祂的灵魂。",
		["We live in a world of endless tragedy."] = "我们生活在无尽的悲剧中。",
		["We need to get into the fight. Are you ready?"] = "我们需要进入战斗。你准备好了吗?",
		["We want another shot at those beasts!"] = "我们要向这些野兽再发出狠狠的一击！",
		["We will fight you until the end, then, Lantresor. We will not stand idly by as you pillage our towns and kill our people."] = "那么，我们会与你对抗到底，兰崔索。我们不会呆站一旁任你掠夺我们的城镇杀害我们的人民。",
		["We'll get you out, Taretha. Don't worry. I doubt the wizard would wander too far away."] = "我们会救你出来的，塔蕾莎。别担心，我猜巫师离这里还远得很呢。",
		["We'll just have to improve our own teamwork to match the two of them."] = "我们必须提高我们的团队协作能力，才能战胜那两个家伙。",
		["We're only doing what is best for Lordaeron, your Highness."] = "我们只做对洛丹伦有益的事，陛下。",
		["We're ready for anything!"] = "我们已经做好了一切准备！",
		["We're ready to face Illidan."] = "我准备好面对伊利丹了。",
		["We're ready to fight the sorceror again."] = "我们已经准备好了再次同那名法师作战。",
		["We're ready! Let's go!"] = "准备就绪！出发！",
		["We're ready, Muradin"] = "我们准备好了，穆拉丁。",
		["We're ready, Thrall."] = "我们准备好了，萨尔。",
		["We're ready. Begin the assault!"] = "我们准备好了。开始进击!",
		["We're ready. This time things will be different."] = "我们已经准备好了。这一次情况就不一样了。",
		["We're sure. Let's go!"] = "确信无疑。出发吧！",
		["We're with you Brann! Open it!"] = "我们与你同在，布莱恩!打开吧!",
		["Weapons"] = "武器",
		["Weapons Trainer"] = "武器训练师",
		["Well Entrance"] = "水井入口",
		["Well then... show me the tribute!"] = "好吧……给我看看贡品！",
		["Well... yes."] = "好的...是。",
		["Western Sewer Entrance"] = "西下水道入口",
		["What Guardian? I don't understand any of this."] = "什么守护者?我完全不知道。",
		["What a story! So she went into Hive'Regal and that was the last you saw of her?"] = "真是一个有意思的故事！那么说来她进入了雷戈虫巢，然后这就是你最后一次见到她了？",
		["What abilities do amber drakes have?"] = "琥珀龙有什么能力?",
		["What abilities do emerald drakes have?"] = "翡翠龙有什么能力?",
		["What abilities do ruby drakes have?"] = "晶红龙有什么能力?",
		["What about the Winterfall furbolg?"] = "冬泉熊怪怎么样?",
		["What are Darkmoon Cards?"] = "暗月卡?",
		["What are Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets and how do I get them?"] = "暗月马戏团奖品券?",
		["What are Ethereum?"] = "复仇军是什么?",
		["What are Synthebrew Goggles?"] = "这里是一枚金币，给自己买点好东西吧。",
		["What are the anomalies you speak of?"] = "你所说的变化是什么?",
		["What are the chances of obtaining such a hide?"] = "我如何才能获得比斯巨兽的皮呢？",
		["What are the components?"] = "需要哪些材料?",
		["What are the stones of binding?"] = "禁锢之石是什么?",
		["What are you doing out here?"] = "你在这外头做什么?",
		["What are you doing there?"] = "你在这里干做什么?",
		["What are you hiding under that fold of flesh?"] = "为什么你要躲在那堆血肉之后?",
		["What brings a tauren to the Plaguelands?"] = "你这样的牛头人到底是为了什么来到瘟疫之地呢？",
		["What brings you to the Sunwell?"] = "是什么风把你吹来太阳之井的？",
		["What can I do at an inn?"] = "我能在旅店里干些什么?",
		["What can I purchase?"] = "我可以购买什么?",
		["What can be done? I have tried many different things. I have done my best to help the people of Nagrand. Each time I have approached Garrosh, he has dismissed me."] = "还有什么可以做?我试着去做许多不同的事，我尽全力去帮助纳葛兰的人民，每次我接近加尔鲁什，他就打发我走。",
		["What can other weapon masters teach?"] = "其它的武器大师能教给我什么呢?",
		["What can these siege engines do?"] = "这些攻城机具有什么功能?",
		["What can we do to assist you?"] = "我们怎么协助你？",
