		["Wine & Cheese"] = "葡萄酒与起司",
		["With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won't be too soon."] = "有阿尔杰农持续给我供货，我在这里做事就连一株草药都不用亲自去找。要是我再也不用看见大自然那些奇观，那真是再好不过。",
		["With alchemy you can turn found herbs into healing and other types of potions."] = "借助炼金术，你能把采集到的草药变成治疗药水和各类药剂。",
		["With all due respect, Warchief - why not allow them to be destroyed? Does this not strengthen our position?"] = "恕我直言，统帅大人--为什么不消灭他们？难道这不会巩固我们的地位吗？",
		["With all due respect, your Highness, we can do this alone."] = "我们可以独力完成，陛下。",
		["Woah, woah, woah! Keep it down, $N. Keep it down! <Blast looks around.> We don't want those frosty vrykul noticing us, now do we? What do you think of my jumpbot? I based it off of the mechagnome. Pretty slick, huh?"] = "哇、哇、哇！小声点，$N，小声点！<轰击四下张望。>我们可不想让那些冰霜维库人发现，对吧？你觉得我的弹跳机器人怎么样？我是以机械侏儒为原型造的。挺精巧吧？",
		["World's End Tavern"] = "世界的尽头小酒馆",
		["Worry no more, taunka. The Horde will save and protect you and your people, but first you must swear allegiance to the Warchief by taking the blood oath of the Horde."] = "宽心吧，牦牛人，部落会拯救并保护你的族人。但是，你必须先以部落的血誓效忠大酋长。",
		["Would you like a ride?"] = "想搭个便车吗？",
		["Would you renew my Covenant disguise?"] = "你可以恢复我的银色盟约伪装吗，博学者哈索瑞尔?",
		["Would you renew my Sunreaver disguise?"] = "你可以恢复我的夺日者伪装吗?",
		["Wow, you're insane, aren't you?"] = "啧啧，我看你是疯了……",
		["Wrathgate"] = "愤怒之门",
		["Wyrmbait, eh? Welp, go fetch us Icestorm!"] = "巨龙引诱者，是吗?那，把冰飓带给我们!",
		["X-51 Nether-Rocket Mount"] = "X-51型虚空火箭坐骑",
		["YES!"] = "太好了!",
		["Yarp."] = "对啰。",
		["Yarr!"] = "呀嗬！",
		["Yeah, I'm sure safety is your top priority. Give me a rocket pack."] = "当然，我知道安全是你的首要考虑。拿一件火箭背包给我。",
		["Yeah, you're a real brainiac. Just how smart do you think you are, Slip'kik?"] = "是，你真是个笨蛋。斯里基克，你认为自己有多聪明?",
		["Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks he's a warrior. Ha!"] = "你不是战士……照我的训练强度，你连一天都撑不过去！一个以为自己是战士的$c？哈！",
		["Yes I checked, I'm missing the left piece!"] = "是的，我检查过了，左边这一瓣找不到了！",
		["Yes I checked, I'm missing the top piece!"] = "是的，我检查过了，上面的那一瓣找不到了！",
		["Yes I do!"] = "是的，没错。",
		["Yes Scryer, You may possess me"] = "是的，占卜者。你可以拥有我。",
		["Yes elder. Tell me more of the book."] = "是的，长者。告诉我更多关于这本书的事。",
		["Yes! I want more of that fabulous Noggenfogger Elixir!"] = "我想要看看你卖的货物。",
		["Yes, Augustus. I would like to do business."] = "是的，奥古斯图斯。我想做生意。",
		["Yes, Hargus. I wish to purchase supplies."] = "是的，哈古斯，我想要买些补给品。",
		["Yes, I am ready to travel to Venture Bay!"] = "是的，我准备好要去风险海湾了!",
		["Yes, I have. Teach me."] = "当然，我有。教给我吧。",
		["Yes, I'd like to purchase a ride down to the Ghostlands."] = "是的，我想购买前往鬼魂之地的单程票。",
		["Yes, I'd love a ride to Blackwind Landing."] = "是，我愿意乘坐虚空鳐飞往黑风码头。",
		["Yes, my Prince. We are ready."] = "是的，我的王子。我们准备好了。",
		["Yes, please continue."] = "是，请继续。",
		["Yes, please do."] = "是的，是这样。",
		["Yes, please summon it back!"] = "是的，请把它召唤回来！",
		["Yes, please!"] = "嗯，麻烦你啦！",
		["Yes, please, I would like to return to the ground level of the temple."] = "喔，谢谢，我想要回到神殿的底层。",
		["Yes, please, if you do not mind."] = "是的，拜托，如果你不介意的话。",
		["Yes, sir. Thank you, sir!"] = "是，长官！谢谢你，长官！",
		["Yes, taunka. Retribution is a given right of all members of the Horde."] = "没错，牦牛人，只要是部落的一分子，你就有报复的权利。",
		["Yes."] = "是的。",
		["Yes. Give me the spell to summon the avatar."] = "好的，请教我召唤哈卡化身的法术。",
		["Yes. I do."] = "是的。我愿意。",
		["Yes. I have."] = "是的。",
		["Yes. We are prepared for the challenges ahead of us."] = "是的。我们准备着即将到来的挑战。",
		["Yes..."] = "是……",
		["Yes... yes, it's me."] = "是的...没错，就是我...",
		["Yet what? What is it, Oronok?"] = "可是什么?这是什么，欧朗诺克?",
		["You can cook? So can I! Is there a recipe you can teach me?"] = "你会烹饪?我也会!你有什么独门食谱可以传授给我吗?",
		["You can count on me, Hero."] = "英雄，你可以信赖我。",
		["You can find Tannysa standing outside Alchemy Needs in the Mage Quarter."] = "你可以在法师区的「炼金所需」店外找到塔妮莎。",
		["You can talk to Anya Maulray up by the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. I wouldn't recommend it, but they're your pets."] = "你可以去贸易区上层环廊的旅店找安雅·玛尔雷谈谈。我不建议你这么做，不过宠物是你的，你自己决定。",
		["You can trust me. I am no friend of the Lich King's."] = "你可以信任我。我不是巫妖王的朋友。",
		["You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?"] = "告诉我更多的信息。",
		["You couldn't handle a lone night elf priestess?"] = "你连一个落单的暗夜精灵女祭司都没法摆平？",
		["You gave the crew disguises?"] = "你有提供成员们伪装吗?",
		["You have fought well, spirit. I ask you to grant me the strength of your body and the strength of your heart."] = "你战斗得很勇敢，精灵。我请你赐予我你身体和心灵的力量。",
		["You have lost your mind, Nefarius. You speak in riddles."] = "你已经失去理智，奈法利斯。你在说什么哑谜。",
		["You have not lived until you have dug deep into the earth."] = "不深入地底挖一挖，就不算真正活过。",
		["You look like an intelligent person. Why don't you read one of these leaflets and give it some thought?"] = "你看起来像是一个聪明的人。你何不看看这些传单然后加入你的想法呢?",
		["You look safe enough... let's do this."] = "你看起来够安全了...我们上吧。",
		["You may speak frankly, Neeru..."] = "你明说吧，尼尔鲁...",
		["You mean the iceberg?"] = "你是指冰山?",
		["You mean to tell me you sell frogs?"] = "你想说的是你有在卖青蛙?",
		["You mentioned two results when the Earthen destabilize. What is the second?"] = "你提到当土灵不稳定的时候出现了两个变种。那第二个是什么?",
		["You put the piece on a minnow and placed the minnow somewhere in the waters of the sea between here and the Eastern Kingdoms? And this minnow has special powers?"] = "你把那东西交给一条小鱼，然后将那条小鱼放到这片大陆与东部王国之间的水域中，而且这条小鱼拥有特殊的能力?",
		["You raised all of the orcs here, Greatmother?"] = "主母，你养育了这里全部的兽人?",
		["You want me to do what?"] = "什么？加入王子的军队？",
		["You want me to take part in the Hyldsmeet to end the war?"] = "你要我参与海兹竞技好结束这场战争?",
		["You were telling me about The Veiled Blade and how you took the wrong mission."] = "你在告诉我有关迷雾之刃的事情，以及你们怎样错误地接手了这个任务。",
		["You will be ok, Awbee. Your assailants have been terminated."] = "你会没事的，奥比。攻击你的人已经被杀死了。",
		["You will have to excuse me, Lorax, I do not speak 'crazy'."] = "你一定要原谅我，罗拉克斯，我没有“疯狂”地说什么。",
		["You will listen to this, vile duke! I am not your Twilight's Hammer lapdog! I am here to challenge you! Come! Come, and meet your death..."] = "卑鄙的公爵，听好了！我可不是暮光之锤的走狗！我是来向你提出挑战的！来吧，受死吧……",
		["You! COME! Drink, feast, rest for the next battle. But do not fight! Or I will feed you to my wolves."] = "你！过来！喝酒、吃东西，好好休息，准备迎接下一场战斗。但不许打架！否则我就把你喂给我的狼！",
		["You''re Astor Hadren, right?"] = "你是阿斯托·哈德恩，对吗?",
		["You''ve got something I need, Astor. And I''ll be taking it now."] = "你有我所要的东西，阿斯托。我现在要拿走它。",
		["You'd better have good reason to approach me, minnow!"] = "你最好有充分的理由来接近我，小鱼苗！",
		["You'll be even more amazed after we take them out!"] = "等到我们将他们彻底消灭的时候，你会更吃惊的！",
		["You'll find Horace Alder pacing about above the ground level of Lady Proudmoore's tower."] = "你会看到 Horace Alder 在 Proudmoore 女士的塔楼里、地面层之上的地方踱来踱去。",
		["You'll find the warlocks in the Magic Quarter's main building, but I better not hear of any trouble that comes of this."] = "术士们在魔法区的主楼里，不过这件事要是惹出什么麻烦，我可不想听见。",
		["You're an alchemist? So am I. Perhaps you can teach me what you know..."] = "你是个炼金师?我也是。也许你可以教我些东西...",
		["You're an odd little guy."] = "你是个奇怪的小家伙。",
		["You're free to go Orsonn, but first tell me what's wrong with the furbolg."] = "你自由了，欧尔嵩，但先告诉我熊怪到底出了什么问题。",
		["You're free to go now. The way out is safe."] = "你现在可以走了。出去的路很安全。",
		["You're good for nothing, Ribbly. It's time to pay for your wickedness!."] = "你这个废物，雷布里。现在该为你的邪恶付出代价了!",
		["You're insane."] = "你疯了。",
		["You're not alone here?"] = "你在这儿不是一个人？",
		["Your bondage is at an end, Doom'rel. I challenge you!"] = "你的奴役结束了，杜姆雷尔。我向你挑战!",
		["Your eminence, may I have a word in private?"] = "大人，方便跟您借一步说话吗?",
		["Your insight is appreciated."] = "洗耳恭听。",
		["Your kind?"] = "你们的种族？",
		["Your mate?"] = "你的朋友?",
		["Your propaganda won't work on me. Spout your treasonous filth elsewhere, traitor!"] = "你的煽动对我没有作用。到别处去使出你的肮脏本事吧，背叛者!",
		["Your words of praise are appreciated, Coliseum Master."] = "感谢你的赞扬，演武场统领。",
		["Ysera is my answer."] = "我的答案是伊瑟拉。",
		["Zorus, I need a new pair of goggles."] = "索罗斯，我需要一副新的护目镜。",
	},
}

McodeSTCN_NPC = {  -- NPC 收敛索引·问候：中文名 → 该 NPC 的 GREET 词典键
	["R-3D0"] = { "I AM FLUENT IN OVER TWO LANGUAGES: DWARVISH, GNOMISH AND THE VERY COMMON TONGUE OF HUMANS. BUT I HAVE NO IDEA WHAT YOU ARE SAYING! SPEAK UP; I CANNOT HEAR YOU OVER THE GRINDING OF MY GEARS!" },
	["UNUSED Nicole Morris"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["World Stable Master"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["“万能钥匙”帕兹克·派洛特"] = { "Hey $c, if you've lost a key I might be able to help you out." },
	["“上尉”卡弗提兹"] = { "That Shaffar is a clever one. He's rigged the entrance with some sort of ward to prevent other ethereal groups from entering. We're working on breaking through his defenses so we can get in there and take what's ours. I've got top ethereals working on this around the clock. We'll have it open any minute now. I can feel it..." },
	["“利爪”安吉拉·凯斯提尔"] = { "<Angela coos to the felhunter again before turning her attention to you.> Jir'see's always been smaller than all the other felhunters, but that's never bothered him. And Outland's going to change all that, right Jir'see? Momma's little angel is going to grow up to be a big, fierce felhunter, yes he is!" },
	["“刷子”埃德曼"] = { "I had it all, once. Fame, fortune, a full set of the very best gladiator's gear... and then I threw it all away. Once the Cartel caught me rigging fights... trading wins... it was all over. Now I've got nothing but these rags and a bad liver." },
	["“咸鱼”约翰·索普"] = { "Just another day workin' the kitchen. Sure gets dull after a while." },
	["“国王”唐金"] = { "Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good! I sell the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches.", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["“外乡人”库特·阿尔博森"] = { "Lemme give you some advice: Never trust a gnome.", "Say, you look familiar. Have we met?" },
	["“好儿子”沙度·远行者"] = { "Greetings, $c. You seek to push yourself to the limits of your hunting prowess? Look no further. Hemet Nesingwary has assembled the finest expedition the remnant of this world has ever known. Join us on safari if you dare.", "Hemet is the greatest hunter that I know. We chanced upon each other in the hills of Winterspring back on Azeroth many moons ago. He and I were stalking the same quarry: the great cat known as Rak'shiri. Rather than fight each other over our prey, we made a wager out of it; whoever collected the frostsaber's skin would get to demand something of the other. To my eternal shame, this is how I earned the nickname, Fitz. Do I look like a Fitz?", "The mighty hunter, $N returns. Tell me the tale of stalking your latest prey." },
	["“小专家”丹尼克·布莱沙弗"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["“小个子”洛戈克"] = { "Hungry? Can sleep here, too." },
	["“尖嗓子”斯克里·拉克希德"] = { "I'll never take another shortcut again, I swear! How was I supposed to know the skies over Hellfire Peninsula were that dangerous?" },
	["“曲奇”米维克索斯"] = { "Avast ye, matey. Cookie is me name, cooking is me game. The McWeaksauce bloodline be a long line of cooks and tradesmen that work to please the more delicate senses o' man and woman." },
	["“杂学家”玛姆迪"] = { "What's an \"Ologist?\" A better question might be what isn't an \"Ologist.\" It means I study everything! In fact, I'm so well versed in \"everything\" that I'm guaranteed to be the most intelligent ethereal you'll ever meet - or your money back. Apologies. That's the dealer in me talking..." },
	["“母鹅”托比·铁栓"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["“火柴腿”丹"] = { "What ye be lookin' at, matey?" },
	["“猎枪”琼斯"] = { "Never look these Broken directly in the eyes. I think they can suck the soul right out of you if they're so inclined!" },
	["“瘦子”"] = { "Ah, I see you are a friend to the Consortium. Perhaps you would be interested in making a purchase?", "I'm neither slim nor shady. As a matter of fact, I find both references insulting. Now, get out of my sight before I plant my staff up your backside." },
	["“背刺者”宾度·盖布"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["“脏鬼”拉瑞"] = { "Beat it, kid. I got business to attend to..." },
	["“脏鬼”迈克尔·克罗维"] = { "You might wanna stand back. Fish guttin' is a dirty job." },
	["“诚实的”麦克斯"] = { "Greetings, friend. Something I can do for ya?", "Hey there, hold on just one second. I see you're not riding a flying mount of your own. You probably won't be of much use to the other goblins here if you can't get around. They've paid me to loan my used mounts to people such as yourself -- at no cost to you. Interested?" },
	["“醉鬼”麦克马努斯"] = { "Everything is set up and ready to go." },
	["“钢锯”杰妮"] = { "Bones... flesh... muscles... tendons... cartilage... it all comes together here under my hacksaw." },
	["“银月”哈瑞"] = { "Blood elf treasure's unlike any other. It's not just the gold or the silk or gems used as materials, sin'dorei craftsmanship is valuable in and of itself." },
	["“雷光号”"] = { "Looks just powerful enough to carry one gnome. Maybe two." },
	["“鼠胆船长”托格雷"] = { "Ah, yes, that... the name. Well... as they say, a good name, like good will, is got by many actions and lost by one. No need to go into the hows or whys; suffice to say, that is how I am named by some.", "Aye, that's her name, and a fine ship she is. There's much to learn from such vessels, you know. A great poet once said: Ships that pass in the night, and speak each other in passing, only a signal shown, and a distant voice in the darkness; So on the ocean of life, we pass and speak one another, only a look and a voice, then darkness again and a silence.", "Mr. Combs, the ship's engineer and quartermaster, can furnish you with whatever supplies you might require. He is a fair tinker, too, if your gear is in need of repair.", "Should you desire sustenance, Galley Chief Grace can tend to your needs.", "Welcome to the majestic Lady Mehley. I am Captain Torgoley. If you've questions about the ship, feel free to ask; otherwise, please, enjoy the journey, as I always do... After all, to quote a favorite scribe of mine: My experience of ships is that on them one makes an interesting discovery about the world. One finds one can do without it completely." },
	["“龙饵”"] = { "Awaiting orders!" },
	["丁克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. You want some advice? Befriend a mage! We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..." },
	["丁克·铁哨"] = { "This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn't been all that good as of late..." },
	["丁奇·斯迪波尔"] = { "The Burning Steppes is a dangerous place, but scholars like me will do almost anything to advance our knowledge." },
	["丁奇·火哨"] = { "Are you here to prove yourself to the Lich King as well? It's kind of archaic, don't you think? Having to fight and survive?", "Hey, I recognize you! I guess I have you to thanks for me being here. That teleport accident was the best thing that ever happened to me. If you find yourself back in Borean Tundra, let my goody two-shoes nerd of a duplicate know that I've move up in the world quite a bit!" },
	["万能的尼比"] = { "Bow in my presence, insect! Surely you can feel the power I hold over you." },
	["上古影月之魂"] = { "Teron Gorefiend? Yes... I know of him." },
	["下士亚瑟·弗卢"] = { "Only champions of Stormwind may purchase what I have to offer." },
	["不死者德尔勒克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["不稳定的瓦斯"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["专家考格维尔"] = { "Ugh, I should never have volunteered to be a specialist. They always ask us to do the impossible!" },
	["东尼"] = { "I'm out of my element, eh? Walt doesn't know what he's talking about! I single-handedly kicked the iron out of these dwarves and set up camp to observe the goings-on of the dig site." },
	["丹·戈萨斯"] = { "When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand." },
	["丹克·利刃"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["丹妮卡·森特"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["丹恩·林德雷"] = { "Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?" },
	["丹拉尔·夜路"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["丹文"] = { "Let's get to business, $N. I'll show you what I know, but keep up." },
	["丹纳尔·斯特恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not waste my time, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The warrior's role is one of protection. Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["丹纳罗尔"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["丹莫罗护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["丹达尔"] = { "An alchemist is able to work miracles with ordinary herbs, converting them into stable potions that range in effect from healing to breathing underwater and everything in between." },
	["主工程师特雷普"] = { "When Rocket-Chief Fuselage was asking for volunteers to help out with building the X-52 Nether-Rocket, I submitted my resume for the security division. Unfortunately, the only position that was left was chief engineer. Lucky for me, I have Xyrol here to look over my shoulder." },
	["主教埃德门图斯"] = { "I am Admetius, leader of Blood Watch." },
	["主教纳苏恩"] = { "All three of the gates at the Sunwell Plateau have been brought down, $N. You must marshal your forces and stop Kil'jaeden from entering Azeroth before all is lost!", "This portal is not like the others that lead back to Azeroth. To maintain it, we must acquire more mana cells. It is either that or risk losing our access to the Isle of Quel'Danas and the Sunwell." },
	["主药剂师希尔达迦"] = { "I'm extremely busy, $r. We have a terrible problem on our hands that must be dealt with at once!" },
	["丽娜·壁炉"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["丽莎·坦纳"] = { "Eager to get to Northrend, are you? The steam-powered Kraken sails from here to Valiance Keep in Borean Tundra." },
	["乌尔库"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours." },
	["乌尔格拉"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["乌尔芬"] = { "<Ulfang howls and sniffs at you, and you can understand what he says.> The strange white worg of the north, Garwal, has taken my pack from me. We must rip out his throat so that I will be the alpha worg once again." },
	["乌布雷克·火拳"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["乌拉泰克"] = { "... A message from Banehollow? What message is that? Does he have need of his great advisor and servant, Ulathek? Does he require my presence?", "Be gone! I hold counsel with Dreadlords, and the matters we discuss are not your concern!", "What? But how? No! This is not possible! I have been so careful... he could not know! You lie! You lie, and now you'll die for your deceit!" },
	["乌格索克"] = { "Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time." },
	["乌沙·凿眼"] = { "BOAR'S DUNG! Why must I stay here to guide others to Alterac Valley, when I could be fighting there myself? You! Have you come to fight the Alliance?" },
	["乌泰克"] = { "Kaskala's under attack! We must hold them off until we can escape." },
	["乌特伦"] = { "Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?" },
	["乌瑞克·冯·斯托姆哈斯男爵"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["乌瑞克·猎日者上尉"] = { "Yes, $t citizen : citizen;, what matter of import do you have to bring to my attention?" },
	["乌瑞克·雷角"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do you prefer guns or bows?", "I do not have the knowledge you seek.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["乌米"] = { "Mighty fine weather we're having here, wouldn't you say?", "Why is it that there's never a gyrochronatom lying around when you need one?" },
	["乌舍尔"] = { "I am bound eternally to this cursed world. What is it you desire, mortal?" },
	["乌莫尔特"] = { "'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!", "Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!", "Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.", "Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!", "Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!", "Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!", "If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!", "Season's savings to you and yours!" },
	["乌萨罗"] = { "So many years of battle and slavery, it feels good to have a home again.", "Tell me what you want, and make it quick." },
	["乌达鲁之魂"] = { "Illidan's lackeys still guard these halls, $N. Once they are defeated, my powers will allow me to take you deeper inside the temple." },
	["乔吉亚"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["乔吉奥·波利罗"] = { "Yes, I've been running this shop for some time now. Business has been pretty good lately. A lot of new adventurers coming through..." },
	["乔多·钢眉"] = { "Aye, you look the type to be a leader. Here to organize a guild to fight for the Alliance?" },
	["乔安娜·怀特豪尔"] = { "Leave off. I don't have anything for the likes of you." },
	["乔恩·星眼"] = { "Although we call this land the Barrens, to one who knows where to look this place teems with life." },
	["乔汉·巴内斯"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["乔瑟夫·格里高利"] = { "Cloth is okay. Personally I prefer to work with human skin." },
	["乔纳森·加雷特"] = { "It's amazing what you can learn from a gnome if you squeeze them hard enough: clever little tricks about getting out of a bind, making delicious cookies, and even how to make a flying machine." },
	["乔舒修士"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.", "I trust the Light is with you, $N. Is there something that I can I help you with?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["乔里克·克里丹"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?" },
	["乘务员埃比"] = { "Cap'n Stash is the BEST!", "I swab the decks!", "Swabbin' decks cured my rickets!", "The Lady Mehley is the best ship EVER!" },
	["书记员凯尔斯"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["五指菲玛"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["亚克斯中尉"] = { "Excellent day for a foray into the field wouldn't you say, $g sir : ma'am;?", "Excellent day for a foray into the field wouldn't you say, ma'am?", "Excellent day for a foray into the field wouldn't you say, sir?" },
	["亚历山大·康斯坦丁"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["亚历山大·考德尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["亚历山德拉·波利罗"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["亚历山德拉·米库恩"] = { "Is there anything you can pay me to do?" },
	["亚埃雷尔"] = { "We are very fortunate to be alive, you and I!" },
	["亚尔·锤石"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["亚尔林·晨光"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["亚尔雷"] = { "Yep, I've been stuck here for as long as I can remember. In my former life, I was an armorer. Perhaps I can fix something for you?" },
	["亚尼"] = { "We've lost a good many of our wind riders on scouting missions to the west. The Scourge is ruthless in their assault against any would-be spies. Fortunately, I've come up with a solution that only risks the life of the rider. It's seen a 30% survival rate to those being ferried across the Plains of Nasam. That's a 30% improvement over when we were using wind riders!" },
	["亚尼·纳沙克"] = { "Greetings, $c. It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance. We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us. Please feel free to partake of the feast being offered here. Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year." },
	["亚布·尼比盖尔"] = { "Welcome! Welcome to Yebb Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre - a Trove of Living Legends and Mythical Oddities! Enjoy your visit, friend! But be mindful of what you touch! These exhibits hold artifacts and beasts both dire and divine! They might burn the wayward hand of an over-curious onlooker..." },
	["亚布巴·梅兹布瑞克"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["亚当·希曼"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin.", "I came to Outland hoping to discover powerful artifacts to assist the League of Arathor against the Defilers in Arathi Basin... but all I've found is this smashing magical loincloth, a ridiculous gnome sidekick, and an egomaniacal undead stalker who insists I've stolen his grey skull, or some such. In any case, would you care to join the League in their fight while I continue my search?" },
	["亚当·林德"] = { "You can find passage to Theramore from this dock. Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance. Watch your step and your back." },
	["亚当斯上尉"] = { "We shouldn't have left so many behind at Valgarde. Admiral Keller, that insufferable egomaniac! How am I to fulfill my orders with so few? I need enough men to stay here at the keep and still properly garrison Fort Wildervar when it's ready! At least we have a hope of dealing with our problems now that you're here." },
	["亚恩·诺斯利"] = { "Get lost before I beat you with my booterang." },
	["亚瑟·摩尔"] = { "Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I'm not about to surrender without a fight." },
	["亚米尔德"] = { "Yes, little one?" },
	["亡灵卫兵亚伯拉罕"] = { "Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing. Well to each their own. You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill.", "Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl. He's upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern. Reading, praying, who knows what he's up to, and who would dare to ask?", "At the southeast edge of town is the Gallows' End Tavern. Go there and head upstairs, and you'll find Dark Cleric Beryl inside the reading room.", "Black, grey and dark purple are the prescribed colors. See to it that you don't stray onto the wrong side of fashion street friend. Bowen Brisboise can help to see that you don't. You'll find him inside Cold Hearth Manor on the other side of the bridge to the southwest of town.", "Blacksmith? Nope, our last one turned back into one of those mindless Scourge. There's one in the Undercity though to the south of town though. Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron, clever name, huh? Just take the elevators down at the back of the ruins and then you can talk to one of the Undercity Guardians. They should be able to point you in the right direction.", "Butcher you say? Oh, First Aid Trainer! Same thing. When you see Nurse Neela standing just inside the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of town you'll know why.", "Clyde Kellen, the local bass master, has his favorite fishing spot just east of Brill at Brightwater Lake.", "Do I look to you like I cast spells? Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong was hanging out on the upstairs landing of the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town. Odd how he just stands there outside of Gretchen's room like that.", "Fancy yourself a chef? Head to the Undercity south of town for your training. You can catch the elevators heading down at the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron. Talk to one of those lumbering Undercity Guardians for further assistance once you arrive.", "I guess your first exercise is going to be to mine your way down to the Undercity. Heh, get it? Mine... nevermind. To get to the Undercity go to the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron south of Brill, and take the elevator down. Ask one of the Undercity Guardians there for further assistance.", "I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in the Undercity. All you have to do to get there is head south out of town and go to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron. Then take the elevator down into the Undercity itself and ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions.", "It is Bowen Brisboise that you seek then. You'll find him inside his house southwest of Brill just on the other side of the bridge at Cold Hearth Manor.", "Look for Faruza. Last I saw she was standing out front between the stables and the house on the northwest end of town.", "Look inside the Gallows' End Tavern's main dining room for Austil de Mon. The tavern is on the southeast edge of Brill.", "Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill. I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest.", "Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough.", "Not too clever are you? Hmm, if I were a stable master perhaps I might be in the vicinity of say, the stable? Look for Morganus over there.", "Nothing quite like the feel of something dead rubbing up against you. You can find Shelene Rhobart by heading southeast on the road out of town, and then going east at the intersection. She's at a small camp there not too far along the road.", "Now if I were Innkeeper Renee where might I be? Hmmm? Oh, perhaps inside the Gallows' End Tavern. Yes, that's it, I'm sure of it. Try the southeast end of Brill... think you can find that?", "Nurse Neela greets all of her future customers as they enter the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.", "Our Alchemist's name is Carolai Anise. You'll find her in a house at the northwest end of Brill.", "Paladin? Have you been partaking of the Apothecary's concoctions or some such thing? I have heard a rumor that some elven contingent is visiting the Dark Lady within the Undercity. Perhaps one of them might know.", "Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like. You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill. Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection.", "Rifles, dynamite, bombs, exploding sheep... what's not to love? To learn how to make these and many other exciting tools of the trade head to the Undercity, under the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. Take the elevators down at the back of the ruins. Once you arrive speak to one of the Undercity Guardians about where the trainer is exactly.", "Rupert Boch is his name. I hear that he's upstairs in one of the rooms at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of town.", "Somewhere to fly to? You'll need to go to the Undercity for that! Go south on the road out of town, then southwest to the Ruins of Lordaeron. You can catch the elevator down to the Undercity from the back of the ruins and once there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.", "Sorry friend, we don't have one of those here in Brill. You'll have to head to the Undercity for that. The Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. From the back of the ruins take the elevator down and then speak to one of the Undercity Guardians to find your way further.", "That would be Shelene Rhobart. Take the road southeast out of Brill then head east at the intersection. She's at a camp along the side of the road.", "That's Rupert Boch you're looking for. He and his entourage have a room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of Brill.", "The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call. You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge.", "There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity. Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection. The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left. Go into them and then down into the Undercity. You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance.", "We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that. At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity. Once there ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions.", "What are you looking for?", "What could you possibly need a bank for? Very well, you'll need to go through the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. In the back are a set of elevators leading down into the Undercity. When you get there stop any of those lumbering Abominations they like to call an Undercity Guardian and ask it for better directions.", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity. To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down. Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.", "Why cook when everything tastes like ashes in your mouth? If you have one still that is. Very well, head to the Undercity south of Brill and ask an Undercity Guardian there for further directions to their Cooking Trainer. To get there you can take the elevators down from the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron.", "Word is that Vance Undergloom has taken a permanent room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town. I think he's just off the reading room.", "Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon. He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town. It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it.", "Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill. Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there. We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year.", "You aiming to be a taxidermist? I don't like people who think they can stuff and mount me because they think I'm dead. No? Good! Look for Rand Rhobart at a camp to the southeast of town. To get to him take the road southeast out of Brill and hang a left at the intersection.", "You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill.", "You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town. Why don't you go see if you can help her?", "You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town.", "You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill. I guess he checked in too late to get a room.", "You'll want to look in the Undercity. In the old Ruins of Lordaeron, south of here, you'll find an elevator down. Once you're there, ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions." },
	["亡灵卫兵伦德玛克"] = { "Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing. Well to each their own. You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill.", "Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl. He's upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern. Reading, praying, who knows what he's up to, and who would dare to ask?", "At the southeast edge of town is the Gallows' End Tavern. Go there and head upstairs, and you'll find Dark Cleric Beryl inside the reading room.", "Black, grey and dark purple are the prescribed colors. See to it that you don't stray onto the wrong side of fashion street friend. Bowen Brisboise can help to see that you don't. You'll find him inside Cold Hearth Manor on the other side of the bridge to the southwest of town.", "Blacksmith? Nope, our last one turned back into one of those mindless Scourge. There's one in the Undercity though to the south of town though. Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron, clever name, huh? Just take the elevators down at the back of the ruins and then you can talk to one of the Undercity Guardians. They should be able to point you in the right direction.", "Butcher you say? Oh, First Aid Trainer! Same thing. When you see Nurse Neela standing just inside the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of town you'll know why.", "Clyde Kellen, the local bass master, has his favorite fishing spot just east of Brill at Brightwater Lake.", "Do I look to you like I cast spells? Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong was hanging out on the upstairs landing of the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town. Odd how he just stands there outside of Gretchen's room like that.", "Fancy yourself a chef? Head to the Undercity south of town for your training. You can catch the elevators heading down at the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron. Talk to one of those lumbering Undercity Guardians for further assistance once you arrive.", "I guess your first exercise is going to be to mine your way down to the Undercity. Heh, get it? Mine... nevermind. To get to the Undercity go to the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron south of Brill, and take the elevator down. Ask one of the Undercity Guardians there for further assistance.", "I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in the Undercity. All you have to do to get there is head south out of town and go to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron. Then take the elevator down into the Undercity itself and ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions.", "It is Bowen Brisboise that you seek then. You'll find him inside his house southwest of Brill just on the other side of the bridge at Cold Hearth Manor.", "Look for Faruza. Last I saw she was standing out front between the stables and the house on the northwest end of town.", "Look inside the Gallows' End Tavern's main dining room for Austil de Mon. The tavern is on the southeast edge of Brill.", "Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill. I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest.", "Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough.", "Not too clever are you? Hmm, if I were a stable master perhaps I might be in the vicinity of say, the stable? Look for Morganus over there.", "Nothing quite like the feel of something dead rubbing up against you. You can find Shelene Rhobart by heading southeast on the road out of town, and then going east at the intersection. She's at a small camp there not too far along the road.", "Now if I were Innkeeper Renee where might I be? Hmmm? Oh, perhaps inside the Gallows' End Tavern. Yes, that's it, I'm sure of it. Try the southeast end of Brill... think you can find that?", "Nurse Neela greets all of her future customers as they enter the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.", "Our Alchemist's name is Carolai Anise. You'll find her in a house at the northwest end of Brill.", "Paladin? Have you been partaking of the Apothecary's concoctions or some such thing? I have heard a rumor that some elven contingent is visiting the Dark Lady within the Undercity. Perhaps one of them might know.", "Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like. You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill. Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection.", "Rifles, dynamite, bombs, exploding sheep... what's not to love? To learn how to make these and many other exciting tools of the trade head to the Undercity, under the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. Take the elevators down at the back of the ruins. Once you arrive speak to one of the Undercity Guardians about where the trainer is exactly.", "Rupert Boch is his name. I hear that he's upstairs in one of the rooms at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of town.", "Somewhere to fly to? You'll need to go to the Undercity for that! Go south on the road out of town, then southwest to the Ruins of Lordaeron. You can catch the elevator down to the Undercity from the back of the ruins and once there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.", "Sorry friend, we don't have one of those here in Brill. You'll have to head to the Undercity for that. The Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. From the back of the ruins take the elevator down and then speak to one of the Undercity Guardians to find your way further.", "That would be Shelene Rhobart. Take the road southeast out of Brill then head east at the intersection. She's at a camp along the side of the road.", "That's Rupert Boch you're looking for. He and his entourage have a room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of Brill.", "The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call. You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge.", "There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity. Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection. The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left. Go into them and then down into the Undercity. You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance.", "We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that. At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity. Once there ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions.", "What are you looking for?", "What could you possibly need a bank for? Very well, you'll need to go through the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. In the back are a set of elevators leading down into the Undercity. When you get there stop any of those lumbering Abominations they like to call an Undercity Guardian and ask it for better directions.", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity. To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down. Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.", "Why cook when everything tastes like ashes in your mouth? If you have one still that is. Very well, head to the Undercity south of Brill and ask an Undercity Guardian there for further directions to their Cooking Trainer. To get there you can take the elevators down from the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron.", "Word is that Vance Undergloom has taken a permanent room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town. I think he's just off the reading room.", "Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon. He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town. It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it.", "Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill. Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there. We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year.", "You aiming to be a taxidermist? I don't like people who think they can stuff and mount me because they think I'm dead. No? Good! Look for Rand Rhobart at a camp to the southeast of town. To get to him take the road southeast out of Brill and hang a left at the intersection.", "You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill.", "You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town. Why don't you go see if you can help her?", "You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town.", "You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill. I guess he checked in too late to get a room.", "You'll want to look in the Undercity. In the old Ruins of Lordaeron, south of here, you'll find an elevator down. Once you're there, ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions." },
