use at the northwest end of Brill.", "Paladin? Have you been partaking of the Apothecary's concoctions or some such thing? I have heard a rumor that some elven contingent is visiting the Dark Lady within the Undercity. Perhaps one of them might know.", "Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like. You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill. Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection.", "Rifles, dynamite, bombs, exploding sheep... what's not to love? To learn how to make these and many other exciting tools of the trade head to the Undercity, under the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. Take the elevators down at the back of the ruins. Once you arrive speak to one of the Undercity Guardians about where the trainer is exactly.", "Rupert Boch is his name. I hear that he's upstairs in one of the rooms at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of town.", "Somewhere to fly to? You'll need to go to the Undercity for that! Go south on the road out of town, then southwest to the Ruins of Lordaeron. You can catch the elevator down to the Undercity from the back of the ruins and once there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.", "Sorry friend, we don't have one of those here in Brill. You'll have to head to the Undercity for that. The Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. From the back of the ruins take the elevator down and then speak to one of the Undercity Guardians to find your way further.", "That would be Shelene Rhobart. Take the road southeast out of Brill then head east at the intersection. She's at a camp along the side of the road.", "That's Rupert Boch you're looking for. He and his entourage have a room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of Brill.", "The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call. You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge.", "There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity. Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection. The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left. Go into them and then down into the Undercity. You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance.", "We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that. At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity. Once there ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions.", "What are you looking for?", "What could you possibly need a bank for? Very well, you'll need to go through the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill. In the back are a set of elevators leading down into the Undercity. When you get there stop any of those lumbering Abominations they like to call an Undercity Guardian and ask it for better directions.", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity. To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down. Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.", "Why cook when everything tastes like ashes in your mouth? If you have one still that is. Very well, head to the Undercity south of Brill and ask an Undercity Guardian there for further directions to their Cooking Trainer. To get there you can take the elevators down from the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron.", "Word is that Vance Undergloom has taken a permanent room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town. I think he's just off the reading room.", "Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon. He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town. It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it.", "Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill. Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there. We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year.", "You aiming to be a taxidermist? I don't like people who think they can stuff and mount me because they think I'm dead. No? Good! Look for Rand Rhobart at a camp to the southeast of town. To get to him take the road southeast out of Brill and hang a left at the intersection.", "You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill.", "You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town. Why don't you go see if you can help her?", "You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town.", "You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill. I guess he checked in too late to get a room.", "You'll want to look in the Undercity. In the old Ruins of Lordaeron, south of here, you'll find an elevator down. Once you're there, ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions." },
	["亡灵哨兵玛尔特迪斯"] = { "The High Executor is a very busy man, $c. Maybe I can help you with whatever you need?" },
	["亡灵哨兵莫提斯"] = { "The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources. Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war. Denying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield." },
	["亡灵杀手瑟里尔"] = { "Back off or I'll cut you in half." },
	["亨利·斯特恩"] = { "Hm... yes, I do have a recipe you might find useful. Let me teach you!", "Thank you for saving me! I'm a cook and an alchemist from Stormwind. I was here looking for local herbs and recipes for my uncle Angus when these quilboar captured me. If you hadn't come around, I'm sure I'd have ended up in their stew pot!", "Well yes, I do know a rare alchemical recipe. Let me teach you!", "Your skills in alchemy aren't yet high enough to benefit from my teachings. Perhaps if you speak with me later...", "Your talents in cooking are a little too low. Maybe with some practice I can teach you what I know." },
	["亨里克·斯通"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["人类召唤师"] = { "<The conjurer stands fierce, its gaze distant.>" },
	["人类平民"] = { "Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.", "During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.", "I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.", "I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday.", "I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.", "No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!", "The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?", "To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.", "We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!", "When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!", "Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!" },
	["人类幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["人类步兵"] = { "<The footman stand resolute, muscles tense.>" },
	["人类祭司"] = { "<The cleric stares at you through the corner of its eye.>" },
	["人类骑兵"] = { "<The charger stands proud, eager for battle.>" },
	["仁慈的斯考特"] = { "Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Crimson Acolyte armor for priests." },
	["代理人阿拉克塞"] = { "Agent Ya-six and I were given a high priority mission from Protectorate command to eradicate all signs of void creature infestation at Ultris. These were to be tactical strikes. Our last hit before returning to the Protectorate Watch Post was to be on a void lord named Arconus who had been getting fat off the fleshlings of the area. Unfortunately, we arrived a bit late. Ya-six and I got separated in the firefight with the flesh beasts. Now he's trapped inside, pinned down behind enemy lines." },
	["以太技师学徒"] = { "Our Skyguard Aether-tech and her escort is studying the Bash'ir crystal forge. She needs help! Go to Bash'ir Landing, find the aether-tech and keep her safe!" },
	["仲夏司仪"] = { "Across the lands our fires burn strong and true!", "Have you danced at the ribbon pole yet?", "I admire the skill that torch jugglers have.", "The Midsummer Fire Festival has something for everyone to enjoy!" },
	["仲裁者格蕾塔"] = { "We serve Thorim, sister." },
	["仲裁者索鲁斯"] = { "Here to help with the disturbances?" },
	["伊万·拉尔森"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["伊丝拉米·轻风"] = { "Welcome. May I offer you rest or sustenance?" },
	["伊丽莎白·罗斯"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["伊克萨尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I am Exzhal, Servitor of Rastakhan." },
	["伊兹米尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my brother. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my sister. Do you seek further guidance today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["伊卡因"] = { "The druids protect me from the naga and evil Lost Ones. In exchange, I teach them about the plants and animals of the marsh." },
	["伊卡玛里"] = { "When he says, 'younger brother,' he fails to mention that we're twins. He's really only older by a couple of minutes. Don't let that 'rising star' bit of his fool you. I'll never be a trader of the same magnitude that he is." },
	["伊哈蒂亚"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["伊坎"] = { "It will take a while, but these Broken Ones will learn the ways of the Light!" },
	["伊姆亚克"] = { "I tend these creatures of Gormok as he cannot. I do not fully agree with this slaughter, but at the least he will have his chance to fight." },
	["伊安·斯托姆"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?" },
	["伊安·达克"] = { "Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift, Tyrael's Hilt. Just whisper it in my ear when you are ready." },
	["伊尔拉娜"] = { "Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?" },
	["伊尔杜"] = { "I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?" },
	["伊尔萨·枪酒"] = { "Ya may know a thing or two about handlin' animals, but have ya ever taken ta the skies? We Wildhammers know how ta ride the wind with the best of 'em. Fer a small fee, if ya've got the mettle, I'll train ya good and proper." },
	["伊尔萨·考宾"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior. Why don't you go do something safe, like read a book.", "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["伊尔萨莱恩"] = { "Ah, the beauty of Shadowglen never ceases to delight my senses!" },
	["伊尼文"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you." },
	["伊崔格"] = { "Greetings, young $c." },
	["伊希"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.", "Our friends in the Alliance gather to fight alongside the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch. Will you travel there to help them?" },
	["伊库提"] = { "Welcome to the Orebor Harborage, friend. You have nothing to fear here. We are Broken, but we are not your enemies. I am Ikuti of the Kurenai, a group of Broken who desire to reestablish ties with our draenei brothers and their newfound allies." },
	["伊德莱尔船长"] = { "Welcome aboard the Feathermoon Ferry. We travel between Feathermoon Stronghold and the Forgotten Coast looking for those lost at sea. The sea can be a dangerous place if you are not prepared. If you need to get prepared, please speak to our provisioners. They are more than happy to help you." },
	["伊思达·哈尔蒙"] = { "I'll be fine for now, don't worry about me. I'll find a way out of here once I've performed some cleansing rituals in this room. Foul magic taints this place, $N." },
	["伊文凯恩队长"] = { "Come to train with the Theramore guard have you?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "While Theramore is reknown for it's exceptional training of warriors, I am afraid that I can not help you." },
	["伊斯卡"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["伊斯拉·星鬃"] = { "Hi! Do you think you might help me to get out of here?" },
	["伊斯比纳"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["伊斯法尔"] = { "'Talon King' Ikiss is one of the leaders of the Sethekk, along with my brother, Darkweaver Syth. It was they who led the exodus of the Sethekk from Skettis to the ruins of Auchindoun. In the beginning, Ikiss was a charismatic leader, but he has descended into madness. Now, he openly proclaims that he is Terokk reborn! He truly expects the arakkoa to bend knee to him as their ruler. Can you believe his arrogance?", "<Isfar sighs.> A couple of treehouses don't make a home, but it was vast improvement over the Sethekk Halls. Comfortable as it was in Shattrath, I can't bring myself to return to my true home in Skettis without my sister. She's still trapped in the Sethekk Halls, held prisoner by our older brother.", "He is the greatest hero the arakkoa have ever known. It is said that in ancient times, he built the city of Skettis with his own claws. He was our greatest champion and defender, but he left us when we turned away from the veneration of Rukhmar. We came to worship a new master, one who promised us untold power and status in the cosmos. There are some who say that Terokk and Rukhmar are one, and he withdrew his presence from us when we turned away from him." },
	["伊格努比"] = { "My younger brother here is quite the rising star in the Consortium. Of course, he's too modest to acknowledge it." },
	["伊沙娜"] = { "\"Born from light\" would be a close translation for Sha'tar. It is the name we gave to the naaru who reclaimed Shattrath City from the agents of Illidan.", "Shattrath is more than a staging ground for war against the Burning Legion and Illidan. It serves as a sanctuary to those seeking to escape the violence surrounding us. We would be hypocrites if we turned the refugees away. If your question refers to the Scryers, then I will respond that while I may not like them or their leader's wild claims of visions of redemption, it is not for us to question the wisdom of the naaru. These are difficult times, $N. We need allies where we can find them.", "Welcome, $N. We are the Aldor, priests of the Light and servants of the Sha'tar. You are welcome to stay with us for as long as you need." },
	["伊洛希恩"] = { "Here are more of the incendiary devices, $N. Be careful with these, they can cause a great deal of disruption to time if used improperly.", "You must use the incendiary bombs at the barrels inside the internment lodges of Durnholde Keep. Once five bombs have been ignited and the diversion has been set, find Thrall in the basement prison of Durnholde and set him free. Follow him and make sure that he does not die! Brazen will fly you to Durnholde when you are ready." },
	["伊特努斯"] = { "Amber Drakes excel at dealing damage by manipulating time to their advantage. Using Shock Lance, they can disrupt the flow of time around an enemy target, instantly damaging it. The power of this effect is dramatically increased by Shock Charges on the target. When threatened, an Amber Drake can briefly stop the flow of time for its enemies. This time disruption stores a large amount of Shock Energy on affected targets in the form of Shock Charges.", "An Amber Drake at full power can perform Temporal Rift, which creates a bubble of compressed time around an enemy. Spells that pass through the bubble deal double damage and can generate Shock Charges on the target.", "Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out! I can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the Bronze Fight. Speak to Belgaristrasz or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the Red or the Green.", "Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out! The full power of your drakes has been unlocked. Use their power to defeat Eregos!", "The Bronze Flight is in your debt.", "The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring. He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances! Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures. Seek him out above.", "Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring. Your drakes are more than a match for the Ring Guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself. Ten Centrifuge Constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above. Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable.", "Your greatest challenge lies ahead. Ley-Guardian Eregos is a Blue dragon of immense power. You will find him flying above the uppermost ring." },
	["伊琳尼雅·月火"] = { "Both Handiir and Buliwyf can show you how to swing a mace properly, no matter the size. You can find Buliwyf within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge. Handiir spends his days in the Exodar, training draenei on the Trader's Tier.", "I can direct you to other weapon masters if you prefer. What interests you?", "The crossbow can be learned from Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, Handiir, the draenei weapon master found in the Trader's Tier within the Exodar, or Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.", "The dwarven weapon master Buliwyf can train you in both one and two-handed axes. He's found in the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.", "The grace with which I fight is not something I can teach you, but I can teach you the use of various weapons.", "The man to talk to about gunnery is Buliwyf, found in the Timberline Arms within Ironforge.", "There are two masters of the sword: Handiir and Woo Ping. The former can be found in the Trader's Tier of the Exodar, and the latter in Weller's Arsenal within Stormwind.", "Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind." },
	["伊瑟里斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["伊苏瑞尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["伊苏莉娅"] = { "Sinu a'manore. If you seek to learn how to conjure a portal to Theramore, I can show you." },
	["伊莉莎·基连"] = { "Away with you, $c! Only champions of Undercity may purchase what I have to offer." },
	["伊莎贝拉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["伊莱恩·提亚斯"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["伊萨妮亚"] = { "Did Balandar Brightstar send you to rescue me?" },
	["伊萨尔"] = { "Ah, such an odd place to find potential customers!" },
	["伊萨拉斯"] = { "Greetings $c. Do you wish to aid the Silverwing Sentinels in their fight at Warsong Gulch?", "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch." },
	["伊萨里奥斯"] = { "I know who you are, $N. Fate and forces beyond that have brought you to me for a reason, and it is one I take no pleasure in being a part of. There are many decisions you will make in the coming times, and I hope you are wise enough to make the correct ones. Believe me, $r, when I tell you this - there are correct choices.", "The fact that you are here is a first step... a correct choice if you will, in aiding Ysera's Dragonflight. You may be here for purely the lure of personal gain, or you may be here because you are morally compelled. Neither reason is important on its own, but both are in fact critical to this end: The agony that Eranikus endures is what rousted me from my Dream, and it is now my charge to see his torment ended. I now ask you to aid me in this quest.", "The god that the Atal'ai trolls had brought forth is to blame for this. We destroyed the god's physical manifestation and sunk the temple, but the god was much stronger than even we had anticipated. Its seed of corruption ran deep, twisting everything in its path. Eranikus was charged to watch over the sunken temple to ensure that neither the simple Atal'ai nor their god would rise again. He was an unwitting victim of this corruption, and we in underestimating its potency.", "You are quite inquisitive, though such inquisitiveness belies a general lack of understanding. I say this because were you to have a definite purpose in being here, the question you ask would seem pointless. With that, I bid you good day." },
	["伊萨里奥斯勋爵"] = { "Yes?" },
	["伊蕊莎·血星"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["伊蕾达"] = { "Archibald is the master of the crossbow. He's the weapon master of the Undercity, located in the War Quarter.", "Both Hanashi and Sayoc can train you in the use of one and two-handed axes. They can be found in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar.", "Fist weapons are taught by Sayoc, the orc weapon master in Orgrimmar. He spends his days in the Valley of Honor.", "I can't see why you want to learn something else... but I suppose I can point you in the right direction. What training are you after, specifically?", "If you haven't come to train, step back and leave me to my work.", "Maces are taught by Ansekhwa, found on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Our gunnery instructor is Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Staves are taught by Hanashi, the troll weapon master in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, and Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master who trains on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff." },
	["伊谢尔·风歌"] = { "Greetings, $c. It is good you've decided to visit us." },
	["伊迪拉恩"] = { "By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?" },
	["伊迪瑞娜"] = { "Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?", "Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us ma'am?", "Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us sir?" },
	["伊雷特"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["伊露希亚·卢恩"] = { "We will never forget your bravery, $N. You are always welcome in Wintergarde. Would you like to make this inn your home?" },
	["伊鲁克"] = { "This young tuskarr appears to have been slain in combat rather than drowned." },
	["伍特"] = { "All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!" },
	["伏尔南·天啸"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["伐木工德拉克"] = { "Welcome to Amberpine Lodge, $c." },
	["休·格兰斯"] = { "Limpy Joe, it's you. It's really you!" },
	["休眠的尤尔丁人"] = { "The vrykul rests peacefully in his magical slumbering." },
	["传令官布莱肯·黑眼"] = { "It is regrettable that, among our many enemies in Hellfire Peninsula, the orcs of Hellfire Citadel stand among them. But... who better to challenge and hone the Horde... than orcs?" },
	["传令官阿莫尔林"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["伦德玛尔"] = { "I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands." },
	["伦萨克"] = { "I am he that carries out the Warchief's commands without question. I am Horde.", "Look to this fallen dragon, $r. The might of the Horde is unquestionable!" },
	["伦诺克之魂"] = { "The Drakkari are keeping my body close to death up in the altar building. They cannot see my spirit though. We must work together to prevent them from getting my power." },
	["伯古什"] = { "Hail, $c!" },
	["伯拉克，欧鲁诺克之子"] = { "Tread lightly, $r. Beyond this bridge lies hell." },
	["伯提乌斯"] = { "Normal dogs won't come anywhere near me nowadays. I was devastated when I found out... I used to love the beasts. Plaguehounds make for a fine substitute, however. They're not quite as... easy on the eyes. But then again, neither am I!" },
	["伯格瑞姆·硬锤"] = { "As representatives of the Explorers' League, Bronwyn and I are here at the Alliance's behest to study these mountains. But between you and me, after an extended stay in Silithus, we just needed a vacation. This seems like a nice enough spot." },
	["伯特霍德"] = { "All inquiries regarding Medivh should be directed to Moroes, the Tower Steward. I myself know very little about the Master's business. I believe several nobles are currently having an audience with Moroes in the Banquet Hall, if you wish to inquire further.", "From here in the Gatehouse, you may travel in one of three directions. The stairs behind me lead to the Grand Ball Room, where guests are currently being entertained. I'm sure you can smell the nearby Stables, and the entrance to Servant's Quarters lies next to the Gatehouse door.", "Greetings, travelers. I have been instructed to treat any bearer of a key to Karazhan as an honored guest of the Master. Feel free to ask any questions you wish of me. How may I assist you?", "This is the tower of Karazhan and residence of my master, Medivh. As a humble doorman, there is little else I can explain to you." },
	["伯纳尔·铁足"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["伯纳德·加姆"] = { "We are the only supplier of healthy flowers in all of Stormwind. We provide beautiful blooms for any occasion." },
	["伯里姆·金锤"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["伯鲁斯·折铁"] = { "What? You want to train under me, $c? You better be ready to work." },
	["伽雷尔"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["佐亚"] = { "Greetings, traveler." },
	["佐特"] = { "Impressive, aren't they? These giants would be the perfect fodd... er, allies. This one is their leader, but he continues to refuse to speak with me." },
	["佩拉斯卡米"] = { "If you've the gold, I can teach you how to ride a hawkstrider.", "You must be exalted with the blood elves before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["侍从丹尼"] = { "Are you sure you are ready for mounted combat?" },
	["侍从亚迪"] = { "Are you here for the confessor's sermon? Good luck findin' a place to sit..." },
	["侍从加文"] = { "This is the ring where the champions practice fighting each other. It's my job to summon the knights to their practice battles." },
	["侍从大卫"] = { "Are you prepared to fight a valiant of the Argent Crusade?", "The Argent Crusade riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense. However, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you. Close that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts.", "When you are ready to test for the rank of valiant, I will call forth a member of the Argent Crusade." },
	["侍从洛伊"] = { "I lucked out. Not many tauren get to be cabin boy on a frigate like this! Grezzix even lets me man these incredible battle canoes." },
	["侍从皮尔斯"] = { "Hello. Squire Walter and I are responsible for taking care of Old Blanchy here, along with the rest of the mounts." },
	["侍卫洛文"] = { "Greetings, citizen. I ask that you move along if you have nothing to ask of me.", "Hail, champion. The tale of your deeds will be told throughout the ages. Perhaps one day, a statue of you will stand amongst the heroes of Stormwind." },
	["侍卫玛特拉克"] = { "I live only to serve the master." },
	["侏儒平民"] = { "Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.", "During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.", "I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.", "I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday.", "I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.", "No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!", "The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?", "To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.", "We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!", "When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!", "Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!" },
	["侏儒幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["侏儒技师"] = { "Hello, $n! How can I help you today?", "I installed a new device in our car's matrix regulometer. That should increase its velocity quotient by a factor of no less than fifteen!", "If it weren't for the goblins' inconceivable, dumb luck, they'd crash their car during every race!", "My Gizmotic Almanacotron says that we should beat the goblins by twenty seconds more than we did last time!", "My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!", "Sorry, friend. I'm afraid we've used all of the parts we can spare at the moment.", "Sorry, friend. Only certified officers of the Alliance can authorize the purchase of a vehicle.", "These races are a great opportunity to show our ingenuity!" },
	["侏儒车队员工"] = { "I installed a new device in our car's matrix regulometer. That should increase its velocity quotient by a factor of no less than fifteen!", "If it weren't for the goblins' inconceivable, dumb luck, they'd crash their car during every race!", "My Gizmotic Almanacotron says that we should beat the goblins by twenty seconds more than we did last time!", "My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!", "These races are a great opportunity to show our ingenuity!" },
	["供给官伊萨贝尔"] = { "Hellfire Peninsula is a shattered realm - ruthless and unforgiving to its inhabitants. Be sure to repair and stock up on supplies before venturing out." },
	["供给官匹斯特"] = { "My brothers in Stormwind told me not to join the military... I'm glad I didn't listen to them!" },
	["供给官布拉克纳"] = { "Strength to the Clans, $c! What brings you here?" },
	["供给官瓦林"] = { "Like anything that you see, $c?" },
	["供给者阿妮尔"] = { "Do you need something, $c? Perhaps I can assist you." },
	["侦探斯奈普·滑栓"] = { "I don't like the look of this 'Crown Chemical Co.' one bit." },
	["侦查队长洛洛尔"] = { "Yesh, it'sh true, I'm blind as a bat! An' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk. I'll tell you what, $r. It'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days." },
	["信使兰森"] = { "Scourge aberrations... They'll get what's coming to them soon enough." },
	["信使奥拉莉恩"] = { "Ah, $N - it is good to see you again. I trust your affairs go well.", "If you're heading toward the city, then I have something important for you to do!" },
	["信使考雷·落锤"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["信使赫米修斯"] = { "I deliver the mail to and from Azuremyst, $c. If you need a message delivered, it'll more than likely be routed through me first." },
	["信使迪卡·晨行者"] = { "Who are you? I feel... so... cold." },
	["元素师沙尔瓦克"] = { "How can my people fight when the elements are in such turmoil? Do they not see that without the support of the elements, the world simply cannot be." },
	["元素师温塔格"] = { "I am Untrag of the Earthen Ring. Try not to upset the elements while you remain at the Throne of the Elements." },
	["元素师莫格"] = { "The Earthen Ring seeks to preserve the strength and majesty of the elements." },
	["元素师鲁艾普"] = { "The spirits are restless, $r. Be mindful of your surroundings while in Nagrand lest you be consumed by their fury." },
	["元素驯服者德苟达"] = { "Zim'Torga is able to provide us with a certain level of protection, but she has been greatly weakened by the presence of the Scourge and the actions of the Drakkari. It falls to me and Ahunae to see to the rest of our defenses." },
	["先知亚尼迪"] = { "Tor'gash believes he can see the future in the entrails of birds, or by tossing the knucklebones of his ancestors. Really, all you need to do is ask the spirits. But don't try telling him that, $N. He's very stubborn." },
	["先知亚瓦德"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits." },
	["先知古库斯"] = { "Garadar is in shambles, stranger. Since the Greatmother took ill, Garrosh has gone into a deep depression. He is most certainly not his father's boy. <Kurkush sighs.>" },
	["先知安努"] = { "The spirits of the elements surround us. We must always listen. I have seen firsthand the consequences when we ignore their warnings..." },
	["先知安布洛尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world. So far they refuse to listen, but perhaps you would be willing?", "Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world... but no one will listen.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者"] = { "Perhaps it was a mistake to travel so close to the Rivenwood and Gjalerbron to get here." },
	["先知摩克萨尔丁"] = { "Even in this remote corner of the world, know that Hellscream's eyes are upon you." },
	["先知斯卡泰斯"] = { "I am Skaltesh, guide to the shaman seeking enlightenment here... but even those who follow different paths can be shown a thing or two. Do you wish to see?" },
	["先知沃雷塔尔"] = { "There are those who seek to lie and twist the truth. Seers, on the other hand, bring the truth to light. The purpose of this library, $N, is to make a seer out of everyone." },
	["先知玛加迪"] = { "The spirits are greatly agitated. We must find the cause of this disturbance." },
	["先知约瓦尔"] = { "My sight is filled with visions of events taking place throughout the world and ones that may yet happen. Many of them are grim, but we needn't believe they are incapable of changing." },
	["先知维伦"] = { "As we attempt to gain the help of the peoples of this world against the Burning Legion, we must also learn to live peaceably amongst them. Please keep this in mind as your journey takes you throughout Azeroth. May the Light guide you." },
	["先知考尔胡克"] = { "Dark times loom ahead, stranger..." },
	["先知赫米萨"] = { "Please, keep your voice down, $r. Hamat is old and needs her rest." },
	["先知雷古库特"] = { "Well met, $c. Your arrival in Thrallmar could not have occurred at a better time. The warchief is depending on us, since he cannot be here himself." },
	["先行官米库拉斯"] = { "If you only learn one thing during your time in Bloodmyst, $c, I hope that it is vigilance. This island claims the unwary first, then begins to wear down even the most guarded of warriors. Everywhere you turn, a foe stands ready to take your life." },
	["先驱者乌尔雷"] = { "Dark forces are at work in this land, $N. Keep your eyes open and your courage strong." },
	["先驱者伊努罗"] = { "We have gained control of the armory, but our work on the island is not yet finished." },
	["先驱者萨隆尼"] = { "Illidan's grasp on this land is slipping. Can you feel it, $N?" },
	["克伦德尔·比格波凯茨"] = { "Can you believe it? They finally opened this place up for us to fly a zeppelin through here! No fly zone no more, am I right? We only crashed one zeppelin into a cliff on the test run. I don't see why they were so worried." },
	["克利丝蒂娜·丹尼尔"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["克劳伯·维兹班"] = { "Shh! Be very quiet; I'm observing murlocs. Living in an oversized turtle shell is a sacrifice I'm willing to make for science. After all, if the murlocs see me here, they'll react to my presence and contaminate my data! As the first gnomish member of the Explorers' League, I'm boldly going places no dwarf has gone before!" },
	["克劳德·天舞者"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["克劳德·艾尔克辛"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["克劳恩"] = { "How embarrassing to be taken as a pet by a hunter! I owe you my life, but please, trouble yourself no longer with my welfare. Now that you've freed me from Musel'ek, I'll be able to find my way out. Maybe I'll pick up Rayge along the way." },
	["克勒斯"] = { "Nature is a powerful force, $r. Those who seek to subdue never succeed in doing so permanently." },
	["克古尔·血斧"] = { "$N, the Silverwing Sentinels must be crushed! Are you ready for Warsong Gulch?" },
	["克塞拉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours." },
	["克尔格鲁克·血斧"] = { "What is it? Can't you see I'm busy?" },
	["克尔苏瓦"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["克尔达"] = { "What do you seek, $c?" },
	["克希利"] = { "<The light surrounding Xi'ri pulses blue. The naaru welcomes you as an ally in the field of battle.>" },
	["克拉克斯"] = { "My brother Krixx thinks he has it bad working in Orgrimmar. Nothing compares to the stench of this place. At least the boss had the decency to give me hazard pay! What? Do you want to see where the zeppelin is? Good thing I've got my zeppelin tracker right here!" },
	["克拉姆"] = { "Our ancestors teach us that while the individual must be strong, there is safety in numbers. Do you wish to defend the honor of Thunder Bluff by organizing a guild?" },
	["克拉库克将军"] = { "Make it quick, $c - we've got a war to fight here, or hadn't you noticed?" },
	["克拉度·利刃"] = { "The best defense is a good offense; anyone can tell you that." },
	["克拉拉·沸酒"] = { "It's good to see you here, $N." },
	["克拉提库斯·曼比德尔"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["克拉斯"] = { "Greetings, friend." },
	["克拉斯·沃夫哈特"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin." },
	["克拉格"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Don't waste my time.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["克拉索克·火拳"] = { "I am Krathok, overseer of these craftsmen." },
	["克拉维斯·纳文哈姆"] = { "Friend - Stormwind needs your assistance and your generosity! Our once large stockpile of textiles has run critically low. Stormwind is now engaged in a multi-pronged effort to rebuild those stocks for the manufacture of textiles and bandages! Your donation of cloth would help Stormwind immensely, as well as earn the respect of the citizenry!" },
	["克拉苏斯"] = { "<The queen's consort nods in acknowledgment of your presence.>" },
	["克拉莉斯·纳尔特里"] = { "Don't come out of the shadows like that. Next time give a girl some warning." },
	["克拉迦·铁刺"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["克拉里萨"] = { "Please leave me to my sadness." },
	["克斯塔姆·碎石"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks he's a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks she's a warrior. Ha!" },
	["克朗·石蹄"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["克林塔尔·梦行者"] = { "<The druid appears to be deep in sleep, oblivious to his surroundings.>" },
	["克林科·古德斯迪尔"] = { "Welcome to Tanaris, $N. How can I be of service to you today? You don't look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving." },
	["克格尔·曲藤"] = { "Hi there! I have a proposition for an adventure-seeker such as you, if you are up to the challenge! Along with my invention, the Super Egg-O-Matic, I am hard at work aiding the druids with their campaign to save the hippogryphs. The birds are being affected by the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres inhabiting the ruins of Feralas, and their numbers are dwindling. I collect many different types of eggs. Will you help and find some for me?", "In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger. I need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics. Please know, $N, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch.", "The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it. If you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic." },
	["克洛诺斯"] = { "Greetings. I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets. My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail. Trust me." },
	["克瑞"] = { "Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury." },
	["克米恩·冰蹄"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["克罗卡斯"] = { "Do I see them with weapons still? Why you let them keep their weapons?!", "What you doin' wanderin' around here? Why them small fries not in da shackles?!", "You da strong one now! All hail to da new king of da Gordok!" },
	["克罗格"] = { "If Reethe is somehow involved with the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, you'll have to find him and get some answers out of him. I sent Ogron to track him down. He was headed off to the southeast, toward the main road through the marsh. Meet up with Ogron and then go find Reethe.", "The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down. The Warchief told us to leave the humans alone, so long as they didn't cross our borders, but it appears someone violated his wishes. He has put me in charge of getting to the bottom of it. If you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me.", "The humans claimed much of the Dustwallow Marsh for themselves, but the Stonemaul clan, with our help, has been able to push them back." },
	["克罗米"] = { "$N, good to see you! Or is this the first time that we've met? I'm in so many places and times right now, I sometimes have a hard time keeping track of all of it.", "Arthas gave the order to cull Stratholme, killing every single human within its walls. He discovered evidence that the Scourge had infected the city with their insidious plague, and the disease doesn't just kill people. Those who die to this plague rise up as mindless zombies, further fueling the Scourge's war machine.", "Go find those hidden plagued grain crates and use your Arcane Disruptor on them! Arthas will then have the evidence he needs to begin the culling of Stratholme.", "Hello once again, $N. I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed. Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight. While the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing. The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change.", "Hello there, $N. I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie. I am comfortable with such familiarity. Now - how did I know your name, you ask? I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time. You could say that we have met before. To that end, we shall also meet again. I hope that my choice of visual demeanor does not disturb you; while I might be charged to be a sentry of sorrowful places, I choose not to drown in the sorrow of the locale.", "That's right, I've seen you here before! How could I forget? I can teleport you to Stratholme now, if you wish.", "The Infinite Dragonflight is attempting to alter the destiny of Prince Arthas Menethil. You know him now as the Lich King, but here and now he was still a Prince of Lordaeron trying to do what was best for his kingdom. Arthas makes a very fateful choice today, leading to something we Keepers of Time call an inflection point in the timeline.", "The Infinites are attempting something unusually subtle for them. They are trying to hide the evidence that will lead to Arthas deciding to cull Stratholme. Their agents have used illusionary magic on the plagued grain shipments in the nearby countryside to make them appear normal. I need you to find the hidden grain, and use this Arcane Disruptor on the shipments. Arthas' men are looking for plagued grain, and should find it quickly with the illusion gone.", "Welcome, adventurer. You've come just in the nick of time.", "What are you doing all the way back here? You need to get back to Stratholme immediately! Shall I teleport you to Stratholme?" },
	["克罗索斯"] = { "We have come to compete for honor, renown, and the right to fight the Scourge alongside the brothers of the Argent Crusade." },
	["克苏卡"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Hey der, mon. Did ya need help recoverin' a lost companion?", "Hey der, mon. Did ya want ta be stablin' yer pets, or were ya lookin' for a lost companion?" },
	["克莉·希克斯"] = { "Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c! My name is Kerri Hicks and I'd shake your hand but I'm afraid I'd break it, because I'm the strongest woman alive!" },
	["克莉丝蒂·德米萨"] = { "I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts! I have lots of skins if you want some to give to Harold." },
	["克莉尔·比特修"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["克莉斯塔萨"] = { "$n! I've been wondering how you were. What's kept you?", "If you hadn't rescued me from that prison I surely would have succumbed by now. I have not forgotten...", "In times such as these, dear friends are invaluable. Be safe, $n. As safe as one can be in a place like this...", "It is truly a pleasure to see you again, $n.", "My strength is returning, slowly... I hope to be able to show you the glory of my true form soon.", "Oh... Where am I?", "We must hurry, $n. Malygos' ruinous plans will soon be irreversible.", "When our duty here is behind us, I shall find a way to repay you for my rescue." },
	["克萨尔迪"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Raptor Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the trolls of the Darkspear tribe before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["克里克·维克诺兹船长"] = { "Hey, kid. You're aboard the Maiden's Fancy. The name's Captain Wrenchnozzle, and you've got the privilege of sailing on the pride of the Blackwater Raiders. The Bloodsail don't come near us, not with my sharp crew and the large amount of gunpowder in the hold. Insurance, you know. If you've got questions, kid, I'll answer 'em.", "If your stomach's rumbling, talk to Galley Chief Steelbelly, but just between you and me? You might want to wait. He's got that name for a reason.", "What's a Steamwheedle ship without an engineer, eh? Torquespindle can help you with anything you need. He's handy with repairing things quickly, too, if that's what you're after.", "Yeah, that's her you're standing on. A beaut, isn't she? The Baron set me up as the captain a while back. She's not mine originally, so I didn't name her; if you want my opinion, kid, I think the sailor who named her spent a little too much time at sea and not enough time in port, if you catch my meaning." },
	["克里克斯"] = { "I spend all day retrieving parts for the zeppelin and Frezza doesn't even have the decency to pay me an hourly wage. But you're not here about that, are you? I bet you want to know where the zeppelin is located. Well, you're in luck - I have my zeppelin tracking device right here!", "The zeppelin should have just arrived at Grom'gol...", "The zeppelin should have just arrived at Orgrimmar...", "The zeppelin should have just departed from Grom'gol...", "The zeppelin should have just departed from Orgrimmar.", "The zeppelin should have just departed from Orgrimmar...", "The zeppelin should have just departed from Undercity.", "The zeppelin should have just reached Orgrimmar.", "The zeppelin should just have arrived at Undercity." },
	["克里恩·寻路者"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["克里托斯·血刃"] = { "I can hardly believe the Cult was so careless as to leave these behind." },
	["克里斯托·鲍曼"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!", "Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge. She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\"." },
	["克里斯托弗·德库尔"] = { "Welcome to the Undercity Guild Registry. What do you want?" },
	["克里斯托弗·杰弗寇特"] = { "Can I show you what I have for sale?" },
	["克里斯托弗·沃克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not waste my time, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The warrior's role is one of protection. Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["克雷兹希尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["克雷迪斯"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["克鲁克"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch." },
	["克鲁姆·满月"] = { "This blue leather does draw the eye, I know. You see, we have a great many eager recruits running around here, hunting and slaying with more enthusiasm than wisdom. One must take precautions." },
	["克鲁本·暗刃"] = { "Be sure to catch all the amazing sights and wonders of the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town!", "Step right up and hear about the most amazing spectacle in all of Azeroth - the Darkmoon Faire! Huzzah!", "The Darkmoon Faire is coming to town! Don't miss it!", "The Darkmoon Faire is coming! There is fun for children of ALL ages! Come one, come all!", "When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore. We'll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!" },
	["克鲁格·碎颅"] = { "We serve Thrall with great pride. We'll travel as far as is needed to vanquish the enemy." },
	["全知者阿塔比姆"] = { "I am Al'tabim the All-Seeing - an envoy of King Rastakhan. My dealings are with priests, mages, and warlocks." },
	["公关专员"] = { "Yo! I'm here representing the Crown Chemical Company. You looking for a gift? A job? Maybe a little something for yourself? Well, you've come to the right place, friend. If I don't have what you need, our mascot Kwee or the Lovely Merchant beside me will." },
	["公告员古德曼"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["公告员高拉克"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["公正的莱德尔"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["兰克拉尔公爵"] = { "The Ebon Blade is indebted to you for your help in taking The Shadow Vault. We are lucky to have you. While the Alliance and the Horde fight each other, doing the Lich King's job for him, we will stay focused on the task at hand. Where the Argent Crusade might falter and think twice about how best to crush the enemy, we will have no such moral difficulties. You shall be our instrument of vengeance, $N." },
	["兰克斯特神父"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?", "Yes, $c?" },
	["兰卡·远箭"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do you prefer guns or bows?", "I do not have the knowledge you seek.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["兰妮"] = { "It's good to see you here, $N." },
	["兰度"] = { "If you need to travel to the Exodar, I have just the hippogryph for you!" },
	["兰德鲁·郎绍特"] = { "Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth's more unique items for the discerning adventurer. Since you're speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you're looking for.", "So, $N, which item are you interested in?", "Welcome, $N. I am Landro Longshot - manager of the Black Flame. Perhaps you've not heard of the Black Flame until now. That doesn't surprise me; we work to keep things that way. We prefer to avoid... factional entanglements. The Black Flame specializes in providing the finest services and entertainment money can buy, whether they happen to be hard to find items, gladiatorial combat, or lucrative games of chance. Are you here seeking something specific?" },
	["兰拉"] = { "Come and take a look at my wares while you still can. We're here all week, and then we're off to some far off land.", "Darkmoon Faire Cards? See the Professor here for those. Come see me if you are a dealer in hard to come by antiquities and artifacts.", "Every item that I have for sale I acquired myself. You have my personal guarantee of authenticity.", "Have you any idea what I go through to bring these incomparable valuables to sell? Come see them all for yourself!" },
	["兰杜尔夫·李德尔"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin.", "Our Alliance allies are assisting the Leage of Arathor in their defense of Arathi Basin. They could use your aid against the undead Defilers, $c." },
	["兰杜恩·月爪"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["兰特瑞索·火刃"] = { "<Lantresor glares at you as if he were looking through you.> Perhaps there is another way... I will agree to your leader's demands, only if you do exactly as I ask. With your assistance, we may be able to help each other out greatly.", "<Lantresor laughs heartily.> Do you know where you are, fool? This is ogre land. Before orc, before draenei, there was ogre. Yet, you wish to start a war that you will inevitably lose? Boulderfist will crush you. And if Boulderfist does not destroy you, Warmaul will... But I think your leaders already know this...", "An orc... <Lantresor scoffs.> I am a blademaster of half-orc descent.", "And what do your people want of Lantresor, $r?", "Bite your tongue, $r. I have seen things in my lifetime that you have only heard about in legends. I have killed man, woman, and child without remorse. Under the banner of two Warchiefs of the Horde I have served... And now, I rule Boulderfist.", "Draenei... And because of this, I am neither. Not orc, not draenei. My own kind are a rare breed. Most having been killed decades ago... I live because of my strength of will.", "Then you are a fool. Do you not know what I am?", "Who so boldly stands before Lantresor of the Blade? Do you not know death by sight, $g boy:girl;?", "Who so boldly stands before Lantresor of the Blade? Do you not know death by sight, boy?", "Who so boldly stands before Lantresor of the Blade? Do you not know death by sight, girl?", "You will stage a series of events that will lead the Kil'sorrow orcs of Kil'sorrow Fortress to believe that the Warmaul ogres have attacked their base and then another series of events to make the Warmaul ogres believe the Kil'sorrow orcs are attacking their base. Do this and you solve both of our problems. The Boulderfist will have their territory back and your people will be free from attack from Boulderfist, Warmaul and Shadow Council." },
	["兰登·斯蒂维尔"] = { "Stay away from me, $r! There's no telling when the sickness will take me again. Just leave me alone before it happens again." },
	["兰莎尔拉"] = { "Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel'Theril, to the southwest. Now I'm intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket. Have you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well.", "I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, $N. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?" },
	["兰萨恩·派雷隆"] = { "$N, it is good to see you again. Remember to stay focused on your learning. You represent our future, and should you falter our future will be dark indeed.", "Your continued service to the Blood Elves is paramount to our survival! We must all pitch in and pull ourselves out of the mire we all find ourselves in. If you're ready to work, then let's get started." },
	["兰达尔·亨特"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the humans of Stormwind before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["兰达尔·沃斯"] = { "I already know a lot about style. Now it's just a matter of mastering the techniques for working with leather. Good thing Simon's a real sport about helping me learn them." },
	["兰迪加"] = { "This was the site of a great battle. Many great battles." },
	["兴登堡"] = { "This here is the finest, most state of the art mode of transportation money can build. What? Deeprun Tram? Gnomes? Listen pal, If you believe that garbage then I've got a statue down in Stranglethorn to sell ya. Now, are you walking to Grom'Gol or are you gonna ride in style in this fine flying machine? Your choice." },
	["典狱官朱蒂·月歌"] = { "Be welcome amongst us, $c." },
	["典狱官诺克·血怒"] = { "The actions of these deserters shames us all. A shame so powerful that it must be witnessed to be understood. It is why Ug'thor is here... The boy must learn." },
	["兽人平民"] = { "The largest celebration of the Lunar Festival is taking place in Moonglade. If that's too far to travel to, there are druids offering transport from the Valley of Wisdom." },
	["兽人幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["兽人座狼"] = { "<The orc wolf's frozen, snarling mouth shivers your bones.>" },
	["兽人术士"] = { "<Behind the warlock's eyes smolders a deep malevolence.>" },
	["兽人步兵"] = { "<The grunt's mouth waters, anticipating bloodshed.>" },
	["兽人通灵师"] = { "<Dark magic ripples from the necrolyte.>" },
	["兽女乌达"] = { "You! COME! Drink, feast, rest for the next battle. But do not fight! Or I will feed you to my wolves." },
	["兽王卡莉"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Well met, Battle-Sister. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Well met, Battle-Sister. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["内兹拉斯"] = { "Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It's like paradise down here. But don't tell my brother Zapetta that, he's bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn't have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don't get him started." },
	["冈尼"] = { "Do you know where you are? This is Honor Hold, sweetheart! Love it or get out!", "I have neither the time, nor the inclination, to explain things to you, scumbag! Now do you have something important to say, or are you just here to ask me out for a drink, princess?", "I've seen you prancing around. Why don't you do us all a favor and just drop your gear off at the armory?", "This isn't a field trip, maggot! You're in the Outland now! Shape up or take a stroll back through the portal.", "Well, well, well, what have we here? A $T civilian : civilian;? Isn't that precious? You'll get no special treatment from me!", "What is your major malfunction?!", "What's that $T scrub : girlie;? You want your mommy? Well too bad. Maybe you should pay a visit to the Thrallmar officer's club to get her back?", "Who in name of Kurdran let you through the Dark Portal?" },
	["冈瑟尔·维勒"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["军士长洛琳·萨梅洛克"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["军士长玛克卢尔"] = { "Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance. The war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with. Can I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?" },
	["军士长祖托克"] = { "We will crush Arthas! The Scourge cannot stand up to the might of the Horde!" },
	["军官彼尔德·铁须"] = { "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Ironforge. It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets. I accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once. I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets. As a result, you will earn recognition from Ironforge for your duty and service." },
	["军官波特霍斯"] = { "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Gnomeregan Exiles. It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets. I accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once. I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets. As a result, you will earn recognition from the Gnomeregan Exiles for your duty and service." },
	["军官范恩·罗希姆"] = { "The Skybreaker patrols Icecrown. You will find no finer ship in all of the realms." },
	["军官鲁娜莱"] = { "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus. It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets. I accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once. I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets. As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service." },
	["军营管理员哈尔加"] = { "You can sleep in the barracks, if you'd like. Just don't wake my men, or I'll throw you out in the snow myself." },
	["军营管理员雷尔库"] = { "Might not be snowy out there, but the nights here can freeze your nose right off. The bunks are in the back - just don't make a nuisance of yourself." },
	["军需官乌尔格隆"] = { "Welcome to Thrallmar, $N! As you continue to aid us in our cause, I will grant you access to more of our supplies." },
	["军需官刘易斯"] = { "I try to keep Sentinel Hill stocked, and that's not easy with all the action we see." },
	["军需官巴莱特"] = { "You need something? Maybe your armor or weapon repaired? Hmm?" },
	["军需官瓦丝凯丝"] = { "Whatever you're going to ask for, do it quickly." },
	["军需官米兰达·布利洛克"] = { "Certainly, $N. Adventurers that the Dawn views as exalted must submit a combined total of 12 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 54 insignias. Those exalted in the eyes of the Dawn receive the greatest discounts.", "Certainly, $N. Adventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias. I must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn.", "Certainly, $N. Adventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias. I must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn.", "Certainly, $N. Adventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias. Those that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high.", "Certainly, $N. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about.", "Greetings, $c. I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn. As you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff. Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items. As you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you." },
	["军需官米卡迪"] = { "Welcome to our camp, $c. You're free to rest here if you'd like." },
	["军需官雷米尔"] = { "Another lovely, gloomy day here in Tranquillien, wouldn't you say, $c? What can I do for you?" },
	["农夫萨丁"] = { "Rough times, huh, $N? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception." },
	["冬天爷爷"] = { "A wondrous Winter Veil to you... uh... little $G boy : girl;. Good children get special, um, discounts at any local Smokywood Pastures vendor. Yum.", "A wondrous Winter Veil to you... uh... little boy. Good children get special, um, discounts at any local Smokywood Pastures vendor. Yum.", "A wondrous Winter Veil to you... uh... little girl. Good children get special, um, discounts at any local Smokywood Pastures vendor. Yum." },
	["冬季狂欢者"] = { "A happy Winter Veil to you, friend!", "Ah, mistletoe...", "I wish you a happy holiday, friend!", "Season's greetings, and peace to you!" },
	["冬泉谷护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["冬泉谷护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["冬鳞采集者"] = { "Blrmrrgl gulrgl grr.", "Blurglgr murbrgl... just kidding, I can understand you.", "Brggl-brggl Mrgl-Mrgl! Gluk!", "I knew that we never should have gone into those caves. It's not natural!", "Mawurrgggl, gurgl lur!", "Mrglrglrglrgl... glrgl?", "No time to talk -- I have work to do!", "RAWGRLRLRLRRLGLRL!!!", "There are clams to be collected and orcas to be killed. Help or stay out of the way!", "There's something fishy about new King Mrgl-Mrgl, but I can't quite put my finger on it.", "You can understand me? I can understand you!", "You figure out yet why our brothers and sisters over in the village have gone insane?" },
	["冰掌熊"] = { "The icepaw bear lays here tranquilized." },
	["冰蹄长者"] = { "Elder Rumblerock passes the years in a cave atop Dreadmaul Rock in the Burning Steppes.", "Elder Skychaser looks out over Westfall from atop Sentinel Hill.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows.", "You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale." },
	["冰霜雪豹"] = { "The frost leopard lays here tranquilized." },
	["凄凉之地护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["凄凉之地护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["凯伊·迅爪"] = { "This war's not over, it's only just begun! We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn'Qiraj day and night, $N. It won't be long before the Qiraji city falls." },
	["凯兰娜"] = { "I'm sorry, $N, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.", "Ishnu-dal-dieb, $N. Have you come here in search of knowledge?" },
	["凯兰娜·风语"] = { "Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world." },
	["凯兰恩"] = { "In a different time and place I would've been considered but a youngling. Here I am a seasoned combatant ready to live and die for the glory of the naaru. Ten of us went into Manaforge Ara. All the others fell to the Legion." },
	["凯利斯蒂亚"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["凯勒中将"] = { "We built this place with our bare hands! Blood and tears, my friend. Believe me when I tell you this: We have no plans on ever giving up our hold on Valgarde." },
	["凯塔·深炉"] = { "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lass, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me." },
	["凯夫·重锤"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks he's a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks she's a warrior. Ha!" },
	["凯姆·蛮鬃"] = { "$N, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother. May your ancestors watch over you $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["凯尔坦修士"] = { "The time of judgement is nigh. In your heart, you know justice is the only true path." },
	["凯尔姆·哈古斯"] = { "Zug zug, my friend! I am Kelm Hargunth, the main supplier for the Warsong Outriders. As you improve your standing with the Outriders, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch. Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services." },
	["凯尔布鲁斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c. How may I assist you?" },
	["凯尔林布"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["凯尔登·布雷门"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["凯尔达斯"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["凯尔达隆卫士"] = { "I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe.", "There's no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you're thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow.", "Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town.", "Why, you look like a common street urchin!" },
	["凯尔达隆居民"] = { "Another lovely day on our beautiful island.", "Can't you see we're trying to prepare for Uther's visit? Now get out of my way, I have much work to do!", "Have you tried our bread? Baker Masterson must be the most gifted chef to have ever lived!", "We're not really rude people, stranger, it's just that everyone is in a rush, trying to make sure that everything is perfect for Uther's arrival. It's not often that the Lightbringer comes to town." },
	["凯尔达隆骑兵"] = { "I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe.", "There's no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you're thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow.", "Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town.", "Why, you look like a common street urchin!" },
	["凯尼斯·静风"] = { "It's good to hear the voices of others here in Forest Song again. I'd begun to feel as though I might be the last of the kaldorei ever to set eyes on these lands before their descent into corruption." },
	["凯希尔"] = { "I am Kessel, lord of the elekk, disciple of the Hand of Argus. Are you the new recruit?" },
	["凯德莫斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my brother. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my sister. Do you seek further guidance today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["凯德雷克·布舍尔"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["凯恩·火歌"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["凯恩·血蹄"] = { "Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff. You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here. All denizens of the Horde are welcome here. The spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend. Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself." },
	["凯拉·布舍尔"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["凯拉·风刃"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?", "Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?", "I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child. I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["凯文·布朗宁"] = { "Can't you see that I've got places to go and people to see! Step aside, peasant!" },
	["凯玛德·考伯宾奇"] = { "'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!", "Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!", "Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.", "Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!", "Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!", "Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!", "If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!", "Season's savings to you and yours!" },
	["凯琳·斯蒂文"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["凯瑟琳·利兰"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["凯瑟琳·李"] = { "Welcome to my kitchen! We prepare some of the finest food in Dalaran here." },
	["凯莉·弗莱"] = { "Can you believe this place? 'Course, it's a mite stuffy up here if you ask me." },
	["凯莉·达克"] = { "Greetings, Light of Elune be with you." },
	["凯莉森德拉船长"] = { "It's all a mess, $c, and it's all my fault! I was warned to get out of dock while there was still time, but did I listen? No. What am I going to do now? Those sickly blood elves, the Wretched, have made off with my magical goods, and ate them I think. I'm pretty sure that means they can't be retrieved. And the Grimscale murlocs pirated away the rest of my goods in the dead of night! Furthermore, to kick an honest merchant when she's down, my crew abandoned ship! I think I'm going to cry." },
	["凯蒂·亨特"] = { "Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind. These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies. Not saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.", "Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses! Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount. A horse is a companion for the ages, friend. Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!" },
	["凯蕾妮"] = { "Oh, me a cook? I suppose that's true. A barmaid's got to work in the kitchens from time to time, and I've learned a few recipes over the years. Nothing too special, but they're hearty enough to fill Grok's substantial belly.", "What'll it be, sweety?" },
	["凯雯德拉"] = { "This place... it's cursed. I barely managed to escape, and I cannot bear to go down through the tunnels again. My brother, and sisters though... They were not as fortunate. Trapped inside, they are feverish with the corrupted haze that flows from the evil garden growing there. Please, you must help." },
	["凯雷希亚·猎月"] = { "The forest told me of your presence, but not why you were here. So, speak and enlighten me." },
	["凯雷斯特拉兹"] = { "Our freedom would have meant nothing if C'Thun had survived. You are truly a champion of prophecy." },
	["击碎者金罗克"] = { "I am Jin'rokh the Breaker, envoy of Mugamba: Fist of Rastakhan! My dealings are with warriors and heathens." },
	["刀锋山护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["刀锋山护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["刃叶长者"] = { "Elder Bladeswift wanders the paths of Darnassus atop Teldrassil.", "Elder Skygleam can be found near the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["刃歌长者"] = { "Elder Primestone has spent many years in the Crystal Vale in Silithus.", "For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["切尔希·雷斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["列兵布劳恩"] = { "Dying for one's country is a soldier's duty. But if calling this war folly is treason, then I'm a traitor." },
	["列兵索尔森"] = { "This is a dangerous place, $N. Be careful around here." },
	["列兵维克斯"] = { "We need to figure out what this shadowy group is doing here at Grangol'var Village!" },
	["初级侦探"] = { "Something stinks, and for once it's not my socks." },
	["初级探员"] = { "Something stinks, and for once it's not my socks." },
	["初级药剂师劳伦斯"] = { "Blight, Blight, Blight... that\"s all I hear about around here. I miss the diversity! Here, here. You have pets, yes? Of course you do. Of course. Little pets. I have a mixture for them. It will make them ca-- ah, clever and strong creatures, yes. Yes.", "Careful with it. It\"s unstable and loses its potency quickly. Use it soon! And... preferably within eyesight, yes..." },
	["利廉姆·火轴"] = { "Let's see... fourteen plus seven, carry the two... oh, yes?" },
	["利斯贝·斯涅德"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["利莎·钢眉"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["剃刀基克希"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["剃刀岭步兵"] = { "Bah, that's goblin work! Still, we have an orc here in Razor Hill that will teach you of such things. Look for Mukdrak over near the forge.", "Can't you see I'm busy here? Go north up the road to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there. You can't miss it.", "Dhugru Gorelust is hiding behind the barracks on the east side of town. Don't let me find out that you're in league with the Burning Legion!", "Find Kaplak on top of the burrow in the southwest section of town.", "Flowers? In this wasteland? If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen'jin Village to the south.", "Head north up the road to Orgrimmar. You can ask one of the grunts there for directions to the Cooking Trainer.", "Huh? You'll find the bank in Orgrimmar. Head north up the road to get there and then talk to one of their grunts.", "I could use a drink and some rest myself. You'll find it right in the northwest corner of Razor Hill. Say hi to Innkeeper Grosk for me.", "I don't know of one of those around here. Your best bet is to go to Orgrimmar to the north and speak to one of their grunts.", "I hear that the trolls in Sen'jin Village have a potion maker named Miao'zan. Look there.", "I've seen a troll named Lau'Tiki fishing down south at the Darkspear Strand. That's just on the outskirts of Sen'jin Village.", "It's the big building in Razor Hill that's not the barracks. Just talk to Innkeeper Grosk inside. Got that?", "Jo'mah is in a building on the second floor of The Drag.", "Look for Tarshaw Jaggedscar in the barracks on the east side of town.", "Mmmmm food. It's not too long of a run, but you need to head north to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.", "On the east side of Razor Hill, behind the barracks is where you will find Dhugru Gorelust.", "Pets to take care of? Just make sure you clean up after it! Look for Shoja'my in front of the inn.", "Plenty of good mining to be had in Durotar, or so I hear. So good in fact that we have a Mining Trainer right here in Razor Hill. You'll find Krunn next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of town.", "Seek out Miao'zan in Sen'jin Village to the south.", "Shoja'my is over in front of the inn. Now move along, I'm busy.", "Speak with Un'Thuwa to the south in Sen'jin Village.", "Sure, sure. We have a Mining Trainer right here in town. Look for Krunn over in the northwest corner alongside the inn.", "Tai'jin is her name and you'll find her inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill. She'll teach you to respect the gods. Make certain that you show her the proper respect in return!", "That would be Dwukk. Find him next to the heated forge at the northwest corner of town.", "That's troll business. Look for Un'Thuwa in Sen'jin Village down south.", "The Hunter Trainer's name is Thotar. Seek him out inside the burrow on the southwest corner of Razor Hill.", "The Warchief brings change that will bring the Horde victory! Look for Swart inside the barracks on the east side of town.", "Then Orgrimmar is where you need to go. The north road out of Razor Hill leads directly there. Just talk to one of the grunts there and they can give you further directions.", "There is an Engineering Trainer in Razor Hill. He is called Mukdrak and can usually be found standing over near the forge.", "There's a Skinning Trainer in Orgrimmar. To get there head north up the road out of Razor Hill. Ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for directions when you arrive.", "There's one in Orgrimmar. A grunt up there will know what directions to give you. Just head north up the road here, you can't miss it.", "There's one in Orgrimmar. Go north and talk to one of their grunts.", "There's one of those inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill. Look for Rawrk.", "To learn to cure leather and work with hides go to Orgrimmar to the north. One of the Orgrimmar Grunts will be able to tell you the way to the Leatherworking Trainer.", "What are you looking for?", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "Yeah, I need to drop off some things myself. Find it by heading north up the road to Orgrimmar and then ask one of the grunts there.", "You can learn to sew up in Orgrimmar. That's to the north. Maybe one of the Orgrimmar Grunts can help you.", "You need to find Swart. Look for him inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.", "You'll find the Wind Rider Master in Orgrimmar. Go north up the road to get there and ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for further directions.", "You'll need to head to Orgrimmar for that. Just follow the road heading out of Razor Hill to the north through the canyon and you'll come to it. When you get there ask one of their grunts for further directions.", "You're a hunter? Well anyway, you'll find Thotar hiding from the sun inside the burrow at the southwest corner of town.", "You're looking for Lau'Tiki. You'll find him on Darkspear Strand out beyond Sen'jin Village to the south.", "You're looking for Mishiki. She has a hut to the south in Sen'jin Village.", "You're looking for Tai'jin. Find her in the barracks on the east side of town." },
	["前线指挥官卡伦克"] = { "You look lost, $c. Don't make me put you to work on the walls with the other peons." },
	["前线指挥官托尔克"] = { "If you're ever captured by the Legion, tell them \"Xar il romath da tidesbi.\" They will kill you instantly for insulting their god, saving you intolerable torture or worse..." },
	["前线指挥官金斯顿"] = { "Expedition Point is the Alliance's closest point of contact with the Legion Front. North of here is nothin' but demon, demon and more demon. Travel with a buddy." },
	["剥皮师埃霍奈"] = { "Ahunae's axe will be the end of the Drakkari. You be takin' care of any that get past my axe!" },
	["加克"] = { "Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is." },
	["加克森"] = { "Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it's enough to make a grown goblin cry." },
	["加基森卫兵"] = { "On behalf of the illustrious and still neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, I hope you enjoy your stay. Remember, everyone is welcome in Gadgetzan! Everyone except pirates.", "We're here to protect Gadgetzan interests in Un'Goro and that's none of your business." },
	["加姆·狼脉"] = { "Whatever advice I can give to aid in your fight against the ogres, you shall have it!" },
	["加尔戈克"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.", "The entrance to Warsong Gulch stands before you. Will you fight the wretched Alliance there?" },
	["加尔戈罗姆"] = { "Hail to you, $r. What I am doing here is a story for another time. Oof, that was a bad one. My brother and I are stuck here, between our time and the present. We dare not leave for fear of causing a temporal paradox. Patiently we wait until the dragons restore us to our proper timeline. How long has it been you ask? I'm not sure really. Ask my brother. Care for some cheese?" },
	["加尔特·迷雾行者"] = { "$N, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?", "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother. May your ancestors watch over you $c." },
	["加尔米·赫佐格"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["加尔鲁什"] = { "What is it that you want, $r?" },
	["加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮"] = { "Glory to the Horde!", "The razing of Orgrimmar was not just an attack against orcs, it was an affront to the Horde. An assault against our very existence! The Lich King sought to sow the seeds of fear. This... <Garrosh points to the fortified walls that surround him.> This is the result of Arthas's campaign. The Horde fears nothing...", "With the Warsong Offensive here in Icecrown Citadel, victory is within our grasp! The death of the Lich King will bring glory to the Horde!", "You turn away the might of the Warsong Offensive? Has the chaos of battle turned you mad? With my help, victory is at hand! Without my help, your fight will be difficult." },
	["加巴林卡"] = { "The first time I saw mushrooms taller than trees, I wasn't so sure I could call this place home. After a while you just stop noticing." },
	["加弗洛克"] = { "What brings you out here, little one?" },
	["加恩·石塔"] = { "I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies. What can I do for you, $N?" },
	["加拉达尔卫兵队长"] = { "Draenei have come back! This group jumped two of my best wolf riders as they were out patrolling the western roads. Needless to say, we were victorious in that skirmish. Now I'm not sure what's going on but from what my scouts tell me, there are blood elves and draenei all over Halaa. I'm no blood elf lover but if it's one thing I hate it's a draenei. If you see draenei or any of their allies at Halaa, be sure to put a boot in their backsides for me. Halaa's to the west... In case you want to go now." },
	["加斯顿"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["加林德·风剑船长"] = { "Watch your step aboard Elune's Blessing, $r. Though Elune's blessed us with the discovery of our new friends, we've also had our share of hardships at sea. However, recovering souls lost at sea or lost in a new world is truly a blessing from Elune." },
	["加琳黛尔"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you." },
	["加索克"] = { "Keep your eyes open, $c. Even Durotar is not safe from our enemies." },
	["加维·砂锤中尉"] = { "We've a duty out here, $g boy : girl;, to see to it that we don't let anyone surprise us. That means proactive action!", "We've a duty out here, boy, to see to it that we don't let anyone surprise us. That means proactive action!", "We've a duty out here, girl, to see to it that we don't let anyone surprise us. That means proactive action!" },
	["加罗克"] = { "The Ring of Trials was once of place of great glory and honor. But then, the Steamwheedle Cartel came, with their wagons of gold and quill pens sharper than any orc axe..." },
	["加罗迪努斯"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["加翰·鹰翼"] = { "The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude." },
	["加莉亚·哈斯汀"] = { "I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out." },
	["加诺斯·轻蹄"] = { "$N, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother. May your ancestors watch over you $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["加迪"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["加里杨"] = { "Very few seek me out... What may I do for you?" },
	["加隆·哈金斯"] = { "Leave off. I don't have anything for the likes of you." },
	["加隆·塑石者"] = { "Being part of the Explorers' League, I've been hunting for artifacts in the area. Winterspring is said to contain very magical items... Most are highly guarded." },
	["加鲁斯"] = { "As a representative of the Consortium, I am always mindful of the ramifications that my interactions have upon our business dealings. It is unfortunate that the blood elves do not treat their partnerships with such respect." },
	["助手克拉图"] = { "I fear that Colonel Jules may only be saved through a dangerous ritual... an exorcism.", "May the Light guide you, $n." },
	["助手温图拉"] = { "Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas' will, $N. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves." },
	["助手玛迦兹"] = { "Listen to your elders, $N. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control." },
	["努丝"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["努塔奇"] = { "Our blessed great sea turtle, Green Island, travels from here to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight." },
	["努特拉尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["劳伦斯·瑟尼德"] = { "Life is like a carefully woven tapestry." },
	["劳兰娜·萨维尔"] = { "I've always liked sorting and organizing things. I guess I take after my mother." },
	["劳尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["劳尔娜·晨光"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $N?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["劳拉·摩尔"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["劳莉耶尔·图布雷"] = { "I don't think we can afford to pass an opportunity to ingratiate ourselves with the red flight. With the battles ahead, having them as allies would be invaluable." },
	["勇士巴卡希"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["勇敢的强生"] = { "Hey! Are you on an errand for Tirth? If I were you I'd get as far away from him as I could! His mind's been pickled from too much drink but his magic's as strong as ever!", "Sure, I'll tell you the phrase. As long as I don't have to go anywhere near Tirth!" },
	["勘探员多尔伦"] = { "It's a real honor to be able to aid Brann in exploring ancient Ulduar." },
	["勘探员柯纳尔"] = { "No overgrown bug's gonna chase me out of Zangarmarsh! I'll show 'em what the Explorers' League is made of..." },
	["勘探员罗尔伦"] = { "It's a real honor to be able to aid Brann in exploring ancient Ulduar." },
	["勘探者纳克兰"] = { "In my years as a member of Explorers' League, I've been all over Azeroth, but I've never seen anythin' quite like Bloodmyst." },
	["勘测员安威瓦尔德"] = { "Ah, you must be the $glad : lass; assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods. Took your sweet time getting here, didn't you? Very well, off we go. Let us not waste one more minute.", "Ah, you must be the lad assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods. Took your sweet time getting here, didn't you? Very well, off we go. Let us not waste one more minute.", "Ah, you must be the lass assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods. Took your sweet time getting here, didn't you? Very well, off we go. Let us not waste one more minute.", "What are you looking at, $glad : lass;? Never seen a dwarf before, then? You'd best be on yer way if you don't want any trouble.", "What are you looking at, lad? Never seen a dwarf before, then? You'd best be on yer way if you don't want any trouble.", "What are you looking at, lass? Never seen a dwarf before, then? You'd best be on yer way if you don't want any trouble." },
	["化学家弗雷"] = { "Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past. I know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best. I am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment. I could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures..", "My brother and I have dedicated ourselves to Sylvanas. She is our beacon of light when times were darkest. We sacrifice ourselves day in and day out to ensure our kind overcome the destiny that's chosen us. We will not remain weak. We will take that which is owed to us. We will return tenfold, the pain that was done to us. And we shall do so with smiles on our faces." },
	["化学家阿尔比顿"] = { "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth. With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands! Once you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth. With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands! Once you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth. With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands! Once you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", "This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year.", "Well now $N, let's get to work on those cauldrons! If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me. You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons. You'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons. It's not cheap, nor is it stable. Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it." },
	["北伐军战士乔纳森"] = { "BOOM! That's the last thing I remember..." },
	["北伐军战士哈尔福特"] = { "Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Lightsworn armor for paladins." },
	["北伐军战士拉莫夫"] = { "<sigh>... A little help here, perhaps?" },
	["北伐军战士格瑞姆通"] = { "Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Ymirjar Lord's armor for warriors." },
	["北伐军战士欧尔拉金·萨利斯"] = { "The Scourge must be stopped at any cost. We cannot permit them to field the army they're constructing here." },
	["北伐军战士约瑟芬"] = { "Ohhh, the pain is... overwhelming..." },
	["北伐军战士马克拉尔"] = { "We're in over our heads, $r! Watch your back!" },
	["北伐军指挥官科尔法克斯"] = { "This is a fine mess we've gotten ourselves into. We're overdue to join up with our forces in Icecrown and now we're entangled in this debacle, stuck between the Scourge and the Drakkari. I told the highlord it was a mistake to come here. See what you can do to help out there." },
	["北伐军新兵"] = { "<sob> My uncle served in the Argent Dawn. How was he able to face these foul things?", "Every time I close my eyes I see the scourge surrounding me! I gotta get outta here...", "Get out of here while you can, $c! There's no way we can win...", "I can't take it anymore... They kill you, then eat you! And that's if you're lucky!", "I haven't been able to eat or sleep since I got here. I'm just not cut out for the Crusade...", "I'm going to die here... I just know it.", "We're doooomed!!" },
	["北伐军领主兰迪加"] = { "Look around and let the devastation sink in, $c. Every last troll that lived here is either dead or has fled to the upper levels. It gets worse. In an act of desperation, the living Drakkari trolls sacrificed their own animal gods so that they could drink from the blood of the gods and gain untold power. While they succeeded in keeping the Scourge at bay with their newfound strength, the results were catastrophic. The ancient empire of Zul'Drak lies in ruin as proof." },
	["北贫瘠之地护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["北风苔原护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["北风苔原护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["医师哈索恩"] = { "I've treated peasants, nobles, merchants' sons and beggars. Allow me to share one piece of wisdom with you - we're all the same when staring death in the face." },
	["十字军指挥官科尔法克斯"] = { "Is this a serious question? You really don't know? If you are the cowardly sort, afraid to get their hands too dirty, you will find Dark Iron scraps on the creatures in the Burning Steppes and Searing Gorge. If you're the bloodthirsty adventuring type, the dungeons of Blackrock Spire and Blackrock Depths hold quite a large supply of the scraps." },
	["千针石林护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["半人马贱民"] = { "I need no home to know I still have a place in this world, $c. The tribes will see... all of them. They fight amongst one another, and for what? Scraps left over by vultures... lands infested by the Legion... bah! The centaur should be proud of their heritage--it is just as noble as any Night elf's or orc's--it is time we started acting like it!" },
	["卓尔特"] = { "Be quiet 'bout what you hear and see around here, $r.", "Da $g king : queen;! Chort ready to serve.", "Da king! Chort ready to serve.", "Da queen! Chort ready to serve." },
	["南希拉"] = { "I carry odds and ends, but mostly just odds." },
	["博古斯·粗臂"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["博古斯·钢拳"] = { "Can't ye see I'm busy? This had better be good.", "What are ye daft? That's not a weapon, that's a dinner knife. I don't train amateurs." },
	["博古洛克大王"] = { "We need to get this outpost ready for the push into Sholazar Basin. Don't just stand there, $c. Go out and represent the Horde with honor and spilled blood!" },
	["博学者亚沃"] = { "10,000 years of recorded knowledge tends to draw the wrong element to the Athenaeum. Books are stolen, recovered and stolen again on a daily basis." },
	["博学者基尔达斯"] = { "They've been stolen, $r! Three of our most prized volumes. Should you return the tomes, a reward will most certainly be yours." },
	["博学者拜特"] = { "I almost made it! I came in here to prove the existence of Quagmirran, that most mythical of fungal giants. I got my wish, sort of. You must let me free! In return I will grant you a boon to help you to deal with Quagmirran." },
	["博学者斯克希里斯"] = { "Here I have amassed what may well be the greatest depository of lore in all of Outland. Even the grand libraries of Silvermoon City pale in comparison. Please... look, read, browse to your heart's content. You'll find everything organized and clearly labeled." },
	["博学者莱德罗斯"] = { "What you must understand is that being able to index 10,000 years of existence has given me a rather unique perspective on life. Your present day trials and tribulations are meaningless." },
	["博学者诺拉·暴雨图腾"] = { "Only the most valiant and honorable amongst the tribe can earn the honor of being laid to rest at Red Rocks." },
	["博学者麦库斯"] = { "Kildrath tends to overdramatize the situation. For example, Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery, has been stolen over 400 times. The mark of the Athenaeum protects the tomes, preventing any unauthorized viewings." },
	["博拉·石锤"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["博拉姆·逐星"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["博文·布里斯博埃斯"] = { "Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?" },
	["占星者奥术守护者"] = { "<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn and the stablemaster outside it.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city's open market, in the southeast.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city, where a great forge may be found.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place across the Tier, towards the inn and nearby mailbox.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place below the Tier, a stairwell southeast of the city's center.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place east of the city's center.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place southeast of the city's center.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures to the northwest portion of the lower city, where Shattrath's arakkoa dwell.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards Aldor Rise.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards a place below the Tier, a stairwell northeast of the city's center.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the Seer's Library.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the easternmost portion of the lower city.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the lower city's open marketplace.>", "<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the northeastern section of the lower city.>", "<The Arcane Guardian seems to face you, but says nothing.>", "<The Arcane Guardian silently waits for you to further elaborate.>", "<The Arcane Guardian stands motionless, waiting for you to elaborate on which Battlemasters you mean.>", "<The construct gestures to the eastern portion of the Tier.>", "The grand master leatherworker Darmari may be found in the lower city's open marketplace." },
	["占星者幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["卡乌尼中士"] = { "If you're going to come out here, make yourself useful because the shadowstalker over there isn't doing much." },
	["卡伦·温沃斯"] = { "Even now, free-willed undead battle the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin. Will you aid the Defilers in defeating the humans and their Alliance allies?" },
	["卡伦·诺尔"] = { "The air battle rages close, $n. Both we and the Horde send bombers into the Bombardment and the Valley of Lost Hope. Will you enter the fray?" },
	["卡兰·巨锤"] = { "<Kharan clears his throat.> We made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched. We reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup.", "<Kharan sighs.> I suppose... I suppose you are right. Gor'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?", "All is lost...", "As we were making our way across the Burning Steppes, we were ambushed. It must have been a hundred of them... Dark Iron dwarves! They were shifting out of the walls, from the rocks in the Steppes; out of every crevice, nook, and cranny in sight. They swarmed us, overwhelming the guards and the few brave heroes that had agreed to assist us on this mission. One thing was clear: This was a highly orchestrated ambush. It was as if they knew every move we would make before we made them...", "Do I look stupid to you, $r? I may as well sign her death warrant myself! Why should I trust you?", "Get it over with you filthy $r. <Kharan lowers his head, exposing his stubby neck.>", "How else could this have happened? Someone must have tipped the Dark Irons off. <Kharan shakes his fist at you.> So help me, if I ever get out of here, I will spend the rest of my days finding the traitor.", "She now resides at the side of Emperor Thaurissan. He has her under some sort of powerful thought altering spell... and here I sit, completely helpless.", "Then listen well, $r. Several months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes. Princess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire.", "Where was I? Oh yes, so we were captured. My elite guardsmen were executed on the spot. They spared me and took the princess away by way of ram. I was taken to the detention halls of the Slag Pit and then transferred to this prison. I can only assume I am still alive because they wish to extract a ransom for my pitiful life. Or maybe out of cruelty, as a way to let me forever play back the events that transpired in my mind. Regret is the cruelest jailor of all, $r." },
	["卡兰德拉斯"] = { "Greetings, traveler. As long as you remain within the walls of the Cenarion Hold, you will be safe from harm. Be wary when leaving the protection of the Hold as the silithid have been swarming as of late." },
	["卡兹"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?", "I would train you, but you are no warrior.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["卡兹·双链"] = { "With all the Siege Engines nearly complete, I'm getting a bit bored! You're not an engineer, are you? Care to compare blueprints...?" },
	["卡利亚德"] = { "Midnight is Attumen the Huntsman's personal mount. I've never seen a faster, stronger, or more mean spirited horse. And her rider is even more temperamental! Everyone keeps their distance from her, lest they get a hoof upside the head from Midnight or a beating from Attumen." },
	["卡加"] = { "You won't find a finer firearm anywhere else in Orgrimmar." },
	["卡勒迪斯·晨光"] = { "Knowing a little magic comes in handy in this line of work. Illusions can't always fool everyone, but they're usually good enough to get the job done." },
	["卡博隆"] = { "Come, $r. What formula interests you today?" },
	["卡姆希丝"] = { "This tower is complete and utter madness. This isn't a library, it's a huge haystack of books and I don't think the needle even exists! Now, what was I doing?" },
	["卡娜莉亚"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["卡尔"] = { "Our master Malfurion remains lost in the Dreaming, $c. His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming. Never forget this.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming. Never forget this.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming. Never forget this." },
	["卡尔·噬灵"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $N.", "Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c." },
	["卡尔·雷歌"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Kodo Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the tauren of Thunder Bluff before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["卡尔德"] = { "Hello, little $r." },
	["卡尔托格"] = { "There aren't many of us left, $N. The return of our old enemy is a cause for great concern." },
	["卡尔曼修士"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the Light protect you this day.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["卡尔特拉·血喉"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.", "Lok'tar $c! We have need of your services in Alterac Valley. Shall I add you to the lists?" },
	["卡尔纳·雷塔维"] = { "Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $N? It's simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it's not too bad. My uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I'm following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!" },
	["卡布拉姆·法弗林格"] = { "With the help of my brother Zap in Everlook I have constructed a Dimensional Imploder right here in Area 52. Who needs a rocket when you have instant transportation via Goblin Engineering! Are you a skilled enough Goblin Engineer to lean how to build your own Imploder beacon?" },
	["卡德加"] = { "<Khadgar grins to himself> I convinced A'dal and his brethren to return here with me. I believe that only their power can drive the Legion from this universe. But as you will no doubt find - their power must first live in our hearts. To combat the darkness, we must become beacons of their eternal Light.", "I am Khadgar, former apprentice to the fallen Guardian, Medivh. I'm sure you've heard his name before. It was I who discovered that Medivh had been possessed by the Evil One, Sargeras - and that he had opened the Dark Portal between this world and Azeroth. Though I honored my Master, I was forced to slay him and put his tortured soul to rest.", "I fought alongside Lord Anduin Lothar as we drove the Horde from our lands on Azeroth. As the heir of Medivh's legacy, I could do no less. When the call finally came to invade this grim world - and put an end to the orcs' evil forever - I stepped forward along with my friends Turalyon, Alleria, Danath and Kurdran.", "My comrades and I called ourselves the Sons of Lothar - in honor of the greatest, most selfless man we ever knew. We gave our all to defeat Ner'zhul and end his madness. As this doomed world fell apart around us, we shattered the Dark Portal to prevent any further harm befalling our beloved Azeroth.", "The naaru are wise beyond our understanding. I've learned more from A'dal in the last five months than all the years I spent in the libraries of Dalaran.", "Trapped in this broken wasteland, we did our best to survive. Over time we sensed that a new evil was closing in around us from the Twisting Nether. More foul than the dark orcs - it was the Burning Legion itself that sought to take hold of this... Outland.", "While my comrades held the line against the encroaching darkness, I used my magic to reach out into the Great Dark Beyond. There, I sensed beings of immense Light - of unfathomable purity. It was A'dal and his naaru I had found. It was nothing short of a... miracle." },
	["卡德拉克"] = { "What is it, $c?" },
	["卡德里斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["卡恩斯中士"] = { "\"Great job collecting resources for the war,\" they said, \"Have a promotion,\" they said. What they really meant is \"You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!\" Thanks for the promotion, Captain!" },
	["卡托什"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $N.", "Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c." },
	["卡拉·芒星"] = { "If you've got somewhere to go, I can get you there." },
	["卡拉恩·阿玛卡"] = { "Greetings $c - welcome to the front lines in our conquest of Ashenvale! If you are looking for something to do, then you've come to the right place. I'm always looking for able-bodied individuals to help bring glory to the Horde!" },
	["卡拉然·温布雷"] = { "As you can see, I am but one man with a lumbering oaf of a squire. The might of the Dark Iron dwarves and the beasts held in the grip of Ragnaros would surely overwhelm me alone, but I have the utmost confidence that such a brave and ambitious adventurer such as you would have no problem handling the denizens of the cauldron. Should you choose to assist me, I shall reward you with riches and wealth beyond your wildest dreams.", "My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice. I seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?", "Vengeance shall be mine." },
	["卡斯鲁姆·斧拳"] = { "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lass, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me." },
	["卡普拉克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory, unhindered by the timidness of the Warchief.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["卡普萨里斯夫人"] = { "There are some rewards fit only for those who have attained the title of Crusader, exalted in the eyes of the Argent Crusade as well as all their allied peoples. Tirion himself has charged me with the finding of such heroes and bestowing upon them the proper decorations." },
	["卡林·雷德帕斯"] = { "We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair. Instead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning." },
	["卡林·风程"] = { "To get down safely, I provide wings to those in need." },
	["卡格·血颅"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["卡格罗什"] = { "The orc's corpse has been casually tossed aside so as not to litter the walkway." },
	["卡洛斯"] = { "Don't mind me. I'm just an old man, waiting on an old... friend." },
	["卡洛斯·拉佐克"] = { "Greetings. Our bats are well trained and fed. You'll not find faster." },
	["卡洛雷克"] = { "Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor." },
	["卡特尔·迪芬斯"] = { "What do you want?" },
	["卡特琳娜"] = { "Can you feel it? The spirit world draws close during the Day of the Dead. This is why we decorate the graves of our dearly departed with flowers and candles and offerings: To welcome them back, even if only for a time. So come! Dance with me! Let us cherish and honor those we have lost in their ghostly presence, so that they might eat and drink and smile and know that they are loved." },
	["卡玛古的奥弗斯"] = { "The dead rise and seek vengeance on any that dare pass through their domain. Turn back!" },
	["卡玛瑞"] = { "You like the rug? I killed and skinned the beast myself. May all the centaur fall as easily." },
	["卡琳达"] = { "My knowledge of Jewelcrafting I will share with you." },
	["卡瑞·雷角"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I do not have the knowledge you seek.", "I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["卡瑞娜·麦肯达"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["卡瑞纳库"] = { "You must... free... my children..." },
	["卡米尔·长路"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["卡维恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, brother, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, sister, but I cannot train you." },
	["卡罗琳·瓦德"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it." },
	["卡苏斯修士"] = { "May the light guide your path and aid you in your journies. If you need any assistance browsing, I will be right over here." },
	["卡莱恩"] = { "I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?" },
	["卡萨·赤翼"] = { "Well met, $c. I'm learning the art of gryphon handling from Baldruc over there. One day, I hope to run my own stable of gryphons." },
	["卡萨雷兹"] = { "Yes? What is it?" },
	["卡诺萨克"] = { "Moa'ki Harbor is blessed with two great sea turtles: Walker of Waves and Green Island. They swim between Unu'pe and Kamagua." },
	["卡雷布"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["卡雷斯·炎枪"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["卡雷斯特拉"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!" },
	["卡雷苟斯"] = { "Greetings, $r. I sense some confusion at my presence here. The others harbor suspicion as well, and I cannot blame them, after what my brethren have put them through. Much has happened since the events at the Sunwell, little of it good. And so it falls to me to pick up the pieces, and attempt to salvage the pride of my flight. There is much to say, and more to do, but know this: Not all in the Blue Dragonflight blame the mortal races of Azeroth for the troubles that have befallen the world. Some of us have more sense than that." },
	["卡鲁克"] = { "I am sworn by tuskarr law to avenge my kin... these murderers burned Pal'ea to the ground." },
	["卢卡斯中士"] = { "Be on your guard. We are Theramore's first line of defense against its many enemies in the marsh." },
	["卢尔萨"] = { "Take a look around and let me know if there's anything that you're interested in." },
	["卢希恩·枪穗"] = { "You've got to try some of this beer." },
	["卢弗塔希娅"] = { "Are you lost? Most of the town's vendors are situated near the center of town." },
	["卢格安·钢胃"] = { "Hey there, how are ye? Come ta learn the art o' the Charge, $c?", "My advice is no good to ye unless ye're ridin' a tournament mount. Equip a lance and grab a tournament mount outside yer faction's pavilion.", "Well then! A mounted Charge is about more than just kickin' yer mount ta full speed an' hollerin' yer lungs out... though that IS the fun part, heh! But the Charge Target will teach ye the finer points. A good Charge is all about distance and timing. Ye can't be TOO close, or ye won't get enough speed. But ye can't be too far away either or yer mount will tire! As for timin'... Ye'll want ta make sure the Charge Target doesn't have a layer o' Defend up before ye rush in. If it does, use yer Shield Breaker ta make it vulnerable, and THEN Charge in! Same goes for the real thing: Try ta drop yer opponent defenses before ye Charge!" },
	["卢森·费兹布拉克"] = { "What can I do for you? No, wait! What can you do for me?" },
	["卢瑟·匹克曼"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c.", "It is wise that you humble yourself before me $N in your desire for more warlock knowledge.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["卢瑟弗·图恩"] = { "I am Rutherford Twing, the main supplier for the Defilers posted here at Arathi Basin. As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful. Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services." },
	["卫兵亚鲁纳·云鬃"] = { "Ah yes, Skinning. There is no one finer in wielding a skinning knife than Yonn Deepcut. You can find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village.", "Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find. I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn.", "Ah, you must go to the great heights of Thunder Bluff to visit one of those. Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village. At the base of the bluffs is an elevator that will take you to the top. When you get there ask for further directions from one of the Bluffwatchers.", "Away to Thunder Bluff to the north is where your journey takes you then friend. Once there seek out the wisdom of one of the Bluffwatchers who can tell you directly where to find whom you seek.", "Give a bull a fish and feed him for a day. Teach a bull to fish and feed him for life. Uthan Stillwater can teach you how to fish. Seek his wisdom west of Bloodhoof Village along the banks of Stonebull Lake.", "Hmmm, I think you will need to go up to Thunder Bluff to learn that. Head north on the road out of Bloodhoof Village. It will take you to the base of Thunder Bluff. Ride the elevator to the top and you should be able to ask any of the Bluffwatchers there for further assistance.", "I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in Thunder Bluff to the north. Take the road out of the village and when you get there ride the elevator to the top of the rise. Any of the Bluffwatchers should be able to help you from there.", "If you desire to learn the ways of Herbalism then it is to Thunder Bluff that you must go. Follow the road north out of Bloodhoof Village and take the elevator to the top of the rise. You can ask a Bluffwatcher there for further assistance.", "Innkeeper Kauth can see to your needs. He can be found on the west side of the village in one of the long houses.", "Inside the great tent at the northwest corner of the village is where Chaw Stronghide resides. He will teach you what you must know of Leatherworking for now.", "It is Gennia Runetotem's counsel that you seek. You will find her in the large tent on the east side of the village.", "Krang Stonehoof stands astride his training circle at the southeast corner of the village.", "My mouth waters just to think on it. Pyall Silentstride is the finest cook in Bloodhoof Village. You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village.", "Nothing frees the spirit like soaring through the sky. There is such a place in our great tribal center Thunder Bluff. The road north out of Bloodhoof Village will guide you there. Once you ride the elevator to the top speak with one of the Bluffwatchers who can give you further directions.", "Seek out Poshken Hardbinder in The Pools of Vision, below the Spirit Rise.", "Seikwa can take care of your animal friends when you have the need. Seek her out in front of the inn.", "Such wisdom is steeped in a mystery that can only be found in great Thunder Bluff. Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to an elevator at the base of the bluffs. Ride it to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for further assistance.", "Tailoring you say? Hmmm. Ah yes, of course. You'll need to head to Thunder Bluff, up north. Take the path out of the village to get there. When you arrive at the base of the bluffs ride the elevator to the top of the rise and speak with one of the Bluffwatchers.", "The way of the Druid is sibling to the Shaman. Gennia Runetotem is steeped in such knowledge. Seek her out in the large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.", "There are those that would teach you of Herbalism in the great home of Thunder Bluff away to the north. Follow the road out of the village to get there and at the base of the bluff ride the elevator to the top of the rise. There are many Bluffwatchers there who can direct you further.", "There is a Blacksmithing Trainer in our great home Thunder Bluff to the north. If you seek such knowledge then head there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions.", "There is a Wind Rider Master in the great city of Thunder Bluff to the north. Ride the elevator from the base of Thunder Bluff to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for further instructions.", "There is a large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village. You will find Narm Skychaser awaiting you there.", "There is a time and a place for all things, including relaxation. On the west side of Bloodhoof Village Innkeeper Kauth maintains a long house for those who seek to rest. You will find him there.", "There is a wise one in the village who goes by the name Narm Skychaser. He can continue your learning along the path of the Shaman.", "Unfortunately we do not have one who teaches Tailoring here in Bloodhoof Village, but you can find a trainer in Thunder Bluff. Follow the path north out of the village until you come to a set of elevators. Take one up to the top of the rise and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for directions.", "Using the fruits of the Earth Mother to create potions to aid us in our eternal struggle is an honorable endeavor. To learn of this you must travel north to our great home of Thunder Bluff. When you arrive at the top seek out the assistance of one of the Bluffwatchers for more specific directions.", "Vira Younghoof keeps her practice inside the long house on the west side of the village.", "We have no such place in the village. The soaring heights of Thunder Bluff does though. Head north up the road out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the base of the bluffs. There ride the elevator to the top and speak with a Bluffwatcher. May your ancestors watch over you.", "What are you looking for?", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "While we have no Alchemy Trainer here in Bloodhoof Village, there is one in Thunder Bluff to the north. Follow the road there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions when you get to the top.", "Yaw Sharpmane awaits you on the north edge of the village. He can teach you the ways of the Hunter.", "Yonn Deepcut can be found inside the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village.", "You are looking for Uthan Stillwater. You will find him west of the village, fishing at Stonebull Lake.", "You desire to shape the bones of the Earth Mother into tools that will aid the Horde. Good, good. Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the elevator leading to the top of Thunder Bluff. A Bluffwatcher there can give you further assistance.", "You will find Pyall Silentstride inside the great tent in the northwest corner of the village. He can teach you what you crave." },
