	["厄苏拉·德林"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["厄鲁特"] = { "The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["厨师凯图·黑罐"] = { "All of these mouths to feed, and who has to do it? Me! All the cooking, and the cleaning, and everything else!" },
	["厨师托马斯"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!", "Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge. She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\"." },
	["受伤的地精矿工"] = { "Poison... my insides are churning..." },
	["受伤的雨声神谕者"] = { "<The Injured Rainspeaker Oracle groans in pain.>" },
	["受难者奥图里斯"] = { "<Altruis turns to face you and smiles.> I do not. <Altruis points to his steed, Nethrandamus.> We must stop them before these forge camps are able to complete whatever it is that they are building.", "As a reward for his years of service, Illidan allowed Kael'thas to send him five warriors to train under him. It would be the first time blood elves would be allowed to train as demon hunters. The training was brutal. Illidan put Kael's warriors through trials that would defeat most fully capable demon hunters. Three of Kael's elves died in training - another went mad. One succeeded.", "Do you know what I see? A precursor to invasion. Aye, the master was wise in sealing the portals but has since lost his... how shall I put this? The master has lost his focus. Yes... Focus. With this loss, the Legion has seized opportunity. They seep out now, growing in number day by day.", "It is not surprising that a blood elf's potential for power as a demon hunter is so high. After all, the sin'dorei do not have the natural aversion to demonic magic that night elves do. However, I do not expect many to succeed. Most of them, Varedis included, pursue power for its own sake. That power will consume them, for they are not driven by the pure fire that burns inside a true demon hunter's heart.", "Knowledge of a demon's true name is rumored to give a certain amount of power over that demon. The Book of Fel names is said to contain the true name of every demon ever to have existed. By memorizing the passages in the book, Varedis had found a source of power to rival Illidan's own drinking from the Skull of Gul'dan. At Illidan's request, Varedis now runs the training grounds at the Ruins of Karabor - along with the three masters that mentored Varedis.", "That is what these structures that litter the landscape are called. The Legion have employed the mo'arg and gan'arg to build weapons of mass destruction at these mobile forge camps. Let us not find out what it is that they intend to build here in Nagrand! You will be my eyes. Your weapons will be my fury.", "The Burning Legion. Demons. I see them as clearly as you can see your own hand in front of your face. That is, I used to be able to see them clearly. With the Legion's return come new machinations. Under normal circumstances, I am able to sense the presence of a demon from a thousand paces. <Altruis grimaces.>", "They elude me. I cannot see past their defenses. They have put in place wards to prevent detection. <Altruis points westward.> They fear us because they know that we fear nothing. The cost for such power is great, the sacrifices many.", "This is what I have gathered from the information that you collected from the survey. There are two primary forge camps: Forge Camp: Hate, directly west of where we stand and Forge Camp: Fear, directly southwest. Each camp has a Legion transporter, one forge, and several spell warding towers. Additionally, the camps are guarded by wrathguards manning fel cannons. Lastly, each camp has a pit lord overseer. Right then, this should be no problem at all... <Altruis laughs.>", "Varedis was his name. To Illidan's surprise, not only did he succeed in the excruciating rites of passage that are part of the training; Varedis was already displaying better command over his powers than many veteran demon hunters. Illidan sensed the potential in Varedis and assigned three master demon hunters to train him further in their ways.", "What do you see when you look to the west, mortal?", "Within a year of training under Illidan's best three demon hunters, Varedis had surpassed them. No longer content with the training they had to offer, Varedis infiltrated the Shadow Council where he learned of a powerful relic known as the Book of Fel Names. He secretly read from this book, committing each passage to memory." },
	["叛逃煽动者"] = { "You seem like a sensible $c, friend. Do you remember the glory days of Theramore, back before Jaina made us give up the fight against the Horde? Are you sick of being told to stay your blade while the orcs continue to provoke us?" },
	["古丹"] = { "Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!" },
	["古博·布拉普"] = { "Hi there. I'm Gubber Blump." },
	["古图尔"] = { "At first we repaired them to harvest the forests here, but ever since the alliance arrived and the fighting broke out we've been using them as war machines. Believe me, $c. If you've got a key, you'd be crazy not to use it.", "Grekk holds them. Maybe he'll give you one if you help him out. The next time you're up north at Blue Sky logging Grounds be sure to talk to him.", "Listen, $r. If you're lookin' for a shredder to ride, you'll need to head up into the hills just north there. This one's out of commission." },
	["古多·斩云"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["古奇"] = { "Greetings, $n." },
	["古安"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my brother. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my sister. Do you seek further guidance today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["古尔基尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["古尔弗"] = { "Gurf is my name, stranger. Gurf the Brave!", "[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor...", "[Furbolg] Poorov'tarkh!", "[Furbolg] Yar vartslaf?" },
	["古尔戈索克"] = { "You look like you could make us some money. How about a spin inside the Amphitheater of Anguish, pal?", "You're definitely strong, $r, but do you have what it takes to become the Warmaul champion?", "You're the champion now, buddy! Do you think you have what it takes to defend your title?" },
	["古尔拉格"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits." },
	["古尔沙"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["古拉克"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley." },
	["古拉克·石拳"] = { "In years past, the warlock Nekros Skullcrusher abused a powerful artifact to enslave Alexstrasza and much of the red dragonflight. Zuluhed and Nekros are dead, but the debt we owe to the reds is far from repaid." },
	["古拉摩·索洛伊"] = { "Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good." },
	["古斯塔夫·范沃森医生"] = { "Greetings, $N. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma.", "It is good to see you again, Doctor $N. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques. Return to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know." },
	["古树莫斯伍德"] = { "Soon I will plant roots and sleep. Before I rest there are things that must yet be done." },
	["古格"] = { "Wut you want? Smell funny for fel orc..." },
	["古玛"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["古瑞克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["古莉蕾·格林菲尔"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["古达·硬锤"] = { "Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty." },
	["召唤者泰里拉伦"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "There is more to magic than just arcane gesticulations... but I am speaking to someone who already knows this, yes? You've come to me to learn, and learn you will... just so long as you pay attention and do as I say. The secrets of the demons do not cater to fools, and neither do I.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["召火者阿库鲁"] = { "These chains that bind me prevent me from bringing the spirit of fire to my people, $N. Souls without fire are souls that cannot rebel against their masters." },
	["史克里克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["史学家卡尼克"] = { "Welcome to the Explorers' League. If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out." },
	["史蒂文·洛汉"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["叶基亚"] = { "Greetings, $c. Though time and drink have dulled my outer senses, my inner eyes remain strong." },
	["叶萨·维尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["司法官亚麦"] = { "I don't know what happened. I had just arrived at Venomspite and then all of a sudden I woke up in this cage! Are you here to rescue me?", "I think he's on the south side of the abbey.", "I think they have her down near the gallows.", "I think they put him in a cage over near the lumbermill." },
	["吉兹·考波克利"] = { "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you...", "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..." },
	["吉嘉"] = { "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?" },
	["吉姆瑞兹·黑轮"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["吉安娜·普罗德摩尔"] = { "Amazing! Anatheron's defeat at your hands has delayed Archimonde from his objective, and brought us that much closer to victory. My forces cannot stay here, however. My troops and I are exhausted, and now is the time for retreat. If your strength has not waned, head east to Thrall's encampment. That is where we make another stand. Be well.", "Hendel is in our custody now, $N, thanks to you. Although the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows. For now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance. Until then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance.", "I have no idea who you are, but your presence is most welcome. Archimonde and his Scourge army could attack at any time, $C. Will you stand with us against this evil?", "I welcome you to Theramore, $N. I apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy. Perhaps we'll have more time to speak later.", "Why... that is very sweet of you. I gather that you are volunteering time for Children's Week, yes $c? Well, you are to be commended. It is imperative that we remember those less fortunate - especially the children. I'd be happy to sign an autograph. Here you go." },
	["吉尔弗拉姆·石趾"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["吉尔曼·石手"] = { "Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so." },
	["吉布·草须"] = { "Who are you? What do you want from me?" },
	["吉恩拉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can I do for you my child?" },
	["吉拉德·格林"] = { "We're miners, farmers and craftsmen - not soldiers. But we'll defend our land with our bare fists if we must." },
	["吉瓦斯·格里加特"] = { "Ticket redemption here! Get your tickets turned into prizes! Step right up!" },
	["吉纳泽林"] = { "Hey mon! You've ever been diving deep in the ocean? I'll let you in on a little secret, eh. Deep in the ocean you can find bubbly fissures; they'll allow you to breathe air while underwater. Let's keep this secret between you and me though, eh. I don't need no competition for me shellfish traps elsewhere... if you get my drift!" },
	["吉蕾布莉·银丝"] = { "I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?" },
	["后勤军需官乌瑞卡"] = { "Greetings, $N. As you rise in rank among the forces of Honor Hold, I will give you access to some of the different goods we keep in stock." },
	["吞火大师"] = { "Behold, the Flames of Summer!", "Careful, don't get burned!", "Enjoying the Fire Festival?" },
	["吞火者"] = { "Behold, the Flames of Summer!", "Careful, don't get burned!", "Enjoying the Fire Festival?" },
	["吧咕姆咕"] = { "Gawurgggl! Blrgl-brgl grgl!", "You have learned a trick to speak with us, $r, but I am not impressed. There are Winterfin betrayers across the water that need killing." },
	["启示者库尔兹"] = { "Ah, the Promised One has arrived. Welcome to Stillpine Hold.", "[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor...", "[Furbolg] Poorov'tarkh!", "[Furbolg] Yar vartslaf?" },
	["吴平"] = { "Both Handiir and Buliwyf can show you how to swing a mace properly, no matter the size. You can find Buliwyf within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge. Handiir spends his days in the Exodar, training draenei on the Trader's Tier.", "Both Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace of Darnassus and Bixi Wobblebonk of the Timberline Arms in Ironforge can show you how to use throwing weapons properly.", "Have you come seeking training in the ways of armed combat?", "Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, or Buliwyf, the dwarf weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, can train you in the use of fist weapons.", "Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can train you in the use of bows.", "The dwarven weapon master Buliwyf can train you in both one and two-handed axes. He's found in the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.", "The man to talk to about gunnery is Buliwyf, found in the Timberline Arms within Ironforge.", "What weapon in particular interests you?" },
	["呀噜咕噜"] = { "<Ahlurglgr looks surprised to be able to understand you.>", "Mmrrglglglg? Glbmr brmmrggl glmrrbmrgl. Grglgrlbrr mrgl!!!" },
	["咕啦咕啦"] = { "Bg'grrml brgl brm!", "Let me out of here, $r!" },
	["咬耳者"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["哀难使者布鲁卡"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["哈克乌"] = { "I'm lonely. I wish that there were more kids my age around here. Sometimes I miss being at the orphanage in Shattrath City." },
	["哈克娅"] = { "I am forever in your debt, $N." },
	["哈克尔船长"] = { "These Alliance pondsuckers sure are gutsy! Boarding fully-manned Forsaken destroyers... now that's suicidal behavior if I ever heard of it." },
	["哈克鲁"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["哈卢"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["哈古斯"] = { "Come to buy from Hargus, you have?" },
	["哈吉克"] = { "A thousand curses upon you, $r! This prison will not hold me for long!" },
	["哈姆菲"] = { "I don't suppose you've come bearing news about the mines, have you?" },
	["哈尔加·岩拳"] = { "How are ye? Had yer fill o' Outland, and ready ta head back ta Alterac Valley and give the Horde what for?", "I'm afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c. Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt." },
	["哈尔南"] = { "By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?" },
	["哈尔琳"] = { "What is it you ask of the Blue Flight?" },
	["哈布·爪蹄"] = { "Kodo beasts, my friend! Trained from a young age and raised on the Golden Plains of Mulgore, these fine animals will make even finer steeds! Please, browse my selection, and see for yourself why we taurens have come to rely on these magnificant creatures!", "You are not known to my people. A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers. Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be exalted, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo." },
	["哈帕克斯"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["哈拉纳·铁皮"] = { "All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor." },
	["哈斯汀斯"] = { "Oh yeah, I've never seen them personally, but sometimes I hear them in the distance. Keep a watchful eye out for them if you venture inside.", "The damn spiders, the endlessly screeching bats, and those blasted demon beasts have all taken residence in the Servant's Quarters. It's not safe to walk around anymore, especially when the big ones come out of hiding." },
	["哈斯温里奥"] = { "Long have we toiled to see our land returned to its former glory, $c. Ever shall we remain vigilant against those who have invaded and defiled Quel'thalas. We will not rest until they are driven from our sight. Let none exist who stand in the way of the sin'dorei!" },
	["哈曼纳尔"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["哈杜尔"] = { "Only the most seasoned hunters of Illidan's minions gain access to my wares. You will be considered worthy when your status with the Sha'tar, Cenarion Expedition and the Aldor is exalted.", "Welcome, $N. Bring me the marks that Illidan bestows upon his most powerful minions and I shall grant you access to my alchemical goods." },
	["哈杜肯·迅蹄"] = { "We must ensure the survival of this camp at all costs, $c! Our enemies must not be given any quarter, for they would surely give us none were we to need it." },
	["哈格丁中尉"] = { "Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard. As you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement." },
	["哈格鲁姆·血拳"] = { "I remember when my brother and I would camp alone in the Azshara wilderness. Look at it now." },
	["哈森尼斯"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["哈洛姆"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["哈洛娜·雷语者"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["哈洛德·李格斯"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["哈玛"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["哈瑞的轰炸机"] = { "<The engine rumbles loudly.>" },
	["哈纳什"] = { "Archibald da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter.", "Archibald is da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter.", "Da Forsaken weapon master Archibald know his way 'round da polearm. He train others in da War Quarter of da Undercity. Ileda, da blood elf weapon master in Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, show you da right techniques too, mon.", "Heya mon. You come right place learn how ta wield a new weapon.", "Ileda of da blood elves, in Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, train her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, da Undercity\"s weapon master, also train you, mon. He in da War Quarter.", "Maces, they taught by Ansekhwa, found on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Our gunnery instructor, he Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Sayoc, da ugly orc here, teach you daggers. You want teaching in other places, you talk to Ileda in da Farstrider Square of Silvermoon or Archibald in the War Quarter of Undercity, hokay?", "What you want to learn, mon?", "You want to punch things, yah? Talk to Sayoc right here. He teach you." },
	["哈纳拉"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["哈罗德·兰恩"] = { "There I was tumbling in a patch of prickly undergrowth with a talbuk stag, hand-to-hand, only my sharp knife...<cough>... and keen hunter's intellect to save me. All of a sudden I'm jumped by a pair of fierce windroc hunters that came at me from the skies! Their cowardly attack...<cough>... didn't help them any though. And while I have their beaks as trophies, I received an infected scratch out of the ordeal. Kind of nasty, and I'm in a lot of pain, but I'm sure it'll heal up in a day or two.", "Yeah, yeah, I'm feeling better, but I kind of like it down here." },
	["哈考尔"] = { "Welcome to me camp, $r. She don't look like much, but she's home fer now." },
	["哈迪乌斯·哈洛维"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["哈里斯·晨行者"] = { "I have all manner of goods for sale, $c. Browse at your leisure." },
	["哈里森·琼斯"] = { "You'd better get outta here unless you want to find yourself in one of these cages..." },
	["哈隆梅瑟尔"] = { "I'm a prisoner! They shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new! Now they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire! I won't be held responsible for what happens to you, but you might as well get on board before she leaves. It's a crime I tell you!", "I'm a prisoner! They shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new! Now they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire! If you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than $3078w minutes. It's a crime I tell you!", "I'm a prisoner! They shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new! Now they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire! If you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than a minute. It's a crime I tell you!" },
	["哈雷尼·平原行者"] = { "$N, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother. May your ancestors watch over you $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["哈鲁克"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["哈鲁特·雷角"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["哈默希尔中士"] = { "Arthas thinks a few of his undead bugs are going to send us running back to the Eastern Kingdoms... he's got another thing coming." },
	["哨兵克瑞丝·晨草"] = { "We've sworn to do our very best to protect the passengers of The Bravery. The sea lane between Auberdine to Stormwind Harbor must remain safe." },
	["哨兵卢希尔·星语"] = { "It's good to see a new face out here. Our outpost is small and our enemies plentiful. We are surrounded by those who seek to destroy us: the satyr to the west, the orcs of the Warsong Lumber camp to the south, and the demons of Felfire Hill. We're grateful that the draenei have accepted our invitation to join us in fortifying Forest Song against these myriad threats." },
	["哨兵琪珊·清泉"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["哨兵维塔迪·冬露"] = { "We've sworn to do our very best to protect the passengers of The Bravery. The sea lane between Auberdine to Stormwind Harbor must remain safe." },
	["哨兵维尔莉妮·星坠"] = { "Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, $N? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from. Your name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem. The first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals." },
	["哨兵艾蒂亚·轻歌"] = { "The battle for Warsong Gulch is a battle that we cannot lose. We fight for our honor and we fight for our land, and no orc or misguided ally will take them from us!" },
	["唐纳德·拉波尼"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["唤地者利迦"] = { "May the spirits guide you, $r." },
	["唤水者埃伊兰"] = { "The spirit of water has left us. Our tribe is doomed." },
	["唤灵者多戈加尔"] = { "Puzzled by what you see, stranger? We give praise to the spirits of our ancestors by keeping the flame of their memory alive and paying it tribute." },
	["唤雷者索乌米特"] = { "Puppy-men been attacking us for days now. Great Lightning Stone is still safe though. Soo-holu come to help us like many times before... puppy-men not stand a chance." },
	["唤雾者索乌甘"] = { "What I not have in height I make up for in magics. I take care of Great Mist Stone good... most of time anyway. Dumb puppy-men." },
	["唤风者卡尔东"] = { "Now that the war is in full swing, we've had no shortage of able-bodied combatants from the Horde and Alliance. If only we could keep them off of each other's throats..." },
	["唤风者塔鲁·黑蹄"] = { "May the winds guide you, $N." },
	["唤风者梅恩·长角"] = { "Greetings, $c. Welcome to Cenarion Hold. From here we will strike against the silithid where they're at their strongest. I hope you've come to lend a hand.", "It's a pleasure to see you again, $N. Your aid has provided us with a considerable boost in the security of our supply lines. I hope you understand the importance of the logistics involved in large battle efforts such as this." },
	["唤风者耶萨德拉"] = { "Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor. You need more than just soldiers to fight a war, $N. Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need." },
	["商人哈斯辛"] = { "All things for sale, my friend! Large and small, whatever you need, Hazzin will provide. If you value your life, do not approach Manaforge Ultris without a resupply. Hazzin is the last chance that you have." },
	["商人扎雷姆"] = { "Many are the rare and precious objects that my clientele seek. You could be the one to bring them to me, $c. In return I offer that which you covet. Shall we speak more on that which I look to procure today?" },
	["商人杜纳尔"] = { "There is something that you wish to buy? There is something that you wish to sell? This is why we are here, my friend. Please, tell me your pleasure." },
	["商人林沃斯"] = { "Hail, adventurer. I am Rin'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland. Perhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter. If you have any of my tribe's Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more." },
	["商人波塔努斯"] = { "Blessings of the naaru upon you, my friend." },
	["嘉伦·誓日"] = { "Are you ready for your first challenge, $c?", "That was an impressive display. But are you ready for your next challege?", "You've impressed everyone here today with your skills in the arena. It is now time to be recognized before all as a champion of the tournament." },
	["嘉莱恩·艾罗"] = { "Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see." },
	["噜呱吧呱"] = { "Blurg awrurgle mrr?", "My brothers and sisters have gone insane! Do you think you could help me get out of here?" },
	["嚎风峡湾护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["嚎风峡湾护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["因娜丽雅"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["因波莉安"] = { "The element of air here is restless. Beware... they will not let you pass unharmed." },
	["国王姆嘎姆嘎"] = { "I recently came here to observe the Winterfin murlocs. Disguised as one of them, I kept my distance and took notes on their day-to-day life. However, not long after I arrived, that all changed. An earthquake in Coldarra caused a landslide, which exposed the nearby caverns. Out came a strange makrura who stole away with the Winterfins' tadpoles. When the murlocs went into the caverns to rescue their young, they re-emerged, glowing and under the makrura's influence. Now the unaffected have retreated to here, and I have reluctantly assumed their leadership." },
	["图书馆员塞尔拉"] = { "Our food and drink are in short supply. I'm afraid I do not have anything to offer you.", "Thank you for your help, $n. These frostberries are literally the fruits of your labor." },
	["图书馆员提艾蕾"] = { "How can I help you, child?" },
	["图书馆员盖伦"] = { "What can I do for you, $r?" },
	["图伦"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Yes, I am one of the 'Broken'. I trust that this does not bother you? Broken or draenei, we must endure the ridicule that some in our society may throw at us. A better understanding and communication with the elements of this world is all that matters." },
	["图兰"] = { "Don't... worry... about me..." },
	["图加·符文图腾"] = { "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c. It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that. Everything else is a waste." },
	["图基"] = { "This forest be a spooky place. It's full of more bad juju than just the Alliance, so you watch out for yourself." },
	["图尔·怒爪"] = { "When I learned about my relatives here in the north, I came to learn more. What I found was warring tribes acting against our very nature. I have no hope left, $r. Even great Ursoc has been tainted by this cursed place. I've lost all hope.", "Yes... I sense Vordrassil's magic... free of any perceivable taint. Please! You must allow me to help you. Fate brought me here, perhaps I can serve a purpose yet!" },
	["图尔洛"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin.", "Our Alliance allies are assisting the Leage of Arathor in their defense of Arathi Basin. They could use your aid against the undead Defilers, $c." },
	["图拉丝"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, brother, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, sister, but I cannot train you." },
	["图拉克·符文图腾"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c. This is where true harmony lies.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you. It never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance. As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong. Training helps us in this regard.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you. It never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance. As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong. Training helps us in this regard.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you. It never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance. As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong. Training helps us in this regard." },
	["图拉希恩"] = { "Sometimes the straightforward approach to a problem is the best." },
	["圈养的银色角鹰兽"] = { "<The Hippogryph looks anxious and ready to go!>" },
	["圣光护卫者阿德因"] = { "The Lightwarden's job is twofold. Protect the priesthood at all costs first and foremost. Destroy the enemies of the Light wherever they may hide second." },
	["圣职者塞瑞恩"] = { "<Thayreen's stare is blank. Cleansing Vordrassil's corruption has taken its toll on the druid.>", "The wind and trees whisper of unseen troubles. The land appears healthy, but there's more going on here than meets the eye." },
	["地狱火半岛护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["地狱火半岛护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["地精平民"] = { "Hey, if people want to run around rooting in the dirt for colored eggs, who am I to judge? I still get a cut of the profits on paint, and I invested in chickens this year." },
	["地精机械师"] = { "Hello, $r. How can I help you today?", "Sorry, friend. Only certified officers of the Horde can authorize the purchase of a vehicle." },
	["地精车队员工"] = { "I heard they were going to try to blow up the gnome's car in the next race! True or not, I'd stand clear of their pit area.", "If I were you, I'd buy a goblin race voucher. Rooting for the other team is a waste of time.", "If it weren't for that cursed, gnomish luck, they'd never win a race!", "If you ask me, I think the goblins are a shoe in. We have the tools, and we have the talent!", "My money's on the goblins! And if you have any sense then yours is too!" },
	["地质学家拉克斯班"] = { "Can ye hear it, stranger? The humming is gettin' louder with each passing day. These crystals must be what's driving these bugs crazy.", "No luck with the Twilight's Hammer deserter? Check the mountains to the southeast thoroughly. There are numerous rumors of a mysterious hermit living there." },
	["地面指挥官库普"] = { "We don't have any easy path before us. If you've got a strong arm on you, stick around until one of my squads is ready to ascend to Ymirheim. They could use all the help they can get." },
	["坎兰"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["坎多斯特拉兹"] = { "A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut. Each of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall. And fall it did... and so we came." },
	["坎妮卡·古德维尔"] = { "Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good! I sell the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches.", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["坎德中尉"] = { "Are you here to relieve me? I'm certain it's almost time. Well, if you want to relieve me anyway, let me know. I could use a drink or three." },
	["坎雷中士"] = { "You think I'm being cruel to this worm? They've killed two of my men this month! We're too kind to this Wretched scum." },
	["坚不可摧的科查尔"] = { "Hello, $r. You are welcome to share this canyon with us as refuge from the dragons. Beware the goblin runt though... his kind cannot be trusted." },
	["坚定的奥斯鲁克"] = { "It will take a sharp blade and reinforced armor to bring tranquility back to Nagrand. Shall I repair your equipment so that you may mete justice?" },
	["坦帕"] = { "Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice." },
	["坦德莉恩"] = { "Welcome to the Registrar of Guilds. How can I be of service to you?" },
	["坦扎尔"] = { "Listen, mon! I tell ya all I be knowin', but first ya gotta be savin' me from these savages and their killer bears. Deal?" },
	["坦普"] = { "And why would I speak with you, $r?", "Look around you, shaman. Can you see the balance of the elements in the earth, the air, the water and the fire that has touched them all?" },
	["埃亚·冷风"] = { "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here." },
	["埃亚伦"] = { "Come and I will show you how to ride the finest beasts you have ever seen. You... do have enough gold to cover the cost, I trust?", "I'm not about to train you until you're exalted in the eyes of the draenei." },
	["埃伯洛克"] = { "This party is pointless. Those foolish nobles will never get to see Medivh. Can't they see this? I should have just stayed in Darkshire with my family instead of wasting my time here." },
	["埃克斯勒"] = { "Come in out of the ash and muck. Dry yourself a spell." },
	["埃博尔"] = { "Oh no, not you again! Go away!", "Very busy... very busy! What?" },
	["埃因·格林"] = { "Welcome to the Cantrips and Crows Tavern, $r. Watch your back while you're here, hmmm? Narisa doesn't like scrubbing blood off the floor." },
	["埃多林·鲁尔"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["埃尔琴·锁簧"] = { "Hurry! You should talk to Mekkatorque! If we don't start the assault soon, we're going to be late. And my boss HATES it when we're late!", "It's my job to ensure that this whole assault runs like clockwork. High Tinker Mekkatorque is out in the field now, but he's scheduled to come back to get some more troops any time now. He's never late, so just stick around and he'll be here." },
	["埃尔辛"] = { "I can instruct you in alchemy. Interested?" },
	["埃文"] = { "What I wouldn't give for a healing crystal right about now!" },
	["埃米恩"] = { "What do you wish to know of Jewelcrafting?" },
	["埃米林中士"] = { "Welcome to Theramore, $c." },
	["埃索达冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["埃索达勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["埃索达卫士"] = { "Blessings of the Naaru. What can I help you find?", "By the Light! It is a blessing to have one who cares about the well-being of others. At a time like this we need all the help we can get. Nus can train you in the ways of first aid. She is near the crystal cave in the Crystal Hall. Light be with you.", "Druid? Ah... Shalannius, you seek Shalannius. You shall find this night elf outside of the Exodar, near Valaar's Berth.", "Farii trains those interested in jewel crafting. You can find her in the Crystal Hall near the cavern there.", "Long ago, we wore one piece jumpsuits. Thanks to our innovative tailors, we no longer wear such impractical outfits. You can find these fashion lifesavers in the Trader's Tier.", "Looking to be a great warrior? War does not make one great. Still, you will find our great warrior trainers on the Warriors' Terrace, overlooking the rest of the Trader's Tier.", "Miall is our chief blacksmith on the Exodar. She can be found on the lower level of the Trader's Tier. Go with the Light.", "Mumman has set up her humble shop near the main entrance of the city, just past the inn. A fine cook, that one.", "Our Caregiver Center is located above the central Vault of Light, near the Exodar's main entrance.", "Our enchanters are located in the Crystal Hall opposite the jewel crafters. Light be with you.", "Our priest trainers can be found within the Order of Light's chamber, at the entrance to the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you.", "So, you are willing to help repair the mighty Exodar? I heard it will take years before the Exodar is fully functional once more. You have two hours. Just kidding. Our engineers are located on the lower levels of the Trader's Tier. Go with the Light.", "Stephanos is our Hippogryph master. He resides just outside of the Exodar, near the main entrance. May the Light bless you on your travels.", "The Exodar's paladin trainers are found in the luminous Chapel of Light in the Seat of the Naaru.", "There are two mailboxes in the Seat of the Naaru: one by the bank, and another outside the auction house.", "Thoth can teach you Inscription in The Crystal Hall.", "Though the acquisition of wealth is no longer a driving force in our lives, we understand that money makes the world go 'round. You will find our auction house in the Seat of the Naaru.", "What trainer do you seek?", "Which profession trainer are you looking for?", "You can find Arthaid, our stable master, outside of the Caregiver Center. He is located on the upper level of the central hub, near the Exodar's main entrance.", "You can find Erett the fishing trainer in the Crystal Hall near the Light Blessed Waters.", "You seek the hunters? You will find them on the second level of the Trader's Tier, in the Hall of the Hunt.", "You will find Funaam, the guild master, near the Trader's Tier entrance.", "You will find a number of shaman trainers in the Crystal Hall. Perhaps you should visit Farseer Nobundo there, and show the Broken some pity. Light be with you.", "You will find him in the Caregiver Center in the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you.", "You will find our alchemist trainers in the Vault of Lights. Go with the Light.", "You will find our bank in the Exodar's central hub. Go with the Light.", "You will find our battlemasters in the Vault of the Lights. There is also one \"Miglik Blotstrom\" staying with Caregiver Breel, who claims to represent an arena fighting circuit on this world.", "You will find our herbalist, Cemmorhan, against the back wall of the Vault of Lights.", "You will find our mages in the Vault of Lights. Go with the Light.", "You will find our mining trainers towards the back of the Trader's Tier.", "You will find the Exodar's leatherworkers in the Trader's Tier. May the Light bless you.", "You will find the Exodar's skinning trainers in the Trader's Tier with the leatherworkers. May the Light bless you.", "You wish to improve your weapon skills? Our weapon master is located on the highest level of the Trader's Tier, on the Warriors' Terrace." },
	["埃维罗·隆古巴"] = { "What be happening? You here to eat, mon? Or maybe to learn cooking from the best, eh?" },
	["埃莉萨·杜马斯"] = { "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic." },
	["埃莉萨拉·射日者"] = { "Greetings, my $g lord : lady;. I trust that you are having a pleasant time?", "Greetings, my lady. I trust that you are having a pleasant time?", "Greetings, my lord. I trust that you are having a pleasant time?" },
	["埃莫伦·叶影"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["埃菲库格·铁桶"] = { "<This pirate has obviously had too much to drink. He appears to be out cold for the time being.>", "Brewfest is all about enjoying the very best food and drink in the lands, and that's no exaggeration! Just take a gander at the many invigorating hand-crafted beers and holiday sausages, pretzels, and cheeses available. You'll find nothing better, and for so little coin!", "Brewfest is the perfect holiday! But it's got one catch, Dark Iron dwarf attacks. They happen nearly every half-hour! The attackers target the kegs that dispense the FREE brew! And it's really good brew that the brewmasters are giving out! Look, if you're around when the Dark Iron dwarves show up, lend a hand and protect the FREE brew.", "Next to the beer and sausage, the most popular part of Brewfest is the souvenirs! From traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew, all sorts of Brewfest-themed items are available from Belbi Quikswitch. Just be sure to have plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand, as it's the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds.", "Ram racing is one of the great traditions of Brewfest. Speak to Pol Amberstill down by the ram stable if you want to learn more. It's a right hoot AND can be a great way to earn Brewfest Prize Tokens!", "Welcome, friend, to the Brewfest Grounds! There's much to enjoy here while we celebrate the spirit of friendly competition between rival breweries. If you have any questions, let me know!", "With enough tokens you can join the \"Brew of the Month\" club. Being in the Brew of the Month club is like having Brewfest all year round! Every month you will receive mail with a new brew to try out. If you like that brew, you can go to the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge and buy more from the vendors there." },
	["埃蕾希·晨歌"] = { "Glory will be ours when we win this tournament in the name of Silvermoon." },
	["埃西恩"] = { "Nature favors those willing to learn its secrets, $N." },
	["埃里·雷击"] = { "She's a beaut', isn't she? Sky'ree... the faithful gryphon of our commander. Kurdran himself, he holds his audiences in th' stronghold. I care fer our Sky'ree here when he's busy. Gorgeous creature, she is; as strong and fierce as they come. She'd die fer Kurdran, she would. A more loyal soul ye've ne'er seen.'Tis an honor to care fer her, it is." },
	["埃隆努斯·冷钢"] = { "Greetings, $r." },
	["埃隆巴克"] = { "Thank you, mortal. There is but one service that I may offer to you before I return to the Dream. The door to Zevrim's master, Alzzin, blocks your path. I shall act as your instrument of destruction. The door will be opened, I merely await your command." },
	["埃隆雷下士"] = { "Expedition Point is a tough place to be stationed, but it's critical to the defense of Honor Hold. The information gathered here, and the engagements our soldiers make against the Legion and the orcs of Zeth'Gor, are invaluable to the Alliance's Hellfire campaign." },
	["埃雷图斯"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["基亚隆·夜刃"] = { "If I heard correctly, you're already doing good work for Sylvanaar. Keep it up and maybe we'll be able to keep our home here.", "If you haven't already, make sure that you offer your assistance to Rina Moonspring." },
	["基伦·希斯"] = { "Welcome to Keelen's Trustworthy Tailoring. I think you'll find my shop will suit your needs. If you wish to train with me, you need only ask; I'll be more than happy to teach you." },
	["基利姆·石趾"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["基利安·坦纳尔"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["基塔·费温德"] = { "What brings you to the Tower?" },
	["基尔·斯巴索克"] = { "Hello, hello!" },
	["基尔兰妮"] = { "Dragonhawks, if raised properly, are really quite tame. Don't you think that is fascinating? To be so friendly and companionable if raised right and so vicious and deadly in the wild...I just love them so much." },
	["基尔兹宾·鼓眼"] = { "These are dangerous times, $r. An ancient evil is rising, and it cares not if you're Horde or Alliance." },
	["基尔哈拉"] = { "Hey mon, what can I be doin' for you?" },
	["基尔尼"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You come in search of training, hunter?" },
	["基尔拉克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You come in search of training, hunter?" },
	["基尔拉姆"] = { "I am Kilram, master of the axe." },
	["基尔格·锐角"] = { "A foul wind blows from the East, $c." },
	["基尔莉芙"] = { "Champion $N, it is good to see you again. Have you returned to Valhalas to assist a friend with their challenges?", "Many have fallen within Valhalas and their corpses are a testament to the strength of our ways. Will your bones litter this place of honor and battle as well, $N?", "You have not yet proven yourself worthy enough to issue a challenge within Valhalas, $N. Return when you have earned a name for yourself." },
	["基尔达"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Wolf Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the orcs of Orgrimmar before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["基沙"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What kin I do for ya, mon?" },
	["基维·Q·匹德菲特"] = { "Did you know about our \"Charitable Charms\" program? Official Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits. You can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens! One popular activity is making bracelets for your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..." },
	["基苏"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["基诺·杜弗莱"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills." },
	["堕落的瓦拉斯塔兹"] = { "I perform one final service. I pray it is sufficient...", "I... I have failed, $N. The Lord of Bla... The Lord of Blackrock is too powerful. He consumed my energy with... with ease. I turn... I... kill me... you must... you must kill me.", "It's simple really. Allow me to summarize..." },
	["塑石者布德克拉格"] = { "You are welcome here, as a friend and ally of the earthen." },
	["塔兰丹"] = { "It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?" },
	["塔兰拉"] = { "Take your time, look the weapons over. I also repair weapons and armor if you need such services." },
	["塔利·萨普纳波"] = { "Hello, $n! How goes your adventures? My experiments are progressing nicely... Be sure to check back with me later! I might have more test flight opportunities for you!", "Toshley's Station is the best! The solitude and supply of strange, Outland power sources is an ideal setting for extreme experiments!" },
	["塔加里"] = { "The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor. A visitor who doesn't want my scimitar buried in them, that is." },
	["塔卡里的巫毒酒学徒"] = { "Hey mon, you ready to try da best brew in all da realms?" },
	["塔卢恩大使"] = { "I am honored to make your acquaintance." },
	["塔娜莉亚"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?", "It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["塔尔"] = { "When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned." },
	["塔尔伦"] = { "Welcome, $g sir : my lady;. This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have. It's good to have company. They've been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde.", "Welcome, my lady. This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have. It's good to have company. They've been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde.", "Welcome, sir. This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have. It's good to have company. They've been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde." },
	["塔尔达·风歌船长"] = { "On behalf of the crew of the Moonspray, I welcome you $c. I hope you take advantage of our provisions before parting with us." },
	["塔尼莎"] = { "Another Herbalist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.", "I hope that your interruption is for a good cause, I was in the middle of some important work." },
	["塔恩"] = { "My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back." },
	["塔拉戈"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["塔拉狱卒"] = { "The interrogator is trying to find out what these blood elves are doing here in Nagrand. From what I hear, they're after crystal powder residue from Oshu'gun, the diamond mountain to the west. No doubt to use in some insidious scheme or concoction... If you are looking to help our cause and stop these blood elves, the conflict is happening right now to the northwest at Halaa. Blood elves and those Hand of Argus soldiers are battling! Join in and show them what's right!" },
	["塔波尔·斯威雷格"] = { "Brewfest is all about the beer and the eats, and it don't get any better than what we're serving up. Think I'm lying? Just check out all the tasty brews, sausages, pretzels, and cheeses we got. You'll see: Best chow around, and it don't get any cheaper!", "Everyone loves those crazy Brewfest racing rams. Want to know more? Talk to Driz Tumblequick down by the ram stable. Have a blast and earn some Brewfest Prize Tokens while you're at it!", "Hey hey, don't forget to grab yourself some Brewfest souvenirs! We got everything from traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew. Just talk to Blix Fixwidget, but make sure you got plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand... it's the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds.", "Hey there, welcome to Brewfest! There's a mess of ways to keep yourself entertained in there, so you got any questions, you let me know. Otherwise, go buy some beer and a pretzel!", "Something's got those Dark Iron Dwarves riled up. They show up almost every half-hour, break all the kegs, and leave! So you're probably asking, \"Why should I care?\" I'll tell you... Because the kegs they break stop us from giving out free brew! You heard me right, free brew! So if you are around when those dwarves show up, take a minute and help protect the kegs.", "Twice a day, at six fifteen in the morning and six fifteen in the evening, Shadow Hunter Vol'jin himself comes out to the Brewfest grounds for the Tapping of the Keg ceremony. You'd be a fool to miss it!", "With enough tokens you can join the \"Brew of the Month\" club. Being in the Brew of the Month club is like having Brewfest all year round! Every month you will receive mail with a new brew to try out. If you like that brew, you can go to the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits and buy more from the vendors there." },
	["塔特纳克·钢炉"] = { "The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens. He feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur." },
	["塔瓦斯德·基瑟尔"] = { "Um, hello! If you are here about fee collection and/or a summons, then you must have me mistaken for someone else. Terribly sorry!" },
	["塔纳"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals." },
	["塔纳利斯护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["塔纳利斯护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["塔绍尔·锯痕"] = { "Are you here for training? Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind, $c. Find your own trainer before you anger me.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["塔罗·刺蹄"] = { "Listen to the stories of an elder. $N. I have many to speak of..." },
	["塔罗兹"] = { "With enough money, I could take over the world..." },
	["塔胡·慧风"] = { "Surely you've been a student once in your life, $c. You learned from an instructor, and you gained respect for them in some way, yes? Maybe not as a person, but at the least, as one who knew more than you and was willing to teach you. If not, use your imagination... What would you do if you came to realize your instructor may not know as much as you thought, and that you may have found a better path?" },
	["塔苏"] = { "Filthy fungal giants! What did we ever do to them?" },
	["塔莱尼娅"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can sense your desire for power, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["塔蒂亚娜"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["塔蕾莎"] = { "Yes, friends. This man was no wizard of Dalaran. His clothes looked quite foreign, and his accent was unfamiliar. All he could mumble about was time this, time that. You'll have to find that wizard and convince him to release me." },
	["塔西娅·幽谷"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["塔贝萨"] = { "Your errand must mean much, $c, to draw you so deep into the marsh..." },
	["塔迦祖母"] = { "Speak slowly, child, I am new to your strange tongue." },
	["塔里奥斯塔兹"] = { "Welcome to Wyrmrest Temple, traveler. Here the dragonflights confer in peace with one another amidst the bones of their honored ancestors. At least, we were peaceful until the Blue Dragonflight launched a surprise attack upon the temple itself. Enter with our blessing, but know that we will brook no aggression within our walls." },
	["塔雷·浆泡"] = { "Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him." },
	["塔雷里斯·晨光"] = { "I haven't time for idle chatter, $c. I must see to the pilgrims and ensure they are prepared for the long journey ahead." },
	["塔鲁克"] = { "I run the fights around here. You want to place a bet, gamble with confidence - anyone caught fixin' fights gets to walk the plank. I'll make sure of that myself!" },
	["塞丽斯塔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["塞伊丹纳"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you." },
	["塞兰妮亚"] = { "Just in... another batch of Darkmoon Special Reserve. Come get yours before they're all gone!", "Tasty drinks for sale! Quench your thirst on some of the Darkmoon Faire's finest brews!", "Tips are always graciously accepted, friend." },
	["塞勒斯·萨雷芬图斯"] = { "<Cyrus's eyes glow brightly> Do I devour you whole or do I allow you to live? Perhaps you could still be of some use... Challenge my minion, $r. Survive and return proof of your victory to me.", "Only a fool would dare disturb me in my lair." },
	["塞吉"] = { "Ahoy, mon! What be happenin', ye salty 'at steppa! Dis place be all chacka-chacka, ye scallywag!", "Issa truut, matey! Neh tougher salts anyweh but da northsea freebootahs yahso, mon! Best not brindle s'mady, mon. Scuppah dat! 'Alf eediat swabs get feh kiss da gunnah's dawta, mate!", "Ku ovah yonder, matey! Dat scurvy bobo be all up inne quashie's face. Dat hard-eared swab gonnna get salt, mon... gonna get keelhauled and gonna be made into a duppy, mon.", "Lookin' mighty cris, me bucko! Ye pillage a fat sutler? Best ye spread da wealth... don't be a craven choke puppy, mon!", "Now ye just be fass and facety, mon! Ye fixin' fe vex me, ye maga dog blaggard? G'waan den, ye lily-livered scallywag. Be seen ya first light!" },
	["塞多蒙·克莱尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["塞娜尼·雷心"] = { "The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves. Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb. To bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $N. I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!", "This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge. While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with. His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains.", "This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent. Shadumbra's hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there. Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated." },
	["塞安·红鬃"] = { "I bid you welcome, $c." },
	["塞尔曼·岩拳"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.", "I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley $N. We can use all o' the help that we can get." },
	["塞尤克"] = { "Archibald is the master of the crossbow. He's the weapon master of the Undercity, located in the War Quarter.", "Hanashi here knows staves. If you want a sturdier instructor, go to Thunder Bluff. Ansekhwa will teach you on the lower central rise there.", "Here to learn how to wield a new weapon, or just to waste my time?", "Ileda of the blood elves, found within Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, trains her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, Undercity's weapon master, can also train you; he is in the War Quarter.", "Maces are taught by Ansekhwa, found on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Our gunnery instructor is Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Tell me what weapon you want to learn or go away.", "The Forsaken weapon master Archibald knows his way around the polearm. He trains others in the War Quarter of the Undercity. Ileda, the blood elf weapon master within Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, can show you the proper techniques also." },
	["塞尤娜"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible." },
	["塞巴斯蒂安"] = { "Greetings! Behold one of the finest musical instruments in all of Lordaeron. It's a true honor to perform for the Master and all his guests. Take a seat in the audience, I hear a show is starting soon." },
	["塞巴斯蒂安·伯尔"] = { "I know, I know... \"fishing in a sewer?\" But you'd be surprised by what you can catch down here. I've even heard stories of sharks, if you can believe it." },
	["塞希娅·黎明玫瑰"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world... but no one will listen.", "Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["塞希罗"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["塞恩德拉·细语者"] = { "The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil.", "Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely." },
	["塞拉多斯"] = { "Good day to you." },
	["塞拉娜上尉"] = { "I don't know, but I'm glad they did. The respite has allowed Anchorite Elbadon to save many of the men and women under my command. I've sent a few of my stealthiest scouts forward, and they've reported back something interesting. Nearly all of the Sunblade Protectors are powered down! Kil'jaeden's forces appear to be conserving their energy, and seem content to merely contain us with one active Protector. If you and your companions want to force your way inside, allow me to suggest a plan of attack.", "I'm glad you are here, $c. The military situation in the Sunwell Plateau is rather grim.", "Kil'jaeden's defenders here on the Sunwell Plateau are much stronger than anything we faced outside on the Island. The Legion have even twisted our Arcane Guardian technology with fel energy to create something much more sinister. Just one of those Sunblade Protectors decimated my troops, and I ordered a swift retreat. I expected my squad to be pushed completely off the plateau, but the enemy surprised me by calling off the pursuit.", "Take advantage of their deactivated Sunblade Protectors. If one of their Sunblade Scouts spot you, I'm sure the elf will try to reactivate a nearby Sunblade Protector. Kill him quickly to prevent this. With the blood elves eliminated, as long as you do not trigger the Protector's proximity sensors you should be able to move past them without a fight. That will save you both time and resources.", "The Shattered Sun Offensive has made great progress in the outer areas of the Isle of Quel'Danas. Kil'jaeden's forces are being pushed back, and in the chaos I was able to lead a small scouting force here inside the Sunwell Plateau. My troops proceeded through Parhelion Plaza, spotted a group of Sunblade blood elves, and we then engaged the enemy. That fight quickly turned into a disaster." },
	["塞拉摩卫兵"] = { "Elder Bronzebeard can be found in the ancestral home of the Bronzebeards, Ironforge.", "Welcome to Theramore, $c." },
	["塞拉菲娜·血心"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["塞斯塔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["塞格"] = { "I have long known you'd seek me out, $N. Every sentient being in this world is driven by the choices they make. Choices begat further choices, and these in turn make someone who they are. This is where your fortune is drawn from - who you are, and the choices you make. Are you ready to discover where your fortune lies?", "Very well then... You have been tasked by your liege to guard his fields of corn from poachers and thieves. One night on patrol, you stumble across a haggard man in thread-bare clothing stealing corn from the field. You quickly confront him, and he immediately begs for his life. He claims he is stealing the corn to feed his family since the lord of the land - your liege - demands too much in taxes. Your liege is indeed known for his harsh taxes throughout the land. Make your choice.", "Your fortune is cast, $c. For the next few hours, you will find your spirit in tune with your true nature. Be careful, as your fortune - and your fate - are never as clear as you might think them to be. If you would like a small glimpse of something to ponder in your future, by all means let me know. I'd be happy to give you a written fortune, provided you have room in your inventory. It is one drawn from the insight you have shown in answering my questions.", "Your next choice awaits. You alone have defeated a terrible beast that has been ravaging the countryside, taking its ear as a trophy. You later learn that your liege had offered a reward for the beast's death, and that a kind but destitute knight who you know is trying to support a family by meager means claims the beast's kill as his own. You have no real need for money yourself, but you know that the destitute knight is lying for his own personal gain. Make your choice.", "Your next choice awaits. You are on a diplomatic mission for your liege to a cruel country that is currently at war with yours. The war has been costly on both sides. Your mission is to secure a peace that is honorable to both peoples. At a diplomatic dinner, you overhear the ruler of the opposing land viciously insult your benevolent liege. You are fairly certain the ruler meant to say it out of your earshot, but nonetheless he has besmirched your liege's honor. Make your choice.", "Your next choice awaits. You are the sworn executioner for your liege. A man has been sent to you for execution as a traitor of the liege and your people. You know this individual as a close, virtuous friend who mysteriously vanished one day. You also know that the man's crimes for which he was convicted supposedly caused the deaths of many innocent civilians. Upon seeing you he begs for his life, claiming he was framed by a higher authority. Make your choice.", "Your next choice awaits. Your brother seeks to join the ranks of the prestigious military order you are already a part of. While you are sure of his commitment and loyalty, his talent and ability to perform the arduous tasks of the order is what you question. While you are not certain he will be able to rise to the challenge of the order - putting you and others in danger - you are certain that your word alone would allow him in or keep him out. Make your choice." },
	["塞欧杜斯·霜须"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "I hope the Light is with you, $N. Is there anything I can do for you today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["塞洛莉娅·影衣"] = { "The opening of the Dark Portal brought news of my people's fate. In a way, my exile shielded me from sharing in their downfall, but to see the Farstriders throw their lot in with Kael'thas... I never imagined my one-time brethren capable of such a thing. The homecoming I once dreamt of will never happen. This forest is the only home I have left." },
	["塞瑞德兰"] = { "Made by the finest craftsmen in all of Teldrassil, carried by hand from Kalimdor to Azeroth as a sign of the growing alliance between the people of the Great Tree and the humans of this land. If there is anything you require, you have but to ask." },
	["塞瑟"] = { "I've been watching the Aldor working on the walls. They're gonna rebuild the whole city, you know. They work much faster than old Foreman Oslow did back home in Lakeshire. He kept losing his tools in the lake, or the gnolls would take his supplies. I should ask the Aldor to send him some help. They'd have that bridge fixed faster'n anything." },
	["塞米德"] = { "By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?" },
	["塞纳里奥使者安亚·碧月"] = { "Are you here to help the cause? Mount Hyjal burns!" },
	["塞纳里奥使者托尔·黑蹄"] = { "Are you here to help the cause? Mount Hyjal burns!" },
	["塞纳里奥斥候兰蒂奥"] = { "It takes a bit of practice to be this close to the silithid and go unnoticed. I don't recommend trying it if you can avoid it." },
	["塞纳里奥斥候加莉亚"] = { "Soon we shall rid Azeroth of the silithids' abominable presence. Their potential for destruction is much greater than what you've seen firsthand, $N. Greater, darker powers are behind their activities." },
	["塞纳里奥斥候艾泽奈尔"] = { "Don't get me wrong, I'd rather not be in a tunnel filled with silithid day in and day out, but if hiding here and watching these creatures' movements is going to help us win the war then I'll do it for as long as it takes." },
	["塞罗努斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears.", "I can sense your desire for power, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["塞莉亚·冰鬃"] = { "Here for a ride, $r? Or, is something else bothering you?" },
	["塞莉德·酒痕"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["塞莫尔"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["塞莱恩"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!" },
	["塞菲尔"] = { "This world has been damaged in ways beyond what our eyes can see. Even the passage of time feels different somehow." },
	["塞菲里恩"] = { "I'm looking for someone to help me with a task that is long overdue. You look capable." },
	["塞萨克"] = { "There are mysteries in this place that we, the orcs, are desperate to uncover. Mysteries of our past, mysteries of our future, and mysteries that offer glimpses inside us. It is my hope to pierce these mysteries... will you walk that path with me?" },
	["墨尔杜·旋轮"] = { "What? Can't you see that I'm busy here? You think this transmatter is going to fix itself?!" },
	["复仇者伊芬"] = { "Our way is sacred. We will choose death before we abandon Thorim and join the likes of the Lich King." },
	["复仇者梅兹"] = { "I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, $r. State your business or get out of my sight!" },
	["复活节商人"] = { "Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?" },
	["复活节小贩"] = { "Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?" },
	["夏恩"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["夏拉托尔"] = { "Do you have a story for me?", "I am Xarantaur, the Witness.", "I wandered for the rest of my natural life in search of knowledge, seeing more wonder and meeting more strange and mysterious races than any of my people before me. I travelled across the length and breadth of ancient Kalimdor until there was no more to see, no new lands across the horizon. Yet... there was still so much I did not know as I felt my final journey approaching and I wept for the things I would never know. As I fell, my life at an end, that is when they found me.", "I was one of the first tauren druids, of the last generation taught by Shan'do Cenarius, before the Legion, before the Sundering, when the world was still young. Before everything changed. While my brethren hunted great beasts, I hunted stories. I had been drawn to the druidic arts by this hunger, this lust for knowledge. For a time, that hunger was sated as I learned to talk to the trees, rocks, and beasts, and heard their stories. But then, the time came when Cenarius walked among us no more and my brethren began to forget what he had taught us. I could not forget, though, and I still needed to learn more about our world. So I said my farewells and travelled beyond the lands of my people.", "The bronze dragonflight. They snatched me from the brink of death and took me before their master, Nozdormu. He said they had been watching me and wanted me to continue my hunt. He granted me immortality as a watcher, tasked to bear witness to the history of Azeroth as one of his agents. I am Xarantaur the Witness, and it is my duty to preserve the true history of Azeroth lest it be forgotten.", "Would you like to hear a story?" },
	["夏格"] = { "Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?" },
	["多利安"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c. How may I assist you?" },
	["多弗斯·阿尔法麦"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["多拉斯"] = { "You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider." },
	["多普雷尔"] = { "Our punishment is also our blessing." },
	["多洛索斯"] = { "What enchantments interest you today, $c?" },
	["多诺瓦·雪山"] = { "Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets..." },
	["多里安·达克斯托克"] = { "Have you ever seen drakes like the ones around here? Makes for perfect hunting." },
	["夜光长者"] = { "Elder Bladeswift wanders the paths of Darnassus atop Teldrassil.", "Elder Nightwind passes the days at the shrine in Jaedenar in Felwood.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.", "The village of Astranaar in Ashenvale is Elder Riversong's current home.", "The village of Dolanaar atop Teldrassil is home to Elder Bladeleaf." },
	["夜行者奥斯伯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?" },
	["夜风长者"] = { "Elder Brightspear can be found wandering amongst the ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring.", "Elder Skygleam can be found near the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara.", "Elder Starweave can be found at the coastal village of Auberdine in Darkshore.", "Last I knew, Elder Stonespire was at Everlook in Winterspring.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.", "The village of Astranaar in Ashenvale is Elder Riversong's current home." },
	["大主教梅内莱厄斯"] = { "Gaze upon the Exodar, young $r. It is hard to imagine that we survived such a catastrophe. <Menelaous sighs.> The Prophet states that it is here that our fate will finally be known. Ten lifetimes spent fleeing from the madness of the Burning Legion... here we finally make a stand. No more running... I am ready to die.", "Thank you for the warning, $N. We will prepare our defenses.", "The infected nightstalker runts seem to be coming from the north. If I were you, that's where I would start my hunt." },
	["大主教欧纳拉"] = { "When I was young I trained hard to become an anchorite in the priesthood. Female exarchs were practically unheard of. Nowadays gender matters little - it is courage and conviction that make all the difference." },
	["大主教欧雷里斯"] = { "It is good to see a friend of the Aldor around these remote parts. I fear I cannot stand for much more of these elves' insolent chatter." },
	["大副哈帕纳"] = { "Hapana simply grunts and waves you away towards the Dread Captain DeMeza. Beneath the fur of one massive arm can be seen a tattoo of the word \"MAGATHA\" in an arrow-pierced heart." },
	["大副玛斯克"] = { "Welcome aboard the Maiden's Fancy. It should be smooth sailing all the way to port." },
	["大副科瓦斯基"] = { "I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good $gsir:madame;. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you.", "I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good madame. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you.", "I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good sir. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you." },
	["大副维瓦·水歌"] = { "The Bravery's crew will do its best to make your journey as swift and pleasant as possible." },
	["大卫·提亚斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it." },
	["大厨师莫迪尔"] = { "How can I work under these conditions?! And all of these disgusting Forsaken around here! I weep for Tranquillien and Quel'Thalas!" },
	["大地之环召焰者"] = { "The stone radiates a bitter cold, chilling the air around it and the platform on which it sits. Deep within its facets, a blue light pulses, waiting." },
	["大地之环长者"] = { "The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r." },
	["大地治愈者托洛克"] = { "It is here that Gul'dan severed the tie between orcs and the elemental spirits. His unquenchable thirst for power could not be satiated with the complete annihilation of the draenei. He had to also destroy Draenor, razing the land and siphoning all of its energies for use in his war. Now all that is left are remnants of his madness. Look to the altar, $r - the land is forever haunted..." },
	["大地看守者格莱弗"] = { "I'm keeping an eye on the forsaken idiots down there. You can never be too cautious around them!", "If you ask me, and you DID, I think we should kill all of the apothecaries before it's too late!", "If you have dealings with the doctor over there, be cautious. Whatever they're up to, it's unnatural.", "Mark my words, these forsaken fools will be the death of us all!", "The Horde is about honor and war. I am certain that there is nothing honorable about what these apothecaries are doing." },
	["大工匠梅卡托克"] = { "Welcome to Tinker Town!" },
	["大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾"] = { "The earth keeps many secrets, $c; it is our duty to ensure that those that must remain a secret for the good of all stays as such." },
	["大德鲁伊拉索留斯"] = { "Is your cause righteous and your heart true? If so, you are welcome here - among the druids for the ethical and humane treatment of animals. So long as you do not veer down the dark path of depravity and harm the animals that have allowed us to coexist within their world, D.E.H.T.A. will consider you an ally.", "While Nesingwary's advances upon the wildlife of Northrend has been halted, it is only a matter of time before he attempts another incursion. You must remain vigilant, $N! Above all else, do not give in to whatever temptations may be set before you... The demon will attempt to charm you. When it happens, you must resist!" },
	["大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔"] = { "If you are here to waste my time, then you are wasting the time of the Cenarion Circle as a whole. For your sake, let us hope that you are not foolish enough to be doing just that.", "Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism! You will be required to nurture and cultivate special seeds -- not to swing an axe blindly or gesticulate wildly at passing shadows. While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even the simplest brute to grow something, those who show some aptitude will have more bountiful results." },
	["大德鲁伊莉琳德拉"] = { "It is always a pleasure to meet heroes such as yourself in this forsaken land. Is there some form of assistance that I can offer you?", "Of course! Go with Elune's blessing." },
	["大法师伯塔鲁斯"] = { "My, my, I never thought I would have the chance to see Ulduar myself. Why, when Brann asked me to help fund this expedition, how could I refuse?!", "Welcome to Dalaran, $c." },
	["大法师伯林纳德"] = { "Greetings! Do you need something?" },
	["大法师兰达洛克"] = { "Amongst the Kirin Tor, it is my duty to see to the strategic interests of the magocracy. There is much yet to be done this week. Will you assist me, $N?" },
	["大法师塞德瑞克"] = { "Do not be fooled by the ruins surrounding us, $c. Dalaran is as powerful as ever." },
	["大法师塞琳德拉"] = { "As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place. I can teach you if you are ready. And remember that you can always use the crystal behind me to teleport down to the ruins beneath Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest.", "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic. However, you can use the crystal behind me to teleport to the ruins below Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest." },
	["大法师奈苏尔"] = { "Should Kil'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!" },
	["大法师奥图鲁斯"] = { "Karazhan is more than a mere building, $N. If you traced the ley-lines traversing Azeroth you would find that they all converge right about there. <Alturus points at an invisible spot below the tower.> Fascinating, isn't it?" },
	["大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯"] = { "<Angela nods.> After the deaths, the Six decided that the best course of action was to seal the staff behind impenetrable barriers of magic and appoint a watcher: A guardian of the staff... I would be that watcher.", "After the fall of Dalaran, I took my leave from the Kirin Tor. I spent years watching over Atiesh, only to have my purpose amongst the Kirin Tor taken from me in one fell swoop. I would find the staff, though it might take a lifetime. That is how I came to join the Argent Dawn and why I am here now.", "After the fall of Karazhan, the Kirin Tor dispatched an assembly of mages to search the tower and seize all items of import... for the purposes of \"research.\" It was then that the fabled staff was discovered and brought back to Dalaran.", "Ah, a good question. If you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater. If you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths.", "I have tracked the various fragments of the staff across this world and in doing so, discovered Kel'Thuzad's plans to reform the staff. He has already collected several of the staff's fragments - which are being held by his most trusted lieutenants. I cannot emphasize enough the importance of keeping the greatstaff of the Guardian out of Kel'Thuzad's grasp. Frankly, I do not know what the result would be, other than a catastrophe of epic proportion.", "It is a story of legend and one that I do not have the time nor the inclination to retell. Just know that Medivh was the last of the Guardians. The greatstaff of Atiesh was a focal point of his power and a focal point of corruption.", "It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian. Yes, the very staff once held by Medivh.", "Like Kel'Thuzad, I too was once a mage of the Kirin Tor. And like Kel'Thuzad, I seek the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian. Our fates are intertwined as such, $c.", "Progeny of Aegwynn, he that would be the last Guardian of Tirisfal... Medivh.", "The corruption of a fallen titan. The corruption of the Destroyer. After all, the staff was forged from the seed of hate. That is, of course, what has brought me here...", "There is not much more to tell. Dalaran was nearly wholly destroyed by Archimonde, the staff lost, presumably shattered by the barrier's fail-safe mechanisms. There are those that believe the staff to be the cause of Archimonde's reprisal.", "What followed were a series of tragic events, leading to the death of every Kirin Tor mage that came into contact with Atiesh. You see, it was an artifact with sentience. A sentience granted to it by Sargeras..." },
	["大法师山姆"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["大法师提迈尔"] = { "I foresee that you will speak with Archmage Lan'dalock, $N." },
	["大法师特沃什"] = { "Well met, $N. We must be brief because there is much to do." },
	["大法师特纳亚"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["大法师瓦格斯"] = { "Amazing! There are passages in here that I have never seen before. This must have taken quite a while for you to track down. If you ever find anymore books like this, I would like to be notified immediately. Please take one of my Kirin Tor Familiars with you just in case you stumble across anything.", "Welcome $c, to my humble retreat. I find this place very relaxing and I have always loved being at home in Dalaran. Sometimes though, it can be a lonely place... such a lonely place." },
	["大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像"] = { "Yes? What is it?" },
