re are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["大法师茉德拉的影像"] = { "Greetings, $c. How may I help you?" },
	["大法师莫丹特·永影"] = { "I suppose I should not be surprised at this cold reception. We have long been in hiding, and the separation from our brethren was necessary. That time, however, is done. Whether the residents of this young tree come to accept us or not, the Highborne are returning to light, and we will not turn our backs on what we are." },
	["大法师萨布兰希"] = { "Are you the correspondent from the Gadgetzan Times? If you just follow me, I'll show you my experimental apparatus... <You tell the magus that you're not the reporter she's expecting.> Oh, you're not? Well then, if you need reagents, find what you need and don't tarry. I'm expecting someone." },
	["大法师蕾尔达"] = { "Karazhan wasn't always quite as... ominous. The darkening of Karazhan only came with Medivh's death. Or what we believe was Medivh's death." },
	["大法师马林"] = { "Pleased to meet you, $c." },
	["大盗萨艾"] = { "My life and spirit has been filled with memories of the insufferable Horde. Times of sorrow, desperation, and sacrifice have come to pass. The rage of battle could never leave my heart!" },
	["大督军霍恩·重拳"] = { "Thrallmar needs you, $c. The warchief needs you. Stand ready to do your duty." },
	["大药剂师法拉尼尔"] = { "It's true our new... guests are limiting our work somewhat, but it is only natural to be wary when a genocidal attempt is made. Perhaps in time they will be convinced that Putress was an unfortunate anomaly and allow us to continue our work in peace." },
	["大财主里维加兹"] = { "Welcome to Booty Bay, partner. Don't mind DeMeza and her crew... we let the hellion run riot one day a year, Pirates' Day, and then she leaves us in peace to go plunder the South Seas again. Now then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you? Better still - what can you do for me, eh?", "Welcome to Booty Bay, partner. I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter. We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy. Now then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you? Better still - what can you do for me, eh?" },
	["大铁匠博恩奈特"] = { "Burninate's the name, smithin's my game... and, erm... I sell a little food and water on the side. Care for some meat?", "You've done all that I've asked you to do, $N. There's really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths. Farewell!" },
	["大领主尤雷加尔"] = { "What is it then? Can't you see I'm a busy dwarf?" },
	["大领主提里奥·弗丁"] = { "The taking of Crusaders' Pinnacle is only the first step in a long and dangerous journey. There is much left to do before we are able to assault Icecrown Citadel. It can only be possible with help from you and others like you, hero.", "There you are. Are you ready then? Once we start, there is no turning back.", "This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people. Remember, hero, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!", "We mustn't lose our focus. The dangers inherent in getting lost in the moment could put us in peril. Alas, the soldiers need a respite from this madness. Bask in the victory, $N. If not for you we might have lost the Vanguard." },
	["大领主达里安·莫格莱尼"] = { "<Highlord Darion Mograine nods.>", "Here is where I sacrificed everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it...", "Here is where I sacrificied everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it...", "Ready yourself, $c. The time has come for the Lich King's reign to come to an end.", "Speak with Alchemist Finklestein, $c. He can set you on the path. Demonstrate your loyalty and their methods shall be made known to you.", "The Ashen Verdict is a select group of the most talented craftsmen in the Ebon Blade and Argent Crusade. Its creation symbolizes the unity of our forces as we mount this final assault on the Lich King and his minions. It is through the Ashen Verdict's efforts that we have discovered how to bend primordial saronite to our will." },
	["天守长者"] = { "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["天空卫士卡提"] = { "Hey there, $c! <Khatie looks at you slyly.> Anytime you want to wrangle us up some more aether rays, you make sure to come and see me!", "Huh? What? I'm a little busy here, friend! Of course, if you're here to help, I've got all the time in the world.", "I hope you don't think I'm a stalker, or anything like that, $N. I mean, I know that you're real famous within the Skyguard now, and well... I'm sure that you wouldn't want to hang out with a lowly peon like me. But, if you ever want to get together to just hang out, or even wrangle some more rays, drop by anytime! I'll be here. I miss you...", "So, you've been around a lot, but we seem to keep missing each other for getting together after work. Is it me? <Khatie purposely cheers up.> Anyway, I just wanted to say that I... we really appreciate everything that you've been doing for the Skyguard!", "You know, $N, it's such an honor to work with you! When you're not busy wrangling, maybe we could $g go out some place for dinner? : get together for a girl's night?; Oh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick? If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that.", "You know, $N, it's such an honor to work with you! When you're not busy wrangling, maybe we could get together for a girl's night? Oh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick? If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that.", "You know, $N, it's such an honor to work with you! When you're not busy wrangling, maybe we could go out some place for dinner? Oh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick? If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that." },
	["天空卫队兽栏管理员"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["天空卫队火焰技师"] = { "How can I outfit you today, sir?", "Need supplies for the field?", "Need to requisition some supplies?", "You can never be too prepared." },
	["天空卫队训练师伊雷娜"] = { "Hello, $N. Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains? I've got a pretty little nether ray ready. You want to go now? You just say the word, $g big guy : bunny;!", "Hello, $N. Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains? I've got a pretty little nether ray ready. You want to go now? You just say the word, big guy!", "Hello, $N. Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains? I've got a pretty little nether ray ready. You want to go now? You just say the word, bunny!", "Hey, comrade. If you get yourself in good with the Skyguard, I can offer you a direct flight to our base, Blackwind Landing, in the Skethyl Mountains. Do you like my beautiful nether ray? It is lovely." },
	["天空卫队训练师德萨克"] = { "Good day to you. When you've risen a bit more in the ranks of the Sha'tari Skyguard, I will be able offer you a direct flight to the Skyguard Outpost, our base atop the Blade's Edge Mountains.", "Hello, $g sir : ma'am;! If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade's Edge Mountains. Just let me know.", "Hello, ma'am! If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade's Edge Mountains. Just let me know.", "Hello, sir! If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade's Edge Mountains. Just let me know." },
	["天空指挥官凯勒"] = { "Ack, ye've been busy now haven't ye?! I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts. Yer making our job all the more easier. Keep up the good work, $g laddy : lassie;!", "Ack, ye've been busy now haven't ye?! I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts. Yer making our job all the more easier. Keep up the good work, laddy!", "Ack, ye've been busy now haven't ye?! I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts. Yer making our job all the more easier. Keep up the good work, lassie!", "Don't ya have something better ta do, $g lad : lass; than jaw with me? Now get out there and prove yer mettle!", "Don't ya have something better ta do, lad than jaw with me? Now get out there and prove yer mettle!", "Don't ya have something better ta do, lass than jaw with me? Now get out there and prove yer mettle!", "Oh, ye like me eyepatch now do ya? Well, just make sure that ya don't have ta be wearing one yerself now $g boyo : girly;.", "Oh, ye like me eyepatch now do ya? Well, just make sure that ya don't have ta be wearing one yerself now boyo.", "Oh, ye like me eyepatch now do ya? Well, just make sure that ya don't have ta be wearing one yerself now girly.", "That's the spirit, $g laddy : lassie;! Yer making all of us proud with all o' the work ye be doing! And ya know, if ya want a quick trip ta our other base in the Skethyl Mountains, go down an talk ta Skyguard Handler Irena. She'll set ya up nicely.", "That's the spirit, laddy! Yer making all of us proud with all o' the work ye be doing! And ya know, if ya want a quick trip ta our other base in the Skethyl Mountains, go down an talk ta Skyguard Handler Irena. She'll set ya up nicely.", "That's the spirit, lassie! Yer making all of us proud with all o' the work ye be doing! And ya know, if ya want a quick trip ta our other base in the Skethyl Mountains, go down an talk ta Skyguard Handler Irena. She'll set ya up nicely.", "Yer gettin' ta be something of a revered figure 'round here, $g boy : girl;! If'n I didn't know better, I'd say ye were gunnin' fer me job!!! All the same, if ye keep up the way ye have been, ye'll deserve it!", "Yer gettin' ta be something of a revered figure 'round here, boy! If'n I didn't know better, I'd say ye were gunnin' fer me job!!! All the same, if ye keep up the way ye have been, ye'll deserve it!", "Yer gettin' ta be something of a revered figure 'round here, girl! If'n I didn't know better, I'd say ye were gunnin' fer me job!!! All the same, if ye keep up the way ye have been, ye'll deserve it!" },
	["天空船长“尘灰”布拉斯纳特"] = { "Welcome aboard the Zephyr, the smoothest ride you're likely to get across the Barrens. Sit back and enjoy the flight, eh, kid? Ain't nothing like that sweet, dry air mixed with the scent of oil." },
	["天空船长克劳基克"] = { "Welcome aboard the Thundercaller! Don't pay attention to the people that complain about explosions or the like. I mean really, everyone makes mistakes. We should cut people some slack. Look, I'd understand if a captain managed to crash his ship 22 or 23 times... But anything less than that isn't worth mentioning." },
	["天空船长博布拉斯"] = { "I run the tightest airship in Azeroth. She used to be fitted with twin light cannons and enough bombs to flatten a city, you know... her mere shadow was enough to rout armies. What? Of course it's true!" },
	["天空船长卡贝克拉"] = { "Welcome aboard $c. Take a load off and enjoy the trip. Aboard \"The Purple Princess\" we want you to relax. We have vending machines down below if there's anything you might need while aboard." },
	["天空船长塞罗弗莱特"] = { "Greetings $c! Welcome aboard the Cloudkisser. Northrend can be a very harsh place. I hope you have prepared yourself." },
	["太空虎"] = { "<It's a giant, armored, saddle-bearing attack cat. Isn't that already silly enough without it talking, too?>" },
	["奈克塔尔"] = { "It was not so long ago that we had to wrest control of Thunderlord Stronghold from the nearby ogres. You are here to help us maintain our defenses? I know that Gor'drek is looking for assistance." },
	["奈尔萨拉库"] = { "<Neltharaku nods.> Karynaku... She is held prisoner atop Dragonmaw Fortress. I have made many attempts to free her. All have failed... You have battled these beasts before, have you not?", "Greetings, mortal.", "I... We are powerless. Illidan found and delivered unto the Dragonmaw their leader - Zuluhed. This orc was the one responsible for the capture and incarceration of Alexstrasza. How could we fight against such power? He captured an Aspect! And just as easily, he took my mate.", "In the eastern reaches of the Netherwing Fields lies Dragonmaw Fortress. It is there that the cruel Dragonmaw orc clan tortures the drakes that they capture in an attempt to bend them to their will. Many have given up hope, choosing instead to do the bidding of Dragonmaw. The others... They refuse to land for fear of Dragonmaw war parties capturing them and taking them back to the fortress." },
	["奈欧玛"] = { "Welcome to Dolanaar, $c. Let me know if you need any recipes or basic cooking ingredients." },
	["奈瑟"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["奈里森"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?", "It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奎丝鲁恩之魂"] = { "Do you like the new home that I've carved out for my so-called worshippers? In the throes of my death, I cursed them all and dragged them along with me into this special underworld of my own creation. I think that I shall delight in their eternal torment, but what I really want is to exact revenge upon my former prophet!" },
	["奎恩萨斯"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you." },
	["奥丁·雷拳"] = { "If it's a hammer you're looking for, you've come to the right place." },
	["奥伯妮·亮鬃"] = { "This is awful! I shouldn't be sitting here, useless, when there's so much to be done! If only my arm hadn't gotten injured up in Northrend... No use dwelling on it, though! Tahu will have me patched up and cured eventually, and we'll still help around here in the meantime. Just because we're not at the front doesn't mean we can't help out somehow." },
	["奥克基尔"] = { "I can instruct you in engineering. Interested?" },
	["奥克索斯·铁怒"] = { "What do you want?" },
	["奥兰纳·鸦眼"] = { "Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone." },
	["奥兰雅"] = { "This is the only way Harry will even talk to me! I have to keep this stupid mask on all the time..." },
	["奥利维亚·伯恩赛德"] = { "No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!" },
	["奥努度"] = { "I can instruct you in blacksmithing. Interested?" },
	["奥努森"] = { "Onu'zun here to challenge the vrykul and work himself up in the ranks. Then when Onu'zun fight in Valhalas and win, Onu'zun gonna be workin' for the Lich King!" },
	["奥古纳罗"] = { "I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race. Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.", "Zug zug, brave $c! I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse. You'll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere! Please, inspect them for yourself." },
	["奥吉尔"] = { "Are you looking for reagents or poison supplies? If so, you've come to the right place!" },
	["奥尔多守备官"] = { "<The Aldor Vindicator scowls.> You... will find High Enchanter Bardolan in the Seer's Library on Scryer's Tier, with the rest of those wicked blood elves.", "Inessera is a sharp woman who carries various gems as well as jewelcrafting supplies. You can find her shop in the northern part of Aldor Rise.", "Jack Trapper can be found cooking in the lower city's open market, in the southeast.", "Lorokeem, grand master alchemist and Skettis outcast, lives among the other arakkoa in the northwest portion of the lower city.", "Mildred Fletcher may be found within the infirmary in the northeastern section of the lower city.", "Our grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, is here on the Aldor Rise.", "Our resident alchemist Lorokeem brought his equipment with him, in fact. It may be slightly different from what you're used to - he is an arakkoa, after all - but it should serve your needs. He roosts in the northwest portion of the lower city.", "Seymour, the principal skinner in Shattrath and grand master of the trade, may be found in the lower city's open marketplace.", "Shattrath's battlemasters often congregate on the stairwells between the upper and lower city. The Alliance battlemasters gather in one place, the Horde in another, with the arena battlemasters between and across from them.", "Shattrath's flight master is Nutral. You will find him east of the city's center.", "The Aldor bank is located northwest of the the city's center.", "The Alliance battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell northeast of the city's center.", "The Arena battlemasters are in the southeast lower city, along the wall.", "The Horde battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell southeast of the city's center.", "The World's End Tavern may be found in the easternmost portion of the lower city.", "The armor and weapons crafters Kradu Grimblade and Zula Slagfury may be found working at a great forge in the lower city.", "The grand master leatherworker Darmari may be found in the lower city's open marketplace.", "Welcome to Aldor Rise. You seek guidance?", "What sort of trainer were you looking for?", "You will find a caregiver center in the southern portion of Aldor Rise.", "You will find a mailbox near the caregiver center.", "You will find the Stable Master near the caregiver center." },
	["奥尔多幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["奥尔巴兹·血毒"] = { "We are the chosen ones, $N. Death knights of the Scourge, sent to sow the seeds of the master's destruction." },
	["奥尔托什"] = { "I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth. Leave me to my thoughts." },
	["奥尔明·燃须"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "If you're here to be trained in the tactics and strategy of hunting, you've come to the right place!", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥尔鲁赫"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["奥尼克森"] = { "Greetings, traveler." },
	["奥巴洛恩大王"] = { "You made it this far, grunt. There is no turning back now." },
	["奥德兰"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥德文·拉弗林"] = { "Welcome to the Stormwind Guild Registry offices. What can I help you with today?" },
	["奥德瑞克·摩尔"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["奥德蕾·炎枪"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["奥恩·嫩蹄"] = { "What brings you to me?" },
	["奥拉斯塔萨"] = { "Hello, $r. I'm sorry that you had to see our sacred land for the first time in such a state." },
	["奥拉玛"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears.", "I can sense your desire for power, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥斯库"] = { "The Exodar's vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here.", "We control access to the Exodar's storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?" },
	["奥斯瑞克·斯图恩"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["奥斯莱特元帅"] = { "The League of Arathor has sworn to retake Arathi for humans of Stromgarde and the Alliance. It is a battle hard fought, but a battle worth fighting." },
	["奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not waste my time, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The warrior's role is one of protection. Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥术士麦迪米德兹"] = { "Did you manage to see their show in Terokkar Forest? It was amazing!", "I wonder how much longer they'll be in Silvermoon City. I hope they play here!", "I'd give nearly anything for a chance to go up there and speak with them...", "The Tauren Chieftains must be the best-known minstrels in all of Azeroth!" },
	["奥术师亚尼达"] = { "We've important work to do, $N. Let us attack our enemies while their guard is down. Let us show them that sin'dorei vengeance never forgets nor forgives." },
	["奥术师伊塔纳斯"] = { "You've caught me at a critical time in my research! No worries, you're welcome to join me in quiet contemplation... emphasis on \"quiet\", if you don't mind though." },
	["奥术师伊莱米尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["奥术师兰妮蕊娅"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["奥术师卡雷希斯·晨星"] = { "Outland just oozes with magical energy, it's in the very air. Can you feel it, $N? I can't think of a place better suited to our race. Soon the sin'dorei shall have a new land to call our own!" },
	["奥术师布莱丁"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["奥术师帕尔琳"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["奥术师杜莱尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["奥术师森纳瑟林"] = { "Can you not see that I am busy here?", "Do not waste my time. What is it you want?", "Yes? What do you want?" },
	["奥术师泰利斯"] = { "The Silver Covenant welcomes you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing." },
	["奥术师泰拜林"] = { "Never trust the Sunreavers. They are hard at work undermining us in the eyes of our Argent Crusade allies." },
	["奥术师索瑞斯"] = { "Only the most seasoned hunters of Illidan's minions gain access to my wares. You will be considered worthy when your status with the Sha'tar, Cenarion Expedition and the Scryers is exalted.", "Welcome, $N. Bring me the marks that Illidan bestows upon his most powerful minions and I shall grant you access to my alchemical goods." },
	["奥术师纳扎丽娅"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["奥术师艾蒂莉亚"] = { "Can you believe it? This ethereal does not have a single basilisk eye on him! And his leader has the gall to call himself \"the Smuggler Prince!\"" },
	["奥术师艾齐纳哈·连科"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["奥术师范迪瑞尔"] = { "$C, look what they've done to our beloved land. The Scourge must be destroyed!", "The situation is more grim than many have been led to believe. The Forsaken are here as allies in the fight against our common enemy, the Scourge. Trust me when I say this, without them the Ghostlands would be lost and the Scourge would already have overrun all of Eversong Woods! But more than anything else, we need your help in reclaiming our once proud lands!" },
	["奥术师赫里恩"] = { "Knowledge is power - TRUE power, my young friend. You'll be wise to acquire as much of it as you can, and pay proper heed to those who have already done so. Before the razing of the Sunwell, we fooled ourselves into thinking we had neared the apex of our civilization. It took the Scourge to bring us to our knees... and in a way, back to reality." },
	["奥术师阿尔杜尼斯"] = { "Manaforge Ultris, of course! Where have you been? The manaforge was overloaded and created a huge explosion. It left a tear in reality and now void creatures have been pouring in through it. You can see them all over the place towards the northeast.", "What are you doing here? Shouldn't you be working on the energy pipeline? We've more than doubled the amount of energy we're sending to Tempest Keep and can't afford anyone loafing. We don't want another Ultris to happen here." },
	["奥松·格鲁尔"] = { "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["奥林达尔·石鹿"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥格林"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["奥格瑞拉商人"] = { "Friend! It's been too long. What can we get for you?", "How can we be of service, exalted one?", "We are happy to provide you with supplies.", "What are you looking for?" },
	["奥格瑞拉补给者"] = { "Mighty one! We hope that you find our food to your satisfaction.", "Our food should satisfy even the mightiest of hungers.", "Still hungry $G brother:sister;? How can we help?", "Still hungry brother? How can we help?", "Still hungry sister? How can we help?", "We have quite the feast for you friend.", "What tasty treats can we offer you?" },
	["奥格瑞拉贸易者"] = { "Greetings $G brother:sister;. How can we be of service?", "Greetings brother. How can we be of service?", "Greetings sister. How can we be of service?", "How can we help you?", "Mighty one! How can we serve you?", "We are honored by your presence, friend. How can we serve you today?", "Welcome friend! What would you like to see?" },
	["奥格瑞拉酒王"] = { "Drink or be gone!", "Everyone's gotta drink. What can we get for you?", "Our drinks should quench even the mightiest of thirsts.", "We'll let you in on our secret diet: Cocktails and dreams. We can help you with one." },
	["奥格瑞拉铸钢者"] = { "Do you have steel that needs shaping?", "Here in Ogri'la we have time to contemplate the riddle of steel. But enough of that, how can we help?", "Steel isn't strong, exalted one, flesh is stronger. Steel gains its strength from the one who wields it. But enough of that... How can we help you exalted one?", "There are few things you can trust in life. Steel, you can trust.", "What is steel compared to the hand that shapes it?" },
	["奥格瑞玛冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["奥格瑞玛勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["奥格瑞玛步兵"] = { "Arnok makes good bandages. Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits. It's above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.", "Can you enchant my axe? I'll want a permanent. Maybe later then. Find Godan's Runeworks on the west end of The Drag near the Valley of Wisdom.", "Clothing!? That won't help you against good steel! Bah, if you're sure you want to be a tailor go find Magar's Cloth Goods in The Drag.", "Didn't we just break free of the Burning Legion, and here you are messing with demons again? Seek out the Darkfire Enclave in the underground cavern known as the Cleft of Shadow. You'll find a tunnel down into it from The Drag.", "Don't let me catch you stealing anything! Look for Shenthul and his Shadowswift Brotherhood in the underground Cleft of Shadow. Find the tunnel leading down into it south of the Valley of Wisdom.", "Find Red Canyon Mining northeast of the lake in the Valley of Honor. Speak to Makaru there.", "Find the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak to Grezz Ragefist. Let them know that I'll be reporting back in after my shift here.", "Find the Wind Rider Master at the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength. Doras will make sure you find your way to the battle you seek.", "Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle! Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor.", "Go to Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag. Ask for Karolek.", "Go to the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor, west of the Coliseum. Talk to Ormak Grimshot there.", "Go to the Valley of Honor and seek out Xon'cha near the stables.", "Go to the Valley of Strength and look for the Bank of Orgrimmar to the south of the Sky Tower.", "Godan's Runeworks is where you'll go. Look for it on the west end of The Drag, right next to the Valley of Wisdom.", "Healing is for those who cannot endure pain. However if you must, seek out the Spirit Lodge on the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up and above the Valley of Strength to the west.", "Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag. There are some wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom. Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you'll find her.", "I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting. Seek out Arnok at the Survival of the Fittest hut next to the Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits. Look up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength for a lake. That's where he's at.", "It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use. Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag.", "Jo'mah is in a building on the second floor of The Drag.", "Just outside the city's main gate is a signpost. It will point you toward the western zeppelin tower.", "Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want. Find it in the middle of The Drag.", "Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength. Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates.", "Look for Nogg's Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining.", "Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend. Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog.", "Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions. Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree.", "Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength.", "Look for the eastern Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast.", "Looking for Shenthul of the Shadowswift Brotherhood, huh? In The Drag across from Droffers and Son Salvage look for a tunnel leading down into the Cleft of Shadow.", "Looking to learn how to use a new weapon? Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor.", "Magar's Cloth Goods is in The Drag. Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks.", "Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake.", "Master Pyreanor can be found among Thrall's advisors in his fortress, Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom.", "Maybe Saru Steelfury will teach you to make an axe as good as mine some day. Find him at The Burning Anvil in the Valley of Honor down the path to the right past Red Canyon Mining.", "Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy. Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag.", "Shoot straight to the northwest section of the Valley of Honor. There you will find the Hunter's Hall.", "Speak to Grezz Ragefist in the Hall of the Brave, which is in the Valley of Honor. Put in a good word for me!", "Speak to Pephredo at the Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.", "Talk to Saru Steelfury at The Burning Anvil. Go to the Valley of Honor. It's at the end of the path to the right of Red Canyon Mining.", "That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting. You'll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor. While you're there say hi to Shankys for me.", "That's the second building on the right in the Valley of Strength north of the main city entrance. Speak to Innkeeper Gryshka.", "The Bank of Orgrimmar is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it north of the main entrance to the city.", "The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side.", "The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "There are two zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar. The eastern tower serves Tirisfal Glades and Stranglethorn Vale, while the western tower serves Northrend and Thunder Bluff.", "Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills. Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag.", "What are you looking for?", "What, you can't port there? Go to the Darkbriar Lodge next to the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.", "Where did you think the Wind Rider Master would be? Head to the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength!", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "Ya man, you be wantin Jandi's Arboretum. Did I just say that? Glok'tar I must be tired! Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you'll find Jandi's there on the upper level.", "You can pick up your love letters outside the bank in the middle of the Valley of Strength.", "You seek Grol'dar and the Darkfire Enclave? Find them in the underground cavern called the Cleft of Shadow. There are two tunnels leading down into that cave, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other from The Drag.", "You seek Kardris Dreamseeker. She and the other shaman are in the entrance room to Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom.", "You want Zamja at Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag. Go up the stairs on the left as you enter The Drag from the Valley of Strength.", "You want the Hall of Legends. It's high above the Valley of Strength on the west side.", "You will find the battlemasters inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor.", "You'll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength.", "You'll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor.", "You'll want to learn from Zamja. Head to Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag by taking the stairs on the left as you enter from the Valley of Strength.", "You're looking for Urtrun Clanbringer in the Horde Embassy. Find it on the west side of the Valley of Strength.", "Your search is almost completed. Seek your truth in the entrance room of Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom.", "Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh? Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength.", "Zayus and his priests are in the Spirit Lodge, which is in the Valley of Spirits. Look for it on the lake up above and to west of the Valley of Strength." },
	["奥格瑞玛狂欢者"] = { "Did you see? That last firework almost caught that dwarf's shirt on fire! Hah!", "Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...", "If I didnt know better, I'd say this party was organized by orcs!", "This moon beam will send you to Orgrimmar. Use your invitation when you want to go." },
	["奥格索普·奥布诺提斯"] = { "Hello there $glad:lass;... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess! If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties! Oh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching. I have nothing to say to you.", "Hello there lad... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess! If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties! Oh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching. I have nothing to say to you.", "Hello there lass... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess! If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties! Oh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching. I have nothing to say to you.", "Well, if it isn't $N! It's good to see you again; I cannot express my gratitude enough at the help that you've given me and my invention work to date. What can I do for you today?" },
	["奥比"] = { "I... I am badly injured..." },
	["奥特兰克山谷传送门"] = { "This is a portal to the Alterac Valley battleground." },
	["奥玛·詹洛斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["奥玛克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you.", "I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥琳萨·格瑞菲斯"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["奥米尔·火眼"] = { "Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What kin I do for ye, $n?" },
	["奥索·莫吉克"] = { "I've got all the cooking supplies you'll ever need, mon!" },
	["奥索恩"] = { "I once roamed the Grizzly Hills, son to the great Ursoc, who ruled over this land. But now... now I'm doomed to spend the rest of my life in this cave.", "The sapling they grew bore a fruit. At first it seemed to work. Ursoc did come back and I was filled with joy for a brief moment. As he recovered, it was clear that he wasn't the same. Neither were the furbolg. Whatever evil caused the ancient druids to tear down Vordrassil manifested itself in the new tree and turned them all into monsters filled with bloodlust. The thing that now walks the Grizzly Hills is not my father and it must be put to rest.", "You don't understand. If I wanted to I could fight my way out of this cave. It's my father, Ursoc. He has returned from the dead... but he's not the same. He gave his life during the War of the Ancients thousands of years ago. For centuries, the furbolg who worshipped him tried to devise a way to resurrect him. Finally they decided they were to attempt to regrow the failed world tree, Vordrassil, and use its magic to bring back my father." },
	["奥纳尔"] = { "Hello, $c. Old man Kessel over there, he's a clever one. I'd be real careful in my dealings with him if I were you. He offered me work 'caring for the elekk' and being the fool I was, I took it to mean feeding, training, and the like. Things became real clear when he handed me the shovel..." },
	["奥莉丝塔夫人"] = { "Are you certain? There is no turning back once I wipe the knowledge of the talents you have learned from your mind.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It is through the power of the unholy that we command death itself!", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources." },
	["奥莉娜·埃杜恩"] = { "Hello $r, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance." },
	["奥莉希亚"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?", "Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?", "I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child. I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥莉菲洛丝夫人"] = { "Welcome to Tranquillien, $c. I apologize for the state that you find it in. As you can see, we've been having some trouble, but the Forsaken, and their Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, have been gracious enough to lend us a great deal of assistance in our time of need. If you can lend a hand please do not hesitate to do so. We can use all of the help that we can get in our struggle against the myriad forces arrayed against us." },
	["奥莫克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory, unhindered by the timidness of the Warchief.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥菲尔·铁须"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["奥萝拉"] = { "Crystal Restore is a difficult item to acquire, if you plan on finding it yourself. I believe that it comes from Un'Goro Crater, so you'd best head there. However, you might be able to find someone that is willing to part with their own supply...", "Enchanted thorium is a highly sought-after metal. You best chance of finding some of it is to speak with an artisan blacksmith or miner.", "My people, they are as shattered as the relic you seek to repair.", "Please, leave this place, $N. You know nothing of what troubles us...", "While nothing can change the past, time can heal all wounds. Thank you for showing me that it is possible, $N. I wish you well.", "Why have you come here, $c?" },
	["奥萨姆·铁角"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Ram Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the dwarves of Ironforge before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["奥蕾尔·金叶"] = { "The Cenarion Circle is wise, and has delved into many of earth's secrets. Craftsmen would do well to heed the words of these druids." },
	["奥蕾西娅·铁刃"] = { "Greetings, $c. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much." },
	["奥里克斯"] = { "I do not have much time in this world, but Light willing, it is time enough to fulfill my destiny. When you face Baron Rivendare, I will be with you.", "It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest. Greetings. I am Aurius. I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace. The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight! Finally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel. It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand.", "Leave me. My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me. Thank you, $N. I will die here, but because of you... I'll die in peace." },
	["奥雷伦"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, brother, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, sister, but I cannot train you." },
	["奥雷妮亚"] = { "Are you interested in learning the intricacies of Jewelcrafting?" },
	["奥雷斯托斯"] = { "What can I do for you?" },
	["奥雷索尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?", "You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Scryers." },
	["奥雷萨多·卢卡"] = { "Welcome to Blue Moon Odds and Ends, $c. If you have any questions, please let me know." },
	["奥鲁姆之魂"] = { "I sense you've cleared the path to my brethren. My connection to them and to the temple is still strong. Do you wish to delve deeper inside?", "My brethren were here not long ago. My connection to them has grown tenuous. A powerful presence in the courtyard guards the way forward." },
	["奥鲁特·埃雷古"] = { "The mountains are rich with history... don't forget to stop and take it all in, $c." },
	["女主人伊布拉"] = { "Come, Battle-Sister. Feast, sleep, so that you may fight with all your strength!" },
	["女妖希奥克丝"] = { "I no longer train Death Knights, having grown weary of cretinous Initiates and their constant questions. Now begone." },
	["女巫凯兰娜"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["女巫格蕾兹拉"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["女巫洛莉拉"] = { "Look at them... all they care about is outdoing each other.", "These mines are a dreadful place. Fortunately, I don't plan on being here long.", "Thorim lost it. He lashed out against his most beloved allies, the frost giants. That's one reason why to this day, this land is torn apart by the war between the Hyldnir and the Sons of Hodir... and why Thorim has exiled himself to the Temple of Storms.", "What do I care if these she-wolves and the frost giants kill each other every day? No, no... I want Thorim to break out of his stupor and rally all his allies to retake Ulduar. The world will be torn asunder if he fails to accomplish this! And of course, I'll reward you appropriately.", "You see, Thorim is not like these harpies. He's a worthy being of near godlike stature. He served the titans as guardian of Ulduar and the Terrace of the Makers. That is until his wife, Sif, was cowardly slain by his brother." },
	["女牧师安妮塔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.", "I trust the Light is with you, $N. Is there something that I can I help you with?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["女牧师洁塞塔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.", "I trust the Light is with you, $N. Is there something that I can I help you with?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["女猎手凯拉·夜弓"] = { "Greetings, $N." },
	["女猎手琪玛"] = { "We've got to get those supply crates back!" },
	["女祭司基琳·伊尔蒂娜"] = { "<Priestess Il'dinare eyes you suspiciously.>", "I am a night elf, stranger. While you may know nothing of my kind, we know much of you and your progenitors. You may not call yourself eredar but, in appearance, you share many similarities. You have helped my allies, and for that I am thankful; but for the time being, you walk a tenuous path. Perhaps in time, you will be able to dissolve the doubts and fears that I hold in my heart." },
	["女祭司阿兰希雅"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $N?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["女裁缝蔻妮·琥珀之光"] = { "Can you not see that I am busy here?", "Do not waste my time. What is it you want?", "Yes? What do you want?" },
	["奴隶工"] = { "Are you... here to save me?", "Get out of here, before the slavers see you!", "Who are you?" },
	["妖术师乌布戈"] = { "I am Ubungo. I represent the Zandalar tribe. Bad things are afoot, $r. The Drakkari are going to be their own doom with what they're up to. Some trolls never learn." },
	["妮可·巴雷特"] = { "Hello, what business brings you here? This is an orphanage for the children of Outland who have lost their parents and have no one else to look after them. Perhaps you are here because you are considering adoption?" },
	["妮拉"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["妮瓦拉·刃舞"] = { "We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["姆姆咕咕"] = { "Ahglrglglrglgrrr!", "I'm not blind, you know. I can see what's going on around here!" },
	["姆希菲"] = { "I welcome you to Sporeggar, $r. We don't normally see many of your kind around here, but you've proven your worth to us. Make yourself at home." },
	["委任官翠希·普罗维尔"] = { "For years, Honor Hold has stood against the horrors of Hellfire Peninsula. Now, now that the portal has reopened and aid streams in from Azeroth, perhaps this bloody stalemate will end.", "Oh, no! My Fei Fei would never take someone else's things! He's a good dog... he just needs attention sometimes. If you give him a treat, then you see!" },
	["威利·梅比"] = { "If you're shot down and caught, don't tell them your real name. Use a codename." },
	["威利德·马绍尔"] = { "Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater! My name is Williden Marshal. My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown. We've hit a bit of a rough patch here, and we're looking for some help if you have the time!" },
	["威士忌斯利姆"] = { "Here's to you! Here's to me! May we never disagree. But if we do... BLAST YOU! Here's to me." },
	["威尔弗雷德·菲兹班"] = { "You! Yes, you! Gaze upon me and treasure this moment of meeting, for soon the world will come to know and fear the name and stern visage of Wilfred Fizzlebang! Once my magnificent summoning is complete, no one will doubt my ability!" },
	["威尔海姆修士"] = { "May the Light protect you this day." },
	["威廉·萨丁"] = { "I was here visiting relatives when Lordaeron fell, and then... well. I suppose I won't ever be returning to Westfall, now. Sometimes I wonder if my family is still alive. More often, though, I wonder why I no longer care." },
	["威廉姆森"] = { "Rest your weary bones for a spell." },
	["娅琳·永歌"] = { "We of Darnassus look forward to competing in the tournament." },
	["娜拉·梅德隆"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $N?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["娜玛拉小姐"] = { "Be sure to try our Dark Iron Ale. I hear the dwarves around here can't get enough of it.", "My master, Plugger Spazzring, is a good boss. And he makes a lot of money. His pockets are bursting!", "Thanks again, $N. Rocknot and I are really hitting it off!", "Welcome to the Grim Guzzler!" },
	["孤儿监护员奈丁加尔"] = { "There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked. Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth. Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves. One week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents. This time is called Children's Week." },
	["孤儿监护员巴特维尔"] = { "There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked. Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth. Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves. One week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents. This time is called Children's Week." },
	["孤儿监护员艾蕊娅"] = { "The Lich King's cruel reign has inflicted great suffering on all of Northrend's inhabitants, particularly the children. If you are a friend to the Oracles or Frenzyheart Tribe of Sholazar, perhaps you might consider caring for an orphan for a week." },
	["孤儿院长莫希"] = { "The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen. And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind. Now, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of. These children often live without the hope of a bright future." },
	["孤儿院长蒂布雷兹"] = { "These infants will live. With love and affection they will grow to be strong members of the Horde, and with time the horrible reminders of their shattered lives will fade." },
	["学员米蒂丝"] = { "Desperate times call for desperate measures, $c." },
	["学徒克里汀"] = { "Don't mind Skuerto, $N. He doesn't mean to be rude, he's just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don't we work on something more productive?" },
	["学徒加里奥"] = { "I wish we had a priest or a druid out here. I can't continue my studies until I've recovered from my injuries." },
	["学徒匹斯波特"] = { "What are you looking down at? I'll have you know that the Pestlepots are a storied family with a long tradition of pestling. Yes, that's a word! There are no finer alchemists in all of Azeroth, or anywhere else for that matter, I can assure you! I may carry the title of apprentice at the moment, but my skill is second to none! One must endure such humilities though to get places in life. Of course, maybe you're just here to help me? <The diminuitive gnome grins arrogantly.>" },
	["学徒安德雷萨"] = { "<The apprentice occasionally looks over his shoulder, apparently responding to sounds that you can't hear.> Good day, $N. Pardon me if I seem distracted, but I'm in the middle of a job for Farmer Natin. I want to have all of his horses shoed by the time he returns from the town hall. What can I help you with?" },
	["学徒沃尔伊"] = { "You don't see too many apprentices around these parts, do you? I'm beginning to think it's because the magisters give us all the dangerous work they'd rather not do themselves." },
	["学徒沙塔瑞亚"] = { "Well this is troublesome! How am I supposed to collect the ore samples for the magisters if the mines have been overrun with gnoll vermin?" },
	["学徒泰顿"] = { "With some help, I believe Taerix may be close to a breakthrough." },
	["学徒瓦尼斯"] = { "<The blood elf lies limp on the table. While he's still breathing, he appears to have been the victim of potent sedative toxins.>", "<Varnis coughs violently as the restorative draught takes effect.> Thank you for rescuing me. I must go back to Tranquillien at once!" },
	["学徒维莎尔"] = { "I am sure that, with our help, Botanist Taerix will be able to find solutions to our problems." },
	["学徒罗拉塔莉丝"] = { "Hello, $c. These are troubling times indeed if this is what is to become of our beloved Quel'Thalas." },
	["学徒莫兰恩"] = { "If you need to speak with Apprentice Garion, you'll find him inside the cottage with Tabetha. At least there, he can't steal all the reagents." },
	["学者亚米娜"] = { "I've never experienced cold like this, $r. Even in the absence of ice and snow, the frozen wastes of Northrend are extremely taxing." },
	["学者卡尔亚"] = { "While the focus of the Sha'tar remains on Shadowmoon Valley and Illidan, we cannot ignore the threat that Kael'thas Sunstrider presents." },
	["学者卢索恩·纹角"] = { "Oh the horror! The tragedy! We are on the verge of a breakthrough, yet all could be lost." },
	["学者安霍尔"] = { "Telredor has seen more change in the last 20 years than it did in prior centuries. I cannot complain, $N, for the world has changed far more in that time. The Light has brought me friends and companions I could not have met as a cloistered priest. Learn what you can of the past in your time here. It will help you to understand where your journey is leading you." },
	["学者巴拉达"] = { "It is with solemn pride that I perform my services in Honor Hold." },
	["学者希拉"] = { "Glory to the naaru, $N. The Light will soon triumph over its enemies." },
	["学者德尔兰"] = { "Greetings. I am Anchorite Delan - one of the draenei. I am a teacher of sorts. And who might you be?" },
	["学者恩沙姆"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["学者欧巴迪"] = { "Light be with you, $c." },
	["学者法蒂玛"] = { "If you have not yet learned how to make use of bandages, I will be happy to show you the basics of creation and application. The difference between life and death can often come down to properly bandaging wounds.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["学者特卢恩"] = { "Hello. What brings you to Chillwind Camp today?", "How fares your search for the Mark?" },
	["学者艾尤莉"] = { "Isn't the memorial beautiful? It is important to remember moments in our history when great sacrifices are made, lest we forget the price of all wars - even ones that are won." },
	["学者菲索斯"] = { "Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. In my travels, I have amassed a wide variety of tools, artifacts, and knowledge from the various peoples we've encountered. Should you find yourself in need of this knowledge, you have only to ask." },
	["学者阿弗恩"] = { "Greetings. I am Anchorite Avuun of the draenei. I am here studying the Lost Ones of the Fallow Sanctuary in the hope of being able to find a cure for their condition.", "Once more, thank you for your assistance with the cursed Lost Ones. Without your help I would never have been able to continue my research." },
	["守卫队长索雷克"] = { "So you're the new hot shot in town, eh? <Zorek spits on the ground.> Yea..." },
	["守备官乌里恩"] = { "Hey, don't open the cage! Okay? These ogres have got me right where I want them." },
	["守备官伊索姆"] = { "I am Aesom, third of the Triumvirate." },
	["守备官伊达尔"] = { "Telredor was once a secluded retreat for draenei priests and pilgrims. The resident priests seldom received visitors. When the orcs started to attack draenei settlements, refugees began to arrive in larger numbers. Anchorite Ahuurn and the others transformed Telredor from a shrine into a safe haven. Many draenei, myself included, owe our survival to his efforts." },
	["守备官凯兰"] = { "We've almost consolidated our control over Sun's Reach. If we manage to keep the harbor from getting any reinforcements we will certainly succeed. We are $3238w percent done with our goal.", "We've done it, $N. With Sun's Reach under our control we are but mere moments away from absolute victory." },
	["守备官夏安"] = { "We succeeded in taking the Sanctum. We can continue to convert sentries and use them as guards at other tactical locations." },
	["守备官奥达尔"] = { "Many are the paths of the Light, $c. You must decide which to follow on this world, or any other." },
	["守备官奥鲁门"] = { "Illidan's grasp on this land is slipping. Can you feel it, $N?" },
	["守备官帕兰纳尔"] = { "Greetings, I am Vindicator Palanaar, a traveling paladin of the Light. I am here to be of assistance to the night elves.", "It is my fervent hope that we will be able to bring the Light to those places in Ashenvale where it has been forsaken." },
	["守备官库卢斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I am Kuros, second of the Triumvirate of the Hand." },
	["守备官波鲁斯"] = { "What it means to be a Hand of Argus... We are agents of the Light. We serve without question. We die without question." },
	["守备官考尔琳"] = { "I am patiently awaiting orders, $c." },
	["守备官莫尔巴"] = { "All of the barriers blocking you from reaching the Sunwell have been destroyed. Enter the Sunwell and stop Kil'jaeden from entering this world!", "Captain Selana has instructed me to assist you with your efforts here on the Sunwell Plateau." },
	["守夜人布隆尼尔"] = { "Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave... I think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around..." },
	["守护者玛兰迪斯"] = { "May Cenarius guide you, $c. I am here in this corrupt land with my sisters on a mission of great importance to the Cenarian Circle. But only those who are powerful enough I ask speak to me about such matters--to send a lesser being would be folly." },
	["守护者雷姆洛斯"] = { "The Emerald Dream has become a dangerous place. I grow increasingly concerned for those who have sacrificed their waking life in Azeroth in hopes of saving it." },
	["守望堡指挥官雷索恩·奈瑟维"] = { "Not long ago, this place was the site of a terrible battle. We of Nethergarde and the Argent Dawn held at bay a wave of demons, surging relentlessly from the Dark Portal. Those were dark days, full of bloodshed and despair... But the Kingdoms of Azeroth soon joined us and pushed the monsters back! The fighting continues on the far side of the Portal... This camp is now calm, but I fear the quiet here belies the madness found through that hellish gate." },
	["守望者哈尔洛"] = { "I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started. Now that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done. I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, $N." },
	["安伯达"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["安卡祖母"] = { "Come closer, young one; my ears aren't what they once were, and I care not for raising my voice." },
	["安吉利娜·索伦纳船长"] = { "Welcome to The Bravery, $gsir:madame;. Now if you'll excuse me...", "Welcome to The Bravery, madame. Now if you'll excuse me...", "Welcome to The Bravery, sir. Now if you'll excuse me..." },
	["安吉拉·科萨斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not waste my time, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The warrior's role is one of protection. Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["安哈努"] = { "Greetings. If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted." },
	["安塔留斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["安塞瓦"] = { "Archibald is the master of the crossbow. He's the weapon master of the Undercity, located in the War Quarter.", "Both Hanashi and Sayoc can train you in the use of one and two-handed axes. They can be found in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar.", "Dagger instruction can be sought from three weapon masters: Archibald in the War Quarter of the Undercity, Sayoc within the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar, and Ileda in Silvermoon's Farstrider Square.", "Fist weapons are taught by Sayoc, the orc weapon master in Orgrimmar. He spends his days in the Valley of Honor.", "I would be honored to train you in the use of the weapons that I have mastered should you have the ability to learn within you.", "If you require more training, I would be happy to tell you who can aid you. What weapon has caught your eye?", "Ileda of the blood elves, found within Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, trains her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, Undercity's weapon master, can also train you; he is in the War Quarter.", "Sayoc and Hanashi, Orgrimmar's weapon masters, are true artisans of the thrown weapon. They train willing students in the Valley of Honor. For pure finesse in the art, however, Ileda of Silvermoon's Farstrider Square cannot be beaten.", "The Forsaken weapon master Archibald knows his way around the polearm. He trains others in the War Quarter of the Undercity. Ileda, the blood elf weapon master within Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, can show you the proper techniques also.", "The weapon masters in the Valley of Honor within Orgrimmar, Sayoc and Hanashi, can teach you how to shoot a bow. Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon found in Farstrider Square, is also an expert." },
	["安多尔·橡木之手"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["安多葛斯"] = { "Step carefully mortal. You tread where mightier beings have met their fate.", "With Ouro slain the way is clear to the final chamber. I am able to transport you there, if you desire." },
	["安多霍·踏冰者"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["安妮·波恩"] = { "That cursed Jonah Sterling will lead us right into doom. If he spent more time outside of his cave, he would realize the folly of attacking professional navies in a time of war.", "You'd best scram, $N. I do not want Jonah's death to be linked back to me. It'll be hard enough to establish myself as leader of this lot without them knowing I had their previous skipper killed." },
	["安妮莎尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["安娜斯塔西娅·哈特威尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["安尼希尔"] = { "This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what." },
	["安布罗斯·雷钉"] = { "Gnomeregan's finest have come to compete in the tournament. Wish us luck!" },
	["安度因·乌瑞恩"] = { "Welcome to Stormwind, $c." },
	["安度尔格·岩甲"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["安德尔·杰曼"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior. Why don't you go do something safe, like read a book.", "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["安德鲁·马休"] = { "Welcome to Dalaran's Guild Registry offices. How may I help you?" },
	["安德鲁克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["安格妮塔·泰斯多达尔"] = { "This puny green pup was of no use at the mines. No matter, he'll make for suitable warmup for battle." },
	["安格尔·斯塔特弗斯"] = { "Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind. These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies. Not saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.", "Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses! Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount. A horse is a companion for the ages, friend. Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!" },
	["安格雷尔"] = { "I am one of the Seven, and it is our doom to stand sentry. Forever." },
	["安苏瓦"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $c. Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?", "Greetings, $c. I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you...", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["安诺拉"] = { "Greetings traveler, you have my undying gratitude for dispensing with those dreadful creatures! I was beginning to think I might have to hide out forever!" },
	["安达尔"] = { "Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $c." },
	["安迪尔·风矛"] = { "The ghostly figure looks at you with mistrust in her eyes and remains silent." },
	["安迪恩·达克斯宾"] = { "If you're seeking patterns or knowledge about shadoweave tailoring, I'd be happy to help you." },
	["安雅·玛尔雷"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["安霍塔·白霜"] = { "Enemies are closing in on us from all sides, and all the elders talk of abandoning this post. I say we should stand and fight like the warriors we are." },
	["安霍纳"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?", "I would train you, but you are no warrior.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["安鲁里克"] = { "The great sea turtle Walker of Waves travels from this dock to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight." },
	["宾吉·羽哨"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Mechanostrider Piloting, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the gnomes of the Gnomeregan Exiles before I will teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c." },
	["宾斯匹德"] = { "If my calculations are correct, the wheel will soon be obsolete!" },
	["富有的法比奥索"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["寻路者卡雷尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?", "It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["小不点奥克"] = { "<One gets the sense that Oric is here only in a sorry attempt at comic relief and shouldn't be paid attention to, as it will only encourage him.>" },
	["小个子约翰·米斯瑞尔"] = { "Arr! There be nothin I like to see better than folks fightin to the death in the arena. If you be here at the right time maybe you can be one of them!" },
	["小穆图"] = { "I... Are you... <Mootoo shivers.> Are you here to save me?" },
	["小萨鲁法尔"] = { "My father has gifted me with his battle armor and axe. Soon I put it to good use.", "They died. All of them... As the Murkbloods cut through us, something took hold of me that I cannot understand. Tell me, have you ever felt a rage so great that the whole of your being burns? A heat that wilts the living? A heat that incinerates the blood in your veins? That is what I felt. <Saurfang's eyes glow red for a brief moment.> I was the last one left alive. 30 of them surrounded me... Murkbloods... I remember nothing beyond that vision. I blacked out and awoke some time later." },
	["小诺亚"] = { "When I grow up I wanna be a tanner!" },
	["尘泥沼泽护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["尘泥沼泽护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["尤勒斯上校"] = { "Be gone, $c! Leave us be, or we will enter you next and show you true despair!", "Oh, thank you! The pit of blackness inside of me has been lifted! I can see again... and I see the face of my savior!" },
	["尤卡·斯库比格特"] = { "Need some supplies?" },
	["尤塞尔奈"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $c. Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?", "Greetings, $c. I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you...", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["尤奈斯·伯奇"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!" },
	["尤尔达"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["尤尼克斯"] = { "Well. Look what the netherwinds swept in. Come in, sit down, and rest yourself a spell. The fee is modest; you can surely afford it." },
	["尤格雷克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["尤金蒂"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["尼克斯·斯普克斯宾"] = { "Let me break down a little math for you: \"goblin\" plus \"engineering\" equals KNOW HOW, baby. Anyone who tells you otherwise simply doesn't know how to add." },
	["尼兹尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["尼姆布亚"] = { "The trolls of Stranglethorn don't take too kindly to us Darkspear. I'm not afraid of no Bloodscalp or Skullsplitter, but still... Grom'gol's high walls make me feel safe." },
	["尼尔·拉姆斯登"] = { "Hey there! Just because I can race rams better than anyone else, doesn't mean I won't pitch in and help out the brewers. You can help out if you like. But wait, there's more! Helping out with Brewfest means you get a chance to ride some of the fastest rams in the realms!" },
	["尼尔诺·铜线"] = { "Hey there! Miss the Eastern Kingdoms, huh? Well, the Kraken sails back to Stormwind if you're really itching to return. I know I'd enjoy the warmer weather!" },
	["尼尔鲁·火刃"] = { "Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members. That fool Thrall thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely.", "Haha! Save for their leaders--the satyr, Bazzalan, and the warlock Jergosh--yes, all of them. That is why I constantly send Thrall's worshippers at them. It gives Thrall the impression that I am weeding out the evil in the bowels of his great city. The victory is in reality two-fold: kill Thrall's faithful and test the strength of those in the Searing Blade to see if they are truly worthy of joining me.", "I will make it known to you. You are obviously already proving yourself in our ranks to become a lieutenant so quickly. Perhaps you can return to me later and I will have tasks for you. The council adores those skilled in the arcane, but servants of all kinds are always welcome, no matter their profession.", "Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust. For even friends serve their own ends, $c. Our great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can.", "Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council's rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me! Look at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council." },
	["尼普希"] = { "You'll find no finer rat kabob this side of Khaz Modan!" },
	["尼特布尔·火花"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. You want some advice? Befriend a mage! We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..." },
	["尼瑞尔"] = { "Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master. I will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain.", "Greetings, miss. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master. I will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain.", "Greetings, sir. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master. I will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain." },
	["尼艾丝队长"] = { "We must take what is ours. Our survival depends on it." },
	["尼莎·影歌"] = { "The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust. Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause." },
	["尼莎·火石"] = { "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["尼达"] = { "I think my necklace fell in the lake. My daddy got it for me, and he's gonna be mad now.", "Thank you $g mister : miss; for finding my necklace! You're the best!", "Thank you miss for finding my necklace! You're the best!", "Thank you mister for finding my necklace! You're the best!" },
	["屠杀者杜维尔"] = { "We must not allow the Alliance to expand their power base in Arathi! Even their miniscule Refuge Pointe may one day grow to threaten us." },
	["山德"] = { "If you're expecting some kind of official welcome, you're going to be disappointed, $c. We don't stand on tradition, here. What works is what goes." },
	["山达尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["山迪·格罗斯"] = { "Are you surprised to see me here? Everyone needs clean laundry, and what better way to do it than with your own water elemental? Simply bring your laundry, pay a nominal fee, and before you know it, everything will be fresh and clean!" },
	["岩石猎鹰"] = { "<The creature pecks at your hand.>", "<The falcon squawks hungrily for a grub.>" },
	["峡谷之灵"] = { "Do you have the understanding to continue, shaman? Do you know why you are here?", "Your work here is complete, shaman. Return to your people." },
	["巡山人卡德雷尔"] = { "Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan! Thelsamar is a nice place, but it's not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty! If you're willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers' League." },
	["巡山人贝波蒂"] = { "Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters. So the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way.", "I don't care to hear it, $N. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO! If I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened.", "I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge. Yes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?", "I'll tell you what. Since you fancy yourself the hero type, if you can make your way through the Badlands to the Searing Gorge and bring me back something to prove your heroics, I'll see what I can do about getting you a key. In the southeasternmost corner of Searing Gorge is a lady almost as tough as me, Margol the Rager. Maybe you should investigate.", "Invulnerable?", "You're a fool that should heed my warnings. No one is invulnerable. You would be wise to remember that bit of advice." },
	["工兵斯迪尔林"] = { "I've seen a lot of things in my time, but the change that came over the Explorers' League in the Whisper Gulch takes the cake. I'm just glad that I got out of there with my skin intact!" },
	["工匠"] = { "I'm very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me." },
	["工匠大师欧沃斯巴克"] = { "I am Tinkmaster Overspark, and I am the chief architect for modern gnomish engineering principles in the world today. It is my job to ensure that the power of invention continues to shine brightest from our arclight spanners than anywhere else! Also, if you happen to know a good schematic for radiation elimination, we just so happen to be in the market for one right about now..." },
	["工匠威尔海姆"] = { "Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines." },
	["工头伊蕾娜·石衣"] = { "Aren't you a sight for sore eyes! There's work to be done and not much time." },
	["工头努埃尔"] = { "Negotiations? NEGOTIATIONS! Allow me to make our stance perfectly clear. We are a free people, able to do whatever we want and come and go as we please. The Cenarion Expedition does not own this mountain range. There will be no negotiations! Now, go back to the druids and tell them that we will continue to do as we please.", "The Blade's Edge Mountains are a place of great opportunity. How unfortunate that some deem themselves above all others on matters that pertain to taking advantage of such opportunities. Who do the Cenarion Expedition think they are to tell us what we can and cannot do here?" },
	["工头奥菲斯特"] = { "Welcome to Thorium Point. As Overseer, I'm responsible for all the activities of the Thorium Brotherhood. While that mainly involves mining, smithing, and some minor guard duty, we've lately become more of a martial organization... out of necessity." },
	["工头希兰娜"] = { "Don't they teach you new recruits anything? These manaforges were built from parts of Tempest Keep designed to siphon energy from the nether. The naaru used this technology to power their vessel during its travels. Some said the technology might not be safe to use on land. They were promptly silenced.", "Working with this technology is a huge headache. Everything is constructed in such an alien way." },
	["工头拉泽克拉兹"] = { "All muscle and no brain, that's what peons are! They're great when you can motivate them, but they have to be 'kick' started, if you know what I mean." },
	["工头比格姆斯"] = { "Can't thank ya enough fer helpin' with the mines. Now, it's just a matter of convincing the miners to get back to work.", "Haven't got much time to talk, $r. That is, unless you're willin' to help with this mine trouble." },
	["工头瓦尔库勒·龙息"] = { "I got nothing new for you, kid. You've outgrown manual labor..." },
	["工头萨杜恩·日落"] = { "Day in, day out, all we do is toil in this mine. The blood elf male was not built for such manual labor." },
	["工头葛瑞尔斯"] = { "Dedicated to those that fell to the Scourge during the war in the frozen wastes." },
	["工程学博士沃米萨"] = { "Busy, busy! So much to do, so little time! Now where did I put that pyrospanner? I know it's around here somewhere... I burned my fingers on it just a moment ago!" },
	["工程师布尔克"] = { "Hey, $g buddy : ma'am;. I've seen you around. Mind getting me out of here?", "Hey, buddy. I've seen you around. Mind getting me out of here?", "Hey, ma'am. I've seen you around. Mind getting me out of here?", "I think I saw them take him over by the north side of the abbey, near the archery targets.", "I think they have her down near the gallows.", "I think they put him in a cage over near the lumbermill." },
	["工程师戴罗"] = { "Greetings, $c. I have been sent here from the Exodar to oversee the construction of Azure Watch." },
	["工程师欧格林德"] = { "Can't you see that I'm busy?" },
	["工程师菲纳特"] = { "How'd I ever let Petrov talk me into coming out here with these incompetent dwarves?!" },
	["工程师辛蓓"] = { "I can instruct you in engineering. Interested?" },
	["工程师里德"] = { "Gerk, Burr, Dargath: all gone... It's just MacKellar and I left out here. I hope you've brought some good news." },
	["左撇子帕德姆普"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["巨人杀手乌芙达"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["巨熊之灵"] = { "I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid. You have come to me to learn this strength, young one, and I will teach this to you. I will teach you all that is the spirit bear, provided you will listen and understand. In order to know what it means to draw upon my spirit, you need to understand the importance of the strength of the body, as well as the strength of the heart.", "It remains to be seen if you are ready, young one. Even the wisest and oldest of druids are never truly ready when their ultimate time of testing comes. You have heard my words, and now you must move on. Heed what I have taught you. There will be a time when you will have your strength tested. You must face your foe as the bear would - with strength of body and with strength of heart. Learn from the fight, young one. Go... with my blessings.", "Strength of the body is the power and swiftness of action. You must keep yourself fit at all times, both physically and mentally. The bear's girth highlights its strength, as it is a ferocious foe in combat. The bear's girth, however, belies its lithe agility and sharp mind. These are surprises you will use to your advantage. You must rely on the strength of the bear's body in order to master the way of the Claw.", "Strength of the heart is what gives you the resolve to take action... action that is rooted in intents that are pure and forthright. To keep the balance is not to be complacent or banal. You must show resolve for that which you believe in, and you must be willing to fight for it. The mother bear shows endless conviction in protecting her young, as does an elder bear protecting his den. It is this resolve, this strength of heart, which you must come to know if you are to master the way of the Claw.", "The bear looks at you calmy and patiently, but says nothing.", "The bear spirit looks upon you with a calm and peaceful gaze. You hear a voice speak to you as though it was coming from the bear, but the creature makes no indication that it is speaking. \"Greetings, my young friend. If you have come to me seeking guidance, then perhaps I can help you find what you seek.\"" },
	["巨石长者"] = { "Elder Dawnstrider can be found at Flame Crest on the Burning Steppes.", "Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind.", "Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake.", "Winterhoof? I hear he's living it up in Booty Bay." },
	["巨魔平民"] = { "The most amazing of the Lunar Festival parties is in Moonglade. Don't walk there, though, the druids in the Valley of Wisdom can transport you." },
	["巨魔幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["巫医尤克里"] = { "Existing in this area are many creatures considered allies of the night elves. The elves have had access to the power within each of these creatures; it is time that the horde be allowed this same satisfaction. I have devised a way that this power can be captured and used for our benefit. Do not doubt what I tell you, $N. Help me, and you shall see that I speak truth." },
	["巫医库弗"] = { "It saddens all of us to see the Drakkari destroying themselves this way. The power that they gain from killing the natural gods of the land is transitory. What is gained in the short run will be lost to them for all eternity." },
	["巫医托尔加什"] = { "Now don't you be thinkin' about tryin' to make off with me baby murlocs! I got the eyes of a hawk and ears like... ears like... like somethin' with mighty powerful ears!" },
	["巫医玛艾里"] = { "Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far... Yah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions! Go, now.", "Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power.", "Da Cache of Mau'ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself. Keeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e'ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e'ko, you bring it ta Mau'ari.", "E'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation. I know an incantation dat can transform da e'ko you find, and turn it into juju. You can den take the Cache of Mau'ari, an' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself. C'mon, give it a try. Bring da e'ko ta Mau'ari an' we have some fun.", "E'ko is da unfocused form of the supernatural power, and Juju is da concentrated essence. By using a stong incantation, I can transform da E'ko into Juju. Once it becomes Juju, you can den use the Cache of Mau'ari ta reflect da powers onto yourself.", "Mau'ari know why you seek her out... Bring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you." },
	["巫医赫兹托克"] = { "May de spirits guide ya, $c." },
	["巫女麦兰达"] = { "Do you require an illusion? Should your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise. Should you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives.", "These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly." },
	["巫师上尉莫尔兰"] = { "Be careful among the ruins, $c. The Kirin Tor spirits you find there will not recognize you as a friend. The custodian and I are the only ones whose spirits retained a strong enough tie to this place to preserve our full identities in death." },
	["巫师阿克鲁比"] = { "At last! I am finally free from this cell! The Kirin Tor sent me from Dalaran to investigate Arugal's progress with the undead here in Silverpine Forest. Little did we know that the wizard had lost his grasp on sanity. I must report this mess at once! But before I leave, allow me to undo the magical lock on the courtyard door. You defeated Rethilgore, perhaps you will survive what lies beyond..." },
	["巴兹克·布拉斯温"] = { "I've been working on a way to transport oil underground between major cities, but everyone tells me it's a pipe dream." },
	["巴兹尔·弗莱伊"] = { "I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies." },
	["巴内斯"] = { "Finally, everything is in place. Are you ready for your big stage debut?" },
	["巴图恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, brother, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, sister, but I cannot train you." },
	["巴尔图斯·弗勒"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not waste my time, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The warrior's role is one of protection. Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["巴尔度·锐眼"] = { "Hello, $c. I've set up camp here at the Bulwark to make my preparations for my journey into the Plaguelands. I've heard rumor that a great human wizard took up residency in Hearthglen not terribly long ago. He was commissioned by the Scarlet Crusade to fashion their warriors and hunters new bows and guns. It's said that he completed a remarkable weapon before the Crusade killed him. I guess their mistrust of the arcane has grown." },
	["巴尔雷"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["巴尼尔·石罐"] = { "Master Nesingwary has a big hunt ahead of him. I find helping him prepare for a day in the jungle is much more relaxing than helping him ready for combat. Although I do miss some of those glorious moments on the battlefield." },
	["巴巴加亚·影隙"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["巴巴罗·阿克巴斯"] = { "The exiles of Gnomeregan find ourselves in even more dire straits by running low on cloth reserves! Perhaps you can help us, eh?! Bring me extra cloth pieces you might have to help us replenish our stocks. By donating them, you'll be earning the respect and trust of gnomes everywhere. That's something that money can't buy! Well, I guess cloth does, but that's beside the point..." },
	["巴布·拉扎尔"] = { "A lot you know... Some say they're just observing, some think they're altering our sea-life, and then others think they're here to take over Azeroth! Once I take one down with my rocket propelled warheads I'll get the answers. You can believe that!", "Don't be fooled, $r. They're very elusive. One moment they're there, the next they're gone - virtually inexplicable! Between you and me, I actually held a piece of one in my hand once! Sadly, before I could conduct any measurements it was gone! Just disappeared...", "Hey, $c, did you see that? Out there, lingering near the water's surface... You saw it too didn't ya?", "Listen here, now. When you're looking for answers nothing beats a good explosion - the bigger, the better! But that's probably enough with the questions for now, $r. My warheads are classified material, and the element 115 that I created to power them is even more classified! In fact, it's best that you just return to your everyday life and pretend we never met.", "The wha-?? Well, I refer to them as undefined floating obstructions. And where I'm from, most deny their existence entirely. But I know better! I've even seen 'em up close! My recent years have been spent building this vessel to locate, track, document, and if needs be, eradicate them!" },
	["巴布芬克"] = { "Howdy, $r! If you're lookin' for a shredder to ride, you'll need to head on up into the hills. This one's out of commission.", "My brother, Synipus has lots of them. You should head up north to Blue Sky Logging Grounds and talk to him.", "Well, before all the hostilities broke out here we were fixing them up to harvest the local trees. Lately, though, they've been forced into service against the Horde. Turns out they make for a pretty fine fighting machine. If you've got a key, you'd be silly not to use it!" },
	["巴希尔·克罗"] = { "The steam-powered Alliance icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands, across the sea in the Eastern Kingdoms." },
	["巴希尔·奥斯古德"] = { "Rest your weary bones for a spell." },
	["巴德"] = { "<Budd holds very still, pretending not to hear you. Looking closely you see a bit of drool drip from under his mask.>", "<Budd rocks back and forth on his haunches, muttering something that sounds like troll speech.>", "I can only assume that you know who I am. And yet you insist on disturbing me? What could you possibly want that requires my attention?", "Listen, $c, it's clear that you and your friends know your way around Azeroth. Surely you've come across certain folks who hunger for fame and fortune. Send me anyone who might be willing to enter Zul'Aman and I'll make it worth your while.", "Troll powah, mon!", "What be wrong wit you, mon? Ain't ya never seen a troll before?" },
	["巴德拉克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["巴柯斯特"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["巴珊娜·符文图腾"] = { "Greetings, noble $c. This humble servant of the Cenarion Circle wishes blessings and bounties be given unto you and yours." },
	["巴瑞特·克罗斯"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["巴蒂"] = { "By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?" },
	["巴里姆·裂蹄"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["巴隆·朗绍尔"] = { "<The Baron lifts his manacles.> Come on then, $c. Do ye trust me?", "Well? Don't ye have heads ta roll an' treasure ta dig up?", "What're ye starin' at, $r? Come ta torment the condemned?" },
	["巴鲁斯"] = { "Well met master of Rod and Reel! If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up! On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!" },
	["布伦希尔达驭熊者"] = { "The Hyldsmeet is sacred. Whoever earns victory is assured a lifetime next to Thorim." },
	["布兰度尔·铁锤"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the Light protect you this day.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid." },
	["布兰斯托克·卡德尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "I hope the Light is with you, $N. Is there anything I can do for you today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["布兰顿上尉"] = { "Little hairier out here than you expected, $r? Can't say I'm surprised. I hear that from most everyone who makes it this far." },
	["布兹"] = { "What's your pleasure? Pull up a seat and knock one back. I'm Boots, lead mixologist for B.O.O.M. and bartender extraordinaire! If it's got kick, Ol' Boots can give it to ya." },
	["布利克斯·菲克维特"] = { "Brewfest has undergone some changes since its first year. We now issue Brewfest tokens instead of tickets. If you have old tickets, I can exchange them for you.", "Hey friend, what I've got here is a breakthrough, the likes of which have never been seen! And it's for sale, for cheap! You see, I got tired of spending money in taverns looking for the perfect person. So I made these goggles and now EVERYONE looks like pure perfection. I mean you CAN'T go wrong with these puppies! So, you wanna try these out, help pad my pockets a bit? Since you look soo good, I'll even give you a discount!", "I saw you across the way and was hoping you were going to stop by. So what can I do for you sweetie?", "You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club? Those gals love to party. If they had their way, Brewfest would never end! Sometimes last year, it felt like it didn't. But now they've figured, the best way to keep the Brewfest spirit going would be to allow people to join their club. For a small fee, just a few tokens, you can join! You get brew mailed to you every month and a chance to buy that same brew if you like it. It's cutting edge stuff and a way to make sure that Brewfest's spirit is never really gone." },
	["布劳恩"] = { "We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can't fight us off forever. Then they'll pay for enslaving us. We'll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery." },
	["布劳格·幽魂"] = { "Greetings, $c. Is there something I can help you with?", "My question to you is this, $c: Which of the Aspects created by the titans became the nefarious creature known as Deathwing?" },
	["布卢克"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["布尔斯"] = { "I lived in Dire Maul for a little bit. That was fun. Really.", "I need a second head like I need to lose my first one.", "Move along, rube.", "This ain't a ride, clem. Beat it.", "Unlike most ogres, I do know what an outhouse is for - giving you a swirlie. Now beat it.", "You mess with Silas, you mess with me. Have a nice day." },
	["布尔鲁格"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["布拉古尔"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.", "Throm'ka $c! Are you ready to fight for the Horde at Warsong Gulch?" },
	["布拉斯·炸雷"] = { "Woah, woah, woah! Keep it down, $N. Keep it down! <Blast looks around.> We don't want those frosty vrykul noticing us, now do we? What do you think of my jumpbot? I based it off of the mechagnome. Pretty slick, huh?" },
	["布拉斯博特·机钳"] = { "Good day, $N. If you require my services as an auctioneer, I regret to inform you: no. Only grand master engineers possess the minimum intellectual capacity to interface with my superior functions. More importantly, why are you still talking to me?" },
	["布拉森"] = { "I can take you to Durnholde directly, if that is your wish.", "You should recieve a pack of incendiary bombs from Erozion before I fly you to Durnholde. You wouldn't want to waste time, after all." },
	["布拉贡·血拳"] = { "Varimathras? No, he hasn't reported in for some time. No doubt he's off on an errand of importance for his queen." },
	["布拉高克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["布洛冈·石盾"] = { "Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?", "Aye lad are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?", "Aye lass are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?", "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley." },
	["布洛格"] = { "Brogg is glad Mudsprocket goblins have let him stay here, but sometimes thinks he hears them laughing at him." },
	["布瑞克·石蹄"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["布瑞尔索恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further. Move along please.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["布瑟恩·草风"] = { "If you're looking for a flight back to Rut'theran Village, then you should talk to my night elven counterpart, Silva Fil'naveth.", "In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore. Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue. It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it. You'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant. Use it wisely.", "The waters of Westfall is where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore. An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water. The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue. Look for a natural formation to aid you, $N - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath.", "Would you like a flight to Thunder Bluff, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?", "You're not a druid!" },
	["布科雷克·怒拳"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["布罗姆"] = { "I'M COOKIN HERE!" },
	["布罗姆·基里安"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["布罗莫斯·格鲁诺尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid." },
	["布莉亚娜"] = { "Icefang has carried me through countless battles. Don't let her lack of armor fool you. She's the toughest bear I know." },
	["布莱中士"] = { "Help! My band and I have been captured by trolls, and they're going to sacrifice us! Get us out of here and I'll give you anything you want.", "Thanks a lot, $N. We couldn't have made it without you. Oh, and if I had mentioned before something about repaying you for saving us, well... you can forget it!" },
	["布莱恩·铜须"] = { "<Brann looks at you expectantly.>", "It's a good thing you guys showed up! The Iron Dwarves have pushed us back to this location, and we're barely managing to hold the line here. Even worse, they've begun to power up their magical defenses. If we don't attack soon, they'll be able to annihilate us in the blink of an eye! We've managed to rebuild several siege machines, demolishers and motorcycles from the Alliance and Horde expeditions that were here before us. However, all of our pilots died in the last assault. You must take the vehicles and storm the gates of Ulduar! Please, $n! You're our last hope!", "There are secrets contained within these halls that are beyond our wildest dreams.", "There you are! I think I've just about got this door figured out. Let me know when you're ready and I'll open'er up!" },
	["布莱纳·火崖"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "I hope the Light is with you, $N. Is there anything I can do for you today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["布蕾卡·狼女"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["布赖恩·克罗斯"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["布里克·基克拉夫"] = { "Yeah? Of course I'm a smith. What, you think Dwarves are the only ones worth their weight in anvils? Fine, be that way. Go get a dwarf to help you!" },
	["布里维夫·石拳"] = { "Bixi Wobblebonk in this very shop can train ye in daggers. If ye're still looking abroad, anyone else - Woo Ping in Stormwind, Handiir in the Exodar, and Ilyenia Moonfire in Darnassus - can show ye a thing or two. Me, I was never one fer knife fights.", "Bixi here can teach ye how to lob throwin' weapons. If Darnassus is more yer speed, talk to Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace there.", "Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can show ye how to use a bow.", "My plucky companion Bixi Wobblebonk here can train ye in crossbows. If ye're looking for other trainers, though, ye might want to try Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, or maybe the draenei weapon master, Handiir, in the Trader's Tier within the Exodar.", "Staves are taught by both Woo Ping, the master found at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, and Ilyenia Moonfire, who trains the night elves on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus.", "There are two masters of the sword: Handiir and Woo Ping. The former can be found in the Trader's Tier of the Exodar, and the latter in Weller's Arsenal within Stormwind.", "What weapon were ye lookin' to learn?", "Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind.", "Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye? Well don't stand there slack-jawed, speak up $gladdie : lassie;!", "Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye? Well don't stand there slack-jawed, speak up laddie!", "Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye? Well don't stand there slack-jawed, speak up lassie!" },
	["布隆克"] = { "Just a minor adjustment here... ah there we go!" },
	["布隆恩·菲兹维克"] = { "What can I do for you, $N? Make it quick, I don't have all day!" },
	["布隆薇·硬锤"] = { "Borgrim might be correct. Maybe we do need to take a break. But now that we're here, I'm eager to get my hands dirty and study what this land has to offer." },
	["布雷依克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["布雷格"] = { "<hic> It be lonely in here without me mateys, $g lad:lass;.", "<hic> It be lonely in here without me mateys, lad.", "<hic> It be lonely in here without me mateys, lass." },
	["布霍达"] = { "We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["布鲁克·石衣"] = { "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lass, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me." },
	["布鲁沃·斩铁"] = { "The hammers of the earthen stand united behind Bouldercrag. We will oppose Loken's minions to the end." },
	["布鲁贝克·雷足"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["帅哥泰里"] = { "I never understood why some pirates bury their treasure. Me... I like to keep it within arm's reach." },
	["希克瓦"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["希兹克·古斯提"] = { "Welcome to my shop, $c. What is it the Goodstitch brothers can do for you?" },
	["希利苏斯护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["希利苏斯护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["希塔尔·达克门德"] = { "Consider all of the suffering that the Scarlets have caused over the years. The torture, the zealotry, the murder. I won't allow that to continue. Will you?" },
	["希多尔米"] = { "This portal leads to the Caverns of Time, deep beneath the earth in far-off Tanaris. I possess the power to send you there, should you so desire." },
	["希尔"] = { "Gezhe has been really nice letting me come here to apprentice and learn all of this fun stuff, $g mister : ma'am;. <Jheel hangs his head.> But, I hate being away from my sister.", "Gezhe has been really nice letting me come here to apprentice and learn all of this fun stuff, ma'am. <Jheel hangs his head.> But, I hate being away from my sister.", "Gezhe has been really nice letting me come here to apprentice and learn all of this fun stuff, mister. <Jheel hangs his head.> But, I hate being away from my sister." },
	["希尔·符文图腾"] = { "$N, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother. May your ancestors watch over you $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["希尔拉"] = { "Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?" },
	["希尔斯布莱德护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["希尔斯布莱德护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["希尔瓦·菲纳雯斯"] = { "If you're looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind.", "In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution. The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste. In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $N. Be warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such. You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose.", "In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood. As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where deepest parts of the ocean begin. A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due it its shape is where you may find what you seek. Be warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory.", "Would you like a flight to Rut'theran Village, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?", "You're not a druid!" },
	["希尔瓦娜·林月"] = { "Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life." },
	["希尔瓦娜斯·风行者"] = { "I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you must keep moving. Arthas will soon realize that we're here.", "Speak quickly; I don't have time to waste on idle chatter. The Forsaken have become a force to be reckoned with, but there is still much to do in a given day. This city doesn't run itself. What do you want?", "We have no time to waste, $c. Why do you delay here?" },
	["希弗里克斯"] = { "If I can make a new war machine, I know I can get a pretty penny for it over at the Wrath Gate. Some of our previous iterations haven't been entirely... stable, but my flying machine should do the trick if I can just develop an effective bomb system for it." },
	["希德·利巴迪"] = { "Sid's the name. It's nice to see some new faces around here. What can I do you for?" },
	["希恩·逐星"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["希拉·雪晨"] = { "Nice to see you again, $N." },
	["希拉斯·暗月"] = { "Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth! Please, step right up and take in all we have to offer. Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world! We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!", "It's not always about money, clem! While we receive generous donations - some extremely substantial - our traveling troupe of performers is fueled creatively by a need to brighten this war-torn world. Don't worry about us, but instead let us worry about how to best entertain you." },
	["希欧曼·格瑞菲斯"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["希达奈尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?", "Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?", "I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child. I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["帕乌·霜蹄"] = { "Come in out of the cold and rest your weary bones a while. Our hospitality is yours." },
	["帕卡特·钢皮"] = { "Welcome to my shop!", "[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor...", "[Furbolg] Poorov'tarkh!", "[Furbolg] Yar vartslaf?" },
	["帕尼亚"] = { "Need me to take care of your animal companions?" },
	["帕沙恩"] = { "<The arakkoa favors you with a haunted gaze and alternates between looking at you and looking through you.> What have our efforts wrought, but a greater abomination than we sought to prevent?" },
	["帕科瓦·芬塔拉斯"] = { "It's always nice when someone wishes to speak to me. How are things with you, $c?", "Now, answer me this, $N: Which creature became the Lich King before spreading the plague across Lordaeron?" },
	["帕达尔"] = { "Creation of Jewelry and Gems is what I live for. Can I share my passion with you?" },
	["常青林德鲁伊"] = { "Death's Door is a portal that opens upon the world that the Burning Legion uses to breed their fel hounds and other canine-like terrors. Any time that you see one of those creatures, that is where it came from, and it passes through here, first. Lately, we became aware that the Burning Legion have ramped up their summoning of these creatures through the portal. You must shut down Death's Door before it becomes an inexorable tide, and all is lost!" },
	["平凡的西蒙妮"] = { "What a wonderful day to be alive! Look at the beauty that surrounds you, friend. Enjoy what life has to give!" },
	["幻术师卡琳娜"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["幽暗城冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["幽暗城勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["幽暗城狂欢者"] = { "Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...", "There's nothing like a little Lunar celebration to warm your bones!", "This beam of moonlight leads to the Undercity. Retire when ready.", "You have to be careful lighting fireworks when you can't feel your fingers..." },
	["幽林长者"] = { "Elder Graveborn spends time near Brill in Tirisfal Glades.", "Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.", "Elder Snowcrown can be found in Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "Elder Windrun resides in the Crown Guard Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["幽魂之地护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["库加托克"] = { "Be wary, $c. The forest is full of hidden dangers and potential enemies." },
	["库勒"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?", "I would train you, but you are no warrior.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["库卡隆监视者"] = { "Arthur Moore is the leatherworker. He tends the trainees over in the Rogues' Quarter, on the inner ring.", "Doctor Herbert Halsey is who you want. Just don't try anything funny. Any more of that plague nonsense and you'll find an axe in uncomfortable places.", "Eunice Burch cooks what passes for food here over in the Trade Quarter. It's your stomach, not mine.", "Even the walking dead need to mend themselves. Mary Edras handles it here. She's in the Rogues' Quarter, on the inner ring.", "Go to the Magic Quarter and head to the inner ring. The tailor's there.", "Go to the outer ring of the Rogues' Quarter if you want to find rogues.", "Good to see someone wanting to learn something useful. Head to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter.", "Head to the Apothecarium's inner ring. Martha Alliestar is there, and she'll instruct you in herbalism.", "Head to the central ring; you'll find auctioneers stationed there.", "Hope you're not looking for those abominations. The apothecaries can't be trusted, and that means none of their little constructs patrolling the halls. We're here to keep things safe.", "I bet you rotters thought you were pretty clever at the Wrath Gate, didn't you? Playtime's over. We're here to make sure you don't try anything.", "I don't blame you for wanting to get out of here. Go up topside and head north of the ruins. The zeppelins leave from the two towers there.", "I don't know what he's trying to catch there, but Armand Cromwell is on the dock in the Magic Quarter.", "I'll tell you what you need to know, but I don't have to like it. We're watching you and your kind.", "If you need keys, talk to Walter Soref in the Rogues' Quarter, but watch yourself.", "If you really trust some undead with your pets, you can talk to Anya Maulray at the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.", "If you want to access the market here, get to the central ring of the city.", "If you want to find a paladin, you'll have to go to the Royal Quarter. There's some elf there who can teach you.", "If you want to learn enchanting, go find Lavinia Crowe on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.", "If you want to learn how to skin things, head to the Rogues' Quarter. The skinner has his place on the inner ring.", "If you want to learn how to wield weapons, go to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter.", "If you want to learn to mine, talk to Brom Killian at the inner ring of the War Quarter.", "In the War Quarter is where you'll find the warriors. Head to the outer ring there.", "Innkeeper Norman keeps a dusty crack in the wall he calls an inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.", "It's right in the center of the city. The hub of the wheel.", "James Van Brunt runs a decent forge in the War Quarter. He's on the inner ring.", "Lavinia Crowe's the local enchanter. She's set up shop on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.", "Lok'tar. Don't try anything suspicious around here. If these undead are going to be part of the Horde, they're going to mind themselves under our watch.", "Look, if you want to go talk to those engineers on the outer ring of the Rogues' Quarter, it's your hide.", "Mages? They're in the Magic Quarter, in the central building. Thought you'd be smart enough to figure that out.", "Mailbox? You want to head to the inn in the center of the city's upper ring. It's right there.", "Mary Edras is the one you want. She's set up at the inner ring of the Rogues' Quarter.", "Michael Garrett tends the Undercity's bats. He's in the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.", "Naznik's the local barber. He set up shop on the top ring of the Trade Quarter.", "On the outer ring of the Magic Quarter you'll find a large, stepped building. That's where the mages hide.", "Surprised to see an orc here? Don't be. The forsaken need watching. If we'd been paying closer attention from the start, maybe the Wrath Gate wouldn't have happened.", "The bank? It's that tower in the middle of the Trade Quarter.", "The bat handler has his roost on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. You can't miss the smell.", "The battlemasters are stationed in the Royal Quarter; you'll find them around the throne room.", "The blacksmith here works in the War Quarter, close to where his weapons will be put to use. He's there on the inner ring.", "The city's leatherworker is in the inner ring of the Rogues' Quarter.", "The cook around here is in the Trade Quarter. Her name's Eunice Burch.", "The crazy fisherman is on the dock in the Magic Quarter.", "The engineer here is called Franklin Lloyd. He tinkers in the Rogues' Quarter, on the outer ring.", "The guild master handles his business in the Trade Quarter. He's up on the eastern platform.", "The guild master is Christopher Drakul. He's on the eastern platform in the Trade Quarter.", "The herbalist around here is Martha Alliestar. She's over on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.", "The inn - if you can call it that - is on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. They don't even have beds.", "The mailbox is in the Trade Quarter by that coffin storage closet they call an inn.", "The miner here works in the War Quarter on the inner ring. His name's Brom Killian.", "The priests are located on the outer ring of the War Quarter.", "The rogues are in the Rogues' Quarter. Simple as that. Look for them on the outer ring.", "The scribe of the city is in the Apothecarium, someone named Margaux Parchley.", "The skinner here is named Killian Hagey. He works in the Rogues' Quarter on the inner ring.", "The tailor here's Josef Gregorian. He's in the Magic Quarter on the inner ring.", "The warriors are in the War Quarter, practicing on the outer ring.", "The zeppelin towers are just north of the Undercity.", "Us have skinning hook. We get it from Killian Hagey who teach us how to skin kills. You have nice skin. You find him on inner ring of Rogues' Quarter.", "What's wrong, bonebag? Looking for someone else? I'm all you've got now, so if you want something, make it quick.", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "With the bulk of Undercity's forces deployed to Vengeance Landing in Northrend, the Warchief has sent us to reinforce the city's defenses.", "You can talk to Anya Maulray up by the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. I wouldn't recommend it, but they're your pets.", "You have guts asking me about warlocks. Go to the Magic Quarter's outer ring and get out of my sight.", "You'll find the warlocks in the Magic Quarter's main building, but I better not hear of any trouble that comes of this.", "You'll find them in the Apothecarium. Names are Doctor Herbert Halsey and Doctor Marsh. Just watch your back." },
	["库尔·锐角"] = { "I supply the Hold with various relics required for spellcasting as well as other alchemical reagents." },
	["库尔丁·血爪"] = { "Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch? Lok'tar Ogar $c!", "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch." },
	["库尔菲斯·暗鳞"] = { "Begone, overseer! We've already spoken. Stop dragging your feet and execute your orders at Ruuan Weald!", "I don't want excuses, I demand results! You think what we're doing here is a joke? If we don't do this right, then not only will the so-called do-gooders come calling, but we'll be found unworthy for elevation within the ranks of the Blackwing. Is that what you want?", "Nuaar, are you feeling well? You don't look like yourself today.", "Right, the meeting. Let's get down to it then. The fact is that the lumber and livestock being gathered from the Ruuan Weald, which you're responsible for, has slowed to a trickle. We need those resources, but you've allowed the druids of the Cenarion Expedition to get in the way!", "That's the spirit! I'm glad that we had this little meeting. I feel much better about the attack now. With leaders like you on the front, how can we lose? Alright, you have your marching orders. Now get back to the Ruuan Weald and make it happen!", "We're putting the final preparations together even as we speak. The rest will depend upon how quickly you can organize your forces at Ruuan Weald. Do you think that you can handle that and get it done quickly?", "You could at least try to sound a little bit convincing. Look, Nuaar, I wasn't going to tell you this, but I might as well because it's going to involve you, too. Maxnar is planning an all-out attack on the druids at Ruuan Weald. And he intends to wipe them out. It's bad enough that we've been fighting with the Boulder'mok ogres, so we can't afford another front to deal with. I've arranged for a temporary truce with the arakkoa. Well, what do you think?" },
	["库尔迪拉·织亡者"] = { "<Koltira groans.>", "All this fighting is finally getting to you, $N. Do not worry, I will not divulge your little secret -- lest the others think you're mad. Get some rest. It'll do you good.", "Leave me be, fool!", "You're wasting time. Go kill the minions of the Lich King, $c!" },
	["库彻"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["库德里恩"] = { "I can instruct you in enchanting. Interested?" },
	["库洛尔"] = { "<Chu'a'lor's left head says,> We find your zeal to help us most appealing... <His right head concludes,> ... and we want you to know that we greatly appreciate your efforts!", "First you became $g king : queen; of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri'la. This is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof. I thank you, $N, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!", "First you became king of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri'la. This is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof. I thank you, $N, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!", "First you became queen of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri'la. This is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof. I thank you, $N, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!", "On behalf of all of Ogri'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, $N. <Chu'a'lor's left head nods while his right head smiles at you.> And do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a $g king : queen; to.", "On behalf of all of Ogri'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, $N. <Chu'a'lor's left head nods while his right head smiles at you.> And do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a king to.", "On behalf of all of Ogri'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, $N. <Chu'a'lor's left head nods while his right head smiles at you.> And do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a queen to.", "The relics are truly a great mystery. Perhaps by studying them regularly, you will gain a finer appreciation of their capabilities.", "Welcome to Ogri'la, $c. The ogres here have managed to gain a great mental acuity through the magical emanations of the surrounding crystals. Though we do not fully understand how they work, we have come to appreciate our new home and only want to live in peace. Unfortunate then that the demons and ethereals, and especially the Black Dragonflight, will not leave us to that peace.", "Your name is beginning to be revered around here. <Chu'a'lor's left eye pierces you with its stony gaze.> Keep up the good work, $N!" },
	["库里姆"] = { "I can instruct you in leatherworking. Interested?" },
	["库雷"] = { "If not the gods, who? How? What could cause such strife?", "Legion? Demons? They hunt you? My people have also been hunted by Legion: Targeted by their dark masters for damnation. <Cowlen wipes the tears away.> It is the reason that I moved my family here oh-so-many years ago.", "What could I have done to give the gods cause to lash out at me with such ferocity? All that I cherished is gone - dead or destroyed. My family taken from me by the brutes of the forest. My home razed. My ship sunk. I am a broken man, stranded on a broken island. Perhaps you are you here to finish the job? Make it quick, I will not resist. Take my life, stranger; I am too cowardly to do it myself. My hand shivers... the blade will not strike true." },
	["库雷尼斗士"] = { "Well look at you. Aren't you big and tough... Maybe you think you're tough enough to step into the Ring of Blood and face the Warmaul champion? <The pitfighter laughs.> Not very likely but if you ever wanna test your strength, the Ring of Blood is far to the north against the mountains dividing Nagrand and Zangarmarsh. Gurgthock runs the show at the old Laughing Skull Ruins and he also dispenses the prizes. Speaking of prizes, I hear the prizes this season are incredible!" },
	["库雷恩"] = { "I once served Medivh... or pretended to. I helped the Violet Eye keep a close eye on the Master. But now all I can think of is... making horseshoes. Over and over.", "You know about the Violet Eye then? Maybe I'll have time for you later. I have to get back to my work." },
	["度戈鲁"] = { "The Exodar's once-vast supply of textiles has dwindled dangerously low. Your reputation with the draenei here would increase were you to assist us by donating cloth." },
	["廷克维斯"] = { "What? You want something?" },
	["建筑师尼莫斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. Before the night elves invited the draenei to join them here, this glade was all but forgotten. The kaldorei are deeply tied to these lands, and we draenei are honored that they have asked us to share in the task of revitalizing Forest Song." },
	["弗亚林·霜眉"] = { "Where there are frostborn, there are eagles. They've been our allies for longer than I've walked the land... and I'm not exactly young anymore, $G laddy:lass;.", "Where there are frostborn, there are eagles. They've been our allies for longer than I've walked the land... and I'm not exactly young anymore, laddy.", "Where there are frostborn, there are eagles. They've been our allies for longer than I've walked the land... and I'm not exactly young anymore, lass." },
	["弗兰克林·洛伊德"] = { "I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!" },
	["弗兰克罗恩·铸铁"] = { "Greetings, $r. I am Franclorn Forgewright. Are you here to learn of the Spire and of Dark Iron?", "I had no choice, or so I thought. I would endure the destruction of Thaurissan and stand by the side of my king and his people. Under the control of Ragnaros, King Dagran Thaurissan tore out the heart of this mountain and erected Blackrock Spire. We worked tirelessly to build a dwarven city mightier than any city or fortress that came before... or would come after.", "I stood by and watched the corruption of Ragnaros seep through the hearts and minds of the Dark Iron nation. This once honorable race, driven to madness... to evil. When the construction of the Spire was complete, my will to live amongst my people gave way. I passed as a hero of the new nation of Dark Iron. This tomb was placed here - at the entrance to the city I planned and built - in honor of my efforts.", "My great hammer, Ironfel, was handed down to the new chief architect, Fineous Darkvire: A man of despicable motive and little talent. This is where you come in, $N. I want him stopped. He is too inept to harness the true power of Ironfel, but should one come after him with the aptitude to use Ironfel to its full potential, the destruction they could cause with their creations would be disastrous to this world." },
	["弗兰卡·石桥"] = { "I'll tell you 'then what.' She went runnin' straight for the hive. And you know what's crazier? Not a single damned bug got in her way or tried to stop her. She ran through them all as if she'd been best friends with 'em for centuries.", "Listen $g sonny:missy;, I'll have you know that whatever attacked us was no priestess of nothin'! Her eyes were aglow with something evil and she was genuinely frothing at the mouth! She came in, did some kind of crazy scream that sent us all runnin' in separate directions then started flayin' our minds one by one. I'd be hearin' shadowy words in my head, watchin' the other's periodically black out here and there. It was madness! We would have been done for if not for the damned monkey.", "Listen missy, I'll have you know that whatever attacked us was no priestess of nothin'! Her eyes were aglow with something evil and she was genuinely frothing at the mouth! She came in, did some kind of crazy scream that sent us all runnin' in separate directions then started flayin' our minds one by one. I'd be hearin' shadowy words in my head, watchin' the other's periodically black out here and there. It was madness! We would have been done for if not for the damned monkey.", "Listen sonny, I'll have you know that whatever attacked us was no priestess of nothin'! Her eyes were aglow with something evil and she was genuinely frothing at the mouth! She came in, did some kind of crazy scream that sent us all runnin' in separate directions then started flayin' our minds one by one. I'd be hearin' shadowy words in my head, watchin' the other's periodically black out here and there. It was madness! We would have been done for if not for the damned monkey.", "Oh brother, not this again... Have a seat $g sonny:missy;. I'm sure Rutgar has told you some of this story already so I'll spare you the boring details and get right down to the nitty gritty.", "Oh brother, not this again... Have a seat missy. I'm sure Rutgar has told you some of this story already so I'll spare you the boring details and get right down to the nitty gritty.", "Oh brother, not this again... Have a seat sonny. I'm sure Rutgar has told you some of this story already so I'll spare you the boring details and get right down to the nitty gritty.", "Right then! So the Mistress had come back for a second go at the hives but Brann was having none of that nonsense! Before the melee began, she started talking to something or someone. Crazier still, she started chanting in a language none of us had ever heard.", "What's there to ask? He's a monkey you crazy fool. Anyhow, so yea, the monkey went into a frenzy after seein' ol' Brann flop into the sand face first. Nothin' the night elf could do was stopping Glibb here from poundin' on her noggin.", "Yep.", "You're telling me! It's even stranger considering between Brann, Rutgar, me and the monkey, we know 38 different languages including a touch of Titan - both Vanir and Aesir. So anyway, whatever she was click clacking about, it definitely wasn't with anyone present. She then nodded and went on the offensive! Attacked us outright!" },
	["弗兰尼斯·迅翼"] = { "The dwarf appears to have been discovered and slain in the midst of a spy mission. The Deathforge's attendants have left the corpse in the open, perhaps as a warning to other would-be interlopers." },
	["弗德瑞克·斯图瓦"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["弗拉索·磨轮"] = { "Oh my gosh! Keep your voice down, $N! What? Are you trying to get us killed?! Of course I know who you are! Who in the Alliance doesn't know the name, $N?! Say, what do you think of my jumpbot? She's based off of the mechagnome design. Sleek and aerodynamic!" },
	["弗拉胡恩·影语者"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible." },
	["弗朗恩"] = { "Are you here for training? Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind, $c. Find your own trainer before you anger me.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["弗林克·扳钳"] = { "Welcome to the tournament, $N." },
	["弗沃尔"] = { "Fhwoor like little sporelings. They save Fhwoor. Not eat them. Fhwoor hate naga. Fhwoor smash!" },
	["弗洛伊德·平克"] = { "I deal in comfort... Soothe your savage impulse, $r. My inn is your home..." },
	["弗纳姆"] = { "I can help you establish a guild." },
	["弗蕾亚的化身"] = { "It borders on sacrilege that these secrets be revealed to a mortal such as yourself, but I have little choice. Ever since Freya, daughter of the titans, left me here I've had but one task and I cannot fail. Life must be protected at any cost. There is a waygate that links this place with another very much like this one. It is there that the weapon we seek can be found.", "The Scourge are a blemish upon these pristine lands. By the might of my creators, I will crush every last one of their decrepit bones under my heel.", "The titans did not create life overnight. The process was gradual and required a great deal of experimentation and iteration. It is for that reason that highly protected places such as Sholazar Basin exist. To ensure the safety of their experimentation sites, the titans created a defense mechanism. Its destructive force is unparalleled however, and I will reveal no more unless you swear your fealty to my cause." },
	["弗蕾卡·血斧"] = { "Only champions of Orgrimmar may purchase what I have to offer." },
	["弗里克"] = { "Frogs and leather balls for sale!", "Hey, someone help me catch this thing!", "It's getting away!" },
	["弗里克的青蛙"] = { "Kiss me.", "Ribbit." },
	["弗雷玛尔"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["弗雷萨"] = { "Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin", "Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip." },
	["弗鲁恩"] = { "<Floon makes a series of strange clicking and clucking sounds.>", "Are you serious? He already killed me! What more could he want?" },
	["彬克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. You want some advice? Befriend a mage! We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..." },
	["影月谷护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["影月谷护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["彼得·加林"] = { "If you are here to hunt dragons, be my guest. Where should I send my condolences?" },
	["彼雷尔"] = { "Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, $g sir : ma'am;. How may I help you?", "Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, ma'am. How may I help you?", "Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, sir. How may I help you?" },
	["征服之岛传送门"] = { "The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["征服之岛大使"] = { "The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["征服者克雷娜"] = { "Do not think for a second that your past accomplishments entitle you to anything, $N. They don't. If you want my respect you're going to have to earn it. This means following my orders without question and fulfilling them... without exceptions." },
	["微笑的吉姆"] = { "He'll bring you mead He'll bring you beer A grinning face from ear to ear He's served us all from year to year We call him Smiling Jim." },
	["微笑的斯利尔克·布拉诺布"] = { "Come in, come in. Just don't sit too close to the stove. It hasn't exploded yet today, but just to be safe I think you should sit elsewhere." },
	["微笑的比隆"] = { "I cannot believe they made me move my transporter out of town! Most of the gnomes affected by the accident regained some sort of humanoid form within a few weeks and it should have been an honor to be a participant in such a grand gnomish experiment! Besides, we needed the eggs!", "With the help of Engineer Lapforge from Gadgetzan i have built a powerful gnomish transporter here at Toshley's Station! I would be happy to help any gnomish engineer with enough skill to build their own personal transport beacon." },
	["德伦克·斯班纳斯巴克"] = { "Yo. Lookin' to get back to the Old World? Fly to Tirisfal Glades in style on the Cloudkisser." },
	["德利兹·塔波奎克"] = { "Hey there! Are you interested in learning some more about racing rams and ram racing?", "Keeping your ram in a canter or gallop for too long will exhaust him. If you want your ram to recover a bit, let him walk or trot. If there are apple bushels around, take him there to recover.", "Once you start loosening the reins on the ram, you'll see his speed change. He starts off walking. Ease up on the reins a bit more and he'll start to trot. Give him more slack on the reins while he's trotting and he'll go into a canter. Give him even more slack while he's in a canter and you will send him into a gallop.", "Ram racing is easier than it seems, but it takes skill to master. Just use the reins, eat apples if you can and avoid exhausting your ram.", "When you get a ram, you also get the reins. These aren't your grandma's reins though, you've gotta use them! Just loosen up on the reins a few times to build up some speed. Keep on loosening up and GIDDYUP! You'll be flying! But the faster he goes the quicker he'll get tired. So you have to be careful.", "When you take one of these tasks, we'll lend you a ram. It's a loan, so it won't last forever. The ram may seem slow, but just ease up on the reins a bit and he'll pick up the pace. Our rams love apples. We've put a few bushels of apples out along the way, so make sure to stop by. Eating apples will make your ram forget about how tired he's been getting." },
	["德南·弗卡特"] = { "I sell the finest cloth and leather garb this side of the valley!" },
	["德娜·肯尼迪"] = { "Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $N." },
	["德尔克·雷木"] = { "Greetings and salutations from the manor Ravenholdt, adventurer." },
	["德尼卡"] = { "What you want?" },
	["德拉克·奈特弗"] = { "Derak Nightfall, at your service!" },
	["德拉克·石拳"] = { "I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $N, and bring me back some tall tales." },
	["德拉兹辛比"] = { "I will never call Brackenwall Village my home. To do so is to give up hope of reclaiming our rightful lands." },
	["德拉吉亚"] = { "The Greatmother raised all of us. Any Mag'hari that you see has had their life touched in some special way by the Greatmother. We will miss her greatly when she passes." },
	["德拉塞恩·佛莱宁"] = { "The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["德拉森"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["德文·法达尔"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["德斯利克·希维格拉"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["德林拉尔"] = { "Another new face? It's so good to meet you. I'm Dellylah." },
	["德米提恩"] = { "I know much, listen and be educated, $r.", "In the time before time, what the usurpers would later call the First Age of Creation, my master and his siblings ruled over this world. It was they, the Old Gods, who created all. And it was they who would ultimately be cast down by those that would call themselves Shapers.", "It was during the Elemental Sundering that the Firelord, Ragnaros, would seek to consume my Lord, Thunderaan, Prince of Air. <Demitrian bows his head, his face contorted in rage.> Speak his name and I shall decorate this ravaged camp with your entrails. Be silent and listen.", "It was the Lieutenants of Ragnaros, Geddon and Garr, who would perpetrate the betrayal against my Lord. Thunderaan was caught unaware.", "The Firelord's advances were wholly unknown to Thunderaan. Before my Lord could react, Sulfuras, legendary hammer of Ragnaros, would strike an unmerciful blow. Thunderaan fell, utterly defeated. The Firelord feasted upon the essence of my Lord, but was unable to consume him entirely.", "Their manifest forms weak from eons of battle, imprisoned beneath the world - the world that they themselves created - the corruption of the Titan Shapers would permeate through the surface and befoul the Old Gods. It was then and there that the brothers did turn. For five millennia a battle was fought at the core of this world.", "What little remained of Thunderaan's essence was stored within a talisman of elemental binding. Ragnaros then shattered the talisman in two flawless pieces. The pieces assigned to his Lieutenants..." },
	["德米斯塔兹"] = { "You are welcome in Wyrmrest Temple, $r. Forgive the commotion outside; with Malygos' recent acts, we have found ourselves besieged. You may still rest here under our protection should you need it." },
	["德米赛特·克劳斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["德纳萨里安"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["德罗恩的佳酿学徒"] = { "You won't find a better brew in Azeroth." },
	["德莉亚娜"] = { "Try not to draw too much attention, I'm waiting for the King to grant me audience. Not that I mind waiting, I feel pretty safe around all these burly guards." },
	["德莱尼哀悼者"] = { "<Sobbing> I hate graveyards. So many dead. And my sweet Luhanaa..." },
	["德莱尼工程师"] = { "I'm very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me." },
	["德莱尼平民"] = { "Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.", "During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.", "I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.", "I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday.", "I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.", "No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!", "The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?", "To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.", "We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!", "When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!", "Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!" },
	["德莱尼幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["德迪利特·星焰"] = { "Greetings, $c. You are welcome in Nighthaven, as well as all of Moonglade. The Cenarion Circle welcomes all beings who respect the authority and command of nature. While you are here, please be sure to preserve the balance in all things. Disturbances are not welcome here, and our wardens are trained to cease all hostilities without question." },
	["德里亚"] = { "Feel like helping me to take down the warp-gate in that Burning Legion camp to the south?" },
	["德里克·斑须"] = { "Not so fast, $r! Only champions of Ironforge can purchase what I got ta offer." },
	["德雷克格尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["德雷姆"] = { "I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?" },
	["德雷格·掠云"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["德雷米斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You come in search of training, hunter?" },
	["德鲁尔"] = { "Do you mock me while I am unable to defend myself, bound to this ball of iron?", "One of the humans has the key to this infernal contraption. Eston I think they said his name was." },
	["德鲁甘·强风"] = { "Truly an amazing sword, don't you think? That's no weapon of dwarven make, no, it's far more ancient than that. These Sunreaver and Silver Covenant representatives seem intent on getting to the bottom of the mystery. I'm already working on a report for Brann." },
	["忏悔者欧姆斯"] = { "A self-inflicted wound, friend. I could not bear to look upon a world where I'd committed so many horrors under the Lich King's grasp. It was my first step towards redemption, and if my sins are unforgivable, then I will attempt to atone for them for the rest of my life.", "I was once a paladin, $N. Now the Light shuns me, for my sins are too great. I will aid my allies as best I can, but never again will I wield the powers of darkness." },
	["怒爪酋长"] = { "Please to be quiet! Pups asleeping!" },
	["总指挥官卢斯克"] = { "<Ruusk swallows hard.> I... What do you mean?", "I'm listening.", "Listen to me, peon. We have a process for the delivery and safekeeping of the cipher fragment. The envoy delivers the missive, which is sealed by Lord Illidan. No missive, no transfer.", "Oh? Of course you have papers documenting this request.", "Wait. Where are you going? You needed a transfer, correct? Let's just get it done and over with, ok? Zuluhed at Dragonmaw? It will be done. Please let Lord Illidan know that his orders were carried out with the full cooperation of the Eclipsion. I will dispatch Ruul the Darkener to personally deliver the fragment! You heard me right - Ruul...", "Who dares interrupt the Grand Commander?" },
	["恐怖图腾长者"] = { "Elder Mistwalker enjoys watching the struggles at the Maul in Feralas.", "Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.", "I think Elder Splitrock has traveled to Maraudon in Desolace.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["恐怖的奴隶主"] = { "I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire. Let's hope he loses!", "If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power...", "If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.", "If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.", "Ragnaros will reign supreme!", "The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms. What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?", "The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they're at war with us. One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause..." },
	["恐怖船长德梅萨"] = { "Ahoy! It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE." },
	["恐翼"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["恩尤"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $c. Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?", "Greetings, $c. I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you...", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["恩瑞斯·锐矛"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["恩诺哈尔·雷酒"] = { "Things can get a little stuffy here in Nethergarde. Sometimes a dwarf just needs a brew to take her mind off her duty for a bit." },
	["恩霍罗"] = { "How may I serve you?" },
	["悔恨的上层精灵"] = { "Such sssorrow... The passst cannot be undone..." },
	["悲伤沼泽护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["悲惨的酿酒师"] = { "I'm tellin' you, that Corin Direbrew's a madman. It's not MY fault he didn't get invited to compete at Brewfest! But that didn't stop him and all his Dark Iron cronies from roughin' up my employees and drinking all my brew. Someone's got to put an end to this!" },
	["愤怒者玛塔乌斯"] = { "What is it that you want, lemming? Get out of my sight before you find out why I am known as the Wrathcaster." },
	["戈图拉·林风"] = { "The spirits of the elements are wise. They've been here long before us and will persist long after we're gone. When they speak to us, we must listen." },
	["戈多克大法师"] = { "Hail to da new king!", "I cause you no trouble, boss.", "Old king got dead? That's unpossible!", "So long as you stay here with us, you da king. You take off, and some other ogre will take your place. That's da way of da Gordok!" },
	["戈多克蛮兵"] = { "Hail to da new king!", "I cause you no trouble, boss.", "Old king got dead? That's unpossible!", "So long as you stay here with us, you da king. You take off, and some other ogre will take your place. That's da way of da Gordok!" },
	["戈多克酿酒学徒"] = { "Whoah! You really want buy from us?" },
	["戈尔顿"] = { "'Ello, $c! Ya ready ta head on down to Venture Bay and crack some Horde skulls?", "Around this reindeer's neck is a tag with the Smokywood Pastures logo on it and a name - \"Metzen\". Metzen looks at you with sad, forlorn eyes. It is almost as if the reindeer has been immobilized by some unseen force.", "Metzen's eyes light up with reindeer joy as you sprinkle the dust on him. He shakes his antlers at you and breathes out a heavy sigh of what sounds like relief. Around you, magical energy begins to swell. It would seem that something's about to happen!" },
	["戈库恩·铁颅"] = { "We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight. Continue on. We'll meet you ahead." },
	["戈斯中士"] = { "Gorth is confused sometimes. Gorth is good at killing people so Gorth is made sergeant. But now Gorth never gets to kill nothing!", "Gorth not afraid of getting killed. Them Forsaken just put me back together again.", "Vrykuls is bigger and stronger than us. But we is better looking!" },
	["戈斯鲁姆"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["戈达乌"] = { "<The earth rumbles as Gordawg's movements come to a halt.> Speak." },
	["战争使者达沃斯·里赫"] = { "Come to make yourself useful?" },
	["战争法师法诺莱斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["战地指挥官洛姆斯"] = { "The heroics of the Trollbane bloodline are legendary. I idolize the man. And to find him alive, in the Outland... <Romus gazes past you.> When I first saw him, I nearly fainted. The shock was overwhelming. As I knelt before him, I had to fight back tears. You can bet your sweet behind that I'm going to do everything in my power to make sure the Sons of Lothar are kept safe." },
	["战斗法师弗亚拉"] = { "The fight against Kael'thas and Illidan continues on all fronts. Defeat is not an option." },
	["战斗法师艾尔娜"] = { "We've captured the armory, $N. Let's not rest on our laurels, however. The Legion sure will not." },
	["战歌信使"] = { "Yes, $c? Are you reporting in?" },
	["战歌大使"] = { "$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels. And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well! Do you have the courage to enter battle?" },
	["战歌峡谷传送门"] = { "This is a portal to the Warsong Gulch battleground." },
	["戴恩瑞尔"] = { "I can instruct you in leatherworking. Interested?" },
	["戴拉·锐矛"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Wot kin I do fer ye?" },
	["戴维·韦恩"] = { "You can take a man away from the Sons of Lothar, but you can't take the Sons out of him. <The smith shrugs.> It's hard to explain, but I don't feel like I'm meant to be at Honor Hold right now, is all. Perhaps I'm meant to be part of something larger." },
	["扎姆沙"] = { "Can Zamja help you, $r?" },
	["扎尔夫"] = { "Have a look at my meats, friend. You won't want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions." },
	["扎尔杜"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my brother. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my sister. Do you seek further guidance today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light! Is there anything else?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["扎尔迪玛·维夫希尔特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["扎希姆·布伦罗"] = { "Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you $g sir : ma'am;?", "Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you ma'am?", "Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you sir?" },
	["扎弗德·波姆布克斯"] = { "Lost your Rocket Pack? Have you checked your bags?", "Why you're just the $c I was looking for! I'm testing a new rocket-powered flying device, and I need your help! Just take one of these harnesses and put it on under your armor. Hit the button on the side, and BOOM, off you go. Don't go trying to steal my work though. Each of these babies is fitted with a Transponster 8000 linked to the one in my hand. If you get too far from me the Transponster will shut down the main rocket and you'll be unable to lift off until you return. Now where did I put those liability forms?" },
	["扎普·法弗林"] = { "I have just completed a new dimensional imploder that will make me rich beyond my wildest goblin dreams! All I need to do is get a skilled Goblin Engineer to build a dimensional ripper that connects to it and try it!" },
	["扎瑞恩"] = { "Hello, $n. If you'd like to learn a thing or two about cooking, please visit me at any time." },
	["扎雷·穆尔"] = { "Take my advice, don't sit close to the shadows." },
	["托什雷"] = { "Yeah, yeah... welcome to my station. So, what do you think? Pretty nifty what we've done here, wouldn't you say? Makes me glad to be rid of those stuffy elves at Sylvanaar anyway. Make yourself useful around here; there're plenty of experiments and whatnot to help out with." },
	["托兰纳古"] = { "I must leave this place at once!" },
	["托塞德林王子"] = { "For 10,000 years I have ruled this kingdom. In that time, I have heard many fascinating tales from those that would walk the hallowed grounds of the House of Shen'dralar. As I am bound to this place, I often exchange stories with visitors. Do you have a story for me or perhaps you would like to hear a story?" },
	["托姆·暴怒图腾"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["托尔库斯"] = { "Do you have any sons, $c? Let us tell you something, we think we were much happier before we came to Ogri'la and the crystals made us more aware. Before, we would have just bashed them over the head to get them to shut up. Now all they do is bother us about the Sha'tari Skyguard. Ignorance is bliss!", "It's amazing how much you've helped us out. We dare say that if it weren't for you, we'd already have been overrun by the demons, or fried to a crisp by the Black Dragonflight! On a side note, we did mention that we'd sell you one of our sons, cheap, right? No, not interested?", "The boy's too stupid still to say it -- not enough crystal exposure yet -- but, he's thankful for what you did in getting him those flasks. Now, only nine more sons to go. Gah! <Both of Torkus's heads sigh.> Want to take one of them off of our hands? We'll sell him to you cheap.", "We cannot thank you enough for everything you've done to protect our family, $N. And, you do realize that we were joking before when we offered to sell you one of our sons? No, really... although we do feel a couple more headaches coming on. Junior, be still, will you?!", "We hope you'll be able to ease our headaches. You try having ten sons, all of them wanting to do something they weren't meant for! Still, as a father, we do what we must." },
	["托尔瓦·寻路者"] = { "Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe. For me, race and profession mean nothing--it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor. If you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more.", "You've started down an honorable path, $N. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks. You know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit." },
	["托尼·罗曼诺"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?" },
	["托德雷·铁矿"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I hope the Light is with you, $N. Is there anything I can do for you today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["托拉斯塔萨"] = { "Would you like to head back down, $c? I can see to it that one of these drakes sees you safely to where you need to go." },
	["托曼森中尉"] = { "It's not my fault... IT'S NOT MY FAULT!!! If they'd just done what I told them to do everything would have been fine. But no! They wouldn't listen. Now they're all dead. I just want to go home. Home to Silvermoon. I'm so tired." },
	["托查克·双爪"] = { "Bah! Do I look like I have time for idle chit-chat? Do I? Be quick about your business. There are ogres to be killed!" },
	["托格·锈链"] = { "I wish the snow would just all melt away. It's always getting my robe wet and messing up everything!" },
	["托格努斯·燧火"] = { "Good day to ye $g lad : lass;. Can I be of service?", "Good day to ye lad. Can I be of service?", "Good day to ye lass. Can I be of service?" },
	["托格沃特"] = { "You're a sight for sore eyes! I'm too weak to break the links on this rusty ball and chain. Well, don't just stand there! Get me loose!" },
	["托格萨"] = { "Get away from here, $c, or they'll put you in chains as well.", "Marlgen... One of the jailors. He has the key to my bonds." },
	["托玛尔"] = { "Dis be a dark day in troll history, mon.", "Dis be horrible, mon. I cannot bear to be watchin'." },
	["托莉·兰波维奇"] = { "Hello, peach - good to have your company!" },
	["托里姆"] = { "For a moment I thought you were my beloved Sif... that strand of hair... but no! It can't be... Sif is dead... My... my brother... killed her!", "For too long I tolerated my brother. It is time to set things right. It is time to destroy him and his followers.", "I've hidden from my destiny long enough. What I must do has never been clearer. Loken must be destroyed by my hand.", "Speak, $c.", "Ulduar... I was sworn to protect Ulduar. Sworn to protect the Terrace of the Makers. Sworn to protect the pacts between the races of frost. But I failed! I let my brother trick me. I let him turn me against my allies. He tricked me into blaming Sif's death on a dear friend, Arngrim, the king of the frost giants. After I realized what I'd done... I... gave in to despair.", "Who are you, little one? To come speak these words to the mighty Thorim... I should... crush you! Yet, you've delivered me from my stupor. Your presence here is a sign! It was no accident that I mistook you for Sif. What would she think of me? I must prepare for battle. I must avenge her death and liberate the titans' sacred grounds from my brother's madness!" },
	["托雷斯王子"] = { "Are you blind as well as insane? I am a ghost - a cruel reminder of a civilization that has long since ceased to exist - anchored to a land that I failed to protect. Long ago - ten-thousand years past - I was flesh and bone, just like you. I was prince of this land and a dragon rider, blessed by Ysera of the Dream.", "Are you mad? Look around you, mortal. Do you not see that you stand upon sundered earth? Leave this place lest you suffer as my people and I have...", "Deathwing's brood... Ysera's benevolence raised the ire of Deathwing - patron of the black dragonflight. They attacked us in our sleep! Many died on the initial surge but the greens rose to protect us. <Prince Toreth points around the island.> The bones are all that remain of the once great dragons. None were spared.", "Have you not heard of Ysera? Guardian of nature? Aspect of the Dream? She is the matron of all green dragons! Aye, it was Ysera herself that gifted my kingdom with her brood. We stood shoulder to shoulder with the noble creatures and they allowed us to ride them into battle against our enemies. All was well for many centuries... until...", "I was the last to die. As I felt my spirit leaving my mortal shell, I swore a blood oath. <Prince Toreth shakes his head.> A pact was made between this land and I: My blood for this world. I became the sole keeper of the history of my people. I cannot rest until I am secure in knowing that the story of the dragon riders of Loreth'Aran is not lost in the passages of time." },
	["托马斯·克里奇"] = { "What do you need?" },
	["托马斯·帕塔基"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["托马斯·米勒"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["技师沙娜安"] = { "$N! Thanks again for all the help.", "Nope, still not done with these repairs. Shouldn't be long though.", "This emitter is driving me nuts! I'm missing all sorts of parts that I need to fix it." },
	["技师米希拉"] = { "I can instruct you in engineering. Interested?" },
	["抄写员兰罗尔"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["抚风者莫洛德"] = { "The winds do not speak to our tribe anymore, $N. My people are lost without elders to bring the spirits to them." },
	["护井者索兰尼亚"] = { "The Sunspire held a beautiful vantage of the Sunwell... once. Our lives have been turned upside down, $N, but we nonetheless carry on. It is our way; we are survivors. If you are to survive this upheaval... to carry on in your own right, then you MUST learn how to survive. All blood elves must do this. You must master your insatiable hungering for magic before it masters you." },
	["护园者尼瑟拉"] = { "Do watch your step in the garden of Ysera, mortal. Things are not always as they seem." },
	["护士长阿蕾娜"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["护林主管安德霍尔"] = { "Greetings, $c! I hope you don't mind a little hard work. We could sure use a hand here." },
	["护树者查恩"] = { "We've come to the Ruuan Weald to see if we can reestablish the balance of nature to these mountains. The interference of the arakkoa and the wyrmcult is making this a difficult task, however. Luckily, there are those like you and Samia that are willing to lend us a hand." },
	["护理员伊克尼克"] = { "<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.> Do not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble.", "Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don't mind the smell of fish." },
	["护理者奥林"] = { "They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit." },
	["护理者普奥卢"] = { "<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.> Do not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble.", "Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don't mind the smell of fish." },
	["护理者玛迦尔"] = { "If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles." },
	["护理者穆米克"] = { "<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.> Do not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble.", "Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don't mind the smell of fish." },
	["拆毁者"] = { "What want from Raze??" },
	["拆解者基里克斯"] = { "Be wary, $r. This is no place for the meek." },
	["拉乌"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["拉乌克"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["拉克妮亚"] = { "'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!", "Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!", "Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.", "Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!", "Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!", "Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!", "If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!", "Season's savings to you and yours!" },
	["拉兹弗斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["拉卡"] = { "Now's our chance! Let me out of this cage!" },
	["拉哈罗"] = { "Well met, $c. You may speak to me unless you have direct business with my mistress Magatha. I deal with most of her tasks for her so she can concentrate on more important matters. Perhaps there are some things we could discuss before you seek audience with her?" },
	["拉姆斯塔格"] = { "Hail $g brother : sister;... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may. We tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland. We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth. If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them. You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!", "Hail brother... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may. We tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland. We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth. If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them. You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!", "Hail sister... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may. We tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland. We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth. If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them. You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!" },
	["拉娜·硬锤"] = { "King Magni expects us to win the tournament and make him proud. We will not fail." },
	["拉尔德"] = { "Lard keep peace here. Lard also sell fish. Want fish?" },
	["拉尔金·雷酒"] = { "A good club can make all the difference in the world." },
	["拉库尔"] = { "Times are changing, $N. War has arrived. Will our people rise to the occasion and aid our allies... or will we linger in the sidelines?" },
	["拉库泰"] = { "These wastes are scarred by terrible magic. We must do what we can to heal this great wound." },
	["拉扎鲁斯神父"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?", "Yes, $c?" },
	["拉提斯·托博尔"] = { "Ah, hello there, $r. As you can see, I'm not open for business quite yet. Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm very busy.", "Such a delight to see you again, $c. No, really. You're the reason that I'm making money here, hand over fist. Now, what can I sell to you today?" },
	["拉文尼亚·克洛文"] = { "I don't get many visitors. You're looking for something specific, yes?" },
	["拉文德维尔"] = { "'Netherstorm' was not always as you see it now. There was a time when this crumbling land was known as the Plains of Farahlon. Little of those days has survived the evil that has taken hold here.", "Archmage Vargoth enstrusted me with his staff when he told me to flee from the blood elf attack on Violet Tower. I did as he told me, hoping to take refuge in the old draenei settlement of Arklon. There was to be no respite. I had walked right into the leading edge of a Burning Legion force. The demons wrested the staff from me, but I managed to escape with my life. Though my master knows nothing of my failure, it still shames me." },
	["拉文霍德刺客"] = { "Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment.", "You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?" },
	["拉文霍德卫兵"] = { "Brash. Master Ravenholdt does not like brash.", "Watch your back, stranger." },
	["拉普"] = { "<Lump shrugs.> You bring da war to da Boulderfist. We put it in da stew.", "Boulderfist hungry! Need food! Warmaul ogre tribe kick Boulderfist out of mound to north. Many more Boulderfist to feed now.", "Dat not true. Me just want to nibble. I don't eat all. Ok, maybe I eat da little ones. Dey so delicious!", "OK! Lump tell you anything you want!", "Why you mean to Lump? Lump hungry, dat's all." },
	["拉格努斯"] = { "The mountains are rich with history... don't forget to stop and take it all in, $c." },
	["拉格隆德"] = { "I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises. Honor and respect are earned on this frigid field." },
	["拉比恩·萨图纳"] = { "Don't listen to the hearts of the world - the answer lies within. You know the truth." },
	["拉沙克·铁墙"] = { "$G Son : Young lady;, I'm not going to lie to you; things aren't pretty around here. We're under constant assault by the bugs and our very way of life, our freedom, is at stake! Are you going to be a responsible citizen and help out?", "Son, I'm not going to lie to you; things aren't pretty around here. We're under constant assault by the bugs and our very way of life, our freedom, is at stake! Are you going to be a responsible citizen and help out?", "Young lady, I'm not going to lie to you; things aren't pretty around here. We're under constant assault by the bugs and our very way of life, our freedom, is at stake! Are you going to be a responsible citizen and help out?" },
	["拉琳娜·夏月"] = { "The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you." },
	["拉瑞亚"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $N?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["拉瑞安"] = { "Ugh... these pests keep me busy night and day! Haven't you seen them? I wish I could just jump down a pipe to get away from them..." },
	["拉瑞麦尼·普尔度"] = { "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic." },
	["拉瑟尔·火须"] = { "What do you think when you think Wildhammer, eh? Gryphon riders, if you've any sense! Shadowmoon is no Aerie Peak, but we've still got fine stock for you, aye, fine stock. Take a look at my beauties and see if one of 'em catches your eye!" },
	["拉米克·斯拉文奇"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["拉维恩"] = { "Your presence here is interfering with very important work. Please leave at once. Where was I, again?" },
	["拉莉亚娜·河风"] = { "What brings you here, $N? We don't see too many people around these parts. With good reason, I suppose." },
	["拉里斯·空轮"] = { "Amazing, aren't they? All these artifacts and remains. I'm not sure what I'm more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There's so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make... Did you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?" },
	["拉雷·萨普纳波"] = { "Have you talked to my clone--I mean... my twin?", "This flight takes you to the far point of the Singing Ridge. Very dangerous! For this one, I'm going to need a signed waiver...", "We're always eager for more flight data! Where do you want to go?" },
	["拜恩希"] = { "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["拜龙教侍僧"] = { "Hello, overseer. Ready for the attack?", "I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you.", "Something you need, sir?", "You don't look well, overseer." },
	["拜龙教斥候"] = { "Hello, overseer. Ready for the attack?", "I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you.", "Something you need, sir?", "You don't look well, overseer." },
	["拜龙教狂热者"] = { "Hello, overseer. Ready for the attack?", "I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you.", "Something you need, sir?", "You don't look well, overseer." },
	["拜龙教补给者"] = { "Hey there. Taking a break, overseer? We don't get to see you around here much anymore since you were reassigned to Ruuan Weald. Take a look at what I have to offer. It may not have changed much since last we spoke, but I've got plenty. And don't be such a stranger!" },
	["持铁锤的顾客"] = { "I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale. Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?", "I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale. Oh, you're not the waiter?", "I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale. Oh, you're not the waitress?", "You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?", "You looking at me, laddy?", "You looking at me, lassy?" },
	["指导者安瑟隆"] = { "Students are a bit like sheep. They're useful and even likeable when you guide and pay close attention to them. You leave them alone for a minute and they end up falling down a cliff or drowning in a shallow river." },
	["指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者"] = { "<The commander stops his lesson and turns, his eyes appraising you, sizing you up.> I have use for one such as yourself, $c.", "It's good to see you again, $N. Come for a refresher in Scourge tactics?" },
	["指挥官库恩斯"] = { "Welcome to Argent Stand, $c. Make yourself at home, but don't get too comfortable. We're not out of the woods yet - far from it. If we're going to make it out of here in one piece, everyone's going to have to do their share... including you." },
	["指挥官法斯塔夫"] = { "The land is defiled by the presence of the Scourge on one side and the rituals of the Drakkari on the other. We stand resolute betwixt the two." },
	["指挥官海弗斯·石墙"] = { "Fairweather and I are up here representing Sylvanaar's interests. The druids have been more than accomodating, but allowing the Horde to travel through here gives me the willies." },
	["指挥官玛尔利斯"] = { "Why now, $r? I just do not understand it. So much work to be done..." },
	["指挥官纳萨托·晨铸"] = { "Manaforge Duro is the closest facility to Tempest Keep, so it handles most of the load. As you should know, overloading these manaforges causes leaks in the pipelines. The emanating energy attracts unwanted mana creatures. We've had mana creature infestations at many leak locations; Manaforge Duro is being hit the hardest at the moment.", "You ought to feel safe here; we've stepped up security at this facility after the attacks on Manaforge Duro." },
	["指挥官莱诺尔·风矛"] = { "We are quickly learning the price of death in this frigid wasteland, $N. The Lich King's power extends across every inch of Northrend, permeating into the earth itself! He turns our own fallen people against us. From the sky, risen gryphon riders rain down their vengeful stormhammers as the walking dead assail us on the ground." },
	["指挥官萨卡斯·天影"] = { "It's good to see a $r, such as yourself, contributing to the well-being of Sylvanaar. We've done a lot here in a very short time, but the forces that surround us threaten our way of life. I would hear what you have to say. Speak your mind, $c." },
	["指挥官萨纳斯"] = { "Hail, friend! Have you come to serve the sons of Azeroth in battle?" },
	["指挥官达尔多什"] = { "Lok'tar! Have you come to serve the Horde in battle?" },
	["指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特"] = { "Welcome to the front lines, $c. The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge. Here at Chillwind Camp, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis. If you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there." },
	["指挥官阿格罗戈什"] = { "Welcome to Grom'gol, $c. Before we get off on the wrong foot, I'll have you know that I won't have slackers in my Base Camp. I expect a healthy $r like you to pull your own weight around here." },
	["指挥官阿米尔"] = { "The Ethereum have grown dark... twisted. Vengeance has become their only recourse and any that would stand in their way or not join their cause are considered enemies. Many saw that the Ethereum were plummeting into madness and left. Several of the Nexus-Princes of the Ethereum council abandoned the Ethereum to form other groups and factions with different goals. The Consortium are one such example of an off-shoot group. The Protectorate another...", "The Ethereum were the ruling class of ethereal on my homeworld of K'aresh. Tragically, we were forced to evacuate K'aresh shortly before the void lord, Dimensius, unleashed his void armies upon the world and utterly decimated all that stood in his way. For this act, the Ethereum vowed vengeance. They have been tracking Dimensius ever since... The Protectorate, however, were not a reaction to Dimensius. We were a reaction to Ethereum.", "We feel that the Ethereum are as great a threat to our existence as Dimensius. Both must be stopped...", "What do you know about ethereals, fleshling? You undoubtedly view us all in the same light, oblivious to the conflicts and struggles between the differing factions. Perhaps it is time for an introduction. I am Commander Ameer of the Protectorate - also your only hope of resolving the infestation of both void creature and Ethereum in this area." },
	["指挥官阿米尔的影像"] = { "Be wary of the Ethereum that surround us on all sides." },
	["掠天者科鲁姆"] = { "Orgrim's Hammer is ready to strike in Icecrown. You will find no finer vessel." },
	["掠天者考尔姆·黑痕"] = { "Make it quick, $c." },
	["探员斯尼普·滑栓"] = { "I don't like the look of this 'Crown Chemical Co.' one bit." },
	["探险者亚伦"] = { "Keep your voice down, $c. We wouldn't want them to hear us." },
	["提克·扳钳"] = { "Gnomeregan's finest have come to compete in the tournament. Wish us luck!" },
	["提卡·血牙"] = { "Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub." },
	["提恩"] = { "I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?" },
	["提戈尔·逐星"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["提拉萨兰将军"] = { "Should Kil'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!" },
	["提摩西·卡宁汉"] = { "Going somewhere?" },
	["提瑞斯法林地护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["提莫斯·沃森特"] = { "I have outfitted kings. With the proper training, you can too." },
	["提莫斯·琼斯"] = { "What can I do for you?" },
	["提里奥·弗丁"] = { "I must apologize for not being entirely truthful with you in regards to my identity. I had to be certain that you could be trusted - few people would have selflessly lent assistance to an old and forgotten hermit. You have proven yourself as one of those people: A person of integrity and honor.", "Indeed. The Scarlet Crusade are an aberration of the Order of the Silver Hand. You must believe me, $r; Taelan is a good man. He needs guidance. He needs to remember... remember what it is to be noble and honorable. I know that in his heart, he knows what he does is wrong. Will you help him? Will you help him remember?", "My son, Taelan, was only a child when I was found guilty of treason and banished from the Alliance to live a life in exile. I chose to remain here so that I could watch over him; to somehow insure that he would grow up an honorable man. As I had hoped, he took my place as lord of Mardenholde; but in a cruel twist of fate, joined the ranks of the Scarlet Crusade. He is now their Highlord, $r.", "Race does not dictate honor, $r. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo. I have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge. But I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire." },
	["摩尔亚"] = { "I can't find my pet frog, Jubjub. She loves Dark Iron Ale, it's all she ever drinks, but can be so hard to get! Now I'm out... and Jubjub must have run away to find more! I wish she would come back..." },
	["摩根·斯特恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible." },
	["摩罗加尔"] = { "Stonetalon Mountain has many perilous caves through out this region. Exploring these caves can hold many adventures for those willing to risk life for glory. $C, perhaps you seek riches that only following your heart and soul can garnish." },
	["撒迦利亚·普斯特"] = { "On behalf of the Royal Apothecary Society, I am pleased to offer you the finest steeds available for the Forsaken. These beasts have endured trials and tribulations as we all have, and now they too have emerged stronger and more resilient than mere mortal flesh would have had them destined to be! Please, inspect them for yourself and see.", "The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I. Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered exalted by the Undercity. Until then..." },
	["收藏家库米沙"] = { "It's fascinating... I have heard orcs proclaim the odor of humans to be sickening and I have heard humans proclaim the odor of orcs to be wretched; yet, to me, all of the races of these lands give off the same odor: The foul, dizzying scent of greed. Do you doubt the validity of my claim? Do you not see these things that run your life as merely runoff from the greed which dictates your every decision? So be it. As it was greed that displaced me from my home, it shall be greed that takes me back." },
	["攻城技师夸特弗拉什"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["攻城技师布拉斯特维奇"] = { "These babies can hurl fire like none other. We've even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system. If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. Let's see those Explorer's League twirps beat that!", "We were in luck to find enough parts to get these babies working again! How can I help you?" },
	["攻城锻造大师科弗斯"] = { "What is it that you need from Corvus?" },
	["救赎者阿拉托尔"] = { "I was only an infant when my father was deployed to this wasteland. All that I have ever known of him is what others have told me. Do your dreams change, $N? Mine do not. I have one dream: A crimson skyline envelops me as Legion, numbering beyond comprehension, battle in the distance. I kneel before the body of a man, presumably my father, and weep. As he is gasping for air, his body wholly crushed, he whispers something. Despite every effort, I am unable to hear what he is trying to tell me." },
	["斗技者拉雷尼斯"] = { "Few bouts are won by sheer strength. It is cunning, reflexes and knowledge of your weapon that wins the day in the end." },
	["斥候奈弗蒂丝"] = { "We need to figure out what this shadowy group is doing here at Grangol'var Village!" },
	["斥候尼丝蒂娜"] = { "I always be up for a nice three-finger discount. Stealin' be all in the wrist... and when that fails ya, then ya stick somethin' sharp in between the ribs, and that's all in the wrist too. Skilled hands be worth more than a steady paycheck, ya heard?", "I don't be worryin' 'bout no Lich Kings. Seen a lotta big-shots come and go, dey always messin' somethin' up. It ain't long aftah that when a posse rolls on through and sends dem quick on dey way to da history books. Dis one ain't no different.", "When it comes to treasure, never be lookin' sideways at lootin' someone else's junk. Stolen goods be much sweeter, ya? But free is free, no matta how it got that way!" },
	["斥候沃塔肯"] = { "With the help of our new taunka allies, the Northrend will belong to the Horde." },
	["斥候洛伊"] = { "Damn those blood elves and their reckless magic!" },
	["斥候瓦努拉"] = { "It looks like help has finally arrived! The Omenai welcome you to our remnant camp, $N." },
	["斥候瓦罗瑞"] = { "Make haste, $c! This crisis is nowhere near being under control." },
	["斥候约莉"] = { "We've just arrived here and already we've buried too many of our friends and comrades." },
	["斥候纳弗林"] = { "I have seen many dangers in these wastes. Who knows what creatures yet lurk in the dust to ambush the unwary?" },
	["斥候诺勒斯"] = { "Captain Adams sent me out here to investigate what's happening at Halgrind. This is as close as I've been able to get, however; the abandoned Vrykul tower affords me some amount of cover from prying eyes. The Forsaken are up to no good over there. I can feel it!" },
	["断肋者奥格"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["断齿族长"] = { "Welcome to Revantusk Village, stranger. I am Primal Torntusk, leader of the Revantusk trolls." },
	["斯兰·库尔曼"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks he's a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks she's a warrior. Ha!" },
	["斯内维尔·拉斯罗凯特"] = { "<He looks at the rocket and flashes a nervous grin.> Okay, yeah, so maybe I made a couple rockets for some guys. So what? The gold was good and I was paid for my work. It's not like anyone died. That's about as honest as work gets. What's it to you?", "Hey, pal, I don't know who you are or why you've been following me around, but I'm about to board a ship and I want to be left alone, got it?", "Look, I don't know, okay? I don't know! I just got paid to make rockets that deliver an airborne chemical payload, and that's what I did. Job's done, pal. They're all made, packaged, and sent off. I got the money and I was TRYING to enjoy myself a little when you started chasing me all over town. I don't have any more of that chemical and I don't know what it was.", "You expect me to remember all that off the top of my head? Look. They didn't pay me enough to put up with this, and the contract only asked for my silence. So I'm just gonna drop my ledger on the floor here, and you're going to take it and leave me alone. Got it?" },
	["斯利文男爵"] = { "Do keep out of sight, will you? I'm trying to pretend that I'm still under the Lich King's control!", "We must strike at Jotunheim continuously. Never give them a chance to catch their breath, never a chance to sleep, and never accept surrender! Tirion Fordring with all the might of Ashbringer and the Argent Crusade behind him cannot hope to accomplish what you are doing! Now, be quick about your business, $N. There is too much occurring for idle chit-chat." },
	["斯卡特·弗洛斯普"] = { "Day in and day out all Mad Jonah Sterling wants me to do is swab the decks. Swab the decks?! I'm a mage, I don't DO swabbin'! At least not the mundane way." },
	["斯古尔·碎颅者中士"] = { "Throm'ka, $c. You must be new. You look fresh and unspoiled by the horrors of this land. <Sergeant Shatterskull spits into the dust.> That'll change." },
	["斯古莉探员"] = { "Fine, but be more careful with it this time!", "Keep your voice down, $c. I'm in disguise and spying for Venomspite." },
	["斯坦哈德·法尔杉"] = { "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate." },
	["斯塔哈默中士"] = { "We're in a fine mess here." },
	["斯塔姆·雷角"] = { "Darkmoon Dogs fresh off the grill. Come and get em while they're hot!", "For a limited time only, Crunchy Frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire.", "Step right up! Get your Red Hot Wings right here!", "You've got money and we've got food. What are you waiting for?!" },
	["斯奎尔图"] = { "I'm sick of sittin' in this hole. I hope whatever sorry pencil-pusher is holdin' up Danath's return gets a punch in the jimmies." },
	["斯奎比"] = { "Slip a little coin into the boss's hand and look what it gets ya. I love my job. Though, if I could find a way to get that little firecracker Snurk reassigned to this port...well, I can't imagine it any better. But I'm betting that you aren't here about my business practices. You're looking for the Zeppelin to Undercity, am I right? Well that's great, because it docks right here behind me. Oh and hey, if you see Snurk, put a good word in for me, would ya?" },
	["斯巴克·尼米尔"] = { "For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you've come to deliver us from this forsaken land. Though I'm with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place." },
	["斯巴瑞克"] = { "It will take a sharp blade and reinforced armor to bring tranquility back to Nagrand. Shall I repair your equipment so that you may mete justice?" },
	["斯布特瓦夫"] = { "Director Riddlevox put me in charge of the Union's shredder development program. Few months on the job and I'm already in hot water! I could use your help, $n!", "Interesting, interesting... I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns, $N. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found. Now, I must get back to work!", "Lots to do, lots to do! The Union's given us deadlines and they're not the sort you want to miss!", "See, the Venture Company's new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips! My boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn't come up with anything. Nothing was working, so we decided to \"borrow\" one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn't gotten back yet!" },
	["斯库提"] = { "Hello, $N! I am master engineer, Scooty." },
	["斯托菲队长"] = { "Our town's under the blasted ocean, our keep's full of Dark Iron traitors, and I'm laid up with such a wound I can't do a single thing about any of it. So welcome to Menethil Harbor!" },
	["斯拉兹"] = { "Cherry pie is my favoritist food in all of Azeroth.", "Fresh cherry pie for sale, looks so good it will bring a tear to your eye.", "Having a bad day? Try some cherry pie.", "I love pie.", "There are some who desire to stop gaining experience from their actions; to forever remain at the level of strength they are now, and never grow stronger. I can make this possible... for a fee, of course. But understand this: Once you pay me, you will NO LONGER GAIN EXPERIENCE. None. Not one whit. Should you change your mind afterwards and want to start gaining experience again, I can undo the process for the same fee.", "This cherry pie tastes so good, it could make a grown gnome cry.", "This pie is so good, would you like some?", "Try some of this cherry pie, it will put a smile on your face, ten miles wide." },
	["斯拉比船长"] = { "Ahoy, me hearty! Today's OUR day, ye know... PIRATES' DAY! Ol' Chumbucket and I came up with the idea, and once the Dread Captain heard of it... well, here we are!" },
	["斯普拉格·弗劳克"] = { "Welcome to the refuge, $N. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell." },
	["斯普洛克"] = { "This teleporter will transport you to Grom'gol in Northern Stranglethorn. Usually. I mean, sometimes it'll just disintegrate you, or reduce all your soft tissues into a greenish, foul-smelling mist, but mostly it's safe! ...mostly." },
	["斯普莱特"] = { "Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!" },
	["斯汀·绿角"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["斯泰法努斯"] = { "Good day, $c. Are you in need of a reliable hippogryph?" },
	["斯洛安·麦考伊"] = { "Speak quietly and with great care, the wrong word in these parts could get your throat cut. Now, what is it you need from me?" },
	["斯特凡·瓦杜"] = { "Here you are, $n. Now please, return your focus to the task at hand...", "None know the Scourge better than we death knights. Believe me, $r, there's nothing more effective than fighting fire with fire...", "Take it easy on old Nass. He's not as young and resilient as he once was.", "The Lich King is near, $n. His voice taunts me... Let us silence him at last!" },
	["斯特温·艾伦"] = { "Who are you? Go away... I'm exhausted from working so hard on the Harbor Road. It's time to drink some dwarven ale, have a good cry, and take a nap." },
	["斯瓦特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["斯登·粗臂"] = { "Ah, well aren't you a sturdy-looking one? Perhaps you can assist me with a thing or two. Not much help around here except for green apprentices, and they've other things to worry about." },
	["斯纳尔"] = { "If I prove myself to Saru he will have no choice but to let me fight for one of his daughters. Then we will see who is sneering." },
	["斯纳尔克"] = { "$g Hey there cutie, you looking for a ride to Grom'gol? I hear it gets mighty steamy down in those jungles, maybe I could join you for a short vacation, show you a real jungle cat. : Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That's right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!;", "Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That's right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!", "Hey there cutie, you looking for a ride to Grom'gol? I hear it gets mighty steamy down in those jungles, maybe I could join you for a short vacation, show you a real jungle cat." },
	["斯考恩·白云"] = { "I have run through these plains for many, many seasons. And I have hunted great beasts. And I had never been bested... until I faced Ghost Howl. Long ago, the massive wolf was an ally to the tauren and fought bravely against the Burning Legion. But he was wounded savagely by a demon, and the tear in his flesh never healed. Eventually... it drove Ghost Howl mad. Now he roams the plains in agony, seeking an end to his pain. To my shame, when we fought I lacked the strength to slay him...", "You killed Ghost Howl. You're a stud!" },
	["斯蒂文·布莱克"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["斯蒂文·托马斯"] = { "Schweitzer here is an old friend of mine... a valuable thing, that. Friendship, I mean. I thought I'd forgotten the feeling until we met again in Shattrath City. He's not in Tirisfal so much these days, so I thought I'd take the Orb of Translocation here to give my hellos." },
	["斯蒂芬·雷百克"] = { "I don't get too many cooks in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready." },
	["斯诺恩"] = { "We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations." },
	["旅店老板伯兰德·草风"] = { "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here." },
	["旅店老板凯利斯克"] = { "If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles.", "What can you do at an inn? Well when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably. Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness. When you are well rested, you learn more from experience. You may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn." },
	["旅店老板凯达米尔"] = { "Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams." },
	["旅店老板利莎瑞亚"] = { "Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams." },
	["旅店老板卡拉库尔"] = { "If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles.", "What can you do at an inn? Well when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably. Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness. When you are well rested, you learn more from experience. You may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn." },
	["旅店老板卡拉林"] = { "I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands." },
	["旅店老板哈吉尔·拉格拉斯"] = { "This inn was built before the savages from the north awoke. Thank the Light for that, at least! Will you be staying long?" },
	["旅店老板埃德瓦"] = { "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here." },
	["旅店老板埃比克瓦"] = { "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here." },
	["旅店老板埃蕾尔娅"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["旅店老板基姆利雅"] = { "Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams." },
	["旅店老板塞琳尼"] = { "Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams." },
	["旅店老板塞蕾丝·古德哈彻"] = { "Time for some rest, sweety, or just something to eat and some relaxation? Well, if anyone deserves it, it's you!" },
	["旅店老板奥里森"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
