he Mage Quarter.", "Gelman Stonehand would be the one to talk to. I think he has a house over in the Dwarven District but I can't remember exactly. I would check over there.", "Gonna make a guild, are ya? Good luck to ya then! Talk to Aldwin Laughlin in the Stormwind Vistor's Center. It's in the Trade District right as you come in from the Valley of Heroes.", "Gryphons, eh? Never really cared for the beasts but to each their own. You can find Dungar Longdrink on the rampart in the Trade District.", "Hey, that reminds me, I need to have my rocket boots repaired. Word to the wise my friend, rocket boots and gryphons don't mix. Oh, but you need directions... just head on over to the Dwarven District, you'll find Lilliam Sparkspindle towards the back.", "I don't know what's possessed you to look for a shaman... but I have seen someone who matches the profile. There's a woman who calls herself a Farseer on the shore in the Valley of Heroes.", "I would suggest looking in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square.", "If you are looking to become a great cook, venture over to the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town and talk to Stephen Ryback. That man knows how to cook up a rack of ribs like no other. Man... now you got me hungry for some of his famous ribs. Don't count on him teaching you that recipe though!", "If you are looking to become a mighty paladin, there is no better teacher then Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker. He can be found in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square.", "If you need to house your pet while you're training another, then you should talk to Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District.", "If you need training in alchemy, there is only one place in Stormwind you need to go... Alchemy Needs. You can find it in the Mage Quarter along the outer rim of shops.", "It is located in the Trade District citizen. It is nearly straight on from the entrance of Stormwind.", "Jelenik's Barber Shop is in the northern section of the Trade District.", "Jelinik's Barber Shop is in the northern section of the Trade District.", "Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District is the one you're looking for. She tends to hunters' pets while they seek training from her father.", "Laurena is the High Priestess of Stormwind. You can find her in the Catheral of Light in Cathedral Square.", "Leave it to the dwarves to send a mining specialist from Ironforge to tell us how to mine. How hard is it to take a pick and chip away at some rock? Well, since he's here, he's probably the one you should see anyhow. His name is Gelman and he resides over in the Dwarven District.", "Lookin' to take a gryphon ride, eh? Dungar keeps his birds up on the rampart in the Trade District. Just remember to hold on tight!", "Looking for some training, eh? I could train you better then anyone in Stormwind but the guard prohibits it. I guess you will have to settle for one of those has beens hanging out around the Barracks or at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.", "Lucan Cordell has a small shop on the canal by the Stockade. I am sure he will be able to teach you the art of enchanting.", "Master Woo Ping has mastered nearly every weapon known to man. He is especially deadly with his sword techniques. He spends a good deal of time over in the Weller's Arsenal waiting on new shipments of weapons to arrive if you need some training.", "No better place to learn First Aid than under the watchful eye of Shaina Fuller at the Cathedral of Light. To get there, just look for the yellow rooftops, or the towering spire of the Cathedral itself which you can see from almost anywhere in the city.", "Nothing like spending a day down at Crystal Lake fishing. Arnold Leland is the man that taught me. You can usually find him out on the dock in the Canal District just fishing the day away. Oh, and don't believe any of the stories he tells you about monsters in the canals either.", "Oh, looking for some arcane enlightenment are you? No place better then then Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter.", "Old Town is where you should go if you want to find rogues. It's in the northeast corner of Stormwind.", "Seek out Catarina Stanford in the canals southwest of The Stockade.", "Sounds like you want to talk to Maginor Dumas! You can usually find him in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Course, you never know when or where those magi will portal off to.", "Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the Trade District of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink.", "Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the trade district of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink.", "Stormwind Harbor is the fastest way to get to Auberdine or Valiance Keep. You can find it between the Cathedral District and the Park.", "Stormwind's resident engineer trainer is an ingenious gnome by the name of Lilliam Sparkspindle. He can be found in the back of the Dwarven District.", "That bum Leland... all he does is sit out on the dock outside the Trade District and fish all day. I sure hope he's good at it for all the time he spends fishing. If you want to learn, why don't you go talk to him?", "The Bank of Stormwind is located in the Trade District just northwest of the city gates. Here, let me show you on your map.", "The Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square is home to the priests of Stormwind. There you will find High Priestess Laurena.", "The Cathedral of Light is the center of all the healing practices of Stormwind. There you can find Shaina Fuller to help you learn this craft.", "The Park is where you want to go if you are looking for druid trainers. Theridan and Maldryn can usually be found by the moonwell in the center of the district.", "The magi congregate in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Quite a tower they have there. Makes our barracks look like peasant hovels.", "There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I've heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean.", "There's a great cook who works at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town. I've watched him use a knife when he cooks and just between you and me, I don't think he's always been a cook. Don't get me wrong... if you still want to learn, he's the best we have.", "Therum Deepforge is the dwarf you want to talk to. One of the finest blacksmiths around if you ask me. You can find him in the heart of the Dwarven District.", "Thorfin Stoneshield came to us all the way from Ironforge to bring us his expertise in hunting. If you don't mind breathing the smoke filled air of the Dwarven District then you'll find him at his house in the northeast area of the district.", "Trying to reach Auberdine or Valiance Keep? You can find Stormwind Harbor if you head through the Canals, between the Cathedral District and the Park.", "Tucked away in the Mage Quarter, there is a little shop called Alchemy Needs. You're bound to see all sort of strange shops on your way through the Mage Quarter, but if you stick to the outer rim you'll be sure to find it.", "Want to learn leatherworking, eh? Simon Tanner would be able to teach you. He can be found in Old Town at the Protective Hide.", "Warlocks, eh. Well, you didn't hear it from me, but I've heard rumors that those types gather at a bar called the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter.", "Warriors can usually be found either at the Pig and Whistle Tavern or the Barracks in Old Town. Tell ya though, the tavern is probably a better place to look.", "Well, well, moving up in the world are we? You're looking for the Champions' Hall, and you'll find it on the southeast end of Old Town. Good luck!", "Well, you can find Theridan or Maldryn by the moonwell in the Park. Just head to the western area of Stormwind, north of the Mage District, but west of the Cathedral Square.", "What do you need directions to?", "What? I don't know of any warlock trainers in Stormwind. Although... There have been some sightings of demonic activity over by The Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter. I suppose you could check there.", "Which class trainer are you looking for?", "Which profession trainer are you looking for?", "Woo Ping's stamina is simply astounding. Watching him practice his weapon techniques for hours on end, I felt sorry for the practice dummy afterward. I can't think of anyone better suited to train you in armed combat.", "You are gonna want to head over to Old Town and drop by the Protective Hide if you are lookin' to learn skinning.", "You can find Aldwin Laughlin at the Stormwind Visitor's Center in the Trade District.", "You can find Tannysa standing outside Alchemy Needs in the Mage Quarter.", "You can find the gryphon master on the northeast rampart overlooking the Valley of Heroes.", "You don't have the stomach for the gryphon ride, huh. Well lucky for you, we have an alternative where you can keep your feet on the ground... more or less. It's the gnomish mover of people, the Deeprun Tram. Conveniently located in the back of the Dwarven District.", "You mean you can't smell the smoke of the Dwarven forges from here? Well, you will be looking for Therum Deepforge if you want to learn blacksmithing. He's over in the Dwarven District which is just north of the Cathedral Square.", "You want to talk to Osborne then. No finer teacher of the stealth arts than him in Stormwind. Look for him over in Old Town.", "You'll be after Benik Boltshear, then. He's located in the heart of the Dwarven District by the blacksmiths.", "You'll find the battlemasters in the war room of Stormwind Keep.", "You're into leather, eh? Sounds like you should talk to Simon Tanner over in Old Town. He runs a shop there called the Protective Hide.", "You've heard about the Tram have you? What a ride that thing is! You'll find it in the Dwarven District towards the back. Oh, and be sure to keep your arms and legs inside the tram while the tram is in motion." },
	["暴风城狂欢者"] = { "Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...", "They know how to throw a party here in Moonglade. Who would have thought so?", "This beam of moonlight leads to Stormwind. Use your invitation when you're ready.", "Try these fireworks launchers. They're a blast!" },
	["月卫长者"] = { "Elder Bloodhoof can be found at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.", "Elder High Mountain is at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.", "Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.", "Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens.", "Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["月玲"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["朝圣者加尔蕾萨"] = { "I think I'm beginning to regret undertaking this pilgrimage. I anticipated that the road would be rough and I'm no stranger to travel, but I wasn't prepared for the rigors of Outland. On top of everything else, that Taleris seems to want to push me out of here before I've regained my strength completely." },
	["本·提亚斯"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["本内特"] = { "I don't have time for idle chitchat. I have men and women to train, and a tower to watch." },
	["本古斯·深炉"] = { "I hope ye didn't come all the way to the Great Forge just to stay warm. Speak up $g lad : lass;, tell me what it is I can do for ye?", "I hope ye didn't come all the way to the Great Forge just to stay warm. Speak up lad, tell me what it is I can do for ye?", "I hope ye didn't come all the way to the Great Forge just to stay warm. Speak up lass, tell me what it is I can do for ye?", "Nice form $N, I bet a full mug at Bruuk's Corner that the function is just as solid. Ye know, ye might want to talk to Myolor Sunderfury. He'll set ya straight.", "So, off to see Myolor, eh? He's right o'er there... behind ye! Er, maybe in front of ye! Near the Great Anvil!", "Ye have my approval $N, ye can forge blades better than any I've trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path." },
	["本娜·冰蹄"] = { "When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, \"Save them.\"" },
	["本尼"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["本尼·考伯宾奇"] = { "'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!", "Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!", "Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.", "Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!", "Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!", "Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!", "If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!", "Season's savings to you and yours!" },
	["本尼克·螺剪"] = { "Hey $c, if you've lost a key I might be able to help you out." },
	["本杰明·克莱格"] = { "Good Morning!" },
	["本杰明修士"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.", "I trust the Light is with you, $N. Is there something that I can I help you with?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["本诺比奥斯"] = { "We discovered these proto-drakes at the Bronze Dragonshrine in the Dragonblight. We knew at once that they were kin - our blood from ages past. My apologies, $c. You are probably confused. I am Penumbrius of the bronze dragonflight. I have taken this form out of convenience. It is much easier to communicate and live amongst mortals while in the mortal guise. How can I help you?" },
	["朱尼帕尔"] = { "Ahoy! Ye be lookin' to book passage board the Sister Mercy, matey? Ye've come to the right place..." },
	["朱莉·雷线"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. You want some advice? Befriend a mage! We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..." },
	["朱莉亚·射日者"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you." },
	["朱莉安·加林纳"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["机器人专家艾蕾"] = { "This is delicate work out here, you know? It can't just be rushed, or something's likely to get broken. Like Fuselage's head! You might be wondering about my bots? I'm always working on the Mk. I, and the Mk. II gained sentience for a split-second before his brain capacitor blew out and he went insane! I decided to skip III and IV, and went straight to the Mk. V - my pride and joy!" },
	["机械侏儒俘虏"] = { "Go back to work before the overseer sees us.", "This unit is busy. Please inquire later." },
	["机械打手4100型"] = { "The machine adjusts to face you. On the back of the machine is an empty, oddly misshapen slot with an engraving that reads: \"Propirtee o' Cap'n Gelkak Gyromast\"" },
	["机灵鬼沃比斯波基"] = { "How am I supposed to get anything done with Fizzcrank breathing down my neck and me without all of my stuff?!" },
	["杀手洛汗"] = { "Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here? <Rohan sighs.> If you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance. If you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments.", "The title is misleading. I'm really a very nice person once you get to know me." },
	["杉多尔·迅蹄"] = { "Welcome to Camp Mojache, brave $c. How may I assist you this day?" },
	["李·布朗"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["李·斯巴克斯"] = { "If you've been to Zangarmarsh, you might've run into a fellow named Daniels. You know -- wears a strange helmet, only answers to \"the Specialist.\" Of course, I taught him everything he knows. Don't let the fine clothing fool you. I'm still a rogue at heart. Daniels and I spent a lot of time in the trenches together, but that was before I retired. As far as I know, he's still out there, giving 'em hell." },
	["李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵"] = { "Thel'zan needs to die, if only to stop the incessant yammering!" },
	["李奥霍夫"] = { "I do not judge others by their stature, $r, but by their courage and loyalty." },
	["杜克"] = { "I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube." },
	["杜加尔·朗德瑞克"] = { "Where is it ye would like to go $g lad : lass;? For just a few coin my Gryphons can get ye there faster than even the swiftest horse.", "Where is it ye would like to go lad? For just a few coin my Gryphons can get ye there faster than even the swiftest horse.", "Where is it ye would like to go lass? For just a few coin my Gryphons can get ye there faster than even the swiftest horse." },
	["杜埃尼"] = { "There's no thrill like the thrill of a dragon hunt." },
	["杜姆雷尔"] = { "Our fate is the doom of all who face the Great Fire." },
	["杜尔克特·狼脉"] = { "Greetings, $N. I am Durkot Wolfbrother, protector of the pack." },
	["杜尔根·雷矛"] = { "<Sergeant Stormpike salutes.> Name, rank, and serial number, soldier! That's the only bit of information you'll ever give those dirty Frostwolf dogs!" },
	["杜尔维"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["杜尔鲁·雷角"] = { "Apologies, $r, but only champions of Thunder Bluff may purchase what I have to offer." },
	["杜希拉·拉萨雷"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["杜拉姆法尔"] = { "We're glad to have your help." },
	["杜格鲁·血怒"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $N.", "Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c." },
	["杜泽加尔"] = { "If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles." },
	["杜纳尔·奥斯古德"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin." },
	["杜蒙特中尉"] = { "The Alliance has maintained this remote lodge for a while. It's seen some use by our hunters and woodsmen. With the war going on, you'd better believe the military is in charge here now, though." },
	["杜迦"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["杜隆塔尔护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["杜雷克"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["来访的术士"] = { "We may operate in the shadows of polite society, but out here on the battlefront our powers are properly respected at last." },
	["杰克·亚当"] = { "<This pirate has obviously had too much to drink. He appears to be out cold for the time being.>" },
	["杰克·塔博尔"] = { "There's an old saying, \"Give a man a fish; you have fed him for a day. Teach a man to fish; and you have fed him for a lifetime.\" Of course, you might want to cook that fish and that is where I come in." },
	["杰奈·星语"] = { "The Horde isn't the only danger in this forest. Don't let its seeming tranquility fool you." },
	["杰希卡·查伯斯"] = { "Welcome to Light's Hope Chapel, stranger." },
	["杰希尔·月弓"] = { "Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood. It seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power. My two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening. I expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late." },
	["杰斯雷蒙"] = { "I give you warm greetin's, $c, as does the Shattered Hand. Do not look so surprised, $N. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety. But you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else." },
	["杰森·马斯特"] = { "Because you've managed to replenish some of our supplies I can get back to cooking. Now, what can I do for you?" },
	["杰萨拉·考迪尔"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["杰赫"] = { "The Consortium has been planning this operation for months! We were to dig Oshu'gun, the largest known diamond in the universe. Minutes before we were to begin, Nexus-Prince Haramaad sends word that we're to hold off until a political matter is resolved in Netherstorm. I've transformed our operation into a clearing house for smuggled gems in the meantime, but this is slowly eating into our profits." },
	["杰雷米亚·派森"] = { "Wanna buy a cockroach?" },
	["松饼人穆瑟尔"] = { "Oh yeah, I got muffins!" },
	["林克"] = { "A long time ago, during my travels, I met a man that told me, Master using it and you can have this. What do you suppose that means? I didn't know then, and I still don't now, really...", "I... I'm not really sure how I got here... I seem to remember traveling... a raft...", "It's a secret to everybody... including me! I'm glad you found me -- it's a good thing I'm not hiding in a bush or underneath a rock, isn't it?", "Pay me and I'll talk... Oh hey, it's you, $N! Nevermind about that..." },
	["林奇·黑箭"] = { "No, I'm the intellectual one, and I am not to be taken lightly. I could brew a healing potion from dishwater and dandelions, although that's not something I'll show you! Anyhow, if you'd like to make a purchase, please speak with Patricia.", "Welcome to our shop. We have everything you need... if you need alchemy supplies." },
	["林格·巴斯贝特"] = { "We already have a winner for our contest, but Jang is willing to purchase any Tastyfish that you have fished up! There is always next Sunday for you to show your Angling skill!" },
	["枯瘦的莫戈多格"] = { "The Sons of Gruul must be defeated if we are to shake off our shackles and live as free ogres once more! We must work quietly, yet quickly, if our underground resistance is to have a chance of success.", "You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre. It's a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri'la. The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally. It is through your continued actions, at Ogri'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren. You have my thanks, my $g king : queen;, for all that you have done and will do.", "You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre. It's a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri'la. The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally. It is through your continued actions, at Ogri'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren. You have my thanks, my king, for all that you have done and will do.", "You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre. It's a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri'la. The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally. It is through your continued actions, at Ogri'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren. You have my thanks, my queen, for all that you have done and will do." },
	["查姆巴克"] = { "Tomorrow, the baron gets his town back... but for today - Pirates' Day - it belongs to the Dread Captain DeMeza and her crew. Yarrr! And remember: lookin' the part's only HALF the celebration. Talk like a pirate, $glad:lass,!", "Tomorrow, the baron gets his town back... but for today - Pirates' Day - it belongs to the Dread Captain DeMeza and her crew. Yarrr! And remember: lookin' the part's only HALF the celebration. Talk like a pirate, lad", "Tomorrow, the baron gets his town back... but for today - Pirates' Day - it belongs to the Dread Captain DeMeza and her crew. Yarrr! And remember: lookin' the part's only HALF the celebration. Talk like a pirate, lass,!" },
	["查尔·硬皮"] = { "Meat, skin, bones... a good hunter lets nothing go to waste. Every scrap of leather can be salvaged, perhaps to reinforce an ally's armor. Thus, each of us is strong alone, but together we become invincible.", "We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, $N. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive." },
	["查尔利"] = { "Shh! Keep your voice down. The babes are sleeping." },
	["查理·沃尔斯"] = { "Good day to you!", "I have ventured to dark places and learned the tailoring recipe for the Deathchill Cloak. This cloak is a tradeable Epic cloak for spellcasters that grants Spellpower, Haste and Critical Strike. I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to. Someone who had completed most of the quests across Northrend and had the \"Loremaster of Northrend\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Deathchill Cloak.", "In my travels I have learned the recipe for the Wispcloak. This cloak is a tradeable Epic spellcasting cloak that grants Stamina, Spellpower, Intellect and Mana Recovery. I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to. Someone who had completed all the normal dungeons of Northrend and had the \"Northrend Dungeonmaster\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Wispcloak.", "Since you are a tailor of some skill, I can tell you that I know some special recipes. I know recipes for both the Wispcloak and the Deathchill Cloak." },
	["查瑞斯·伊瑟里安"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["查莉·诺斯托"] = { "Welcome! If you need a place to rest, I can solve that problem." },
	["柯布神父"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?" },
	["柯纳"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["根妮亚·符文图腾"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c. His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us. Never forget this.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us. Never forget this.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us. Never forget this." },
	["格伦尼克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["格兰尼斯·快斧"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks he's a warrior. Ha!", "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen! A $c who thinks she's a warrior. Ha!" },
	["格兰尼斯·月晨"] = { "Stray arcane forces can do strange things to the land, the elements and even the spirits of the dead." },
	["格卡斯"] = { "Can't you see I'm fishing here!", "You scared the fish away! What do you want?" },
	["格尔坎·血拳"] = { "You are welcome among us, $c. At least for the time being." },
	["格巴里"] = { "How you be doin' mon?" },
	["格德"] = { "Be advised, $g Jackson : Princess; - I am in no mood for any comment that you think is cute or funny. I am here to make sure that the Arch Druid's research proceeds as planned, and my orders are to weed out all non-hackers who do not pack the gear to serve in my beloved Cenarion Circle.", "Be advised, Jackson - I am in no mood for any comment that you think is cute or funny. I am here to make sure that the Arch Druid's research proceeds as planned, and my orders are to weed out all non-hackers who do not pack the gear to serve in my beloved Cenarion Circle.", "Be advised, Princess - I am in no mood for any comment that you think is cute or funny. I am here to make sure that the Arch Druid's research proceeds as planned, and my orders are to weed out all non-hackers who do not pack the gear to serve in my beloved Cenarion Circle." },
	["格拉兹"] = { "We are the last of the furbolg race... The Timbermaw tribe remains uncorrupted, yet we face the same hostility from outsiders; most believe that it is not possible... that there could actually be furbolg that escaped the corruption... Angry at those that strive to make enemies too quickly, my brethren now attack any that draw near; they trust no one. But perhaps, if you strive to make your presence peaceful with them, they might look upon you as an ally.", "You must find a way to show that you both are fighting for the same side. Although the Timbermaw may attack you now, if you are diligent, you will find a way. You must remember that any attacks on the Timbermaw furbolg directly will greatly hinder your chances of gaining them as an ally. A good place to start would be the Deadwood furbolg found in many parts of Felwood. These furbolg are the enemy of the Timbermaw tribe, and slaying them would greatly improve your standing with the Timbermaw." },
	["格拉哈姆·范·塔伦"] = { "The Dark Lady has said that knowledge will be our greatest weapon in this war." },
	["格拉尼克·古斯提"] = { "They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can't remember. Stupid saying anyway." },
	["格拉布"] = { "Dig rats make some surprisingly tasty stew." },
	["格拉达夫"] = { "It's here... somewhere... I know it. Somewhere in this library is the knowledge I'm looking for..." },
	["格林克"] = { "Hey Hey Hey! I am here to promote a fabulous fishing tournament in Stranglethorn but you need to be tough enough to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to fish those waters. Come back later when you are more qualified!", "Heya Heya Heya! If you want to test your fishing skills then I have just the place for you! This Sunday we have a fishing tournament in Stranglethorn!" },
	["格林德·火花"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["格林戈"] = { "How may I be of service?" },
	["格沙弗"] = { "I don't know what to think of your kind yet, $r. Some of you can be violent and kill sporelings on sight. You seem friendly... though maybe a little bit funny looking, I suppose." },
	["格瑞克·考恩"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["格瑞夫"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Wot kin I do fer ye?" },
	["格瑞姆塔克"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["格瑞戈·玛克温斯"] = { "Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind. These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies. Not saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.", "Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses! Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount. A horse is a companion for the ages, friend. Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!" },
	["格瑞曼德·艾尔默"] = { "If you've come looking for the finest craftsmanship on this or any other continent in the world, then you've come to the right place! Grimand Elmore, at your service!" },
	["格瑞沙"] = { "As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble. Where are you heading $N?" },
	["格瑞诺尔·石印"] = { "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently." },
	["格罗克姆·死眼"] = { "Need your blade sharpened, or perhaps a new weapon? Better safe than sorry..." },
	["格罗杜姆·钢须"] = { "$N, have ye any idea o' what we're up against in Alterac Valley? Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?" },
	["格罗科尔"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["格罗萨·硬须"] = { "Pleased to meet you, $c." },
	["格罗达尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further. Move along please.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c." },
	["格莱奇·菲兹巴克"] = { "Men -- can't live with them, can't live without them. Well, you can... but it's just really boring." },
	["格莱斯·瑟登"] = { "The Wildhammer dwarves might have fast steeds, but can those Aerie Peak gryphons stand the heat of The Great Forge? I think not!" },
	["格莱森·铁翼"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["格莱菲"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["格里伏塔"] = { "Ahaha, ya see this? Griftah's BACK! Back in my stall, back with my old wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya! Want to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!" },
	["格里兹尔"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.", "The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed! Ready for Alterac Valley $c?" },
	["格里安·斯托曼上尉"] = { "With the Light's blessing and your help, $N, the Defias are no longer a threat. But we're a long way from Westfall up here, and if we don't win this battle, there may not be a home to return to." },
	["格里布·拉姆罗克"] = { "Hey there. If you wanna get to Northrend, then The Mighty Wind is the way to go. She'll fly you straight to Warsong Hold in the Borean Tundra." },
	["格里斯罗维"] = { "I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She's due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives." },
	["格里高利·维克托医生"] = { "Greetings, $N. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma.", "It is good to see you again, Doctor $N. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques. Return to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know." },
	["格隆达尔·月风"] = { "I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin.", "Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience." },
	["格雷克"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["格雷兹·怒拳"] = { "Are you here for training? Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind, $c. Find your own trainer before you anger me.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["格雷兹克斯·斯宾德斯纳普"] = { "Best keep yer head down, \"matey!\" If ye know what I mean! Yarrrr!" },
	["格雷塔"] = { "This hide isn't ready to work with yet. I wish it didn't take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can't be good for my health, you know?" },
	["格雷塔·苔蹄"] = { "I welcome you, $N. And the Emerald Circle welcomes you. Hopefully together we can help rejuventate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within. Do not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land." },
	["格雷姆罗克·匹斯诺尔"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!", "Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge. She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\"." },
	["格雷尔·岩锤"] = { "Where can I send ya to today?" },
	["格雷尼·长须"] = { "Mirren and I are two of the very best hunters on either side of the Dark Portal. Stick around, you might learn a thing or two." },
	["格雷戈·查尔斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it." },
	["格雷戈·格雷斯通"] = { "Greetings, my friend. May the Dawn keep you well in these troubled times." },
	["格雷戈里·阿杜斯"] = { "May the light guide your path and aid you in your journeys. If you need any assistance browsing, I will be right over here." },
	["格雷斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the Light protect you this day.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["格雷甘·山酒"] = { "Heh, heh... Quite the inquisitive one, aren't ya, $n? Well, here's what you need to do. North of here, in the old ruins, lives a very disagreeable gnoll by the name of Miblon Snarltooth. He guards the only Evoroot I know of, but he watches it night and day! Seems like he never even sleeps! What you can do, is bribe him. I can sell you some bait that he'll find tasty -- just put it down near him and that will distract him long enough for you to grab the Evoroot. Good luck!" },
	["格雷米斯塔克"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["格鲁伯·巨锤"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.", "What are ye doin\" here?! Get yer chatty self ta Alterac Vallery, where ye\"re needed!" },
	["格鲁努斯·削钢"] = { "Welcome back to the Great Forge, $N. Ye come to visit an old Dwarf or do ye think yer ready for the next step in yer training?", "Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage." },
	["格鲁塔恩"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["格鲁姆·石须"] = { "Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him." },
	["格鲁雷尔"] = { "May your skills in smelting dark iron serve you well, $N. But do not let your knowledge corrupt you... as it corrupted us." },
	["桑德"] = { "Who says Orcs aren't smart? It takes a lot of brains to be an engineer!" },
	["桑迪恩"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals." },
	["档案员蓓塔"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["梅丽德丝·卡尔森"] = { "Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind. These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies. Not saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.", "Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses! Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount. A horse is a companion for the ages, friend. Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!" },
	["梅尔南·黑石"] = { "Boys and girls - children of all ages - the Darkmoon Faire has arrived! Huzzah!", "It's here! The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business! Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!", "The Darkmoon Faire has come to town! Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you'll ever see!", "The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire. Don't miss it!", "The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed. Be sure to visit it today!" },
	["梅拉吉特"] = { "If you be wantin' ta rest here, ya just need to ask!" },
	["梅洛克·远途"] = { "As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords." },
	["梅纳拉·沃伦德"] = { "Kar Aman, $N. You look to be a strong $c--you would do well to mind yourself in this area. Touching things you know nothing about, or showing disrespect to your elders is just cause for punishment. You may not respect me or my companions, but you will learn to respect our power if you prove foolish enough. Now, enough with the pleasantries, was there something I can do for you?" },
	["梅罗什"] = { "If you prove that you are a true ally, I might consider training you..." },
	["梅贝丝·河风"] = { "I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant. The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently. All are a vital part of Felwood's ecosystem.", "Taurahe? The tauren druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her. Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles. She points at you and smiles once more. She finally motions several times down the path to the south. Perhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further down the road?", "There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them. I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me. You will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss.", "These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse! Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves. If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!" },
	["梅达·希恩"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["梦境之龙麦琳瑟拉"] = { "All will know of what has transpired here in this accursed temple, hero. It will be written about in history books - the tales told as legend from Azeroth to the far reaches of the Nether itself!" },
	["梦言长者"] = { "Elder Ragetotem spends her days at the Valley of the Watchers in Tanaris Desert.", "For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater.", "Go to the Freewind Post in Thousand Needles and you will find Elder Skyseer.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Zul'Farrak in Tanaris Desert is Elder Wildmane's home." },
	["森金冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["森金勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["棱石长者"] = { "For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater.", "If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["植物学家塔尼安雷尔"] = { "Can you not see that I am busy here?", "Do not waste my time. What is it you want?", "Yes? What do you want?" },
	["植物学家塔蕾克丝"] = { "How are we ever going to get out of here?", "None will question your actions, $c. You did what had to be done." },
	["植物学家娜萨兰"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["欢乐制造器操作员"] = { "New this year: the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt. Step on up and don't be shy! And sign these forms before you try it, we're still working a few bugs out of this thing..." },
	["欢快的人类灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的侏儒灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的兽人灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的占星者灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的奥尔多灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的巨魔灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的德莱尼灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的暗夜精灵灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的牛头人灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的矮人灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的血精灵灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的被遗忘者灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欢快的达拉然灵魂"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["欧塞兰"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["欧姆萨·雷角"] = { "Where can I send you today $c?" },
	["欧尔嘉，无赖港的妇人"] = { "What's it going to be, then? Rum? Ale? Or perhaps something else?", "You ever tried on Synthebrew Goggles? They're surprisingly uncomfortable!" },
	["欧尔洛克"] = { "You look like you may know your way around a beast that runs on land, but if you want to soar, it'll take training and dedication. And gold. You have gold, right?" },
	["欧尼纳斯"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals." },
	["欧文·沃弗恩"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["欧格鲁姆"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Don't waste my time.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["欧洛恩·远行者"] = { "The untamed plains of Nagrand offer some of the best hunting I've ever experienced." },
	["欧玛利·萨普纳波"] = { "These druids have tapped a tremendous source of power! They can turn into animals... project lightning and intense moonlight... I must discover how they do it! Perhaps they're wearing batteries underneath those robes..." },
	["欧瑞克·图哈特"] = { "The Argent Crusade is here in force, friend. We weren't going to let you have all the glory!" },
	["欧罗拉克"] = { "Do you like fish, $r? I have fish here. If you like fresh fish, the freshest, come and sample my wares." },
	["欧鲁诺克·裂心"] = { "A wave of sickness rushed through me. After the ritual was over, I ran home to my children. I gathered what belongings I could carry in my arms and left with my boys. We ran to the hills and hid. There really was no other option... Not a day goes by that I don't think of the cut. It has taken 20 years to reconnect with the elements. It has taken 20 years for the elements to even begin to heal.", "Are you ready to hear the story of the Cipher of Damnation, $N?", "As I said, the cipher was found by Illidan when he took over the Black Temple. He divided the tome into three parts and charged their care to his minions. My boys... My boys are grown now. When I got word of what Illidan had done with the cipher, I sent my boys to recover the pieces. You must find my boys, $N. You must find them and recover the Cipher of Damnation.", "Greetings, traveler. I am Oronok. Please, sit by my fire and warm yourself. Beware the ravenous beasts of the shattered shelf below us!", "I will never forget that day, $r. Never. Even though I had long since abandoned shamanism in favor of shadow magic, I felt the cut. A sense of loss so profound... I could not explain it to you with mere words. When the tie to the elements was severed, all orcs on Draenor changed. If there was ever any doubt in the power of the shadows, it was washed away with the cresting of the molten lava over the shattered earth.", "The Cipher of Damnation was kept in Gul'dan's private quarters inside Karabor for twenty years. Ah, that's right, you have no idea what Karabor is, do you? The Black Temple... Aye, now home to Illidan Stormrage. When Illidan took control of the Black Temple, he discovered the cipher. He recognized that the damage to this world had already been done but thought it wise to keep the cipher secure for later use.", "Very well. The words you seek have a name, $N. They are known as the Cipher of Damnation: The words uttered by Gul'dan himself to shatter this land. The very spell that severed the last remaining tie the orcs had with the elements of Draenor. <Oronok nods.> Aye, it is the cipher that you must reconstruct and ultimately the words of the cipher that you must call.", "When you stand at the Altar of Damnation and see the spirits of the damned, kneeling in prayer, what you do not see is me, standing next to Gul'dan. <Oronok nods.> I told you that I was a lot of things, did I not? One of those 'things' was a lieutenant of Gul'dan. I have done many terrible things in my life. I have slaughtered man, woman, and child alike. Danced in the blood of innocent draenei... yet... <Oronok chokes on his words.>" },
	["止松大使弗拉萨布"] = { "<As you greet Ambassador Frasaboo in the furbolg language, he smiles.> You must be the one spoken of in the prophecy. It is a great honor to meet you. I am Ambassador Frasaboo, High Chief Stillpine's representative in Blood Watch." },
	["止松老酋长"] = { "It is you who will defend my people and usher in a new era of prosperity for Stillpine!", "Promised One, we thank you for the warning. The Stillpine tribe will be prepared.", "[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor...", "[Furbolg] Poorov'tarkh!", "[Furbolg] Yar vartslaf?" },
	["止松部族的厄尔"] = { "How can I help you, stranger?", "[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor...", "[Furbolg] Poorov'tarkh!", "[Furbolg] Yar vartslaf?" },
	["止松酋长"] = { "Good tidings, $c. I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the throne of Stillpine.", "[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor...", "[Furbolg] Poorov'tarkh!", "[Furbolg] Yar vartslaf?" },
	["步兵欧恩达"] = { "We protect this airship on its way from Orgrimmar to Grom'gol base camp in Stranglethorn Vale." },
	["步兵沃塔·怒拳"] = { "I have to clean up this mess, but I'll do it without complaint. You'll help if you have any Horde pride at all!" },
	["武神"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior. Why don't you go do something safe, like read a book.", "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["死亡尖啸者古拉"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["死亡猎手拉扎尔"] = { "The ground... is frozen. We're sitting ducks here; these meatwagons aren't going anywhere.", "What does it look like? The ground is frozen like a rock! The wheels on these meatwagons were built to go over mud at best. We're going to need an abomination and some chains to salvage them." },
	["死亡猎手维赛里"] = { "When the tournament starts, all will see the Forsaken emerge triumphant." },
	["死亡猎手费恩"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["死亡骑士新兵"] = { "Are you challenging me, $g brother:sister;?", "Are you challenging me, brother?", "Are you challenging me, sister?" },
	["残忍的亚纳尔"] = { "I should kill you where you stand, $r! Get on with your inane prattling and then begone!" },
	["残忍的杜亚希"] = { "The Horde must not allow the draenei and their meddling Alliance to control all the mana cells in Outland. Will you join the blood elves in their assault on the Eye of the Storm?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["毒翼"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["比克斯"] = { "Aw, don't want to train with me? What other weapon catches your eye?", "Buliwyf here will happily teach you everything there is to know about guns!", "Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can train you in the use of bows.", "Maces are a specialty of Buliwyf's! He's around this shop somewhere, grousing. If his training techniques aren't your style, I hear the draenei weapon master in the Exodar, Handiir, knows his way around the weapon too! He's up on the Trader's Tier there.", "My pal Buliwyf here can show you how to use fist weapons... or, if you prefer, Ilyenia Moonfire - she's the night elf weapon master on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus - can show you, too!", "Staves are taught by both Woo Ping, the master found at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, and Ilyenia Moonfire, who trains the night elves on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus.", "There are two masters of the sword: Handiir and Woo Ping. The former can be found in the Trader's Tier of the Exodar, and the latter in Weller's Arsenal within Stormwind.", "There's no finer expert I know on axes than Buliwyf here! One hand, two hands... he's a master of it all!", "Well hi there! Are you here to learn the proper technique of a new weapon?", "Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind." },
	["比兹尔·奎利弗"] = { "S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it's a valuable training asset. If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything! Just try not to hit me." },
	["比利尔"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["比利巴布·旋轮"] = { "If you insert tab A into slot B then of course it's going to go BOOM! Here, let me show you what I have and then you can ask Lilliam about how to put it together so it doesn't blow up." },
	["比尔班·飞钳"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Due to incompatibility on your class specification, I am unable to help you rectify any situation you have with lack of ability.", "Excellent! You meet the required parameters and specifications. What can I do for you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["比希·钳柄"] = { "Keep your voice down. We wouldn't want to attract any attention from these beasties!" },
	["比普·格利兹托"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["比比尔法兹"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["比鲁拉"] = { "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here." },
	["水之先知伊斯伦"] = { "You've come further than many, $N. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most." },
	["水手亨德尔"] = { "Fine day fer sailin', innit?" },
	["水手伊文瓦·长夜"] = { "Many have been lost to the seas. I, and the wisps, are charged with looking for those souls." },
	["水手哈特斯"] = { "The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we've been assigned to guard her passengers." },
	["水手埃伊米·迷雾"] = { "I'm afraid I cannot speak with you at the moment." },
	["水手塞戈·烁星"] = { "The seas are a dangerous place, $c. We must be alert." },
	["水手奈斯塔·霜夜"] = { "Elune has blessed us many times over with all the discoveries we have made. But we must remain vigilant, $c." },
	["水手威尔斯"] = { "This greyin' seadog may be the oldest of the crew, but he's also the toughest of the lot! Eh? Eh? Arms like an ogre!" },
	["水手安德森"] = { "The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we've been assigned to guard her passengers." },
	["水手尼斯达·暗星"] = { "Elune has blessed us many times over with all the discoveries we have made. But we must remain vigilant, $c." },
	["水手希克尔·远途"] = { "I'm sorry, I've little time for speaking to anyone other than the wisps and the captain to report my findings. Forgive me." },
	["水手斯蒂维·永夜"] = { "Forgive me $c, but I must concentrate on my job." },
	["水手斯通希尔"] = { "Unlucky name fer a sailor, innit?" },
	["水手格林德·金夜"] = { "Forgive me, $r, I must focus on my job." },
	["水手法塞特·远界"] = { "The wisps and I watch the seas for any lost souls." },
	["水手维克斯"] = { "Torgoley works us hard, but he's a good captain, aye." },
	["水手维斯帕·刃语"] = { "The seas are a dangerous place, $c. We must be alert." },
	["水手萨弗·轻歌"] = { "We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas." },
	["水手蒂特·月刃"] = { "We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas." },
	["水手费尔弗克"] = { "I'm almost jealous of our Mr. Wavesinger. Why, he may well be prettier than me!" },
	["水手韦恩斯"] = { "Can't ya see I'm workin' here, $glad:lass;? Off with ya, afore Kowalski sees me jawin.\\", "Can't ya see I'm workin' here, lad? Off with ya, afore Kowalski sees me jawin.\\", "Can't ya see I'm workin' here, lass? Off with ya, afore Kowalski sees me jawin.\\" },
	["水歌长者"] = { "Elder Nightwind passes the days at the shrine in Jaedenar in Felwood.", "Elder Skygleam can be found near the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara.", "Elder Starweave can be found at the coastal village of Auberdine in Darkshore.", "Last I knew, Elder Stonespire was at Everlook in Winterspring.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["永恒守望者拉罗沙尔"] = { "Ancient forces stir - forces that have not been seen or felt for thousands of years. The world weeps, $r. Perhaps a new sundering comes. A sickness born from within... The foulness has begun to seep into our lands. From the Dream come nightmares. Nightmares to befoul us in our waking hours...", "Greetings, traveler. It was here, nearly 1,000 years past, that the Qiraji began their march of destruction across Kalimdor. Thousands of lives were lost during the war, most in this cursed desert during the initial invasion. I am one of only a few that remain, chained to both the past and the present. I know not why I am to remain stationed here but I know that I must.", "I have been slain a hundred times. I always wake here, alive. Some say I am cursed and others...", "They say that I am blessed: A herald to harken in a new age." },
	["永歌森林护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["永歌聚会者"] = { "Ack, I don't feel so good.", "And you would be?", "Can you believe the nerve of that Elisara Sunstriker? Thinking that she can catch the eye of Lord Saltheril? And did you see what she's wearing? So last season. It's sad, really.", "Hey everyone, it's $N!", "Hi, $N! Enjoying the party?", "Hmm... I think this year's Suntouched Special isn't so special afterall. Wouldn't you agree, $N?", "Huh, what? What happened?", "I heard a rumor that we're all going to go watch the battle with the scourge at the border tonight. How delightfully wicked!", "Oh... do I know you?", "Sorry, I don't speak with the help.", "Ugh... go away!", "You should try the springpaw appetizers, they're to die for!" },
	["汀克·亮钉"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["汉兹·跳链"] = { "How do you do, $c?" },
	["汉瑟尔·重拳"] = { "When Lolo doesn't wanna spill any o' his precious ale or get his lil' dress dirty, I'm called in. Yep. Ol' Hansel is the dwarf they use to mete out a lil' bit o' justice an' a whole lotta pain." },
	["汉诺维亚"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals." },
	["污染者大使"] = { "Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $N. So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however. I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city.", "You are not yet powerful enough, $c. Move along." },
	["汤姆·海格尔"] = { "Some of us get to avoid military duty. A good fisherman's always handy... even generals need to eat." },
	["沃兰纳库"] = { "Greetings, traveler." },
	["沃尔德"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You come in search of training, hunter?" },
	["沃尔特"] = { "The Dude, over yonder, is pretty upset about his rug." },
	["沃尔蒂萨"] = { "An Emerald Drake at full power can perform Dream Funnel, which transfers the drake's own life energy to a friendly target, healing it. Leeching Poison can be used to restore health lost when using this ability.", "Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed. I can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the Green Fight. Speak to Belgaristrasz or Eternos if you prefer to draw on the power of the Red or the Bronze.", "Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed. The full power of your drakes has been unlocked. Use their power to defeat Eregos!", "Emerald Drakes excel at healing themselves while poisoning their enemies. Using Leeching Poison, they can steal health from their enemies. Repeated applications of this poison can increase the effect. With Touch the Nightmare, Emerald Drakes can reach into the Dream, converting a portion of their life energy into a highly damaging attack that leaves the target weakened, reducing its damage for a short time.", "The Green Flight is in your debt.", "The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring. He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances! Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures. Seek him out above.", "Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring. Your drakes are more than a match for the Ring Guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself. Ten Centrifuge Constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above. Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable.", "Your greatest challenge lies ahead. Ley-Guardian Eregos is a Blue dragon of immense power. You will find him flying above the uppermost ring." },
	["沃德辛"] = { "I have just the thing you need to cast your spell." },
	["沃特尔·索雷夫"] = { "Hey $c, if you've lost a key I might be able to help you out." },
	["沃科尔"] = { "<Volcor doesn't look at you at all as you get close to him. He seems to be concentrating on keeping his bandages from falling off. After a moment, he looks up at you, a little startled.> Oh, sorry, $c. Now's not a good time. I hope you understand.", "Well, the way I see it, $N, we have two options to consider for leaving this cave. We can make our way stealthfully--I use the cloak you've given me, and you'd be left to your own devices, or, and this may be a harder option considering my wounds, we fight our way out back to back. I'll let you decide since you know your strengths better than I." },
	["沃萨·布拉克塞尔"] = { "Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so." },
	["沃金"] = { "Another hero? The fates smile upon us on this day, $N.", "Zalazane's time be runnin' out. De Echo Isles will belong to de Darkspear Tribe again!" },
	["沃雷恩中将"] = { "Throm'ka, $gbrother:sister;! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it's glorious battle you've come seeking, you'll have your fill of it here.", "Throm'ka, brother! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it's glorious battle you've come seeking, you'll have your fill of it here.", "Throm'ka, sister! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it's glorious battle you've come seeking, you'll have your fill of it here." },
	["沙兰尤斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, my $g brother : sister;. How can I guide you today?", "Greetings, my brother. How can I guide you today?", "Greetings, my sister. How can I guide you today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "This land has been ravaged by the crash. While you may not follow our philosophies, $c, I urge you to do whatever you can to aid in the healing process.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["沙塔尔·碎颅"] = { "It is no easy task to protect the Horde's lumber gathering efforts here in Ashenvale, but we have never shied from battle! The night elves and their allies will fall!" },
	["沙塔斯城市卫兵"] = { "High Enchanter Bardolan may be found in the Seer's Library on Scryer's Tier. A grand master of the art, he is surrounded by his students: masters, artisans, experts, and journeymen.", "Inessera is a sharp woman who carries various gems as well as jewelcrafting supplies. You can find her shop in the northern part of Aldor Rise.", "Jack Trapper can be found cooking in the lower city's open market, in the southeast.", "Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you're looking for. She sells her wares in the eastern portion of Scryer's Tier.", "Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you're looking for. She sells her wares outside the large library on Scryer's Tier.", "Lorokeem, grand master alchemist and Skettis outcast, lives among the other arakkoa in the northwest portion of the lower city.", "Mildred Fletcher may be found within the infirmary in the northeastern section of the lower city.", "Our resident alchemist Lorokeem brought his equipment with him, in fact. It may be slightly different from what you're used to - he is an arakkoa, after all - but it should serve your needs. He roosts in the northwest portion of the lower city.", "Seymour, the principal skinner in Shattrath and grand master of the trade, may be found in the lower city's open marketplace.", "Shattrath's battlemasters often congregate on the stairwells between the upper and lower city. The Alliance battlemasters gather in one place, the Horde in another, with the arena battlemasters between and across from them.", "Shattrath's flight master is Nutral. You will find him east of the city's center.", "Shattrath's inns are full of wounded refugees. Still, there is room among the draenei Aldor and blood elf Scryers on Aldor Rise and Scryer's Tier.", "The Aldor bank is located northwest of the the city's center.", "The Aldor inn is located high above Shattrath city, on Aldor Rise. The lift to there is northwest of the city center.", "The Alliance battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell northeast of the city's center.", "The Arena battlemasters are in the southeast lower city, along the wall.", "The Horde battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell southeast of the city's center.", "The Scryers bank is located southeast of the city's center.", "The Scryers inn is located above Shattrath city, on Scryer's Tier. The lift to there is southwest of the city center.", "The World's End Tavern may be found in the easternmost portion of the lower city.", "The armor and weapons crafters Kradu Grimblade and Zula Slagfury may be found working at a great forge in the lower city.", "The draenei grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found among his people on the Aldor Rise.", "The grand master leatherworker Darmari may be found in the lower city's open marketplace.", "There are stable masters just outside both the draenei and blood elf inns on Aldor Rise and Scryer's Tier.", "There are two banks in Shattrath, both along the rim of the central city hub. One is run by the draenei Aldor, the other by the blood elf Scryers.", "There are two gem merchants in residence: one works closely with the Scryers, and the other is loyal to the Aldor. Whom do you seek?", "Welcome to Shattrath City, seat of the Sha'tar in Outland. You seek guidance?", "What sort of trainer were you looking for?", "You will find mailboxes within or just outside the Aldor and Scryers banks and inns." },
	["沙尔蕾恩"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["沙尔迪"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["沙德拉斯·月树"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace. In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place." },
	["沙德雷克"] = { "I think I'll make my own money on the side while the others try to decide whether it's okay to go into Oshu'gun. Time is profit!" },
	["沙鲁蒙"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["治安官玛克布莱德"] = { "Hey, citizen! You look like a stout one. We guards are spread a little thin out here, and I could use your help..." },
	["法多恩"] = { "Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly." },
	["法尔拉特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my brother. Do you seek further guidance today?", "In the Light we all cast shadows, my sister. Do you seek further guidance today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["法尔林·树影"] = { "What now? Can't you see I'm rather busy?" },
	["法师中尉玛利斯特"] = { "I advise the captain on matters that he chooses to share with me, but I have a feeling that he'd rather hear from you." },
	["法德拉"] = { "Welcome to Forest Song, $c. If there is anything I can do for you, please let me know." },
	["法恩森"] = { "The bog lords are devouring the spore sacs! They've got to be stopped!" },
	["法拉·柔蹄"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["法拉克斯"] = { "I do not enjoy conversation." },
	["法拉德"] = { "Come to learn from the master eh?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do I look like a $c to you? Now run along before I feel the need to oil my blade... in your blood.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["法蕾尔·星歌"] = { "I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors. It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!" },
	["法里"] = { "I wish I had more time to teach all who came before me, but alas that is not the way of things. Until you have learned all that Padaar has to teach, I cannot help you." },
	["法雷什"] = { "If you have the money, I have what you need." },
	["波克希·博斯宾"] = { "My S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it's a valuable training asset. If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything! Just try not to hit me." },
	["波尔·冻石"] = { "Hey there! Are you interested in learning some more about racing rams and ram racing?", "Keeping your ram in a canter or gallop for too long will exhaust him. If you want your ram to recover a bit, let him walk or trot. If there are apple bushels around, take him there to recover.", "Once you start loosening the reins on the ram, you'll see his speed change. He starts off walking. Ease up on the reins a bit more and he'll start to trot. Give him more slack on the reins while he's trotting and he'll go into a canter. Give him even more slack while he's in a canter and you will send him into a gallop.", "Ram racing is easier than it seems, but it takes skill to master. Just use the reins, eat apples if you can and avoid exhausting your ram.", "When you get a ram, you also get the reins. These aren't your grandma's reins though, you've gotta use them! Just loosen up on the reins a few times to build up some speed. Keep on loosening up and GIDDYUP! You'll be flying! But the faster he goes the quicker he'll get tired. So you have to be careful.", "When you take one of these tasks, we'll lend you a ram. It's a loan, so it won't last forever. The ram may seem slow, but just ease up on the reins a bit and he'll pick up the pace. Our rams love apples. We've put a few bushels of apples out along the way, so make sure to stop by. Eating apples will make your ram forget about how tired he's been getting." },
	["波尔图"] = { "I sell wares that crafters need. Just the basics, nothing fancy." },
	["波尔泰姆"] = { "Have you seen the way Ros'eleth winks at me whenever I go to pick up a garment or hat? When things settle down around here, I'm going to take her for a nice walk in the woods. For once, I miss all those fancy taverns in Stormwind." },
	["波尔温"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["波希·匹斯顿"] = { "If you're looking for gadgets, doodads, thingamajigs, widgets, whatsis, dohickeys, or gizmos, you've come to the right place!" },
	["波特加"] = { "No, you aren't hearing things. I actually do have the voice of a young orc woman. But you listen here, $g boy:girl;, time travel does strange things to a body. By the way, it's 250 years.", "No, you aren't hearing things. I actually do have the voice of a young orc woman. But you listen here, boy, time travel does strange things to a body. By the way, it's 250 years.", "No, you aren't hearing things. I actually do have the voice of a young orc woman. But you listen here, girl, time travel does strange things to a body. By the way, it's 250 years." },
	["波玛尔"] = { "Good day, $c. If you wish to learn the smith's art, you've come to the right place." },
	["波贝"] = { "Heya mon. Go talk to mah Master Gadrin right over there. Take care of that Zalazane crazy for him and I fix ya right up!", "Ya mon, I be Gadrin's assistant. Dis here volunteer work be my way of gettin through Witch Doctor School. Since you help him, I help ya for free. Whatcha need fixin?" },
	["波雷·寒冬图腾"] = { "Come in out of the cold and rest your weary bones a while. Our hospitality is yours." },
	["泰伦斯·迈特利"] = { "The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["泰伦瑞诺·月影"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["泰兰希尔"] = { "Ishnu-alah, $gbrother:sister;. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil.", "Ishnu-alah, brother. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil.", "Ishnu-alah, sister. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil." },
	["泰兰德·语风"] = { "The moment we've been dreading is now at hand, $C. Archimonde has made his way to Nordrassil, and is beginning to devour the World Tree's energies. Malfurion needs more time for his plan to work, so we must do the unthinkable. You must attack Archimonde directly, while my own troops hold off the streams of Burning Legion forces approaching the top of the mount." },
	["泰姆·暴怒图腾"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.", "Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory $c. You look like the one to lead them." },
	["泰戈·晨行者"] = { "Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now." },
	["泰拉·远途"] = { "No, don't feel bad. I get that a lot. <Taela looks both amused and annoyed.> I'm a HIGH elf, not a blood elf. Don't worry, I'm not going to suck all of the magic out of you." },
	["泰罗伦"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["泰罗卡森林护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["泰罗卡森林护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["泰莉"] = { "I've never seen anything like these nether dragons. They seem to have inherited their sire's temperment, but they have become something entirely different." },
	["泰达希尔卫兵"] = { "A Rut'theran Ferry leaves for Auberdine from Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil. The portal in Darnassus will allow you to reach Rut'theran safely.", "A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home. I believe she can be found just north of the Inn.", "A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar.", "A rogue? I'm not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you're looking for. You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar.", "Ah, gentle Seriadne. All animals are safe while in her care. You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.", "Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade. You should be able to find her there now.", "Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession. Should you wish to learn the Enchanter's profession you will need to go there to find her.", "All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al'Ameth. You should try looking for someone to train you there.", "Byancie has often lent her services to the sentinels who patrol the local wilds. You should talk to her if you desire to learn First Aid.", "Byancie's skill in First Aid has proven useful on numerous occasions. You can find her just north of the Inn in Dolanaar if you wish to learn from her.", "Cyndra's knowledge in alchemy is somewhat limited, but I'm sure it would be sufficient to get you started. She practices her craft just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.", "Dazalar is well known around Dolanaar for his hunting skill. Why don't you talk to him and see what he can teach you?", "Documents such as guild creation papers can be acquired from the Guild Master in the city of Darnassus.", "Feyden Darkin is on the second floor in the center of the Craftsman's Terrace.", "Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach. Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar.", "I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus. When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor.", "I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once. Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well. Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar.", "If a bank is what you desire, then your travels take you to the heart of Darnassus. There you will find storage for your treasures.", "If a hunter is whom you seek, then it is Dazalar that you should visit. He can usually be found just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.", "If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar. Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of.", "Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill. She should be able to provide you with some training. You'll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar.", "Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar. Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest.", "Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them. Certainly he is the one you should learn from. He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.", "Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus. It is not surprising that they all moved there to work. If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus.", "Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus. You must travel there to begin the process of your guild's creation.", "Nadyia has made quite the leatherworker in her years of practice. Travel west on the road to Darnassus to pay her a visit and maybe she can bestow some of her knowledge upon you.", "The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus. Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking. You should see what she can teach you.", "The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar. You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus.", "The bank is located in the serene city of Darnassus. You must go there if you wish to store your possessions.", "The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar. I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require.", "The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding. Which path do you choose to walk?", "There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil. Tell me what you seek.", "To reach the Rut'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.", "We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin's cooking is lacking mind you. Why don't you go see what he can teach you?", "While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade. You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.", "You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus. You should stop by and see what he can teach you.", "You seek a rogue? I believe Jannok would fit that description. Why don't you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar.", "You seek someone who cares for animals? Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar. She is the one that you seek.", "You seek the aid of a Druid? Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar.", "You will find numerous trainers around Dolanaar with ages of experience with which to tutor you. Which would you have me point you to?", "Zarrin seems to have a good knowledge of the cooking trade. Why don't you go see if he will show you some recipes? He is usually cooking over by the Inn in Dolanaar." },
	["泰达希尔护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["泰里恩"] = { "Oh, if I only had a tree branch to hold up in front of me. The guards would never see me then.", "You'll have to be patient with me, $N. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second. Oh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him." },
	["泰金"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours." },
	["泰雷努斯"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["泰龙尼斯"] = { "Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it." },
	["泽尔玛克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["泽弗洛斯特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["泽格·纳克布斯"] = { "These orcs must really be eager to stake their claim in Outland! If I told you how much they were paying for my allegiance, you'd kill me out of jealousy!" },
	["泽莉·哈特诺兹"] = { "Hey, sweetheart. The zeppelin that parks here'll take ya straight to Thunder Bluff, free of charge. Who needs wyverns when you got us goblins here, am I right?" },
	["洁娜·雷姆尼利"] = { "Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you?" },
	["洛伊塔"] = { "I'm in charge of the workers that support the Tauren Chieftains. You know: packing, driving, and unpacking the wagons, building and taking down the stage, setting up the pyrotechnics, all that sort of thing." },
	["洛克加·血握"] = { "I came to this place because of my study into the backward culture that used to be the Thunderlord clan. They were weak and succumbed to the lure of power that came with being transformed into fel orcs through Mannoroth's blood. I have read all of their texts. I am particularly interested in the recovery of an artifact, a drum, an arrow and a tablet that were lost when we crushed the Bladespire ogres and pushed them back down into their hold." },
	["洛克希·拉姆罗基"] = { "Just because something isn't broke doesn't mean you can't fix it. You lookin' for something, sweety?" },
	["洛克莫丹护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["洛卡·刃影"] = { "What's a young $c like you out visiting an old farmer like me?" },
	["洛坎"] = { "Mon, da west wastes of dis place be full o' baddies. Stay away from dis here area if ya want to live!" },
	["洛塞兰"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["洛妮卡·静刃"] = { "My early classes are always filled with bright-eyed young lads. Few make it past the first test, though. I've given up on shouting, 'when I yell vanish, you need to vanish.' They never listen. Now, the test simply kills the inept.", "Never leave home without ample supplies of flash powder, especially when working with others. I guarantee someone will run out every time. When the choice comes down to handing out materials or letting the poor sap die, I help... most of the time.", "Swords, claws, daggers, of course -- I've trained rogues in the use of them all. Now maces, I won't touch maces and I won't instruct any rogue who gets it in his head to wield one. There's nothing stealthy about a mace. You're in for a noisy kill and a long cleanup if you go that route.", "When I first set up my rogue academy in Shattrath, it wasn't nearly this crowded. Then, the refugees started flooding in and the naaru needed every available building to house them. I've closed the doors to my academy for now, but it's not permanent. I'll find a new place to set up. Then, a new generation of rogues will learn such staples as the gouge'n grin, combat looting, and blaming someone else for breaking polymorph. And who can forget the central rule of roguery --- real rogues don't feint." },
	["洛尔克·锐须"] = { "Treasure huntin' and some hearty ale - doesn't get no better than this, $G lad:lass;.", "Treasure huntin' and some hearty ale - doesn't get no better than this, lad.", "Treasure huntin' and some hearty ale - doesn't get no better than this, lass." },
	["洛弗维尔·雷弗鲁"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯"] = { "Can you see them, mortal? No... I did not think you could. Sighted but sightless - it is your gift and your curse.", "In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands. While the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land.", "Their minds are now tainted, $r. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means.", "Then let us pretend that you undergo the long and arduous task of creating the bane necessary to break through the demonic wards placed upon the triad. What would be your next course of action? To face the Defiler in his lair? <Loramus laughs.>", "Tragically, it was Thrall's wisdom that finally sealed the bond between the demon lord and his minions. It was Trebor's regiment that served as the catalyst to unite the demon lord, the shadowsworn sects and the ogres. The lure of nearly unlimited power and the granting of immortal shock troops to each respective leader sealed the deal in blood.", "What Sevine, Allistarj, and Grol did not realize was that just as their servants were bound to the land, so would they be... You see, the price for their own immortality was also imprisonment and eternal servitude under the command of Razelikh. The cruel cunning of Razelikh had emerged the victor once again." },
	["洛林·跃火"] = { "Most of my brethren are disdainful of the Horde's \"barbaric\" ways, and I once counted myself among them. When I was first ordered to this somewhat humid and... fragrant place, I cursed my lot in life. During my studies, however, I grew to appreciate my surroundings. It has a certain charm, don't you think? ...you wouldn't be interested in my studies, of course, not being a mage yourself.", "Most of my brethren are disdainful of the Horde's \"barbaric\" ways, and I once counted myself among them. When I was first ordered to this somewhat humid and... fragrant place, I cursed my lot in life. During my studies, however, I grew to appreciate my surroundings. It has a certain charm, don't you think? Ah, and my studies, of course, were to allow other mages to return here with a spell. Shall I teach you?" },
	["洛特加斯·石须"] = { "The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud." },
	["洛瑟玛·塞隆"] = { "Be strong. Kael'thas has betrayed us and what we know is in flux, but do not lose heart. We will endure, as we always have. Arthas did not crush our spirit when he swept through our land, and neither will Kael'thas. Let it serve as a lesson to us all as we move forward to our prosperous future." },
	["洛瑟蕾丝"] = { "When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake. <Ros'eleth glances around.> Most young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they're taken as apprentices. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage. I don't think I ever quite outgrew the Farstrider phase, to be honest. No one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders running around naked, as my mother used to say." },
	["洛甘纳尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace. In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place." },
	["洛索斯·天痕"] = { "The fabric of which our world is woven is most delicate. It merely takes some knowledge and the application of said knowledge to tear the fabric. It is thusly that rifts are born." },
	["洛纳乌克·冰雾"] = { "It would be an honor to battle alongside of you as a brother of the Horde, $N. I accept your offer.", "Thank you for rescuing me, $N. I will never forget your courage and determination." },
	["派尔·沉默行者"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!" },
	["派尔拉林"] = { "How may I serve?" },
	["派提亚·格罗森"] = { "Hello there, my name is Petra. To my right is my kodo, Dadanga. We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe. If you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could. Dadanga dislikes smoke." },
	["派瑞亚·拉密诺尔"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["派雷亚诺"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["流放者马特克"] = { "What brings you to a bunch of old, washed-up desert dogs like us?" },
	["测量员汉森"] = { "Isn't it just beautiful? Can you see the potential profit?" },
	["测量者尼克维克"] = { "I'm a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I'm not quite certain how I'm supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?! Why can't these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else? Ah well, at least I look good. Say, $g boy : lovely;, have I seen you around here before?", "I'm a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I'm not quite certain how I'm supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?! Why can't these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else? Ah well, at least I look good. Say, boy, have I seen you around here before?", "I'm a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I'm not quite certain how I'm supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?! Why can't these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else? Ah well, at least I look good. Say, lovely, have I seen you around here before?" },
	["浩特·雷角"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, young one.", "Remember, all things are connected. If the beasts were gone from the land, our kind would die from a great loneliness of spirit, for whatever happens to the beasts also happens to the Tauren. Whatever befalls Azeroth befalls all those that inhabit it.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["海军上将奥德修斯"] = { "Thanks for the warning, $N! We shall prepare!", "Watch your step around here, stranger.", "You've been a great help thus far, $N. You would do well to help out the others at the encampment. And don't worry about those goblins, I'm taking care of everything." },
	["海尔伦"] = { "Welcome to Telredor, $c. If you need anything, don't hesitate to ask." },
	["海格纳·快斧"] = { "Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?", "Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?" },
	["海格纳·重枪"] = { "Hegnar Rumbleshot, at your service!" },
	["海达克西斯公爵"] = { "$N, it is good to see you. Our war with the other elemental lords yet rages, but your efforts help ensure our victory.", "Hey there, friend. My name's Remy. I'm from Redridge to the east, and came here looking for business, looking for business. You got any...got any??", "I am Hydraxis, Duke of the Waterlords. You are not an elemental and so cannot understand our struggle, but perhaps we can strike a deal that will benefit us both...", "Welcome back, $N. You've proven a worthy ally against Ragnaros and your presence is always welcome among us.", "You've served our cause with great loyalty, $N. Allow me to present you with an unending source of our elemental quintessence." },
	["海达克西斯禁卫"] = { "Speak not your vulgar language to me! Only Hydraxis can stand it.", "Speak with Hydraxis.", "You have no business with me, little one." },
	["温尼斯·布莱葛"] = { "May Elune walk with you, $c. The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine." },
	["温特白夫人"] = { "Rest your weary bones for a spell." },
	["温瑟拉"] = { "An unspeakable horror dwells here, mortal. C'Thun and his worshippers are not just an affront to nature, their existence presages destruction for Azeroth as we know it. Merithra sacrificed herself a thousand years ago along with Caelestrasz and Arygos because they knew this as well. We're here because of our oath to return for them, but we're also here because C'Thun must be stopped!" },
	["温蒂·达伦"] = { "I'll be damned if these blasted Scourge are going to drive us away! Us settlers gave everything up to start new lives in Northrend. You'd better believe we're going to fight tooth and nail." },
	["游侠克雷安"] = { "Sometimes I stand here, looking into the forest beyond the lake, and I see the land as it once was... green and full of life." },
	["游侠戴戈利恩"] = { "We're too merciful with the Wretched. We ought to drive a sword through each of them. Their boldness in Sunsail Anchorage is unpardonable." },
	["游侠杰拉"] = { "It's been a long day of cutting down the mindless Scourge that endlessly parade down the Dead Scar. I hope you're here to lend a hand and not to waste my time with idle chatter." },
	["游侠瓦兰娜"] = { "I sent Ranger Salissa south to the enclave and Ranger Lethvalin west to Tranquillien more than a day ago! Have you seen either of them? Are you the aid that's been sent back?" },
	["游侠维多兰"] = { "<The blood elf lies on the floor in some manner of induced torpor.>", "<The blood elf quickly regains consciousness as you pour the draught into his mouth.> I owe you my life, $c. Without your help I would've succumbed to the Scourge's painful torture." },
	["游侠维恩娜"] = { "Sin'dorei have lost far too much in the past years. Our land, our homes, even our identities... It's about time we started taking it all back." },
	["游侠莱瑟瓦林"] = { "The high executor and Dame Auriferous are making me wait, but I don't have time for this! My friends are out there dying, $c!" },
	["游侠萨琳娜"] = { "Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals." },
	["游侠萨蕾恩"] = { "Is there no end to these undead? It seems that for every ghoul or skeleton we kill, two take its place." },
	["游侠队长维恩雷"] = { "Though we've arrived at the promised land, $N, much work remains to be done. Our people won't reach Kael'thas if we lunge desperately across Outland. Safe routes must be found, resources must be secured and our enemies must be avoided or destroyed." },
	["湖蛙"] = { "I thought I'd never be free from that terrible curse. You have my gratitude, stranger.", "Take it with my gratitude, $c." },
	["湿地护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["潘娅"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["潘德·缚石"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["濒死的士兵"] = { "Do it, $c...Then... avenge me!", "Please, $r. Release me...", "Please, $r... Leave nothing for the Scourge to raise!", "Uhnhh... It is too late for me, $g brother:sister;. I am... finished...", "Uhnhh... It is too late for me, brother. I am... finished...", "Uhnhh... It is too late for me, sister. I am... finished...", "Wait, $g brother:m'lady;... One last thing...", "Wait, brother... One last thing...", "Wait, m'lady... One last thing...", "We attacked under cover of a blizzard... The Scourge were caught off guard... our victory was certain... Then... from behind us... the Horde came from nowhere. They cost us... everything..." },
	["濒死的狂战士"] = { "Gathering... information... on the Scourge. Alliance forces appeared... We took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear. Pinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them... $g Brother:Sister;... it was... glorious.", "Gathering... information... on the Scourge. Alliance forces appeared... We took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear. Pinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them... Brother... it was... glorious.", "Gathering... information... on the Scourge. Alliance forces appeared... We took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear. Pinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them... Sister... it was... glorious.", "Uhnhh... Don't... bother with me. I am... finished..." },
	["火箭主管弗斯拉格"] = { "Rocket-Chief Fuselage, commander of B.O.O.M - the Braintrust of Orbital Operations and Mechanics - at your service. Are all systems go?! It looks like the X-52 Nether-Rocket still needs a lot of work! Come on people... we're T-minus NEVER here!" },
	["灰烬图腾酋长"] = { "Hail, stranger. If you are looking for a place in need of your help, you have found it. The dead reawaken, walk the land, and arrive on ships from across the great ocean. The fjord grows too dangerous even for us, and soon we must leave for safer lands to the north." },
	["灰烬龙巢古树"] = { "For years beyond counting these woods have burned. They are fueled by an ancient magic and are the mating grounds for the brood mother and her proto-drake consorts. But now a long-forgotten evil has reawakened and seeks once again to enslave the offspring of the brood mother for their own purposes. These vrykul have caused a disturbance that is extending the boundary of the clutch, and threatens your people." },
	["灰熊丘陵护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["灰熊丘陵护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["灰石长者"] = { "Elder Darkcore can be found in the Undercity.", "Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.", "Elder Obsidian wanders near the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.", "Elder Snowcrown can be found in Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["灰谷护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["灰谷护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["灰鬃长者"] = { "Elder Fargal looks over Frosthold in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Kilias can be found inside Drak'Tharon Keep.", "Elder Ohanzee is located in Gundrak.", "Elder Stonebeard resides at Bouldercrag's Refuge in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Tauros found his way to Zim'Torga in Zul'Drak.", "Elder Thoim has spent many years at Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight.", "Elder Yurauk can be found in the Halls of Stone.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["灵语者斯纳尔芬"] = { "The spirits speak all around us. Are you listening, $r?" },
	["灵魂先知加尔托克"] = { "It is said that those who are blessed by the spirits of Auchindoun possess the ability to capture powerful souls in the form of Spirit Shards. I have come across a few of these Spirit Shards throughout my travels but have yet to unlock their secrets. The only thing I have been able to discern is that they seem to originate from the depths of Auchindoun itself. If you happen to come across any of these Spirit Shards I'm sure I could make it worth your while to allow me to take them off your hands..." },
	["灵魂先知斯兰"] = { "It is said that those who are blessed by the spirits of Auchindoun possess the ability to capture powerful souls in the form of Spirit Shards. I have come across a few of these Spirit Shards throughout my travels but have yet to unlock their secrets. The only thing I have been able to discern is that they seem to originate from the depths of Auchindoun itself. If you happen to come across any of these Spirit Shards I'm sure I could make it worth your while to allow me to take them off your hands..." },
	["灵魂医师"] = { "It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living... for a price." },
	["灵魂医者"] = { "It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living... for a price." },
	["炮兵伊莱"] = { "All o' this shootin' at Skorn and other places o'er the horizon, and what do ya think it's gotten me? Cannonball recovery duty! Not exactly what I signed up fer, ya know?" },
	["炮兵匹特洛夫"] = { "Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?! Our stolen zeppelin's almost here... I think I hear her now. Make sure you're onboard when she leaves!", "Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?! Our stolen zeppelin's less than $3078w minutes away. Make sure you're onboard when she leaves!" },
	["炼金师匹斯特苏格"] = { "In need of some alchemy supplies, are we? Or do you have other business with me?" },
	["炼金师卡恩胡"] = { "I can instruct you in alchemy. Interested?" },
	["炼金师格里比"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["炼金师玛洛瑞"] = { "Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?", "Good day, ma'am. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?", "Good day, sir. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?", "You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, $N." },
	["炼金师纳瑞特"] = { "Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn't mean I can't have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong." },
	["炼金师菲肯斯坦"] = { "Greetings, $r. I'm afraid you must excuse me as I'm terribly busy at the moment.", "Hurry, $c! Put the ingredients directly in the pot. Time is of the essence!", "Time is of the essence here, $n. Are you prepared to be tested?" },
	["烈日行者赛恩"] = { "The light of the Sun illuminates the path to wisdom. Where shall we walk today, friend?" },
	["烈焰使者"] = { "Thane Torvald Eriksson's temperamental proto-drake is chained up here." },
	["烟鬼拉鲁恩"] = { "I'm what you call a capitalist, $r." },
	["燃烧平原护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["燃烧平原护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["爆破专家艾米·短线"] = { "Thank the light you are here! I'd accept help from a two-headed ogre at this point. The city has been overrun by troggs! The attempts to wipe them out resulted in mass contamination. But there is still hope. Our scientists who evacuated to Ironforge are working on a cure for the fallout sickness. Meanwhile, if you can help me stop the trogg invasion, perhaps the city can be retaken." },
	["爆破专家莱戈苏"] = { "The time has come to destroy the Vector Coil!" },
	["爱德华·凯恩"] = { "Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift, Tyrael's Hilt. Just whisper it in my ear when you are ready." },
	["牛头人平民"] = { "Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.", "During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.", "I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.", "I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday.", "I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.", "No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!", "The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?", "To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.", "We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!", "When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!", "Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!" },
	["牛头人幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["牛顿·伯恩赛德"] = { "No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!" },
	["牦牛人灵魂医师"] = { "How I can guide your path, young one?" },
	["牦牛村难民"] = { "Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde. I give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command. From this moment until the end of days I live and die - FOR THE HORDE!", "May the Lich King burn in hellfire for what he has called down upon this land.", "My family was slaughtered without mercy. Even the young.", "Only the Horde can save us now.", "The Scourge are a fearless machine set to bring about the end of all life on this world.", "The one that they call Hellscream might be our only hope.", "There is nothing left for us here.", "To avenge my people, to drive out the blight that has engulfed our land - I will take your oath. I will pledge all that I have and all that I am to the Horde.", "We are a people without a home to call our own now.", "Will the Horde grant me the chance to battle the Scourge?" },
	["物资官员梅兹"] = { "I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, $r. State your business or get out of my sight!" },
	["特伦希斯"] = { "$N, I've come to find out how rampant the effects of Fel Moss are throughout Darkshore. The corruption of Teldrassil and our surrounding lands really concerns the druids of the Cenarian Circle, and all Night elves. It is my goal to find out why this has happened and to put an end to it." },
	["特伦顿·轻锤"] = { "Split in two to form the one. The twin blades are bound to Zul'Farrak. Sul'thraze reborn when the twins are found.", "Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared. Many will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children 'straight.' But believe me, $r, it exists. <Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>" },
	["特使艾米萨·闪蹄"] = { "It is our duty to protect these taunka and provide them with what little comfort we can offer." },
	["特劳弗"] = { "The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them." },
	["特尔迪娜·月羽"] = { "The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift. They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance." },
	["特恩·阿兰考尔"] = { "This is MY WAGON! MINE!" },
	["特维布尔"] = { "There's trouble in the woods. We must uncover its source before it is too late!" },
	["特里克希"] = { "The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey..." },
	["特雷利斯·晨日"] = { "Alas, only the esteemed champions of Silvermoon City may purchase what I have to offer." },
	["犹纳"] = { "The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands." },
	["狡诈者维雷斯"] = { "Arthas's weakness is his pride. That weakness only grows as his power does. The Ebon Blade will have its chance to strike at the once-prince - of that I have no doubt." },
	["独眼高恩"] = { "Yes, yes. I see you. Be on your way. You may have earned the trust of a few, but it will take more than that to prove it to me!" },
	["狮鹫指挥官乌瑞克"] = { "The gryphon riders are standing 10 paces from us, friend. They'll be giving you a ride to Thorson's Post. Get going!", "The gryphons of the Northrend peaks are the most resilient of the species." },
	["狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧"] = { "Welcome to Aerie Peak, home of the Wildhammer Clan. With High Thane Falstad off in Ironforge, you'll be dealin' with me." },
	["狮鹫骑士利弗比尔"] = { "Don't worry. Shatter Point is as sturdy as they come! But just in case, be ready to jump on a gryphon if the base starts to break apart..." },
	["狮鹫骑士维比洛"] = { "Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf. I've never had so much time in the air!" },
	["狼女玛卡"] = { "Do not forget, $c, battles still rage in Azeroth. Will you return to help the Horde in Alterac Valley?", "You need to be stronger, $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley." },
	["狼狈不堪的约翰"] = { "What you be wanting? *hic*", "With pleasure... just let me savor this moment for a minute longer." },
	["狼骑兵希亚什"] = { "Need something?" },
	["猎户塞什"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["猎户提卡尼"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["猎户马克霍尔"] = { "Zul'jin shall return one day, $r. Mark my words. Until then, we all hold our positions and do what we can to keep the forest troll population intact. With that said, as master huntsman of Revantusk Village, it is my responsibility to insure that the world around us is safe for habitation. The beasts of this area must be kept in check. Are you looking for work?" },
	["猎手亚托"] = { "The yeti is a fierce, cunning creature, and this one is one of the strongest of his kind. We keep him asleep through herbs in his food. Do not think he will be lethargic in the ring, however." },
	["猎手哈坎"] = { "The magnataur are not as stupid as they appear. Keeping Gormok until his time is a difficult task, but he is bound tightly enough that there is no danger." },
	["猎手托尔弗·怒蹄"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["猎手洛克尼"] = { "We have been tending these worms for some time. I hope they will be fit in time for the ring event of this organization. You must face not one, but two jormungar, after all." },
	["猎手萨格哈尼"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["猎手雷奥普德"] = { "They almost sent my brother, Loksey, to this gathering. He cannot even take care of his hounds, let alone represent the Scarlet Crusade in a competent manner.", "Those filthy beasts are all over the place. If you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands. If you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance." },
	["玛丁雷少校"] = { "I live only to serve our King." },
	["玛丹特·硬木"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace. In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place." },
	["玛丽·艾塔斯"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["玛丽·达隆"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["玛丽亚·卢米尔"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["玛丽萨·艾沃基"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["玛乌格·锐箭"] = { "Bonelashers, I hate them all! If it weren't for the loss of my eye, and the fainting spells that I get sometimes, I'd be out there shooting them down all the time!" },
	["玛修·埃克曼"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["玛克图"] = { "Maktu doesn't recognize you, $r, but he is pleased to meet you. If ever you need to buy or repair armor, look no further than Maktu." },
	["玛克希玛·雷管"] = { "Oh that's simple! You use it like anything else you might activate. Don't worry, I'll take care of lighting the fuse. Once you're up in the air you'll notice that you'll seem to \"float,\" but that won't last forever. What you're aiming for is a target on the lake way over yonder. Make sure that you begin your descent by detaching your \"wings\" at the right time to land in the water, or, well, I don't sell life insurance.", "Welcome! Step right up, don't be shy. This here is my pride and joy... the Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon! Ain't she pretty? You look a little big around the mid section, but I think you'll fit. Flying is so much fun, want to learn how?" },
	["玛克西米利安·克洛文"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "The darkness does not embrace you, $c. Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight! Be gone!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["玛克里尔中士"] = { "To win this war, we can't sit idle and let the tides sweep us over. We must strike, hard and fast, or Arathi will never again be ours." },
	["玛凯雷的耶塞拉"] = { "On Argus, Mac'Aree was the most sacred of our cities. Would you believe me if I told you that the walkways were lined with precious minerals? That the rivers glittered even in complete darkness? I long for those days... How long has it been? A thousand years? Ten-thousand?" },
	["玛加下士"] = { "This is a fine mess." },
	["玛加尔"] = { "I made a lot of the things you see in the store. What do you think? Answer carefully, your life may depend on it." },
	["玛加沙"] = { "Reavij has all the subtlety of a kodo! What's funny is that he doesn't think he's being obvious. I see the way he stares at me when he thinks no one's looking. He creeps me out. I really wish Shadow Hunter Denjai hadn't sent him with us. Setting up Swamprat Post was the perfect opportunity to get away from him." },
	["玛古恩"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["玛吉·冬风"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["玛吉诺·仲马"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["玛哈纳·霜蹄"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["玛尔冯·瑞文斯克"] = { "I know, I know, I'm out here in the middle of nowhere! My home is actually in Ratchet, but after crashing my zeppelin here, I thought I might as well start the research I came here to do!" },
	["玛尔加·比布雷"] = { "We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["玛尔卡"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["玛尔娜"] = { "Greetings, $r. My shop is finally open. I hope you like what you see!" },
	["玛尔德利恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace. In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place." },
	["玛尔法斯"] = { "Greetings, traveler." },
	["玛尔萨·齐布兰德"] = { "The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["玛尔达·维勒"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["玛尔达德"] = { "Welcome to Eco-Dome Midrealm, traveler. I would warn you to be wary of dealing with that goblin, Shauly. I don't believe I've ever heard anyone use the word \"buddy\" as punctuation before." },
	["玛尼尔·琥珀之光"] = { "Welcome to Fairbreeze Village. Silvermoon's all but given up on us, but we refuse to leave. This is our home." },
	["玛布利安·远晨"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["玛库鲁"] = { "Ikan tries and tries. I think these Dreghood are much like the Lost Ones, you know... lost." },
	["玛斯雷·驭熊者"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us. Never forget this.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us. Never forget this.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. We are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us. Never forget this.", "What brings you to the Cenarion Circle, $N?" },
	["玛格拉弗·塔卡尔"] = { "The Fleshwerks will never again produce soldiers for the Lich King's armies." },
	["玛洛戈"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["玛洛维尔爵士"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin.", "Look around you $c. You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself. Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin. Would you like that?" },
	["玛济斯·石衣"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm a mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["玛特·约翰森"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["玛瑞克·斯托纳尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. You want some advice? Befriend a mage! We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..." },
	["玛考布·维恩"] = { "I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!" },
	["玛蒂克斯"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?", "You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Aldor." },
	["玛西娅·切斯"] = { "Hello there! Care to buy some fishing supplies, or perhaps take a lesson or two?" },
	["玛里"] = { "The land of Feralas has been through much, $r. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be. The Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here..." },
	["玛雷弗斯·暗锤"] = { "The Thorium Brotherhood does not waste time on ants. Be gone!" },
	["玛霍尔"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley." },
	["玛鲁卡兹"] = { "Until I traveled through Nagrand and came to the forest, I feared that too much of our original culture was lost. I'm thankful to see that I was wrong. There is so much to be done here!" },
	["玛鲁希亚"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["珀纳瑞斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["珊妮"] = { "We've done it, $N. Mar'nah has learned how to transmute very special gems. And I've learned how to work them." },
	["珊娜·弗勒"] = { "Oh, a fellow Physician. I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.", "Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?", "Yes my daughter? What can I assist you with?", "Yes my son? What can I assist you with?" },
	["珊蒂斯·羽月"] = { "The forces of the Sentinel Army hold back the Horde across all of Kalimdor. While the war continues in Ashenvale and Stonetalon, our forces are also needed here, to protect these remaining wilds and prevent our enemies from gaining further footholds." },
	["珊达"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $N?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["珍妮佛·贝尔"] = { "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?" },
	["珍妮拉·钢锤"] = { "Hail, $c. The Ironforge Brigade is stationed here to keep an eye on Hive'Zora. The Cenarion Circle druids have been monitoring silithid movement and they're anticipating something major in this area." },
	["理查德·科尔文"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c.", "It is wise that you humble yourself before me $N in your desire for more warlock knowledge.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["琳奈特·布莱瑟"] = { "The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["琳沙娜"] = { "Elune's grace upon you. How can I serve?" },
	["琳莉亚·黑盾"] = { "The Horde must not allow the draenei and their meddling Alliance to control all the mana cells in Outland. Will you join the blood elves in their assault on the Eye of the Storm?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["琳达·安·卡斯汀"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["瑞尼尔副队长"] = { "I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure! With thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged." },
	["瑞文戴尔男爵"] = { "Crusaders... <Rivendare shakes his head.> I am convinced that they are a unique lot amongst the humans. My theory is that they lack higher brain function, unable to logically assess a situation and calculate an outcome. One has only to make mention of the Light to get them frothing and battle ready - at which point they will rush headlong into any engagement with complete disregard for their own well being." },
	["瑞斯·朗斯顿"] = { "Welcome to the Pig and Whistle! Grab a drink my friend and pull up a seat, the more the merrier!" },
	["瑞林"] = { "Hello! And welcome! I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed... But I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face. So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates..." },
	["瑞班"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["瑞贝卡·拉弗林"] = { "Welcome to the Stormwind Guild Registry offices. What can I help you with today?" },
	["瑟丹娜"] = { "What mysteries of the trade can I help you uncover today?" },
	["瑟兰尼斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?", "It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["瑟利德"] = { "Gezhe is here to get a job done. I'm here to make sure no one bothers him while he does it." },
	["瑟尔希·暗歌"] = { "Oh, most excellent! That was great fun, was it not? Little by little I've been cursing more of those disgusting Lost Ones. Soon enough I'll be ready to try it on the draenei!", "This is going to be such fun! Don't you think, my dear?" },
	["瑟尔格·希诺特"] = { "Another interruption. How am I supposed to get any work done like this? Don't answer that; do I look as if I care what you have to say? Why don't you go bother Mr. High-And-Mighty instead?" },
	["瑟拉姆"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["瑟拉格·石蹄"] = { "I listen and I listen but I don't hear these spirits that Karn speaks of." },
	["瑟斯哈特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further. Move along please.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["瑟斯顿·科萨恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["瑟琳德拉"] = { "My sisters and I have come down from the Stonetalon Mountains to put to rest a tragedy from ages past. Unfortunately, we are not powerful enough to accomplish our goals on our own and now seek mortals such as yourself to aid us. If you are powerful enough, then we have much to discuss, $c. If you are not, then, for your safety, I will leave the details of my mission out of our conversation." },
	["瑟迪克·普罗斯"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["瑟里亚迪"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["瑟里斯·黎明之心"] = { "Our efforts have paid off. We've captured the Sun's Reach Sanctum, $N. Go there and see if there's anyone you can assist." },
	["瑟里纳尔"] = { "I've played my part in destroying entire civilizations... to have to lower myself to dealing with the wretched Cult of the Damned disgusts me." },
	["瑟里莎·莫莱恩"] = { "May the light guide your path and aid you in your journeys. If you need any assistance browsing, I will be right over here." },
	["瑟鲁姆·深炉"] = { "So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let's see what ye've got.", "So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer lad, let's see what ye've got.", "So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer lass, let's see what ye've got." },
	["瓦利斯·逐风者"] = { "The ranged Shield-Breaker attack is simple to learn, but difficult to master. Alone it may seem weak, but in conjunction with Thrusts and Charges the Shield-Breaker makes a successful jouster. Find a Ranged Target. Take a moment to understand the Shield-Breaker's range... how much space you need, and how far you can hurl the lance. After that? Well. Start throwing, and do not stop until you've broken every last layer of Defend and pierced the vulnerable target. This tactic will serve you well in actual mounted combat: Break down your opponents' defenses... and then crush them!", "Well. Another $c, come to learn the ways of the Shield-Breaker...?", "You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you. Equip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction's pavilion." },
	["瓦勒雷尔"] = { "Our leader, Doom'rel, has ears for the challenge." },
	["瓦多尔"] = { "The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, $N. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable." },
	["瓦妮拉"] = { "I be one of da first to answer Vol'jin's call to arms. Will you be joinin' us?" },
	["瓦妮莎·贝蒂斯船长"] = { "Ahoy, $N! Not a pretty picture, is it? The Horizon Scout at the bottom of the sea, my crew in shambles, and our cargo and passengers strewn about like so much debris that you'd think this was one of Stormwind's canals after a festival. And that's not where the trouble ends..." },
	["瓦尔加·高炉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid." },
	["瓦尔格·风语"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["瓦托尔"] = { "What you see here on this coast is not a result of the Scourge. In fact, we believe that the Scourge also fear the mist - which might be why they do not come here. You see, the mist is alive, friend. Inside those airy tendrils lies death... Should you step within its grasp, you will vanish. The mist will take you! We have never seen anyone return alive from the mist." },
	["瓦拉伊"] = { "Go and rest, wanderer. Our fires are yours." },
	["瓦拉图"] = { "By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?" },
	["瓦拉纳王子"] = { "The Scarlet Crusade will serve a new master - in death..." },
	["瓦拉达尔·星歌"] = { "To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c. For this, the Coins of Ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect. During this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders. As you do so, you will acquire the Coins of Ancestry. Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items." },
	["瓦格·深水"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["瓦格纳·巨锤"] = { "Greetings, $c. It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance. We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us. Please feel free to partake of the feast being offered here. Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year." },
	["瓦琳德拉上尉"] = { "We've taken the harbor, and this ship is a nice bonus. Too bad she's not yet sea-worthy. In the meantime, I've been instructed to oversee the disruption of the naga on the Greengill Coast. Think you can help me out?" },
	["瓦祖恩"] = { "I be seeking someone, $c. Please, leave me be... it is important I find them." },
	["瓦萨特"] = { "Good to see you again, $N! Just a few more adjustments and the trajectory of the jump will be perfect!", "It's driving me crazy. I cannot reach those damned eggs!" },
	["瓦萨里奥·林克格雷斯"] = { "Greetings! If you are here to access goblin engineering schemata, please have your goblin engineer membership card ready for verification." },
	["瓦达巴·冰花"] = { "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here." },
	["瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王"] = { "Too long have I been gone, fighting my way across Azeroth to rediscover my past and reclaim my throne. With all the challenges that have tested the Alliance in my absence, it warms my heart to see heroes such as yourself defending our coalition." },
	["瓦鲁丝塔大使"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Hail to thee, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "While we have much to teach the other races of the Alliance, we have as much to learn from them. Keep your eyes, ears and mind open, $c." },
	["瓦鲁莎"] = { "There are demons to kill, $c. Do you have the backbone to do what needs to be done?", "With a good portion of their demons slain, the Legion will think twice about attacking our lumber camp again. However, I still sense demonic evil stirring." },
	["甘休"] = { "Finally! Da $r $c foretold in da prophecies has arrived!" },
	["甘克"] = { "$N smash warp-gate good, but da demons make it strong again. $N bring Gahk another darkrune and Gahk make special crystalforged darkrune for $N!", "Gahk like little, $r $N. Yous kill da big demon; make all da little demons scared! <Gahk's heads both grin at you.>", "Gahk new at Ogri'la like little $r. It like heaven da other ogres below always talk about. But, Gahk's heads hurt from crystal making Gahk smarter. <Both of Gahk's heads nod to each other.> Us learning ta make da crystalforged darkrune. When us learn dat, we smash da demon's warp-gate!", "Gahk now smart! Us know how ta make da darkrune into da crystalforged darkrune!", "Us starting ta like little $N! Yous bashem da demons real good!", "Us sure see yous here all da time! Chu'a'lor say little $r our $g hero : heroine;! $N like one of us ogres now. Only, Gahk confused because $N need to be bigger for dat!", "Us sure see yous here all da time! Chu'a'lor say little $r our hero! $N like one of us ogres now. Only, Gahk confused because $N need to be bigger for dat!", "Us sure see yous here all da time! Chu'a'lor say little $r our heroine! $N like one of us ogres now. Only, Gahk confused because $N need to be bigger for dat!" },
	["甘纳尔"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["甘鲁尔·血眼"] = { "What is it?" },
	["申苏尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all. You have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $N. The time has come to send you into the field. Are you prepared to undertake your next mission?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["疯狂的拉姆杜尔"] = { "That child gives me chills. He stands there all day long communing with his grandfather. He'll then turn to tell his mother what the grandfather told him and she - of course - just smiles and nods her head. Lambs! Lemmings! All of them!" },
	["疲倦的平民"] = { "Please, don't say anything to me. I don't want to get into any more trouble with them." },
	["白骨女巫"] = { "Once, I had a home in the lush woods of Quel'Thalas. Once, I had a family, a husband... children. Once, I was alive and one with the world. The Lich King took all of that away from me in the blink of an eye. Though I have not the power to strike at him directly, I will pay him back threefold!" },
	["皇冠补给哨兵"] = { "Don't you have some packages to move?", "No snooping around, friend. If you're looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you'll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city." },
	["皇冠货品守卫"] = { "Don't you have some packages to move?", "No snooping around, friend. If you're looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you'll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city." },
	["皇家代理人巴瑟罗尔"] = { "Welcome to Stormwind! I am one of the city's officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau. If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you. Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records. If you have business with me, then please proceed!" },
	["皇家历史学家阿克瑟努斯"] = { "Greetings, $N. Have you come to learn of the history of Ironforge?", "Hundreds of years ago, the great city of Thaurissan stood proudly in a lush expanse of land that is now the dilapidated Burning Steppes. Thaurissan was home to the nation of Dark Iron dwarves and at the time, in the midst of a civil war among the dwarven nation at large. You see, that area of the world was at one point in time part of the Redridge Mountains - until the day that Thaurissan was consumed by a gigantic explosion. The city lay in ruin, the surrounding areas reduced to an ashy wasteland.", "Recently, the Dark Irons have been seen on the surface world with greater regularity. Fortresses have been built in the Badlands. Massive exploratory forces have been sent into the depths of Uldaman in search of ancient lore. They have even invaded our own homeland, striking at our dam near the loch.", "We do not know. The Dark Irons that did survive made their way into the mountain and began rebuilding their city. From the ashes of Thaurissan then rose Blackrock Spire and the new Dark Iron nation. Additional fortifications were made within the Searing Gorge, in the area known as the Cauldron. Stories of an ancient evil that controlled the kingdom of Dark Irons began to circulate.", "We need adventurers to assist us, $N. Will you help?" },
	["皇家管理人巴哈乌斯"] = { "I am an officer of the city, working in the capacity of the Undercity's census. Since our liberation from the Scourge, we have tried to keep an accurate track of our city's populace. Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records. If you have business with me accordingly, please proceed. You should know if you do, at any rate." },
	["皮克希尔"] = { "This forest can be confusing! Be careful out there." },
	["皮尔斯·沙克尔顿"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["皮菲瑞多"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $c. Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?", "Greetings, $c. I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you...", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["皮货商人休尼克"] = { "Hides for the Horde, mon! Only the best for our troops!" },
	["监工斯克兰格"] = { "As acting Taskmaster of this here compound, it is my duty to make sure that there is a certain level of tedium involved with all forms of business, work, rest, and relaxation that may take place here. If you find anything that you are asked to do to be too easy and hassle free, report to me immediately." },
	["监护者哈穆特"] = { "Ysiel expected some enemy opposition to her foray into Outland. That's why us wardens were brought along. We never expected our opposition to come in the strength or numbers that the naga have shown." },
	["监护者布罗克"] = { "Check the bulletin board if you're looking for work, $r." },
	["监护者忒洛斯"] = { "<Warden Treelos looks at you funny and then pauses a moment, clearly struggling.> Zangarmarsh... too close to truth. <His face goes crazy again.> Is he still watching!?", "Anoint my head with a healing balm. Do you like my crown of thorns?", "Dinner guests should show more respect!", "My vicious teromoths will avenge me!", "Oh, what a sacred place is here overthrown!", "The Firewing blood elves... for some reason they want to stop us. <Warden Treelos visibly struggles to keep his wits about him for a few more seconds.> They... they sent one of the Broken as ... as an emissary... But he had a bomb! They died, they all died! They tried to run away! The lucky ones didn't even know. I must have been at the edge of the blast. It was horr...IT'S WATCHING US AGAIN! <Treelos becomes despondent and looks straight through you as if you're not there.>", "There are FOUR lights!", "What's that? Zangarmarsh? Why would I want to go there? <Treelos looks thoughtful.> Yes, Zangarmarsh... we... the druids there are getting close to figuring out why the water level is dropping. It's destroying everything! <You can see the insanity creep back in behind the warden's eyes.> Destroyed us all! Bright light! BOOM!!", "Where did everyone go?", "Who are you? What do you want here?", "Why did you do this to us?" },
	["监护者莫布吉尔"] = { "I used to be known as Iolol until a secret vote was passed around town that resulted in me having to change my name. It was either change it or go the way of Corki. You would have done the same. What do you think of my new name? Huge improvement, right? By the way, check the bulletin board if you're looking for work." },
	["监督者克拉加什"] = { "This pit stinks and I'm surrounded by snakes, but I'm here to do a job. Ever since Putress pulled his stunt at the Wrath Gate, the Warchief doesn't trust these people as far as he can throw them. That's why we're here. The apothecaries can't do a thing without me." },
	["盖亚安祖母"] = { "<Greathmother Geyah laughs weakly.> Of course not, dear. But it's not me that has to believe... Garrosh can lead the Mag'har. He is strong and wise. All of the spirits approve of him. He just needs to believe in himself. He fears so much... He fears so deeply that if he lets himself go, his rage will consume him and all that would be near him.", "<Greatmother Geyah nods, accepting your answer.> I can no longer fight the spirits, $n. My time has long since passed. Once again, I must thank you for all that you have done. While Garrosh may be unmovable, many of my people have been lifted by your accomplishments. They are now willing to fight for our rights as a united clan.", "<Greatmother Geyah nods.> Did you know my son?", "<Greatmother Geyah smiles at you.> You remind me of my son, $n. He was an immovable mountain: A pillar of strength and honor. <Geyah's eyes well up with tears.> He sacrificed himself so that we could survive. So that generations of orcs after him could be born into a world without the blood curse... Without Gul'dan and his dark Horde... <Geyah stares into the distance, lost in thought.> Oh Durotan, how I wish you could be here. Your people so desperately need you...", "<Greatmother Geyah smiles.> I am old. It is my time. When I pass, my spirit will move on to the spirit realm. It is there that I will stand with my ancestors. It is there that we will watch over our people. When Garad was alive Mother Kashur's duty was the same as my duty now.", "<Greatmother Geyah's violet eyes lock onto yours.> Yes...", "<Tears stream down Greatmother Geyah's face.> I... I... Durotan survived to have a child? The child Draka told me of before they left... It was their greatest fear... To raise a child in this world. On the other side of that gate was their only hope. I dared not tell Durotan, but secretly, I begged the spirits to watch over them - to protect their child and to give them strength. I... I must see my grandchild. I must see him. Please, I am too weak. You must tell him. Before I leave this world...", "Hello, dear. I am Geyah, matron of the Mag'har. <Greatmother Geyah coughs.> If you are here, it would be safe to assume that the portal has opened. Most of the orcs here were too young or too sick to remember the Dark Portal. <Greatmother Geyah points to the orcs around her.> Many of them were orphans or would soon become orphans. Aye, Blackhand would have it no other way. Keep the sick from the healthy. Only the strong would survive... Or so they say.", "Hello, young $r.", "I wish I knew, dear. He will not listen to you nor will he listen to me. In truth, it is why I am still here. It is why I have not left with Mother Kashur. He must find his heart. Our people will not survive through the winter without leadership.", "The duty of a clan mother is to listen. To listen to the wind and the water and the fire and the earth. To gather information for her clan in the way others gather furs to stay warm. It is the spirits that I commune with... In my dreams, Mother Kashur speaks to me like the spirits that spoke to her once... When I pass, I will speak to Drakia and Celestine in this manner. <Greatmother Geyah smiles.>", "They have grown up here. We kept them safe from harm. We did the best that we could in nursing them back to health. Many perished but many, many more grew strong. Like Garrosh... <Greatmother Geyah sighs.> He has lost his heart, you know. He tells me that I am his balance. That without me, the blood lust that consumed his father and ultimately cursed our people would take him over.", "What did Garrosh tell you, $n?" },
	["盖兰·维米斯队长"] = { "The guards of Theramore are the finest group of Alliance soldiers based in Kalimdor. It is our duty to uphold the laws of the Alliance even so far away from our homes.", "We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape. We managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since. We have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime. If you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens." },
	["盖尔"] = { "Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?" },
	["盖德拉"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["盖斯特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory, unhindered by the timidness of the Warchief.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["盖米尔"] = { "Listen to what I have to tell you about our enemy before we start. You don't want to be unprepared while we're out smashing Scourge in the field.", "The Ymirjar battle lord, Algar the Chosen, rouses his Vargul armies at the Reliquary of Pain, northeast of this cage. Prince Navarius is across the Dead Fields, east of here, near the great steps leading up to the second level of Zul'Drak. Thrym's location is currently unknown, which is curious considering his size. All must be dealt with!", "When you are ready I will place you atop my head and we will march into the heart of the Scourge in Zul'Drak. You must direct me to smash and destroy our enemies!", "With my freedom comes the vengeance of storm!" },
	["盛宴大餐女招待"] = { "A Bountiful Table is laid out with five Pilgrim's Bounty foods, one in front of each chair. While in a chair, you may eat as much of that food as you like, as well as pass servings of that food to the other chairs. Feast and share with friends! If you eat enough of any one food, you'll gain benefits unique to that food. In addition, if you eat enough of every food, you'll gain the Spirit of Sharing!", "Welcome! Have you come to join us for a Pilgrim's Bounty feast? Please, have a seat at a Bountiful Table. Try everything! I'm certain you'll find something to your liking." },
	["目击者格林比克斯"] = { "Woohoo! They are into it now!" },
	["盲眼法希尔"] = { "Sightless I may be, but vision I have. My primary dealings are with hunters and rogues, $r." },
	["看守者维林森"] = { "A mess, that's what this is! All of these creatures sprung up out of nowhere, and are running around out of control! And where've the Magister, and his apprentices, run off to? Leaving me here all alone without as much as a, \"Hello there Wyllithen, would you like to come with?\" The nerve!" },
	["看护员谢尔兰"] = { "What can you do at an inn? Well when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably. Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness. When you are well rested, you learn more from experience. You may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn." },
	["看护者奥鲁罗"] = { "I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands." },
	["督军达图恩"] = { "The ground of this place is still warm from freshly shed blood. Ah, I would have given my own eye to be here when the demons tore through that portal and clashed with Azeroth's heroes! What a battle it was! But now, even more fierce fighting rages on the other side!" },
	["瞭望员图维"] = { "I be Tolwe. Job be to keep da peace an' watch. So I be watchin'." },
	["瞭望者安姆金"] = { "Let me sleep just five more minutes, mon..." },
	["瞭望者杜恩纳"] = { "The flight from Grom'gol to Undercity is beautiful, though uneventful. Though that is no excuse to fall asleep on the job." },
	["矮人平民"] = { "Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.", "During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.", "I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.", "I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday.", "I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.", "No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!", "The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?", "To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.", "We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!", "When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!", "Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!" },
	["矮人幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["矮人灵魂医师"] = { "How I can guide your path, young one?" },
	["石塔长者"] = { "Elder Brightspear can be found wandering amongst the ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring.", "Elder Nightwind passes the days at the shrine in Jaedenar in Felwood.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "The village of Astranaar in Ashenvale is Elder Riversong's current home." },
	["石墙长者"] = { "Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["石头守卫安比兰"] = { "Keep your voice low and your eyes open, $N. We're surrounded by enemies out here." },
	["石头守卫斯托克顿"] = { "Keep your voice down, $c!" },
	["石爪山护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["石衣老爹"] = { "In all of my days I never thought to see such a magnificent new frontier. If only it weren't tainted by evil and knowledge which is best left hidden." },
	["石须长者"] = { "Elder Fargal looks over Frosthold in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Muraco is just outside Camp Tunka'lo in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Ohanzee is located in Gundrak.", "Elder Tauros found his way to Zim'Torga in Zul'Drak.", "Elder Yurauk can be found in the Halls of Stone.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["矿洞女王"] = { "We must re-establish our stranglehold on these mines!" },
	["码头管理员罗兹基尔"] = { "I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $N. It's never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here..." },
	["研究员纳乌德"] = { "Greetings, fleshling. I am Navuud, chief researcher here at the Protectorate Watch Post." },
	["研究员考内留斯"] = { "Did they send you to find me? Well I'm not going back without my men." },
	["破天号班长"] = { "My men are ready. Let's draw some Vrykul blood!" },
	["破碎者的尸体"] = { "The corpse of one of the Broken lies here. Mysteriously, the cause of its death does not appear to be from one of the mutated moths. Perhaps it has something to do with the strange object resting right next to its outstretched hand?" },
	["碎牙"] = { "My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r. Long ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort> Great thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south.", "You have <snort> aided Mangletooth more than I would have dreamed, $r. Thank you. As long as I remain a captive here, you may bring me blood shards from the Bristleback quilboar and I will bless you with Agamaggan's power.", "You! $R! Come here. <snort> Time is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort> My capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks! The Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth." },
	["碎石长者"] = { "Elder Mistwalker enjoys watching the struggles at the Maul in Feralas.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake.", "You'll find Elder Grimtotem at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas." },
	["碎颅者莫克拉"] = { "The competition will be fierce, but Orgrimmar's champions will decimate all who stand in our way." },
	["碎颅部族演讲者"] = { "Hurry! You should talk to Mekkatorque! If we don't start the assault soon, we're going to be late. And my boss HATES it when we're late!", "It's my job to ensure that this whole assault runs like clockwork. High Tinker Mekkatorque is out in the field now, but he's scheduled to come back to get some more troops any time now. He's never late, so just stick around and he'll be here." },
	["祖卡斯特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c." },
	["祖尔托"] = { "The Darkspears stand ready to face the competition and the enemy." },
	["祖尼尔"] = { "And a good day to ya, brave $c. I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed. There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;! Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.", "And a good day to ya, brave $c. I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed. There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you mon! Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.", "And a good day to ya, brave $c. I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed. There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you sis! Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.", "I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe. When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya.", "I'm sorry mon, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe. When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya.", "I'm sorry sis, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe. When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya." },
	["祖德"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["祖拉·熔怒"] = { "A strong weapon is no good if you don't live long enough to wield it, $c." },
	["祖莱"] = { "Shadow Hunter Denjai sent me here with a small contingent of builders and warriors to establish this outpost. We've barely finished building it and he's already asking for reports! If you need supplies, I can offer a few things, but we're still waiting for our first shipment." },
	["祖达克护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["祖达克护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["祖达萨的梅维克"] = { "What you be expectin', mon? Maywiki only be dealin' with the druids and shaman." },
	["神谕者索乌多乌"] = { "Great battle still going on at Sparktouched Haven. Maybe you find time to help sometime?" },
	["神谕者索乌尼"] = { "You have time? Soo-nee teach you good song!" },
	["科尔·暴怒图腾"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["科尔克·麦克斯韦尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["科尔拉格"] = { "The Exodar's vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here.", "We control access to the Exodar's storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?" },
	["科尔斯塔·迪普沙东"] = { "He... hello, $N. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds. Those Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in. You should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you." },
	["科拉丝塔萨"] = { "Do you possess the courage to face Malygos' elite drakes in their own realm, $r?", "Most dragons would fear to tread here, $r. What could possibly bring a mortal to such a treacherous place?", "My drakes have been eagerly awaiting your return, $c. Are you ready to take wing?" },
	["科林·烈酒"] = { "What?! What did ye say?! How dare ye! Me beer can stand up to any of that rot they serve at Brewfest! You'll pay for this insult, $c!", "Ye've got some stones, $glad:lass;, comin' in here unannounced. What do ye want?", "Ye've got some stones, lad, comin' in here unannounced. What do ye want?", "Ye've got some stones, lass, comin' in here unannounced. What do ye want?" },
	["科琳"] = { "You probably weren't expecting to find me in this cave, were you? My name's J.D., and I really can't tell you much about how I got here, but what I can tell you is that this cave is my home now! I spend my time studying the strange crystals that can be found all over the crater." },
	["科瑞恩·塞尔留斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Sorry, but I only train rogues.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well, well... look what the cat brung in... and how can I help you, $c?" },
	["科索祖尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What kin I do for ya, mon?" },
	["科蒂安"] = { "A furbolg named Tur Ragepaw. Not one of ours. This one came from the southern lands. He was of the Timbermaw tribe. He wanted to see Ursoc. He seemed to think that Vordrassil's taint could be purified and used to save my father. It is foolish to entertain such hopes. You will agree when you see the darkness that has afflicted him like I have.", "I am Kodian, daughter of Ursoc. I watch over this once sacred shrine. I've not seen a stranger come here in a long time." },
	["科隆克"] = { "As a relative newcomer to Ogri'la, you don't have enough exposure to the crystals here to reap their full benefits. Besides, you only have one head. We, on the other hand, have been here a very long time. So, as you can imagine, we're fairly well-versed in a great many things. Of late, we've taken a keen interest in the demons of the forge camps. More specifically, we've devised a way to rid us of them for good. At least, that's the theory.", "The crystal foci? Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out. A depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus. These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon. You see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers. After a time, Gahk will have a mission for you to do just that.", "The crystal foci? Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out. A depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus. These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon. You see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers. If you have a darkrune, Gahk will speak to you about that.", "We are humbled by your selflessness, $N. If in the past we've seemed a bit conceited, realize that it is by your example that we were able to change our attitudes. We thank you, and hope that you'll continue to assist us in our struggle against the forge camps.", "We wish that we could create more than one darkrune in a day, but that would be a waste of time. It's simply not physically possible. Besides, we can't even reliably create them at that rate. And trust us, if there were anyone else here smart enough to help, they'd be conscripted and we'd have as many darkrunes as needed.", "You've been making quite a name for yourself around here, $r. Good for you. We trust that you won't let that go to your single head, and that you'll still help out by banishing demons?" },
	["秘法师雅尔金"] = { "Mystical goods and commodities is my business, stranger." },
	["秘蓝岛守卫者"] = { "Acteon is our resident tracker, and a good one he is, too - the skins he wears are testament to his skill. His camp is in the southeast of Azure Watch.", "Ah, seeking training, are you? There are several instructors who are camped in Azure Watch... what are you after?", "An aspiring angler... well, Diktynna lives on the shore of Ammen Ford, using her net and pole to keep us all supplied. I am certain she could use the help.", "Daedal knows his way around the art of brewing potions. He works closely with Fateema in western Azure Watch.", "Druid? No one here follows that path... but I believe I heard of someone matching that description near the Exodar. Shalannius, I think?", "Dulvi is the woman you want. She trains new prospects in the middle of the Watch.", "Esbina will be happy to take care of your animal companion, my friend. She waits outside the inn within Azure Watch.", "Fateema is our anchorite, and she has been invaluable in tending crash victims. She practices her trade on the western side of the Watch.", "For mastery over the arcane, you need look no further than Semid. He teaches on the eastern side of Azure Watch along with Ruada.", "Funaam is our guild registrar. His office has been set up within the Exodar. Just follow the road; you'll find it in no time.", "Heur has studied the local flora since our landing. He will be able to guide you. You can find him working with Daedal on the western edge of Azure Watch.", "If the Light cannot guide you, my friend, perhaps I can be of assistance. What is it you need?", "In Chellan's small but serviceable inn, you can find the priest Guvan.", "Looking for a lapidary? Our jewelcrafters are in the Exodar, using the materials they have uncovered to work wonders. Speak with Farii when you arrive.", "Our enchanters spend their days in the Exodar, working away at any number of projects. Nahogg will start your training.", "Our humble inn is located in the north of Azure Watch; Chellan will take good care of you.", "Our new allies, the Stillpine furbolgs, have expressed interest in taking what hides we find. They live to the north; I would seek knowledge from them.", "Ruada trains young fighters in the eastern portion of Azure Watch. If training in the practical art of warfare is what you're looking for, she will help you.", "Seeking storage? You'll want to head to the safety of the Exodar, then... the bankers will be more than happy to help you.", "The good Tullas is a noble woman, and a stalwart defender of the Light. Her lessons are taught in the inn proper.", "The hippogryphs are well-tended near the Exodar proper. You should journey there if you wish to fly to Blood Watch.", "The local artificer, Daelo, can teach you the basics of engineering. Perhaps you can help our technician fix that malfunctioning communications device!", "There are a number of skilled tradesmen scattered around Azuremyst. Which one are you looking for?", "This isle can be strange, can it not? Is there something I can do for you?", "Thoth can teach you Inscription in The Crystal Hall.", "Travel to Stillpine Hold, my friend. The furbolgs there have been very helpful, and they might have just the expertise you need.", "We had no cooks to spare, but it is a bit odd... there are some delectable scents on the south wind. Follow your nose, eh?", "We have no smithy set up in Azure Watch. However, I've seen a few young blacksmiths coming from that odd encampment on the south coast. Perhaps you should investigate.", "We have no tailors here in Azure Watch. You might try the encampment on the beach, however - they seem to have a number of tradesmen from across the sea.", "You're one of the shaman? Hm. I suppose you are free to choose your own path... whatever that path may be. Tuluun has an isolated, small camp in the northwest of Azure Watch." },
	["秘蓝岛护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["秘血岛护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["穆亚特"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波"] = { "Greetings, friend! Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors? Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator?" },
	["穆尔沙·月影中士"] = { "The last thing that we needed was for the crazy Drakkari trolls to shoot down a Scourge necropolis in our backyard. How did they manage to do that?!" },
	["穆德拉克"] = { "I like to build stuff. Of course, I like to blow stuff up even more!" },
	["穆拉丁·铜须"] = { "The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im. Tell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel. Arthas won't be expectin' this!", "The old wounds still linger, lad. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im. Tell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel. Arthas won't be expectin' this!", "The old wounds still linger, lass. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im. Tell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel. Arthas won't be expectin' this!" },
	["穆普斯·沙克菲德"] = { "You'd better not be causing trouble, $N!" },
	["穆曼"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!", "Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge. She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\"." },
	["穆格雷斯·深水"] = { "\"...\" The body of the tauren druid lies still and unmoving. It would seem as though he has finally passed from this world to his promised great beyond.", "Please, help me $g brother : sister;... I will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass. The wildlife though, my $g brother : sister;... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release. I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life.", "Please, help me brother... I will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass. The wildlife though, my brother... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release. I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life.", "Please, help me sister... I will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass. The wildlife though, my sister... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release. I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life.", "Yes, I speak a language you understand $r. We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such! Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land. Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea. I came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me. I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life." },
	["穆约"] = { "Naralex sleeps again! Long ago, Naralex journeyed to this cavern with the honorable goal of entering the Emerald Dream and regrowing the Barrens into a lush forest. His focus waned and his thoughts became tainted by serpentine visions. Now, reptilian beasts seep from his dreams to the land. He must be awoken from the nightmare or he will be forever lost, and a great evil unleashed. Only after his corrupted servants, the Fanglords, have been slain can I perform the awakening ritual." },
	["穆鲁图"] = { "I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?" },
	["空军上尉杜尔因"] = { "I don't care who you are or what you do outside of the Skyguard, but while you're here you will do as you're told." },
	["空军上尉范德里普"] = { "Alright, I admit it, you've proven yourself and then some, $N. If I was hard on you before it was because I saw the spark of a true Skyguard within you. I dare say that you're the finest ace that we have! Anytime that you want to help out, I'll be more than proud to hand you another set of bombs.", "I see that you've been putting in your time around here, $c. Put in more; the demons aren't gone yet, rookie.", "You better wake up real quick, rookie. This isn't our cushy backyard outside of Skettis; this is the Blade's Edge Mountains! One false move and it's crash and burn!", "Your name seems to be on everyone's lips around the outpost. Don't let it get to your head; I know that you can do better! I'll be watching you, rookie." },
	["空军指挥官努埃恩"] = { "<Nuainn Stormwing shakes his head.> With the Legion on one side and Illidan's minions on the other, it's going to take everything we've got to defend the stronghold, and defend it we will! Every true Wildhammer would sooner die than surrender our home." },
	["空军指挥官布拉克"] = { "Hello, $c! Are you reporting for a flight mission?", "Move along unless you've got business with the fleet." },
	["空军指挥官格莱芬加尔"] = { "If you're feeling queasy, speak with Pestle. He might have something for motion sickness." },
	["空军指挥官达比利"] = { "Move along unless you've got business with the fleet." },
	["空军指挥官阿达利斯"] = { "Unseen arakkoa... they're all around us... watching us... waiting!" },
	["穿戏服的孤儿院长"] = { "The Headless Horseman attacks! The fires threaten to consume the whole village! What will we do?", "We are free of the Headless Horseman's terror, for now. We may breathe easy again, but until he can be defeated while joined with his head, he may return." },
	["竞技场管理员"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["符文图腾长者"] = { "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["符文看守者德尔雅"] = { "These Runestones protect the lands in Eversong from becoming tainted by the Scourge. The Western Runestone failed long ago, forcing us to burn the ground around it. As long as I live I won't allow the remaining Runestones to fail us. That is my oath." },
	["管理员曼雷克"] = { "If ya need a bat, ya come to da right place. I be handlin' all de bats for de scouts." },
	["管理者戴沃斯"] = { "Kirin'Var survived 20 long years and countless orc assaults, but it could not withstand the forces of Kael'thas. A man who once called himself a member of the Kirin Tor murdered all of us, save one. Archmage Vargoth survived the attack, so Kael'thas imprisoned him within the Violet Tower, warding it with a magic that forbids the passage of any of the Kirin Tor." },
	["管理者迪兰杜斯"] = { "I was born here, $r. This is my world - all that I know... As a boy, my mother and father would regale me with tales of your world and the splendor it held. How I longed to leave this place. Alas, fate is a cruel mistress. My mother and father have long since passed, buried in this very graveyard. I remain to uphold their honor and the honor of my family - the Sons of Lothar." },
	["米什塔"] = { "Oh dear, I am running dangerously low on supplies! What is taking that blasted goblin so long?" },
	["米伦·长须"] = { "I hope yer not here for our ale. We're not sharing and that's final! It's not our fault no one had the good sense to bring beer to Outland but us." },
	["米克·莱文"] = { "My family worked the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen! I will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth." },
	["米克哈尔"] = { "Give me a couple minutes, $N. There was some excitement in here a moment ago, and I just want to make sure things have died back down. I'll talk to you soon enough." },
	["米克达"] = { "Auchindoun is home to my ancestor's spirits. We might not look it, but all Broken were once draenei... our spirits are all the same." },
	["米克高维尔"] = { "Evenin', Gov'na.", "I su... sur... surpose that yar wanna ride back to der outpost. Yarp?", "Yarp? Yar wannar fly? Narp... No-no-no-norp gonnarp ha-hap-hap-happen!" },
	["米利·羽哨"] = { "Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry. I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes. If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer.", "If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination! This year's model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!" },
	["米利迪安中尉"] = { "With the Allerian Stronghold surrounded by enemies on all sides it's time for us to take the fight to them." },
	["米尔卡·远步"] = { "A mage... you seek to learn the magic of portals, yes?", "Only a mage can learn portal magic, $c." },
	["米尔科特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further. Move along please.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c." },
	["米尔蕾·弗莱彻尔"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["米布隆·乱齿"] = { "Grumble, grumble..." },
	["米托菲奥斯·洛希克"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["米拉·晨行者"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["米拉·法拉科纳"] = { "Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here.", "Elune-adore, my brother. You are welcome here.", "Elune-adore, my sister. You are welcome here." },
	["米提亚"] = { "Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔"] = { "There you are!" },
	["米斯蒂娜·钢盾"] = { "Aye, you there! If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources! Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know! Rather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them! Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!" },
	["米格里克·布罗斯托"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["米歇尔·贝利"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["米泽瑞"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["米洛尔·怒斩"] = { "Greetings, $N. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge." },
	["米菲·法索特"] = { "Northrend awaits, $r. The majestic Cloudkisser will take you straight across to the sea to Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord." },
	["米葛"] = { "Hello friend! What can we do for you?", "Honored $G brother:sister;, how may we help?", "Honored brother, how may we help?", "Honored sister, how may we help?", "How might we be of assistance?", "We are here to help.", "What can we get for you, our exalted $G brother:sister;?", "What can we get for you, our exalted brother?", "What can we get for you, our exalted sister?" },
	["米西·米恩卡普"] = { "Keep it down! I don't want them to see me over here. Ooh, this really burns me up! Who do these ethereals think they are? This is MY claim!" },
	["米谢尔·舒维瑟尔"] = { "The Tauren Chieftains are staying in Silvermoon while I arrange their next tour. They often lounge on the balcony above me when they're not practicing. Feel free to wave... they love the attention. We're not currently hiring for the show or the crew, but you can always check back later. Who knows what will arise?" },
	["粮食商人洛克兰"] = { "Some supplies for the road? Perhaps a refreshment to enjoy while you watch the fights?" },
	["索乌"] = { "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic." },
	["索克"] = { "Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief. Please, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space. There are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do." },
	["索加斯·格瑞姆森"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Wot kin I do fer ye?" },
	["索塔尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, $c.", "I train and guide young hunters in the traditions passed down many generations.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["索姆·哈格林"] = { "Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?" },
	["索尔"] = { "Where are you going? Well if you're looking to get there quickly, then look no further!" },
	["索尔宾·范达瑟"] = { "Maybe this wasn't the best place for a shop after all...", "Well hello again, $N! I don't know how much longer I'm going to keep on trying to set up a shop out in the middle of nowhere. Still, since you've helped me out in the past, I'll show you some stuff you may find interesting!" },
	["索尔芬·石盾"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["索恩斯·火石"] = { "There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer." },
	["索拉尼"] = { "My sister Silanna is naive to the growing danger in these woods. But like it or not, as soon as I get this wagon loaded we're moving within the city walls. It appears that I've got more bags here than I need. Perhaps you could make use of them." },
	["索拉查盆地护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["索拉查盆地护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["索格拉姆·伯雷森"] = { "Mark my words! You won't find faster gryphons anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms than the ones right here in Thelsamar!" },
	["索瑞克"] = { "Are you here for training? Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind, $c. Find your own trainer before you anger me.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["索瑞姆·轻歌"] = { "What? You wish to donate cloth to Silvermoon? You're merely after a Hawkstrider, aren't you? Very well, very well... do the city this service, and I will see to it that your reputation here rises." },
	["索瓦尔勋爵"] = { "Are you certain? There is no turning back once I wipe the knowledge of the talents you have learned from your mind.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The blood is life... And as easily as the ebb and flow of blood is controlled, so too is the life of our enemies." },
	["索维克"] = { "Hello, $N! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!" },
	["索艾·鹰怒"] = { "My charge at Agmar's Hammer extends far beyond the care of the animals at the stables." },
	["索莉多米"] = { "I am pleased that you've decided to take up our cause. As a reward I will infuse a ring with the remnants of the Well of Eternity you brought me. I offer you four different paths in which to unlock their power. Choose wisely, $N. The sands of time flow easily in one direction and not the other.", "The Battle of Mount Hyjal is one of the most well-guarded events of this timeline. Should an intruder alter its outcome, the impact would extend to all subsequent moments in history. As the Aspect's prime mate I'm far more in tune with the flow of time than other bronze dragons. I recently sensed a minute ripple in time emanating from the events surrounding the Battle of Mount Hyjal. Someone or something is attempting to change this timeline and they must be stopped." },
	["索鲁克·雷怒"] = { "Welcome to Camp Oneqwah." },
	["约尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, brother, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, sister, but I cannot train you." },
	["约库姆国王"] = { "Very well, little $c. While there is much left for you to do to mend our relations with Thorim, I am compelled to share with you this one secret. Speak to me again when you are ready to be shown that which you seek.", "You are permitted to visit our stronghold, little $r. Do not bring us dishonor!" },
	["约拉尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["约林·死眼"] = { "Do you know who we are, stranger? We are Mag'har - brown orcs, as I have heard your kind call us. The Mag'har are survivors: Survivors of a fallen dynasty; Survivors of the Red Pox; Survivors of a shattered world... I am Jorin, son of Kilrogg; last of the lineage of Deadeye: Warchief of the Bleeding Hollow Clan." },
	["约瑟夫·德尔特"] = { "Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!", "My job title is Waste Management Specialist.", "Perhaps you should speak into these sound enhancing devices attached to my FISTS OF FURY.", "The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there." },
	["约瑟夫·霍雷上尉"] = { "Welcome to the tournament, $N." },
	["约瑟芬·李斯特"] = { "Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see." },
	["约翰·伯恩赛德"] = { "No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!" },
	["约莫德·石眉"] = { "Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!" },
	["约鲁斯"] = { "Greetings, traveler." },
	["纯洁的凯瑟琳"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the Light protect you this day.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["纯洁者耶德瑞克"] = { "It is an honor to represent the Argent Crusade in this tournament." },
	["纳丝玛拉·月歌"] = { "Welcome, $N. My expertise is in the art of working with primal mooncloth. Tailors interested in becoming mooncloth specialists often ask me to teach them our ways." },
	["纳亚尔"] = { "The forest sings with the seeds of change. Our new friends, the draenei, are here, and we will help them to build a place of their own." },
	["纳兹尼克·苏萨弗"] = { "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you...", "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..." },
	["纳兹戈林中士"] = { "Krenna must doubt my abilities. While our elite warriors march out to face the Alliance and their trapper allies, or wreak havoc among the trolls, I've been assigned to mop up those pesky Dragonflayer vrykul. Perhaps if we combine our efforts, we can both prove ourselves in the conqueror's sight." },
	["纳兹格雷尔"] = { "Once our warchief heard that the Dark Portal had been reopened, he immediately gathered his advisors to plan this daring expedition. Though a few of his councilors have their doubts, Thrall holds out the hope that we might discover new insights into the history of our people. He believes that somewhere amidst the wreckage of this world, the true tale of the orcish people lies hidden. I must admit that in my darkest moments... I fear that that tale should remain untold.", "So you've recently arrived from Azeroth, eh? You'd best steel yourself, $c - there are perils in this land unlike anything the Horde has faced before. I am Nazgrel - right hand to our mighty warchief, Thrall. He honored me with the task of safeguarding this brave expedition and - by all the spirits - I shall!", "The Horde has risked much to venture into Outland - resources, manpower - even the tactical defense of our lands is at stake. Despite all else, Thrall believes in the promise of this ravaged land. There is a strange light in his eyes these days - as if he senses some stirring revelation the rest of us do not. Still, he is my warchief and my blood-brother. I would follow him through the gates of the abyss itself." },
	["纳卡"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["纳塔蕾·图布莱尔"] = { "A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers.", "A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers.", "A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Some of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran.", "The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran. You'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills.", "There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran. Be certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course.", "There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers.", "There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers.", "Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?", "You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers." },
	["纳夫"] = { "The strongest hides come from those kodo that have laid themselves to rest in this wasteland." },
	["纳姆·逐星"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["纳尔克"] = { "Care to purchase some piratey items?" },
	["纳尔弗"] = { "Huh? What?! Go away." },
	["纳尤拉"] = { "From this dock, The Bravery travels back and forth between Stormwind and Auberdine." },
	["纳戈·斯库波尔"] = { "Heading home, $c? The Mighty Wind will get you there, if home's in Kalimdor. She flies straight from here to Durotar." },
	["纳托克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $N.", "Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c." },
	["纳拉杜"] = { "The Illidari demons keep me here because of my knowledge of ancient draenei crystals and relics. They've enslaved many of my people and use us to look for a powerful crystal... one that in all likelihood is not even here.", "What for? If Illidan's demons don't catch me and enslave me again, then the naga of Zangarmarsh will. Joining Illidan and his allies has turned out to mean nothing but slavery to most of the Broken tribes. There is no hope for my people." },
	["纳斯中尉"] = { "Lieutenant Aden always volunteers for gate duty. That's fine by me. I've got a post that allows me a good view of my guards AND the daughters of the tradesmen at the same time." },
	["纳林斯"] = { "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic." },
	["纳格兰护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["纳格兰护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["纳特·帕格"] = { "If you ask me, the best part about fishing is its slow pace. It gives one time to think, to reflect on past events and to plan for future ones. Oh, and it's also a great excuse to drink. Heavily.", "To catch Gahz'ranka, you'll need a special Mudskunk lure. I make 'em myself! But you need more than just the lure; you need some mudskunks too... you need to place them in the lure to give it a rank old smell! When you have the mudskunks, throw the lure off Pagle's Point in Zul'Gurub... and then grab a drink and wait... but not too long, because Gahz'ranka is sure to come a'stomping!" },
	["纳瑞安"] = { "<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.> What is... Mmmm... Velvet! Am I right? If you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there... <Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">", "Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens! If you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there... <Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">" },
	["纳莉丝"] = { "Does being in the presence of a Black Dragon make you nervous? Good. It should. It makes these dragons nervous too. They cling to their ancient virtues though - they wouldn't dare attack me here. Fools." },
	["纳莱丝·晨雪"] = { "Justicar Mariel Trueheart has asked us to see to the needs of the tournament. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties." },
	["纳菲恩"] = { "Only those who have proven themselves to not be hostile toward the Timbermaw may pass through the Hold without fear of being attacked. Have you made an effort to earn our trust, outsider?" },
	["纳萨尼尔·杜马"] = { "Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind. We lost a number of friends and family in those days, and it pains me to know that the Scarlet Crusade has taken the mill for their own ends. That's why I've returned." },
	["纳萨诺斯·凋零者"] = { "No doubt you are another inept simpleton sent from the Dark Lady to train under her champion. <Nathanos sighs.> I've sent every one of you back to her in pieces, I don't see why it will be any different this time. Mine, however, is not to question why, but instead to do as the Dark Lady bids." },
	["纳迪娅·织发"] = { "You need to make your stitches smaller, $N. Fewer items will slip out of your quivers and ammo pouches. Besides, no one likes a lumpy tunic." },
	["纳雷塞特"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["纳霍加"] = { "I can instruct you in enchanting. Interested?" },
	["纽尼"] = { "SQUAWK! Avast, ye scurvy dogs! Avast!", "SQUAWK! Keelhaul the lad! Keelhaul!", "SQUAWK! Shiver me timbers! Shiver!", "SQUAWK! Walk the plank! Walk!" },
	["绮思·傲风"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["维克加"] = { "Hope you take it to big-tongues good. It about time they go away." },
	["维克图斯"] = { "Be silent! Do you think our plagued dragons will hatch and train themselves?", "Have you come from the Burning Steppes? Do you have my black dragon eggs?", "What, may I ask, are you doing here? Put on your student's attire, and study!" },
	["维克多·奈法里奥斯"] = { "Do you expect me to cower before the mighty legion of $N? You are nothing to me. Less than nothing. Had I desired your head, it would have been presented to me on a pike. You have made the mistake that all mortals make. <Lord Victor Nefarius sighs.> Time does strange things to those that use it as a form of currency.", "In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull.", "It's simple really. Allow me to summarize..." },
	["维克多·瓦德"] = { "We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?" },
	["维克斯顿"] = { "Yo. I'm Vixton Pinchwhistle, official Arena Vendor for the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit. If you've got the rep, I've got the goods that'll make your mouth water." },
	["维兰达"] = { "Greetings, $c. I get so few visitors up here. To what do I owe the pleasure?" },
	["维兹格里克"] = { "Grab your things, $N! I've just gotten word from Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge that the Undermarket has set up operations in the heart of the Cauldron. Find Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge and get the low down!", "If tailoring is your thing, Vizzklick will most definitely have your supplies. Take a look around, $N, and let me know if you wish to purchase something!" },
	["维兹罗"] = { "Whitereach Post is something of an unintended stop for me, to put it mildly. My clients are counting on me to deliver my wares and I'm starting to wonder if I'm going to make it in time with all the delays involved." },
	["维勒老妈"] = { "Can you believe this ethereal technology?! I'm sure glad they let me stay out here with them. I'm gonna learn a lot... and maybe get some of it for myself, too!" },
	["维勒老爹"] = { "Shredders?! They just won't cut it anymore. They're so yesterday! If we're going to build rockets - if we're going to get the X-52 off the ground - we need better tech!" },
	["维卡克斯"] = { "You wish to speak to me, $r?" },
	["维奈丝特拉"] = { "Hawkstriders are noble creatures. Make sure to always treat yours well; there are fewer things more dangerous than an angry hawkstrider.", "You'll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you've proven your worth and dedication to our people. Do not return until you are considered exalted among the blood elves. Away with you!" },
	["维尔"] = { "What?! How did you sneak past my jail...er, minion out there? Well, I suppose it's for the best. Sales have been a little slow lately. How may I fulfill your infernal needs, $c?" },
	["维尔拉·幼蹄"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["维尔海姆·斯图恩"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["维尔玛·瓦纳姆"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Skeletal Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the Forsaken of the Undercity before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["维尔达·熊鬃"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["维尼克斯的机械设备"] = { "The machine comes alive at your touch." },
	["维序派虚空幼龙"] = { "The nether drake looks upon you approvingly." },
	["维序派顾问拉希姆"] = { "I am here at the behest of Nexus-Prince Haramad. Strange things are afoot at the Stormspire." },
	["维恩·拉尔森"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["维恩德·夜风"] = { "Welcome to Starfall Village, traveler. Have you come to assist us?" },
	["维拉加·乱羽"] = { "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place." },
	["维摩尔上尉"] = { "Welcome to Sentry Point, $c." },
	["维斯·库鲁兹"] = { "The Commander has not been himself as of late. His mistress disappeared while on an archaeological dig in the southern desert - vanished without a trace! Very strange, indeed. I suppose you're looking for work? Do I need to bash you in the head with a clue?", "You're hunting Deathclasp, $N? Color me impressed. I lost two of my men to her this week alone. Let's hope your luck is better than theirs." },
	["维斯派塔斯"] = { "To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore." },
	["维斯雷"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["维斯雷·扭钳"] = { "I call 'er the Spirit of Gnomeregan. Isn't she a beaut? Without your help, she'd've never been restored.", "I never thought we'd escape from that steamy jungle! Now I'm the lead engineer of this expedition.", "My poor flying machine. She didn't survive the crash and without spare parts, I'll never get 'er up and running again!", "These babies may look like scrap, but they can rush ahead, knocking enemies aside. The front ram has been overloaded with a electroscopic hyper capacitor, letting it discharge electrical blasts. Even the turret has been upgraded with anti-air rockets, providing it with a definitive edge over those blasted demolishers." },
	["维林·疾风"] = { "Get that head and it's sure to give Daryl a fright. Not that he doesn't deserve it, the bloody arrogant bastard. But ha! I can't wait to see the look on his face when you show it to him.", "Welcome to the Farstrider Lodge, $N!", "You're always welcome here, $N. Thanks for the laugh -- and don't worry about Daryl, he had one coming!" },
	["维格利"] = { "Thanks, $N. If you hadn't shown up I'm sure we would have been dead meat! Now the only thing between us and the chief troll is that door yonder...", "We have to kill more trolls! Kill enough and I'll blow the door to the troll chief!" },
	["维沃·金齿"] = { "We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["维罗妮娅"] = { "I'm a little busy negotiating a bribe right now. You might want to come back later.", "I've arranged for your flight to Manaforge Coruu. Are you ready, $N? You will be dropped off behind enemy lines so make sure you bring everything you need." },
	["维罗格·冰啸"] = { "Good to see ya again! King Stormheart has informed me that he will be taking his leave for a time... a grim memory brought back to him has left him with a score to settle it seems. He was very insistent that we not join him, so we have respected his wishes as we always do. I have taken responsibility for our clan in the meantime. You are still welcome with us, of course." },
	["维赫亚"] = { "Riplash will never return to its former glory, but these boat-riding scum will pay for their deeds - I swear it!" },
	["维赫纳"] = { "Aye, you there! If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need! Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know. Rather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them! Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!" },
	["维隆·冻石"] = { "Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge. Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale.", "Not so fast, guy... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge. Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale.", "Not so fast, lady... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge. Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale." },
	["维雷迪斯·雪晨"] = { "Before we can overcome external obstacles like the Scourge and the Amani trolls, we must overcome obstacles from within. The Wretched have been a nuisance for long enough; it is time we vanquished them." },
	["编织者欧尔"] = { "I can instruct you in tailoring. Interested?" },
	["缚地者加兰蒂娅·夜风"] = { "We must discover what's behind the mystery of the giant crystal that fell from the heavens on Fallen Sky Ridge.", "Your help was invaluable, my friend. I can assure you that the Cenarion Expedition will do everything in its power to counter any future tainted crystals dropped from the heavens by Illidan." },
	["缚地者塔弗格伦"] = { "Be careful going into the thicket, $c. There is a harmful aura lingering about the place. It must be the residue from whatever destroyed my fellow druids.", "Thank you again, $N, for helping me to uncover what happened here at the thicket." },
	["缚地者雷葛"] = { "Thank goodness for you! Claw and I were investigating this place when we were jumped by Swamplord Musel'ek. He can control animals, even druids! Unfortunately, Claw was caught in bear form at the time, and is now the swamplord's pet. I don't dare change into cat form or he'll get me too! I'm afraid you'll have to fight Claw in order to save him. Just keep heading west; you can't miss him." },
	["罗伯特·克拉克"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["罗伯特·奥布斯"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["罗克图斯·暗契"] = { "The Thorium Brotherhood possesses the knowledge required to make the sacred arms and armaments of the Fire Lord, but we lack the manpower to obtain the materials required for the crafting. I, Lokhtos Darkbargainer, have been empowered by the Brotherhood to exchange the exalted recipes for materials gathered from the Molten Core. Present your offer, $r." },
	["罗克希克"] = { "Sometimes I surprise even myself!" },
	["罗克诺特下士"] = { "The Alliance needs you. Answer the hero's call!" },
	["罗卡格"] = { "Malukaz chatters incessantly about the historical importance of this forest, but I don't have the luxury of indulging in history until our present problems are settled. I'm not saying his work here isn't important, but someone has to see to the defenses and logistics of running the hold." },
	["罗哈图"] = { "A powerful human mage is rumored to live to the north; he keeps watch over the land for some unknown reason. I have not traveled there myself, but it is said that visitors are welcome and can even earn favor with him if they are willing to do errands for him.", "Because you have aided me, I will tell you what I know of this land and of the things there are to see. My knowledge is not vast, but perhaps I can point out some things that might interest one such as yourself.", "Greetings, $c. Those Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes? I am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble.", "I've seen terrible things happen to the furbolg over the last few years--they were victims on many fronts. But it's unclear to me what's become of this tribe. Are they corrupted by the same plague that's touched Felwood? Or perhaps they are simply angry at what's happened to their once peaceful people and now seek to defend themselves. Either way, most of them appear hostile to those who come into the area.", "My knowledge of night elf lore is limited, but it is said long ago--back when the night elves still held sacred the art of arcane spell casting--that Azshara was the greatest of their kind. A beautiful woman they named queen. Sadly, it was her addiction to the arcane that would one day be the catalyst for the most devastating events in this world's history.", "Once a great city of the night elves, the Highborne once ruled there, practicing great and powerful arcane magics. They are cursed now, haunting the lands, and their ruined city has been victimized by the Spitelash naga. I understand that the naga search the ruins for powerful Highborne artifacts.", "The blue dragons themselves aren't here, but followers of Malygos are. I do not know why, but I can tell you this: wherever the blue dragons are, expect to find arcane magic. I wouldn't be surprised if the dragonspawn are here protecting something... perhaps something the Highborne left behind." },
	["罗宁"] = { "Welcome to the home of the Kirin Tor." },
	["罗尼·威尔斯"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["罗拉克斯"] = { "Bite your tongue, $r, lest I rip it from your skull case and use it as a horn warmer.", "He took the unforged rune covered breastplate, used in the making of the demon forged breastplate and ran away without making payment. A fool, I am not, however... the unforged chest piece is useless without knowledge or the recipe to apply said knowledge. I wonder... does he sit safely in his city of Blackrock Spire and attempt to create the item from the raw material? I know he dare not leave!", "I would teach him how to demon forge in exchange for his soul. The soul of a Blackrock orc is worth very little but in these trying times, a soul, any soul, is better than none at all.", "Test not my patience, mortal.", "What it is that I do, of course. I brood. I lament. I hate. I plot. When that cycle is complete, I brood again. What is it you want from me? I have much on my mind.", "You? <Lorax laughs.> That is doubtful. I stand in these ruins and dream. Dream of the day that I catch that miserable thief, Goraluk Anvilcrack. We had a deal, him and I. A deal that he broke. Betrayed." },
	["罗斯洛·鲁治"] = { "Welcome to Steelgrill's Depot!" },
	["罗格瓦尔"] = { "Warchief Thrall himself asked me to come out here. I was honored to obey, and it's no hardship. I couldn't have asked for a better posting than Stonard. Just about any herb I might need grows in the muck here." },
	["罗纳德·安德森"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["罗罗基姆"] = { "Forgetting your skill in Elixir Mastery is not something to do lightly. Are you absolutely sure?", "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["罗里克·玛克雷尔"] = { "Another hungry recruit?" },
	["罗雷利恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["罗霍克"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["罗顿·石锤"] = { "My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air." },
	["美酒商人"] = { "I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the \"Brew of the Month Club.\"" },
	["老人科布恩"] = { "Huh?" },
	["老冰鳞"] = { "<Old Icefin draws in the sand. From the crude pictures he traces you can make out that he wants your help.>", "<Old Icefin eyes you warily, his fishy eye blinking as he bobs his head up and down once in a curt dismissal.>" },
	["考乌尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["考克·基泽尔顿"] = { "Ah... a customer! Talk to my greatest invention, the Vendor-Tron 1000. He has all your needs... some of the rarest items you will ever find on the market anywhere in Kalimdor... not to mention that his programming will not allow any bargaining, so the price you see is the price you pay." },
	["考古学家安多林"] = { "Welcome to the Storm Peaks, $r." },
	["考古学家阿达曼特·铁心"] = { "I am Adamant Ironheart of the great city of Ironforge. As you could probably guess by looking at my uniform, I was once part of the Ironforge elite guard. Yep, I was Magni's right hand man! At least until I retired. Now I dabble in archaeology. It's a hobby really; plus I figured it would be a great way to see the world!", "What are you lookin' at?" },
	["考尔奇"] = { "Get me out of here, $r!" },
	["考尔文·诺灵顿"] = { "I hope the archmage appreciates what I've gone through to uphold Hemet's end of the bargain." },
	["耶兰·洛克伍德"] = { "The Melee Target trains Aspirants in both mounted attack and defense. Approach the Melee Target and strike it with a Thrust attack. The force of the blow often spins the target hard enough to injure you or your mount. This is where defense comes into play. Be certain to have at least one layer of Defend before attacking the target, and continue to stack and refresh Defend throughout the training exercise. Otherwise, you may well find yourself dismounted. The same holds true in actual mounted combat: Balance attack and defense, Thrusting at every opportunity and maintaining your layers of Defend as best you can.", "Well met, $c. I train Aspirants in the art of mounted close combat.", "You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you. Equip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction's pavilion." },
	["耶利尼克·沙希尔"] = { "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you...", "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..." },
	["耶努萨克雷"] = { "The elements speak to us, $c. They share knowledge that we must learn, and they share secrets that must be kept." },
	["耶尔玛克"] = { "I'm busy, $N. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something." },
	["耶比托·乔巴斯"] = { "Welcome to the Wonderworks! Please take your time and browse the shop. We have wonderful toys for people young and old!" },
	["耶泰尼斯·射日者"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["耶玛"] = { "I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!" },
	["耶纳尔"] = { "Conspiracies abound, I say. There are those who lack vision in understanding what I do, and would seek to keep me shackled to obscurity! Don't step in the dirt.", "What am I doing? Do you lack vision? I am a dreamer, good $g sir : lady;, and I dream of a better future for us all. Clearly, I am a visionary. There are those, however, who seek to keep us mired in banality. I told him that I was a dreamer, and Arch Druid Staghelm replied, Well, the world needs ditch diggers too. Until such time as the shackles of banality are ripped from us, I will help the Cenarion Circle by shuffling these piles of dirt around.", "What am I doing? Do you lack vision? I am a dreamer, good lady, and I dream of a better future for us all. Clearly, I am a visionary. There are those, however, who seek to keep us mired in banality. I told him that I was a dreamer, and Arch Druid Staghelm replied, Well, the world needs ditch diggers too. Until such time as the shackles of banality are ripped from us, I will help the Cenarion Circle by shuffling these piles of dirt around.", "What am I doing? Do you lack vision? I am a dreamer, good sir, and I dream of a better future for us all. Clearly, I am a visionary. There are those, however, who seek to keep us mired in banality. I told him that I was a dreamer, and Arch Druid Staghelm replied, Well, the world needs ditch diggers too. Until such time as the shackles of banality are ripped from us, I will help the Cenarion Circle by shuffling these piles of dirt around." },
	["耶罗米"] = { "Finally, someone came down to talk to me! Want to hear some of my rhymes?", "Walking down the street! Looking at my feet! Watching the leaves, fall off of the trees!" },
	["耶蕾娜·夜空"] = { "I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?" },
	["耶诺瓦·石盾"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["耶雷米亚·霍宁"] = { "The Scourge are everywhere! This is... a nightmare!" },
	["联盟准将"] = { "The war against the Horde has reached full tilt, $N. This is a time of great need for the Alliance and it's necessary that all of us do our part to help." },
	["肖恩"] = { "Hello there $g mister : ma'am;... do you have a little time that you could help us out? Please?", "Hello there ma'am... do you have a little time that you could help us out? Please?", "Hello there mister... do you have a little time that you could help us out? Please?", "Thank you again for helping Hilary, $g mister : miss;! When I grow up, I wanna be a hero just like you!", "Thank you again for helping Hilary, miss! When I grow up, I wanna be a hero just like you!", "Thank you again for helping Hilary, mister! When I grow up, I wanna be a hero just like you!" },
	["肖祖"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["肯图卡尼斯"] = { "You not a real mon til you killed a dragon... mon." },
	["肯尼克斯"] = { "With new enemies on our doorsteps, we must not allow our ancient enemies to take advantage of our situation!" },
	["肯杰"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours." },
	["胡达尔"] = { "Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there. We must do what we can against the Dark Irons!" },
	["舍伦尼·洛巴尔特"] = { "Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing." },
	["舍尔戈莱恩"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["舒特"] = { "If our enemies would see that we only wish to live in harmony with them, maybe we wouldn't have to attack them for our own survival?" },
	["舰队指挥官卡拉·海角"] = { "Welcome to Booty Bay, $r." },
	["船主格瑞姆比"] = { "You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn." },
	["船员克罗斯维"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员加兹盖尔"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员卡派普"] = { "I don't have time to talk right now.", "I'm busy right now." },
	["船员奎菲克斯"] = { "<Grumbles> I guess those mountains came out of nowhere... All five times!", "<Grumbles> I still don't know how we managed to snake through Thousand Needles without a scratch, only to crash and burn in the Shimmering Flats!", "<Grumbles> You'd think it would be hard to crash a zeppelin into the ocean. You'd think it'd be even harder to do it four separate times!", "I am impressed that pine tree branches don't seem to damage our ship much. Not that it excuses the three times we've crashed into some forest.", "I never thought I'd get to see Teldrassil... I certainly never thought we'd crash into Teldrassil.", "We've managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!" },
	["船员巴鲁维兹"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员布特塞"] = { "I don't have time to talk right now.", "I'm busy right now." },
	["船员帕伯伦奇"] = { "It's a pretty smooth ride if you don't mind the dust.", "Keep away from the edge there, champ. Don't want you falling." },
	["船员帕特托普"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员戴德博特"] = { "Hey. I'm on break." },
	["船员拉斯哈默"] = { "<Grumbles> I guess those mountains came out of nowhere... All five times!", "<Grumbles> I still don't know how we managed to snake through Thousand Needles without a scratch, only to crash and burn in the Shimmering Flats!", "<Grumbles> You'd think it would be hard to crash a zeppelin into the ocean. You'd think it'd be even harder to do it four separate times!", "I am impressed that pine tree branches don't seem to damage our ship much. Not that it excuses the three times we've crashed into some forest.", "I never thought I'd get to see Teldrassil... I certainly never thought we'd crash into Teldrassil.", "We've managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!" },
	["船员斯宾维尔"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员斯宾萨弗"] = { "I don't have time to talk right now.", "I'm busy right now." },
	["船员斯巴弗莱"] = { "<Grumbles> I guess those mountains came out of nowhere... All five times!", "<Grumbles> I still don't know how we managed to snake through Thousand Needles without a scratch, only to crash and burn in the Shimmering Flats!", "<Grumbles> You'd think it would be hard to crash a zeppelin into the ocean. You'd think it'd be even harder to do it four separate times!", "I am impressed that pine tree branches don't seem to damage our ship much. Not that it excuses the three times we've crashed into some forest.", "I never thought I'd get to see Teldrassil... I certainly never thought we'd crash into Teldrassil.", "We've managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!" },
	["船员斯迪波特"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员格瑞特"] = { "It's a pretty smooth ride if you don't mind the dust.", "Keep away from the edge there, champ. Don't want you falling." },
	["船员法斯维克"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员科尔斯班"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船员舒布斯卡"] = { "On duty. GO. AWAY.", "Sorta busy.", "What? I'm busy here." },
	["船长保罗·卡维尔"] = { "Before we can set sail to Northrend, we've got to eliminate our pest problem aboard the Assurance.", "The Assurance has somehow become inundated with bugs and we are unable to set sail to Northrend.", "We were all set to sail into Northrend, but we've noticed a severe number of pests aboard our ship." },
	["艾丝崔·约利塔尔"] = { "Bears are beautiful creatures. Wild, strong and fierce in battle... much like us, sister." },
	["艾伦·哈弗甘"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["艾伦琼·阳刃"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["艾克提恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I am far too busy to be wasting time on idle chatter. If you are looking for work as a huntsman, speak with Diktynna at the river's edge -- to the east. No doubt she's behind on her duties...", "Just north of Azure Watch is where you will have the best luck finding moongraze bucks. Happy hunting, $N!", "Moongraze stags can be found grazing south and east of Azure Watch.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["艾尔丁"] = { "I can tell that your wardrobe is in dire need of care." },
	["艾尔兰拉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?", "It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["艾尔文森林护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["艾尔杜·炙痕"] = { "The Wretched are a constant thorn in my side, $N. When they're not being a danger to themselves by tapping unstable arcane sources to satisfy their cravings, they're cooking up half-brained schemes against our respectable society." },
	["艾尔莎林"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["艾尔萨娜"] = { "Walk always in the Light, $N." },
	["艾尔达拉·晨行者"] = { "Do not fight the enemy unprepared, $N. I can provide you with very powerful items... provided you have proven yourself to us." },
	["艾弗拉兰"] = { "Hail to thee $N. Do you wish me to aid you in your journey to Warsong Gulch?", "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch." },
	["艾德勒·费欧德"] = { "Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her." },
	["艾德华·汉斯船长"] = { "This land still bears the scars of the past. I wonder if they will ever heal." },
	["艾德娜·穆比"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["艾拉兰"] = { "<Eralan appears to be chewing on some deathweed.> If you're looking to make a love potion, you've got the wrong place. Blinding, crippling, and killing is my business and hopefully yours." },
	["艾斯特蕾·根德瑞"] = { "With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it." },
	["艾林·凯利"] = { "I can instruct you in tailoring. Interested?" },
	["艾欧莉娅"] = { "Only a mage can learn portal magic, $c." },
	["艾沃奈斯"] = { "We chose to leave the protection and comfort of the Depths to exploit... er, I mean... hrm, yes that's right, EXPLORE the world." },
	["艾法希比元帅"] = { "Move along, citizen. There is nothing to see here." },
	["艾玛"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["艾瑞丹·蓝风"] = { "The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land." },
	["艾瑞卡·塔特"] = { "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin." },
	["艾瑞安·影语"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["艾瑞拉斯·琥珀"] = { "Druids are very sensitive to the plight of all creatures of the world. When it was found that these birds were in danger, we set up a system of rescuing them from the corruption of Feralas. A gnome named Curgle Cranklehop leads the affair; she collects the eggs and has them sent here, where I care for them. We could always use more help for our cause, $N. Maybe you should head over to Gadgetzan and look for Curgle.", "Hello, $N. I train and care for young hippogryphs here; feel free to have a look around." },
	["艾瓦·萨克霍夫"] = { "And go where? It was all that we knew; all that we had known and all that we would ever know. Eventually, we lost contact with the Barovs and ultimately, were separated from the household. We knew not what happened to the other servants, only that there were screams. Tortured screams. Knowing that we had nowhere to go, Lucien and I were forced to hide in our quarters. During the day, when the school was relatively quiet, Lucien would sneak out to scrounge up food and drink.", "Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance. I was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler. We had worked for the Barovs for decades, until... <Eva weeps.>", "Certainly, miss. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance. I was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler. We had worked for the Barovs for decades, until... <Eva weeps.>", "Certainly, sir. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance. I was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler. We had worked for the Barovs for decades, until... <Eva weeps.>", "Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.", "Hello young Master. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.", "Hello young Mistress. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.", "Oh it's just so horrible, $g sir:miss;. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire. Lucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak.", "Oh it's just so horrible, miss. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire. Lucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak.", "Oh it's just so horrible, sir. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire. Lucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak.", "Restraints? There are things in this world far more restraining than bars and shackles, young $g master:mistress;. The undead surrounded us, constantly tormenting us with horrifying acts of depravity. Finally, he came. He introduced himself as Doctor Theolen Krastinov. We came to know him as 'The Butcher.\\", "Restraints? There are things in this world far more restraining than bars and shackles, young master. The undead surrounded us, constantly tormenting us with horrifying acts of depravity. Finally, he came. He introduced himself as Doctor Theolen Krastinov. We came to know him as 'The Butcher.\\", "Restraints? There are things in this world far more restraining than bars and shackles, young mistress. The undead surrounded us, constantly tormenting us with horrifying acts of depravity. Finally, he came. He introduced himself as Doctor Theolen Krastinov. We came to know him as 'The Butcher.\\", "The Butcher would speak of 'the blood of innocents,' and his dark master, 'Kirtonos.' Of how he must appease his master. Finally, the beast was done with his experiments. We had been drained of all life. Our spirits shattered. The sweet embrace of death was upon us and we welcomed it with open arms. But in his infinite cruelty, the Butcher revived us from death's door. We were to be kept alive and thrown to his ravenous ghouls. He laughed as he watched the fiends devour our flesh.", "We did this for about six months and watched as the house went through horrifying changes. Foul monsters roamed through the manor at will. Dark cultists populated every inch with various paraphernalia relating to rituals and sacrifices. We knew that we could not hide much longer. As expected, we were found and captured. They stripped us of all our clothes and laid us out inside a circle of blood. We sat there for days, naked and terrified.", "We feel nothing. Our souls remain here, in limbo. We are unable to leave until our remains are found and spirits laid to rest.", "We finally understood what the screams were from. The Butcher exposed us to pain that we did not know existed. He used us in countless experiments, attempting to devise a plague. The days turned to weeks. We would have died on the first day had it not been for that cruel monster keeping us alive through magical means.", "We suspect that in order to preserve their fortune and hold of the land - well past their lifespan - the Barovs made a deal with a powerful human mage named Kel'Thuzad. <Eva shudders.> From this deal sprang the school of necromancy: A place which bore the Cult of the Damned and would become their capital. As each week passed, the house Barov became more and more decrepit... Dark beings began to take residence in the various wings of the house. Upkeep became impossible... and disgusting." },
	["艾登中尉"] = { "I haven't much time to talk unless it's urgent, citizen. The gates of Theramore are my greatest responsibility." },
	["艾米丝·埃索盖斯"] = { "Welcome to the Legerdemain Lounge, $c. I do hope you'll enjoy your stay." },
	["艾米琳·菲弗莱"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["艾米莉"] = { "I think you should go, $g mister:miss;. You're scaring Mr. Floppy.", "I think you should go, miss. You're scaring Mr. Floppy.", "I think you should go, mister. You're scaring Mr. Floppy.", "Mr. Floppy and I went for a walk, but then we got lost and I was really scared, cause there were these wolves, you know, and they chased us, but then I saw this tower and Mr. Floppy and I hid here and the wolves finally went away after a while and it was terrible and now we don't know how to get back home." },
	["艾米鲁尔·冬风"] = { "Elune watch over you, $r." },
	["艾索雷葛斯之魂"] = { "As I was saying, I held onto that scepter shard for a good five-hundred years and it was nothing but trouble. It attracted all kinds of attention - the wrong kind of attention. I want to be left alone to my studies not babysit some would be hero's ticket to glory. So... I gave it to the fish.", "Correct. You've been listening! This minnow is really quite a terrible creature of my own creation. When I am relaxing I like to think of the unlucky fishermen who have run into this minnow and been devoured whole. I bet they were quite surprised! <Azuregos laughs.>", "Exactly!", "Genius is often misunderstood, $r. Now, about the scepter shard... If you want that shard and do not wish to spend the next ten thousand years searching for it, you are going to have to listen very carefully.", "Genius, I know... It will never be found; but, in case it is found, I gave the minnow some special powers.", "If I did not know better I would think that you were mocking me, mortal; but yes, that is mostly correct. You may remain fully clothed.", "My watch is eternal, mortal.", "Not just any fish, mortal. This fish was a minnow. A very special minnow.", "Of course I do not have the shard. That would be asinine. I walk amongst savages in this cursed land! I cannot take five steps without some crazed orc or human trying to thrust a sharp stick into my hide. At any given time you could very well be speaking to my ghostly spirit. Anyhow... I hid it. Go on... ask me where.", "Right then... You have to build an arcanite buoy and place it in the ocean. My minnow will be attracted to the magical emanations. When he gets near the buoy - BLAMO! It will explode in a glorious pulse of arcane energy, revealing the minnow's true form. Also, you may or may not incur the wrath of Neptulon. A 50/50 chance I would say.", "Shouldn't you be saving the world?", "Take this ledger to an old acquaintance of mine in Tanaris. His name is Narain Soothfancy - terrible, terrible, psychic but an amazing engineer! He should be able to make sense of it all. No need to thank me, $N. It's the least I could do. Good day!", "Two words: Arcanite buoy.", "You seek the scepter shard charged to the protection of the Blue Flight? <Azuregos appears to be smiling.>" },
	["艾莱"] = { "Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["艾莱·觅星"] = { "It's good to see you here, $N." },
	["艾萨莱斯特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?", "Yes, $c?" },
	["艾蒂安·花丛之风"] = { "Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it." },
	["艾蒂尔·月火"] = { "May the blessings of the night be yours, friend! I am Illiyana Moonblaze, and I am the main supplier for the Silverwing Sentinels here in Ashenvale. As you improve your standing with the Sentinels, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch. Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services." },
	["艾蕾娜·斯托姆法瑟"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["艾蕾希"] = { "Only champions of the Exodar may purchase what I have to offer." },
	["艾达伊斯"] = { "Made by the finest craftsmen in all of Teldrassil, carried by hand from Kalimdor to Azeroth as a sign of the growing alliance between the people of the Great Tree and the humans of this land. If there is anything you require, you have but to ask." },
	["艾雷·碎云"] = { "You don't get to see much action in my line of work. Serving this close to the front lines in a combat zone is a nice change of pace." },
	["节日博学者"] = { "Enjoying the festival, $c? While the Flame Wardens tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think? You know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..." },
	["节日诗人"] = { "Enjoying the festival, $c? While the Flame Keepers tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think? You know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..." },
	["节点亲王哈拉迈德"] = { "If you've been sent to kill me, please take a number and wait your turn." },
	["节点亲王哈拉迈德的影像"] = { "Welcome to the Stormspire, $c. Please do not be put off by my being present through this imaging device. I have many enemies that would like to see me dead, so it is only a precaution. I assure you that you are perfectly safe here." },
	["芬努斯"] = { "Fineous has what you need, friend." },
	["芬布斯"] = { "I'm never too busy to speak to a stranger! Almost never, anyway..." },
	["芬提"] = { "If you need reagents, you've come to the right place. You won't find a finer selection in all of Shattrath." },
	["芬斯维克"] = { "Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can I do for ya?" },
	["芬雷·箭羽"] = { "Day and night all I do is sit here and make ammo and restring crossbows. I suppose you want me to do something for you too?" },
	["苏亚米"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["苏兰"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits." },
	["苏尔加亚"] = { "Don't forget to take some time out to fish while you're in Zangarmarsh. You never know when you'll see water again." },
	["苏尔曼·火崖"] = { "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.", "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lass, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me." },
	["苏拉·迅箭"] = { "$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch. But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills. As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf. Will you join the battle?", "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch." },
	["苏拉库"] = { "Greetings, traveler." },
	["苏拉文"] = { "This is just horrible. I care not for our own discomforts here, but we must do something to ease the pain of the dead in the Bone Wastes!" },
	["苏特菲兹"] = { "This outpost is a cog-free zone. Persons employing cogs in the construction of mechanical devices will be subject to unrelenting mockery." },
	["苏苏鲁斯"] = { "What brings you all the way up here, little $r?" },
	["苏雷·疾锋"] = { "Dealin' wit' *hic* poison and alco... *hic* booze ish dangeroush..." },
	["苏雷斯塔兹"] = { "Why do you disturb me?" },
	["苔行村受害者"] = { "The mosswalker looks severely injured." },
	["苟拉尔"] = { "If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles.", "What can you do at an inn? Well when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably. Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness. When you are well rested, you learn more from experience. You may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn." },
	["苦工加克拉"] = { "If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles." },
	["英尼戈·蒙托尔神父"] = { "The Lich King is attempting to make his presence known in our world. This must not be allowed to occur." },
	["范恩"] = { "No part of the animals we hunt is wasted." },
	["范斯·安德格鲁姆"] = { "Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?" },
	["荆棘谷海角护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["荆棘谷海角护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["草药学家奥莱拉"] = { "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?" },
	["草药师博米洛伊"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["荒芜之地护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["荣耀堡卫兵维斯洛"] = { "About twenty years ago, the Alliance launched the first Expedition to this world in hopes of eradicating the orcs forever. It was a... terrible conflict. Many brave souls perished to assure Azeroth's safety. Yet some souls remain...locked in eternal combat." },
	["药剂师塞兰娜"] = { "The Royal Apothecary Society of the Undercity is eager to aid our orc allies here, in Outland. It is an opportunity to strengthen our bonds, and to find new specimens and compounds for study. Compounds...such as poisons." },
	["药剂师安东尼维奇"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["药剂师安娜斯塔西娅"] = { "Yes? What is it? Time waits for no one!" },
	["药剂师恩尼斯"] = { "<The Forsaken female is curled up on the floor, her face in a grimace. She does not appear capable of getting up on her own at the moment.>", "Ahhhhggg... this pain in my head is killing me. They must've sent you to rescue me. Took them long enough! Do you have any idea of the things they do to prisoners here?" },
	["药剂师提灵哈斯特"] = { "So many uses for the plague, so little time!" },
	["药剂师汉摩尔"] = { "A few weeks in this pathetic castle will give us time to work on some new products and let others forget about the unfortunate... misunderstanding in Dragonblight." },
	["药剂师温努图斯"] = { "I must say, you delivered my poison and dealt with those trolls most ruthlessly, $c. You've got the makings of quite a talented young $g man : lady;!", "I must say, you delivered my poison and dealt with those trolls most ruthlessly, $c. You've got the makings of quite a talented young lady!", "I must say, you delivered my poison and dealt with those trolls most ruthlessly, $c. You've got the makings of quite a talented young man!", "We really must perfect a way to deal with those smelly Shadowpine trolls!" },
	["药剂师瑟德拉"] = { "It's going to take a bit of work, but I think we can save this blood elf's life." },
	["药剂师艾瑟森"] = { "Befriending the Sunstriders has paid off; I get to conduct research with subjects I can only find in Outland and they get... my charming personality and rugged good looks." },
	["药剂师诺斯"] = { "Heigan is probably performing maintenance on his slime and crap filled dance studio.", "How dare you! Get out of my sight!", "I can tell you where he's not...", "It might look like an ordinary pumpkin patch now, but once the plague cauldron is placed it will become a source of disease, rot and plague!", "It's only a matter of time before the plague overtakes New Avalon.", "NEVER say that name around me! Consider this your one and only warning!", "That no good kiss-up is probably practicing ballet in his chambers." },
	["药剂师迪瑟斯"] = { "A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee. I just hope we don't get caught up in it.", "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth. With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands! Once you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth. With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands! Once you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth. With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands! Once you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", "Well now $N, let's get to work on those cauldrons! If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me. You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons. You'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons. It's not cheap, nor is it stable. Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it." },
	["药剂师阿尔布雷克"] = { "I am told that the dust and heat of Hellfire Peninsula is quite irritating... I would not know, but I will trust my esteemed, and still living, allies." },
	["药剂师雷兹特恩"] = { "The drafts of fresh air that blow from Eversong from time to time really upset my stomach, if you know what I mean." },
	["药剂师雷杉德尔"] = { "The Royal Apothecary Society welcomes you to Northrend, $c. Now, what is it that you will do to aid us in Sylvanas' service?" },
	["莉吉特"] = { "Hello, peach - good to have your company!" },
	["莉塞拉"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["莉娜·月泉"] = { "Our work in the Living Grove must not be endangered. Our very lives hinge upon its continued health and growth." },
	["莉安娜中士"] = { "Look sharp, $r. It's life or death out here!" },
	["莉琳希亚·夜风"] = { "Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now." },
	["莉芙·雷兹菲克斯"] = { "Hiya! This workshop isn't mine, no! But one day after I finish training I am going to be an inventor, just like my hero, Marvon Rivetseeker. You've never heard of him? Well it just so happens that he left quite some time ago to study some ancient troll ruins he kept talking about. He left in a zeppelin... not quite sure about where exactly he went... Tanarasin? Tenkeris? Taneranisany? <Liv shakes her head.> No, that's not it..." },
	["莉蕾·转轴"] = { "Hi there! Sorry, friend, but only champions of Gnomeregan can buy what I've got." },
	["莉蕾萨"] = { "Arthas was once a human prince. The army he led into Northrend suffered a horrible fate. My brother, Thassarian, was a part of that army.", "I'll never forget what you did for Thassarian. I will always be in your debt." },
	["莎伊斯·钢怒"] = { "I don't train smiths with no skill, come back when you have something decent to show me.", "I see potential in you $N. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice." },
	["莎妮尔"] = { "My job is to care for these poor souls. I accept the help of any willing to lend a hand, be they Aldor or Scryer. We are so understaffed, I wouldn't turn an ogre away if they knew how to apply a tourniquet. The politics of the city are of little matter to me." },
	["莫克瓦尔"] = { "Thrall has shown great kindness in granting me sanctuary within his domain. I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate. It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our leader." },
	["莫加努斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["莫塔哈·风魂"] = { "Boktar thinks this crash an unfortunate event, but I believe we're intended to learn something from it." },
	["莫多"] = { "I am Moordo, elder hunter of Stillpine.", "[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor...", "[Furbolg] Poorov'tarkh!", "[Furbolg] Yar vartslaf?" },
	["莫娜·涌泉"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["莫尔托格"] = { "The Cenarion Expedition rescued me from certain death inside the mines. I owe them my life! I offer up my services of repair and reagent sales to those that are allies of the Cenarion Expedition." },
	["莫布"] = { "Both Garrosh's Landing and Pal'ea were wiped out by the mist. We're the only ones crazy enough to stay here, buddy!" },
	["莫希·斯蒂格里"] = { "The situation out here is worse than I thought! The zeppelin is little better than a heap of twisted metal and burning fuel!" },
	["莫希斯·轻翼"] = { "<Morthis glances skyward.> In a way, I envy the freedom Rook and Corvax enjoy. To be free of earthbound responsibilities is a great blessing indeed. The future will see me on wing once more, but first there's a task I must complete." },
	["莫德奈"] = { "$G Brother:Sister;, you are now considered bound by blood to the Netherwing. All of Netherwing will be behind you now! The time to strike at the heart of our enemies is now, friend! We must reclaim our lost heritage.", "Brother, you are now considered bound by blood to the Netherwing. All of Netherwing will be behind you now! The time to strike at the heart of our enemies is now, friend! We must reclaim our lost heritage.", "It is good to see you again, friend.", "Sister, you are now considered bound by blood to the Netherwing. All of Netherwing will be behind you now! The time to strike at the heart of our enemies is now, friend! We must reclaim our lost heritage.", "They can't keep this up! Their wings will eventually give..." },
	["莫托尔"] = { "If you have come to save the world then you have come to the right place. The faceless one - the Blood God, Hakkar - has been brought back into our world!" },
	["莫格霍尔大王"] = { "<Overlord Mor'ghor salutes.>" },
	["莫沙·星角"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["莫特·晨行者"] = { "What I wouldn't give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but my duty binds me." },
	["莫维克"] = { "It takes a lot of dedication to train and ride a Venomhide." },
	["莫苏尔·召血者"] = { "There comes a time when the life we know falls short. We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places. Only then, $N, do we take our first steps to freedom." },
	["莫莱"] = { "Everything that has happened since the crash is little more than a blur. It seems like a lifetime ago that I was aboard the Exodar. Now, my reality is restricted to this island with its mutant creatures and endless sea of blood elf agents. Soon, it will be as if I've never known anything different..." },
	["莫高雷护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["莱什纳·刺藤"] = { "In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves. Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort! If you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so. For the Horde!" },
	["莱克斯顿·莫泰姆"] = { "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic." },
	["莱兰多尔"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.", "The Silverwing Sentinels still fight the Horde in Warsong Gulch, $c. What remains to be seen is if you will return there to help them." },
	["莱兰奈"] = { "Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil. Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.", "By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber. For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions. Take your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction. I am sure you will not be disappointed." },
	["莱兰迪斯"] = { "$C, we need your assistance at Warsong Gulch. Will you aid us in our fight against the Warsong Outriders?", "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch." },
	["莱加尔·断眉"] = { "Welcome to the camp, $c." },
	["莱娜"] = { "What can I be helping you with?" },
	["莱尔德"] = { "Although the coast of Darkshore is more dangerous than that of Teldrassil, many fishers find profit here." },
	["莱尼·拜舍尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior. Why don't you go do something safe, like read a book.", "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["莱布斯基"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["莱恩·狼行者"] = { "I know these forests as if they were a part of me... But know that there is still much to be learned from them, and much danger still hidden.", "You have completed Teronis' mission, and I appreciate all you have done, $N." },
	["莱恩国王"] = { "<Llane's true wisdom and strength burn bright, even in this likeness of the king.>" },
	["莱斯顿·法斯雷"] = { "You there... it is in your best interest to aid the Forsaken during these dire times. Listen closely, as I dislike repeating myself. We currently find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth. Bandages and simple textiles are running low, and donations are being accepted to bolster sagging inventories. While you'll not receive financial compensation - hence what donation means - your aid will not go unnoticed." },
	["莱森·月火"] = { "We Cenarion druids are the protectors of the balance of nature. The main point being the balance. When called for, we shouldn't wait too long before taking decisive action. Don't let anyone tell you otherwise, especially those of us who only want to observe!" },
	["莱欧伦·玛尔迪拉斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I am Leoren, stable master of Cenarion Hold." },
	["莱欧洛克斯"] = { "Our enemies surround us. I would have a better life for the Mok'Nathal, but the forces we are at battle with have chosen otherwise for us. If you would prove yourself worthy to the Mok'Nathal, aid us in their elimination." },
	["莱洛拉斯"] = { "Focus your mind, mortal. This is the front line of a war unlike any you've witnessed. You'll need full command of your faculties if you are to be of any use.", "In a word, magic. Irresponsible mortals with their brief lifespans think nothing of the lasting effects of their actions. Arcane energies have been tapped too liberally, disrupting the world's balance. If this is allowed to continue, Azeroth will soon be annihilated. On this, both sides agree. But before a council could even be appointed, Malygos put his own plan into action. We had no choice but to confront him.", "Malygos the Spellweaver, the Lord of Magic, Master of the Blue Dragonflight. He is the blue dragon aspect, one of the most ancient creatures on Azeroth. He is said to be recovering from a madness which has lasted for millennia, but his recent actions lead me to believe that he is still far from sane. His solution to our dilemma is to search out and destroy every magic-wielding mortal on Azeroth. As the guardians of life, this has forced the red dragonflight to take action. Dragon now fights against dragon, and the fate of our frail world lies in the balance.", "We must succceed! Azeroth's fate lies in the balance...", "We're making progress, $r, but far too slowly." },
	["莱玛"] = { "Hey, I see ya got some Brewfest tokens. If ya want, I still got a few Brewfest goods to sell.", "It's great bein' a member of da \"Brew of the Month\" club." },
	["莱瓦里安神父"] = { "Walk in the Light, my child." },
	["莱纳里斯"] = { "Come, come. If you've properly prepared your leather for once, I'll show you how to fashion serviceable items." },
	["莱耶·星击"] = { "The past lives in these wastes, $c. We must be careful to not awaken it." },
	["莱茵"] = { "After the Plaguelands and the Battle for Light's Hope Chapel, I didn't think that we would witness anything more horrible. I was wrong.", "If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds. If you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds." },
	["莱顿·暗影"] = { "Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may... We have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil. Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth. If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them. You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!" },
	["获胜的挑战者"] = { "I will tear you limb from limb.", "You challenge?", "You don't look so tough.", "You think you have what it takes?" },
	["菜刀库尔格"] = { "What can Korg do for you today?" },
	["菲兹兰克·铁阀"] = { "After a couple of days of silence, I sent a scouting party out to the platform. They never returned. I sent another group the next day with the same results, and lost a couple of flying machines out on aerial recon. At that point I sent someone south to find help, and we hunkered down to prepare for the worst. We turned all of our attention to making armor, weapons and robots so that we could head out there in full force. When we did a few days ago, we couldn't believe our eyes!", "And that's where we find ourselves now, $N. We can't possibly deal with all of this by ourselves, and quite frankly, I feel a little out of my depth. Jinky knows what needs to be done. You should go see her now. I just hope you'll be able to get us out of this mess with our bodies intact.", "Anyway, we needed to pump up lots of sand and oil for the machinery. The nearby pools proved to be perfect for that. Some of the sand even proved to have magical properties... can you say possibilities!? But that's a different tale. So, we drained most of the water out and built the pumping station smack dab in the middle. Everything was going swimmingly until one day the main suction pipe got clogged.", "As I was saying, what we saw out there defied explanation. My people were nowhere to be found, but in their place was a veritable army of robots and androids going about their business! The droids all looked like gnomes and they said that they'd been expecting us. In fact, in their own strange way, they acted like they knew us. We were surrounded and quickly taken to the top of the pumping station. That's where we saw their leader and what he was doing to the surviving gnomes!", "Fine then, have a seat. This might take a while. When we first came to this frozen hell, General Arlos, down in Valiance Keep, gave my group of flying daredevils and I a special task: to establish a forward airbase for Alliance operations. This airstrip is the result. Let me tell you, it wasn't easy, what with all the nasty beasts and the ground rock-hard from being frozen! But we managed, and we did it quickly too!", "He called himself Gearmaster Mechazod. When we arrived he was busy transforming the survivors into mechanical beings! He greeted us warmly and explained that he was one of the first gnomes ever to be created by something he called \"The Grand Architect\", a Titan keeper from within the halls of fabled Ulduar. Apparently, he was the blockage that my team had accidentally sucked up from where he'd malfunctioned thousands of years ago. It was just our luck that we'd built the pumping station right above him.", "I've got my hands full here at the moment, $c. What can I do for you?", "It didn't look like much of a \"cure\" to me, and I wasn't about to stand around listening to some crazy robot while he was butchering my people! We did what any sane gnome would do... we ran! Well, actually, most of us parachuted off the side of the platform, but you get the picture. Not many of us managed to make it back here, and we're still spread thin from having to deal with everything else too, like the magnataur to the north and the Scourge to the east. To make things worse, the Horde just setup shop to the northwest!", "Mind you, this part I learned later because I wasn't out there at the time. When they ratcheted up the suction on the pump, up came pieces of a robot that looked like a gnome! Of course the fools worked night and day to put it back together without telling us. This is when we lost communication with the pumping station.", "The station's mechanics had put him back together, bringing him back to \"life\". And now, by way of thanks, he was going to return the favor by curing all of us of what he called the \"Curse of the Flesh\". According to Mechazod, it's a condition that eventually befalls all of the creations of the Titans! In other words, we all supposedly start out as robots of some kind, and, over thousands of years, slowly turn into fleshy beings! Preposterous, I know." },
	["菲兹兰克伞兵"] = { "Hello there! Fizzcrank's pilots are the best of the best. We stay that way through constant training. That includes parachute training. You never know when you will need to use your chute, but you do know that one day you'll have to use it. So what we have here is a teleporter to the top of this spire. Once you get up there, the only way for a real soldier to get back down is with a parachute. We've got another trooper stationed up top ready with the parachutes. If you feel like trying it out, $c, I'll clear you for teleporter use. Then just step onto the teleporter." },
	["菲兹兰克侦察机飞行员"] = { "This recon pilot did not survive his squadron's crash." },
	["菲兹姆·布拉斯维"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["菲兹特·表针"] = { "Welcome to the Toshley's Station inn. What can I do for you?" },
	["菲利克斯"] = { "Oh dear. Things aren't looking good for Felix." },
	["菲利希亚·加姆"] = { "We are the only supplier of healthy flowers in all of Stormwind. We provide beautiful blooms for any occasion." },
	["菲利希亚·玛林"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["菲勒里亚·夜翼"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["菲尔古"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["菲尔迪恩·月羽"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["菲尔隆·暗歌"] = { "The wind fiercely cuts across this bluff, and most life has long since fled this corner of Icecrown. However, all it takes is a bit of coaxing for it to return, and that is why I walk these grounds. One day these trees will tower over us all." },
	["菲恩·叶影"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["菲拉·苍白行者"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["菲拉斯护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["菲拉斯护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["菲斯卡·影歌"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["萨义德上尉"] = { "Fleshling, I am Captain Saeed of the Protectorate and these soldiers that stand by me are my avengers. We await orders from the fleshling who destroyed the void conduit. On that fleshling's word, we will make our way up to Dimensius's lair and wait for the word to make a final strike! Too long it has been... The void lord will soon face our combined might!" },
	["萨博迈恩男爵"] = { "My loathing of interruptions is overshadowed only by my hatred of Gruul the Dragonkiller and his seven sons!" },
	["萨古尔德·铁翼"] = { "Greetings, $c! Stormwind Harbor is quite a sight to behold. It's even better seen from the air. How would you like a bird's eye view of the harbor?" },
	["萨哈克"] = { "You're a young hatchling aren't you? My eyes fail me. I assume you're here to purchase one of my exotic texts?" },
	["萨哈斯"] = { "Thank you, little $r!" },
	["萨多雷·格雷夫"] = { "Hello, $N." },
	["萨姆诺·普尔"] = { "I can train you in First Aid techniques.", "I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.", "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks." },
	["萨尔"] = { "<Thrall laughs.> Noted... Now pay attention, $N. The Black Dragonflight brood mother, Onyxia, has been flushed out from her position of power in Stormwind. She has escaped, fleeing to her lair in Dustwallow Marsh. She cannot be allowed to live in such close proximity to our capital cities. We must strike before being struck! I want her destroyed, $N.", "<Thrall laughs.> So much to learn still, $r. You are too young to remember the wars and bloodshed of ages past. Too young to remember the burden of the curse carried by our people. Our position with the Alliance right now is a tenuous one. Skirmishes and smaller battles do take place, but there is peace - something our people have not known for millennia. Would you give this up and plunge us into the maw of chaos again but against a new foe? One that will not rest until we are all destroyed?", "All members of the Horde are equal in my eyes, $N. We have all suffered many burdens, and if it were not for wisdom and honor, then we would be no better than the Scourge or my people while our blood was tainted by the demon Mannoroth. It is your duty to aid the Horde and to defend our way of life. But it is also your duty to know when quarter and compassion should be given to friend and foe alike. Understand this well. This is the new Horde, not some demon-spawned army who lack freewill.", "Indeed. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight had used illusion and trickery to disguise herself as a member of the royal court. Worse yet, she had assumed control of the current Highlord of Stormwind, Bolvar Fordragon. It is no wonder that such foolish military decisions had been made. The movement of the Alliance forces as of late had left us scratching our heads. We now understand that the Black Flight was attempting to divide the empire - destroy it from within.", "It would appear as if the influence of the Black Dragonflight had extended beyond the borders of the Burning Steppes and into the kingdom of Stormwind itself! The usurper has since been unmasked and ousted.", "Lady Proudmoore's forces have bled to delay Archimonde and his Burning Legion, and now this grim task falls to us. Are you ready to stand with me against the onslaught?", "No, $N, you did not. I do not fault you, however, as yours is a mind much like mine was as a youth: Impetuous, rebellious, and often without a single coherent thought! Traits I can no longer afford to express. Enough lamenting. $R, I have a task for you; one that you may not survive.", "The Shattered Hand has been able to place spies throughout the upper citadel of Blackrock. Though the information gathering process has been slow, we have made discoveries that cannot be ignored.", "Who are you? Just leave me be." },
	["萨尔克·暴怒图腾"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["萨尔姆"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["萨尔曼·穆比"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["萨尔法"] = { "The Winterfall furbolg that reside here in Winterspring were once our allies... But one day, that all changed. Driven by the strange demands of their high chief, they began to attack all others that they came in contact with, including our tribe. They keep to themselves now...", "We Timbermaw can grant you safe passage through the hold, however, you must prove yourself worthy of our aid." },
	["萨尤斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours." },
	["萨尼恩"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears.", "I can sense your desire for power, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["萨布奥斯"] = { "I used to amuse myself by accepting challenges from anyone who would offer them, but I've long since grown tired of such easy victories. For now, I'm taking some time to get my reagent business off the ground and write a book about my experiences in Twilight's Hammer." },
	["萨布莉娜·哀凝"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["萨希尔"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["萨拉·古迪"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["萨拉·坦尼"] = { "Oh hi! My name's Sarah. What can I do for you?" },
	["萨拉·弗斯莱特"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["萨提斯"] = { "What is it that you want?" },
	["萨斯雷·蓝空"] = { "Hello, friend. How may I be of service to you today?" },
	["萨杜尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What kin I do for ya, mon?" },
	["萨杜斯·帕雷教授"] = { "If you manage to complete a deck of Beasts cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of the Blue Dragon. This is very useful in restoring of magical energies.", "If you manage to complete a deck of Blessings cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of Crusade. This will increase the damage you do with your spells and attacks as you continue to fight.", "If you manage to complete a deck of Elementals cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of the Maelstrom. This card will occasionally impact an enemy you are fighting with for heavy damage.", "If you manage to complete a deck of Furies cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of Vengeance. While wielding this card anyone who strikes you has a chance of suffering holy vengeance.", "If you manage to complete a deck of Lunacy cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of Madness. The power of madness will fill you each time you slay an enemy.", "If you manage to complete a deck of Portals cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of the Twisting Nether. This card will occasionally pull your spirit back into your body after death and restore you.", "If you manage to complete a deck of Storms cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of Wrath. This will increase your chance to get a critical hit with spells or physical attacks until you achieve one.", "If you manage to complete a deck of Warlords cards you will be rewarded with a Greater Darkmoon card of Heroism. This card will occasionally heal you while you are engaged in melee combat.", "We have seeded Darkmoon Cards around the world to see if any worthy individuals could complete a set of any of the eight suits. If you manage to collect all eight cards of one of the suits we will reward you with one of the Greater Darkmoon cards that functions as a powerful trinket as well as a link to the Darkmoon Faire.", "Welcome to the Faire young one! We have collected wonders from all over the world for your perusal. Oh and please let me know if you manage to collect a set of the lesser darkmoon cards, as the master...I mean I would be keenly interested in them.", "You are astute to ask, young $c. Scribes are capable of inscribing tarot cards of great power, although even they do not have full control of what they make. The fates decide for them. If you manage to obtain a completed deck, please bring it to me for a magnificent reward." },
	["萨格尼"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the spirits be with you.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的遗体"] = { "These appear to be the remains of Thalorien Dawnseeker, the last wielder of Quel\"Delar." },
	["萨满祭司亚克耶克"] = { "Kartak comes for big-tongue meat. Frenzyheart make sure plenty is ready." },
	["萨满祭司维克伊克"] = { "Disgusting big-tongue friend, you no belong here. Go from Frenzyheart land or I call magic stuffs to kill you!", "Frenzyheart never be friends of big-tongues. You dumb to come back here traitor thing!", "Vekjik no want to be bothered." },
	["萨玛利亚"] = { "On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus. From the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to Stormwind Harbor. The dock to the west, at the end of the pier, leads to Azuremyst Isle, near the Exodar. Safe journeys to you!" },
	["萨玛巴"] = { "Samamba tinkin' joo be at da wrong quartermaster! What she got only for de Sen'jin champions..." },
	["萨琳娜·杜洛曼"] = { "An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food and drink, then head over to Stamp and Sylannia's booth. My favorite is the Darkmoon Special Reserve. If you'd rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world. And then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets.", "Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are our way of letting you help with the faire, and in return you can turn in your tickets for special prizes! To get started you'll want to talk to Chronos, Kerri Hicks, Ringling and Yebb Nebblegear to see who you can best help. They always have something that needs doing to improve and expand our attractions. Then when you have enough tickets, speak with Gelvas Grimegate and he will give you a list of prizes to choose from.", "Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help. Do you have any questions?", "I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he's a gnoll. But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future! And we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!", "No one really knows who made the Darkmoon Cards or what their true purpose is, but I can tell you that they have been found all over Azeroth, usually in the hands of a villain attempting to unlock their mysteries.", "Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire. All that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy! Hold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!", "The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats! If you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's central rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!", "There are eight types of Darkmoon Cards; Beasts, Blessings, Elementals, Furies, Lunacy, Portals, Storms and Warlords, with eight cards, Ace to Eight in each suit. If you collect all eight of one suit then you can turn them into a deck that you can give to our Professor Thaddeus Paleo in exchange for a powerful trinket." },
	["萨瑟利尔男爵"] = { "Oh, hello there.. um, what's your name? No matter, what brings you to my home-away-from-home here out in the beautiful countryside?" },
	["萨祖"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?", "May da spirits protect you mon.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["萨米亚·因克林"] = { "I am here at the behest of my master, Baron Sablemane, to help the Cenarion Expedition with its wyrmcult problems. I'm something of an expert on these things." },
	["萨米尔"] = { "Welcome to Granite Springs, friend. If you manage to catch any of these ice trolls alive, be sure to let me know. We're paying well for 'em." },
	["萨纳瑞恩·绿树"] = { "Greetings $R, I am Tharnariun Treetender." },
	["萨缪尔·克莱布克"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["萨缪尔·霍克"] = { "I am Samuel Hawke, the main supplier for the League of Arathor posted here at Arathi Basin. As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful. Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services." },
	["萨缪尔修士"] = { "May the Light protect you this day." },
	["萨缪尔森少校"] = { "<The Major nods curtly.>" },
	["萨艾特"] = { "Ah, welcome back, hero. You have returned to protect the Guardian once more? Do not forget to take a chrono-beacon with you!", "Hail, adventurer. Heed my warnings before venturing into the Black Morass." },
	["萨莉娜·白星"] = { "Welcome to the Cenarion Refuge, $n. I've been instructed to offer you basic supplies for purchase, should you need them." },
	["萨莎"] = { "These monsters killed my father and kidnapped my sister. They're going to pay for this!" },
	["萨萨拉比姆"] = { "<Sal'salabim growls at you, then goes back to drinking his frothy beverage.>" },
	["萨萨里安"] = { "All I ever wished for was to serve my king once again. For humanity, against a common enemy. Instead, I find that our numbers have been infiltrated by cultist scum... and all signs point to Naxxanar as the origin of this rot.", "How fare your efforts against the Lich King, $c?", "It is good to see you again, $N. How could I ever forget the $g man : woman; who saved my sister's life?", "It is good to see you again, $N. How could I ever forget the man who saved my sister's life?", "It is good to see you again, $N. How could I ever forget the woman who saved my sister's life?" },
	["萨蕾妮·晨光"] = { "If you have the coin, I have the food and drink to keep that appetite of yours satisfied. Every copper goes to keeping the Retreat in tip-top shape." },
	["萨里顿"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["萨隆邪铁矿洞奴隶"] = { "Can you hear it speaking in your mind?", "I have to get out of here! Can you get me free?", "It's all around us. It's in my head!", "The saronite... there's something in it!", "The voices are talking to me.", "There's something here. It's in the rocks and the earth!", "You have to get out of here before it gets to you, too!" },
	["萨雷维"] = { "Forgetting your skill in Transmutation Mastery is not something to do lightly. Are you absolutely sure?", "I am Zarevhi of the Consortium. My skills as a transmuter are known in a thousand worlds." },
	["萨鲁·钢怒"] = { "What is it you seek at my forge? Is it training? Do you perhaps seek the secrets of steel? The mysteries of the forge? Speak up Grunt!" },
	["萨鲁法尔大王"] = { "Are you sure, $N? We must face the Scourge at full strength if we are to succeed. If you do not require more rest, we will begin.", "Brave soldier of the Horde, I salute you! We would have surely been destroyed by the Alliance gunship had it not been for you and your allies. Take a moment to rest before we begin our assault upon the upper reaches of the citadel.", "Fear has always been our greatest weapon. Entire wars have been won and lost upon the shifting shoulders of trepidation and doubt. So how, then, does one fight an enemy that knows no fear? <Saurfang shakes his head.> We do not just fight the Scourge in Northrend, we fight to gain control of our senses before they tear us apart...", "I have heard tale of my boy being here. That he's now a powerful death knight in service of the Lich King. If this is true, then it must be me that ends the bloodline. My charge now is to command Orgrim's Hammer to the top of Icecrown Citadel and destroy all Scourge that get in our way. We leave when you and your allies are ready." },
	["萨麦尔·月棘"] = { "As a young night elf in Darkshore, I crossed paths with a group of unsavory individuals known as the Twilight's Hammer. A group of them befriended me and shamefully, I ended up eschewing my faith in Elune and embracing the vitriol of the Twilight's Hammer. It was not until a vision came to me from Elune, that I woke up from the malaise that I had fallen into as a follower of the old gods. In repentance, I began work on my prayer to Elune.", "Etched into a tablet of pure gold was the embodiment of my remorse, shame, regret, and sorrow. Unfortunately, the Twilight's Hammer found the tablet and branded me a blasphemer. I was summarily executed, my prayer to Elune incomplete. I am now bound to this world as a spirit, unable to transcend to the Nether; held in this cage as a warning to all that would betray the faith of the Twilight's Hammer.", "Praise Elune! It has been many years since I have had visitors." },
	["葛尔多"] = { "Gordo like picking flowers. Pick flowers kind of like killing.", "It drafty out here.", "Johaan say Gordo need a tailor to fix Gordo tummy.", "Simmer say Gordo got guts, but got no brains. Why he mean?" },
	["葛拉米"] = { "Heading down to Tranquillien today, $c, or is there something else that I can do for you?" },
	["葛瑞姆·雷酒"] = { "Grab a pint!" },
	["葛罗克"] = { "Grok look for help. Little $r go to the mountains and help the Bloodmaul!" },
	["葛达克·猎枪"] = { "I'll tell ya, the only proper way to hunt is when yer good an' goggled!", "We want everyone to have fun at Brewfest. It would also help if we had some people remember it as well. These goggles allow anyone to experience what it's like to be drunk, but without the drinking part. Put the goggles on, and you're drunk! Take them off, and you're sober! Are you interested in a pair?" },
	["葛雷克"] = { "You read wanted poster to Grek? Grek want to help!" },
	["葛雷拉格"] = { "I've managed to work myself into quite a spot here. Far Seer Regulkut tried to warn me, but my carelessness has finally caught up with me. I came down here to study the ruins of Zeth'Gor, but ran afoul of the Legion on my way. Now, all I have to show for it is a nasty gash on my leg.", "Thank you for your help in making the salve, $N. Once it's had a chance to dull the pain, I'm going to see how far I can get on this leg." },
	["蒂基特"] = { "Welcome to Garadar, stranger. Are you looking for a place to rest?" },
	["蒂姆·斯崔特"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["蒂姆斯·霍兰德"] = { "Rest your weary bones for a spell." },
	["蒂安娜"] = { "There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave." },
	["蒂巴尔"] = { "Why is everyone looking at me as if I crashed the ship?" },
	["蒙图克·红手"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.", "Throm'ka, $c. Did you know our fight with the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch continues still? Your presence would be welcome there..." },
	["蒙希"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["蒙提"] = { "Monty be me name an' rats be me game." },
	["蓝狼长者"] = { "Elder Pamuya is just outside Warsong Hold.", "Elder Sandrene has traveled to Lakeside Landing in Sholazar Basin.", "Elder Wanikaya can be found at Rainspeaker Rapids in Sholazar Basin.", "Go to Stars' Rest in Dragonblight and you will find Elder Morthie.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["蕊萨·叶影"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["薇拉·火语"] = { "What do you want? It's a bit rude to walk up to strangers for no reason, don't you think?" },
	["虔诚的亚瑟"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "May the Light protect you this day.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["虔诚的阿布萨兰"] = { "The time of judgement is nigh. In your heart, you know justice is the only true path." },
	["虔诚者埃弗雷姆"] = { "What are YOU doing here? Just make sure that you stay out of my way. I didn't leave the Scarlet Onslaught to be distracted by the likes of you!" },
	["虚空学家哥白尼"] = { "Hey there! Good to see a new face - I don't get many visitors and the technicians aren't very good conversationalists. I bet you're on your way to Area 52. Am I right?" },
	["虚空猎手卡尔伊"] = { "The Consortium will exact its revenge upon the Zaxxis betrayers!" },
	["虚空猎手玛哈杜恩"] = { "An order is whispered upon the nether winds and Mah'duun hears. A $g man : woman; comes before Mah'duun, and they speak of those which the winds demand be slain today.", "An order is whispered upon the nether winds and Mah'duun hears. A man comes before Mah'duun, and they speak of those which the winds demand be slain today.", "An order is whispered upon the nether winds and Mah'duun hears. A woman comes before Mah'duun, and they speak of those which the winds demand be slain today." },
	["虚空猎手纳乌希思"] = { "Legion everywhere... they must be dealt with!" },
	["虚空风暴护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["虚空风暴护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["蛮鬃长者"] = { "Elder Dreamseer resides in Gadgetzan in Tanaris Desert.", "Elder Ragetotem spends her days at the Valley of the Watchers in Tanaris Desert.", "For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater.", "Go to the Freewind Post in Thousand Needles and you will find Elder Skyseer.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["蝙蝠管理员卡米蕾"] = { "You seek passage somewhere, $N? My bats will get you there in no time." },
	["血卫士洛尔加"] = { "We've lost a few good people up here already. I'm beginning to doubt that this place is worth our attention." },
	["血帆叛徒"] = { "Gangway, ye scurvy dog! Revilgaz has spared me from the gallows but my punishment might be nearly as bad." },
	["血法师劳莉丝"] = { "Be careful around these parts, $r. The natives are ruthless." },
	["血法师德拉吉亚"] = { "The beasts of these blasted lands exhibit preternatural attributes, heretofore unseen in nature. We have theorized that the energy which was released upon the opening of the Dark Portal, infused into their physical being and forced the creatures to evolve into their current forms. Fearsome beasts they are, no doubt, but we also believe that they could prove to be quite useful in our studies. Perhaps you would be interested in assisting us in the study of these beasts, $N?" },
	["血法师莱诺雷"] = { "While my brother, Drazial, focuses his analysis on the more physical nature of the beasts of the blasted lands, I tend to focus on the more cerebral and spiritual aspects of the wildlife. It is true that the beasts exhibit extremely unusual strength, agility, and stamina, but some of them also possess great intelligence and regenerative abilities, untied to their physical being. Perhaps you would be interested in helping advance my research, $r?" },
	["血玫瑰达图拉"] = { "<Bloodrose eyes you curiously.> I cannot help but wonder what makes you worthy of such attention. No offense...", "Move along. Nothing to see here." },
	["血精灵平民"] = { "If you find the lunar festival revelers in Silvermoon, they can transport you to Moonglade to partake in the celebration." },
	["血精灵幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["血肉模糊的尸体"] = { "The body is that of a female orc warrior. It is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.", "You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face. Based on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife. He will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth." },
	["血色指挥官玛尔兰"] = { "The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen. As for me? I'll die in battle... <Marjhan shrugs.>" },
	["血蹄长者"] = { "Elder High Mountain is at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.", "Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens.", "Elder Wheathoof is enjoying the vistas above Mulgore at Thunder Bluff.", "Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["血骑士伊斯塔·晨星"] = { "Examining the corpse, you conclude that this must be Blood Knight Dawnstar, the leader of the failed assault on Deatholme." },
	["补给官塔尼斯"] = { "Hey dere. You need anythin', you let me know." },
	["补给官塔萨尔特"] = { "If you become a friend of the Lower City, perhaps we can do business?", "Welcome, friend of the free people of the Lower City, but do not tarry long. There are sounds of battle coming from within. My compatriots could use your assistance!" },
	["补给官弗雷迪加"] = { "As you gain renown with our town, I can make more goods available to you, $N. With equipment in such short supply we can only afford to provide it to those we trust." },
	["衰老的戴奥"] = { "You are certainly a long way from home, $r." },
	["被俘虏的亚科纳琳"] = { "So cold... and hungry. My poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you. You! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?" },
	["被俘虏的达卡莱酋长"] = { "Get away from me, nasty Scourge!", "I think you be lost, mon...", "Lemme outta here, mon!", "Our people gunna kill every last one o' you Scourge!", "Why da Scourge let you walk around in here, mon?", "You Scourge gunna fail here, mon.", "You Scourge not welcome in Zul'Drak!", "You're no Scourge. What you doin' here, mon?", "Zul'Drak belongs to da Drakkari, mon. Always will!" },
	["被俘虏的鳄鱼"] = { "<The captive crocolisk lets out a low growl as you approach.>" },
	["被召唤的恶魔"] = { "<The summoned daemon twitches, fighting against Medivh's rules of play. He wants your soul!>" },
	["被召唤的水元素"] = { "<The water elemental is ready to surge.>" },
	["被感动的奥古斯图斯"] = { "Before the Scourge came, I had a great business. I bought and sold everything. Everything! And my prices were INSANE! Just ask anyone. Anyone who's not dead.", "Hi $N! Are you here to buy something? Or maybe sell something? You won't find better prices anywhere, or my name isn't Augustus the Touched!" },
	["被抓住的炎鹰间谍"] = { "<The captured Sunhawk agent eyes you suspiciously.> I've never seen you before. Who are you?", "<The captured Sunhawk agent smirks.> Don't worry, new blood, there are many more portal controllers and many more suitable locations for portals. I am certain that Sironas will have a new gate up very soon. These blue skinned dogs are not long for this world. Sironas and the abomination will clean up whatever the Sunhawk forces leave behind.", "Be thankful that I am locked inside this cage, $r.", "It was Sironas' idea... The abomination is actually one of their own. He is a high ranking member of the draenei military order: Triumvirate or some such nonsense. Whatever that thing is, it's massive, powerful, and full of rage. Any attacks against the Vector Coil will most certainly result in failure as long as that abomination is around.", "Numerous? It has two weak points: The base of the structure on the west side and the base of the structure on the east side. Hey, wait a minute. How would you know anything about the Vector Coil? Didn't you say that you were captured before you even materialized?", "Obviously. How else could she infiltrate their ranks and pass as a draenei? She had been living among them for a very long time.", "Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar. <The agent laughs.> Can you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?", "Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari: Savage demonic beings. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar. <The agent laughs.> Can you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?" },
	["被折磨的维林"] = { "I can take care of myself, $N.", "If there's nothing else that you can do, kill these things!" },
	["被杀死的沙塔尔守备官"] = { "The Lightwarden's job is twofold. Protect the priesthood at all costs first and foremost. Destroy the enemies of the Light wherever they may hide second." },
	["被遗忘的农夫"] = { "Can't you see that I'm busy! We'll never have this base ready in time for the Prince's return!", "If it weren't for those damned beasts burning our ships, we'd have been home by now. Now leave me alone so I can get back to work!" },
	["被遗忘的步兵"] = { "<Forgotten footman shakes his head.> We can't keep this up, friend. If Prince Arthas doesn't return soon we will all perish.", "Arthas and Muradin have been gone a long time. I hope they aren't in danger.", "We'll never get these ships ready in time. The winter comes and with it our doom. I fear that the young prince has damned us all." },
	["被遗忘的火枪手"] = { "I don't know what could be takin' the young prince so long, but I don't think we can hold out for much longer. The cold is gettin' to some of the soldiers.", "The cap'n says that as soon as Prince Arthas returns we'll be on our way back to Lordaeron.", "Those damned peasants need to work faster! I wanna get back home to Ironforge. I surely do miss my wife and children." },
	["被遗忘的骑士"] = { "Despite the hardships we've had to go through in this wasteland, I believe that the young prince will see us to victory. I pray each night for his safety.", "Rage. That's how I can sum up my feelings towards this whole mess. We worked our fingers to the bone trying to get through the woods to the shore only to find that we were too late. Our only way home had been destroyed.", "When we saw that the ships had been burned by those savage beasts our hearts sank. Never have I felt so helpless..." },
	["被遗忘者平民"] = { "Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.", "During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.", "I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.", "I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday.", "I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.", "No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!", "The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?", "To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.", "We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!", "When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!", "Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!" },
	["被遗忘者幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["袭月长者"] = { "Elder Darkcore can be found in the Undercity.", "Elder Graveborn spends time near Brill in Tirisfal Glades.", "Elder Highpeak watches over the Hinterlands from a hill near its center.", "Elder Obsidian wanders near the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.", "Elder Snowcrown can be found in Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "Elder Windrun resides in the Crown Guard Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特"] = { "On behalf of the Argent Crusade, I welcome you to the Argent Tournament." },
	["西尔兰娜"] = { "I really don't think our situation is so bad. I am certain it will all be rectified soon and the Sunwell's power will be restored. It just can't possibly be as bad as everyone is making it out to be." },
	["西尔瓦莉雅"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["西斯雷尔"] = { "You may not pass. You are not our kin, nor have you issued the challenge." },
	["西瘟疫之地护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["西蒙·坦纳尔"] = { "Randal's a bit of a dandy, but he's dependable, which is more than I can say for a lot of the students I take on. Still, I guess I can't blame them for wanting a bit of adventure." },
	["西部荒野护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["观察者克鲁什"] = { "Uh... I sorry I attack you boss. You no kill me, please OK!? You da king now, and I help make your tribute better!" },
	["观察者希德·月影"] = { "We know that the wyrmcultists are massing on the other side of the tunnel. We'll make our stand here." },
	["观察者杰哈恩"] = { "If only I hadn't twisted my ankle coming into this place, I'd be in there with my friends. Hmmm, now that I think about it, maybe it's better that I'm out here?" },
	["观察者莉莎·月叶"] = { "It was kind of the Explorers' League to allow me to tag along. However, with the dangers in the Rivenwood and surrounding area, it looks like it may have been foolish of me to come without help." },
	["观察者莉萨奥"] = { "All things in nature exists in an interconnected web; an ecology. If we're careful not to disturb it, and simply observe, we may be fortunate to piece together the complex relationship between the diverse organisms around us. Once we have that understanding, we can take the appropriate actions to ensure the wellbeing of all creatures. Interfere without that knowledge, and we'll surely cause destruction. I am here to observe the complex interactions between the sporelings and the bog lords.", "Oh, pay no mind to Buddy. He won't hurt you, he just likes to scratch now and then. He's just a big, loveable kitty. Aren't you Buddy? Yes, you are, you cute, little thing. You're mommy's little baby, that's what you are!" },
	["詹妮丝·费尔斯通"] = { "I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes...", "John, honey, where are you?", "Shhh... do you smell something?", "Time is running out for me... for us all...", "What is happening to everyone? I feel... cold..." },
	["詹妮亚·坎农"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: as you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained." },
	["詹姆斯·范·布朗特"] = { "Want to be a smith? Want to forge blades to gut your foe? Hammers to crush his skull? Aye I can help, and gladly too if there is blood to be shed from it." },
	["詹姆斯·迪肯"] = { "Can I get you anything? My selection is a little limited, but that's to be expected... all things considered." },
	["詹诺克·柔歌"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind $c.", "Like a cat dragged in from the rain, you scratch and claw, then do it all over again... I'll be back for more... Oh, I didn't see you enter, $N! What can I do for you?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible." },
	["让·皮埃尔·布兰"] = { "The Argent Tournament has begun in the northern reaches of Icecrown, $c. If you've yet to find your way there, I can pay your way. The more we have participating in the melee, the stronger we'll be when we strike against the Lich King." },
	["记载者图基尼"] = { "Though my compatriots would have you take an active role in what is transpiring in Zul'Drak, we Zandalari are primarily here to witness what is occurring and to chronicle the end of an empire." },
	["记载者拜基妮"] = { "It be my duty to record these tragic events for the good of generations to come." },
	["诅咒之地护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["诺兰妮"] = { "The view from the top of Telredor is magnificent, isn't it?" },
	["诺哈因"] = { "I have food, if you are hungry, and you may make use of my tent, should you require rest." },
	["诺尔蕾妮"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["诺库玛·雪眼"] = { "I'm going to miss Camp Winterhoof, but I understand why Chieftain Ashtotem made his decision. Home is a comfort we cannot always afford." },
	["诺格"] = { "If there were just a few more hours in a day..." },
	["诺格·斯巴格"] = { "Hey! Thanks for saving my hide! I think I'll be lying down for a while until I recover my strength.", "Who are you? Where am I? I feel... so weak..." },
	["诺特·希姆加克"] = { "Please, please, please tell me you are here to get me out of these shackles. There's got to be a key somewhere... At the very least, maybe you can take out Guard Slip'kik. I think I might be able to help you out! See that broken trap over yonder? The ogres are too stupid to figure out how to fix it. Clearly, it needs a thorium widget and some frost oil. If you fix it, I bet you could lure Slip'kik into it, and BLAMMO - trapped ogre guard!" },
	["诺甘农的看门人"] = { "Activating secondary defensive systems will result in the extermination of unauthorized life forms via orbital emplacements. You are an unauthorized life form. Please confirm.", "Additional background information on the Earthen must be given to you before this question may be answered properly. Processing. To understand the anomalies of the Earthen, it is first important to understand what the Earthen represent in their design intent. The Earthen represent the Creators' attempt at improving the survivability paradigm of the standard subterranean being matrix. This was done by incorporating a resilient foundation of construction inherent to the world into said matrix.", "Greetings.", "I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies. The trogg retains some composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds, but the loss of cognitive power makes this variant unacceptable to the Creators. The trogg procreates as per a standard biomass. By default it consumes stone and anything else it can acquire, including other troggs. Cannibalism is considered unacceptable by the Creators.", "I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies. Though the dwarf maintains most of the Earthen's mental attunement to Azeroth's stone composition, the reversion back into living biomass remains the main degeneration of the matrix. Dwarves eat and procreate through means typical to other standard biomasses. The Creators view the dwarf as an acceptable variant, worthy of genesis in its own right.", "Initiating visual aid representation number two. The second resultant variance of the Earthen matrix retains many desired elements when compared to the standard subterranean matrix. The common nomenclature for this variant is \"Dwarf\". This variant retains strength and stamina inherent to the Earthen. In some cases, the dwarf even exceeds the cognitive powers of the Earthen's matrix. The dwarf, however, retains none of the physical composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds.", "It is integral to the assimilation of this data that it is understood that the Creators wanted to synthesize a race that would long be an integral part of this world's development cycle after they had departed. This race would be instrumental in fulfilling the Creators' long-term development objectives for Azeroth. As an ancillary note, the nomenclature \"Earthen\" was deemed apropos for the new race by the Creators, based on the Earthen's composition.", "It is one of the synthesis matrices the Creators use when seeding a world. Each synthesis matrix is used to achieve the Creators' goals. For Azeroth, a subterranean being matrix was modified to create a being with increased durability with an affinity for deep region shaping; the Earthen are the product of this modification. After the Earthen had been put into service for the Creators, unforeseen anomalies were discovered that affected their synthesis matrix due to high-stress environments.", "It is the baseline material used in race synthesis. A cross-section of Azeroth's crust was used as the foundation for the Earthen's synthesis rather than the typical biomass construction foundation used by the Creators. Research on the world's composition led the Creators to theorize that an enhanced being could be synthesized that would epitomize the resiliency of this world's essence. This was accomplished by choosing to use a blend of Azeroth's various stone core compounds as the foundation.", "Salutations. My function is to offer access to and, when permissible, insight into information regarding the Creators' synthesis of the Earthen on the world designated as Azeroth. I am ready to share this information with you now at your leisure.", "Simply stated, this is correct. The Earthen's physical features are that of a smaller stature humanoid, though their composition is that of Azeroth's various stone core compounds. Their design maximizes strength and stamina without sacrificing cognitive processing power. Their skin and musculature are nearly impervious to physical damage, and with very minor modifications the Earthen display a remarkable resiliency to unwanted magical forces.", "The Creators are cognizant of the magnitude of the information housed in this repository. Subsequently, a portable copy of the data stored here will be made available to you once you are attuned with the Discs of Norgannon. Please consider your cursory requirements for the assimilation of this knowledge to be complete. At your leisure, access the Discs of Norgannon to begin synthesis of your discs.", "The Creators are... the Creators. They are the beings that seeded and shaped this world by their own design. They are the reason for this world's existence, as well as many other worlds. They are the wellspring from which Azeroth flows.", "The Earthen are a synthesized race engineered by the Creators, functioning as one of the seed races in the initial population of the world designated as Azeroth. The Earthen were created to aid the Creators' efforts in shaping the deep regions of this world. They are a modification of the standard subterranean being matrix used on other worlds that the Creators have seeded. The construction of this prototype race created various anomalies that were observed after initial synthesis.", "The Earthen's only anomaly in synthesis is the tendency for matrix destabilization while being utilized in high-stress environments. Addendum: deep earth sculpting was naturally suited to the new matrix design and thus never met the qualifications of duplicating a high-stress environment. Destabilization was not discovered until well into the Earthen's primary service cycle for the Creators. The Creators began work on post-synthesis modification, rather than recall and re-synthesis.", "The data stored in this repository does indeed correlate with your astute proclamation. The dwarf maintains an affinity for the stone composition of Azeroth, but due to the high-stress environmental anomaly within the Earthen's synthesis matrix, the dwarf reverts to a default biomass composition as seen in the standard subterranean matrix. Ergo, the dwarf variant does synthesize from the degeneration of the Earthen creation matrix, as you inferred with your query.", "There are two potential results when the Earthen's synthesis matrix destabilizes. Initiating visual aid representation number one. The first variant matrix is a degenerative product of synthesis, hereby designated with the common nomenclature of \"Trogg\". This variant maintains strength and stamina comparable to the Earthen, but its cognitive processing power has been almost completely compromised. Force of will and a strong sense of cunning are the only driving factors in the psyche of the trogg.", "[There is a noticeable pause after you ask this question.] The information you request is not currently available in this repository's data cycling. I sincerely apologize for this omission. Please request this information after a data cycling update has been performed on this information repository. You may also request this information from another information repository located on Azeroth." },
	["诺维娅"] = { "Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, $g sir : ma'am;. How may I help you?", "Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, ma'am. How may I help you?", "Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, sir. How may I help you?" },
	["诺莫瑞根冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["诺莫瑞根勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["诺莫瑞根医疗兵"] = { "I'm only here in case someone faints. The new recruits get a little excited and occasionally overexert themselves. ...well, that, and sometimes one of the new mechano-tank prototypes explode. Whoops!" },
	["调查员塔雷姆"] = { "This crime cannot be allowed to go unsolved. The location of the inn and the violence of its destruction make this a very delicate matter. Inspect the site with the utmost respect, friend." },
	["调查员费岑·布莱斯塔克"] = { "Finally, the backup I've been waiting for! I prepared the paperwork that Snagglebolt requested. All that remains is for someone to serve it." },
	["调酒师日灼"] = { "Can't you see that I'm trying to have a conversation with the lady? Oh, very well, she seems preoccupied anyway. I deal in only the finest drinks, both local and exotic in vintage. Care to have a look?" },
	["谢尔卡·狼行者"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["谢尔比·石火"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["谢尔雷·布隆迪尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["象群管理者妥拉留斯"] = { "What are you after? Speak up. I'm not about to trust you with one of my Elekks until you prove your dedication and friendship to our people." },
	["贝兹尔·布拉斯波"] = { "No one builds it faster, cheaper, and better than the Blastbolt brothers!" },
	["贝加里斯塔兹"] = { "A Ruby Drake at full power can perform Martyr, which shields friendly targets by redirecting all hostile magic to the Ruby Drake for a short time. Evasive Maneuvers can still be performed during Martyr.", "Malygos' most powerful agents protect the rings above. Alone, you cannot hope to defeat them. We can grant you power to call upon drakes from our dragon flights. Mounted on the back of a drake, you will be able to fly here in the Oculus and command powerful dragon magic.", "Ruby Drakes excel at mitigating damage and protecting their allies. Using Searing Wrath, they can breathe streams of liquid fire that jump from target to target, dealing increasing damage with each jump. Whenever a Ruby drake is damaged by an enemy attack, it gains an Evasive charge. These charges can be used to perform a series of evasive maneuvers, allowing the drake to dodge incoming attacks and spells for a time.", "The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring. He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances! Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures. Seek him out above. I can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the Red Fight. Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the Bronze or the Green.", "Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring. Your drakes are more than a match for the ring guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself. Ten centrifuge constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above. Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable. I can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight. Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green.", "You have wrested control of the Oculus from the forces of Malygos. The Red Flight is in your debt.", "Your greatest challenge lies ahead. Ley-Guardian Eregos is a Blue dragon of immense power. You will find him flying above the uppermost ring. The full power of your drakes has been unlocked. Use their power to defeat Eregos!" },
	["贝卡·兹维"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["贝塞尼·火锤"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["贝尔斯塔弗·风暴之眼"] = { "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic." },
	["贝尔杜克·凝眉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid." },
	["贝尔比"] = { "Brewfest has undergone some changes since its first year. We now issue Brewfest tokens instead of tickets. If you have old tickets, I can exchange them for you.", "Hey there, good looking! What can I do to help you out?", "I understand that many individuals seek romance in taverns and festivals like this one, but alcohol dulls the senses and makes calculating the difficulties of daily life all fuzzy! But I've found a solution! Through many trials and tribulations, I've engineered an extraordinary device that gives you all the benefits of alcohol with none of the drawbacks! With these goggles on, ANYONE looks attractive! Mmm... including you, cutie! Tell you what. I'll give you a discount!", "You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club? It's a bunch of really cute guys that want to celebrate Brewfest all year long! They tried to bring Brewfest back in the past, but it never lasted very long. Once you join the club you get mailed a different brew every month! If you like that brew, you can talk to the vendors in Ironforge to get more brew. I think you are cute enough to join the club. You give me a few prize tokens and I'll give you the forms. Then maybe we can celebrate Brewfest together, all year round!" },
	["贝布莉·科弗库尔"] = { "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you...", "Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps? We can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features! Have a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..." },
	["贝斯滕"] = { "There are some who desire to stop gaining experience from their actions; to forever remain at the level of strength they are now, and never grow stronger. I can make this possible... for a fee, of course. But understand this: Once you pay me, you will NO LONGER GAIN EXPERIENCE. None. Not one whit. Should you change your mind afterwards and want to start gaining experience again, I can undo the process for the same fee." },
	["贝比·鲁诺兹"] = { "Hey, can't you shee I'm trying to drink here?" },
	["贝索德·菲格"] = { "Leave me to my shame, $r." },
	["贝莉亚·雷岩"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["贝萨妮·奥尔蒂"] = { "We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["贝蒂·冰雹"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["贝蒂·奎恩"] = { "Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?" },
	["贝蒂娜·比格辛克"] = { "The plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!" },
	["贝蕾丝特拉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["贝霍玛特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?", "I would train you, but you are no warrior.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["贸易机器人1000型"] = { "My programming will not allow me to lower the cost of any items." },
	["费古尔·双刃"] = { "Make it quick, $r." },
	["费布·钢轴"] = { "Lots to do! Haven't been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, $N, those were the days..." },
	["费曼瓦尔"] = { "As the only apparent surviving 'Broken', it is both my duty and honor to carry on the shamanistic teachings of Farseer Nobundo.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["贾兰娜"] = { "Is there a pattern or two I can show you today?" },
	["贾德莉亚"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $N?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["贾恩"] = { "Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament. Once he gets his winner, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!" },
	["贾斯伯·菲尔"] = { "Speak quietly and with great care, the wrong word in these parts could get your throat cut. Now, what is it you need from me?" },
	["贾琳希亚"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["贾萨姆"] = { "I can teach you the finer points of Tiger Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!", "You need to be exalted with the night elves of Darnassus before I will teach you a riding skill, $c." },
	["贾达莱德"] = { "I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?" },
	["资深攻城技师雷格索"] = { "It's a mighty good day, is it not? I do hope we see a few fireworks before this day is through." },
	["资深血骑士"] = { "There is nothing to see here. Move along.", "This does not concern you. Be on your way." },
	["赎罪的埃隆巴克"] = { "Thank you, mortal. There is but one service that I may offer to you before I return to the Dream. The door to Zevrim's master, Alzzin, blocks your path. I shall act as your instrument of destruction. The door will be opened, I merely await your command." },
	["赛场主管科鲁克莱德"] = { "The goblin racer packs a lot of punch, but the gnomes hid a trick or two in their car...", "Welcome to the races! Enjoy your stay, and don't bet all your money in one place!" },
	["赛戈·波斯纳普"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["赛羊管理员雷恩"] = { "I see you checking out our legally obtained racing rams... I can see you want in on the ram racing sensation... But before you can play, you gotta work. Well, work and play are pretty much the same when it comes to these rams." },
	["赞加沼泽护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["赞加沼泽护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["赞杜沙"] = { "Zando'zan of the Shattered Hand. How can Zando'zan help you? He can't! He won't!" },
	["赞达拉大使"] = { "We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.", "We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world. The leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul'Gurub." },
	["赤脊山护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["赫伯特·哈尔希医生"] = { "My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen." },
	["赫克希"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["赫加斯"] = { "Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?" },
	["赫塔希姆"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin." },
	["赫尔隆"] = { "I've got fresh meat, fish and mushrooms. And plenty to drink!" },
	["赫拉德·月行者"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["赫米特·奈辛瓦里"] = { "Keep a sharp eye, $c. You never know when some beastie is stalking you instead of the other way around.", "Listen $g lad : lass;. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you've stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more. And have you seen the size of the beasties here?! I'm here hunting the most dangerous prey you'll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!", "Listen lad. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you've stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more. And have you seen the size of the beasties here?! I'm here hunting the most dangerous prey you'll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!", "Listen lass. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you've stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more. And have you seen the size of the beasties here?! I'm here hunting the most dangerous prey you'll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!", "You've bagged them all: Bach'lor, Banthar, Gutripper, and even the mighty Tusker! You're truly the finest big game hunter that I know!", "You've proven yourself a very capable game hunter, $N. But there's still one beastie that haunts your dreams... Tusker!" },
	["赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世"] = { "My father's off to more exotic locations in search of bigger prey. Don't worry though, we're still on the hunt here!" },
	["赫苏瓦·雷角"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["赫里奥斯中尉"] = { "What business brings you here, $c?" },
	["超级商人680型"] = { "I am the latest incarnation of automated vendors... we will rule the world one day... don't tell my boss that I am skimming money off his merchandise..." },
	["跳跃者"] = { "Mrfrrmrfrmrrr! <The geist clears his throat.> Yes?" },
	["践踏者克雷格"] = { "You da boss now, yeah? Long live da new king! Kreeg let you look at Gordok hooch. Ogre hooch best of all hooch, and Gordok hooch best of all ogre hooch! Maybe you buy some from me, ya boss?!" },
	["身经百战的吉莱娜"] = { "The tournament's seneschal has asked us to shoulder some of the burden of running the competition now that the coliseum is finished. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties." },
	["车队卫兵的尸体"] = { "Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw's caravan guards." },
	["车队工人的尸体"] = { "Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw's caravan workers." },
	["轻盈的莉莉丝"] = { "Don't get too close, $N. I'm liable to fumble and bash your brains open with the face of my hammer." },
	["辛克"] = { "There's money to be made! Just like pops always said - no better time for raking in the cash than a time of war." },
	["辛克莱尔中尉"] = { "Is your entire party of adventurers ready to continue? I'll fire off a discharge from this activation crystal to cover the retreat of my guards.", "Reinforcements, finally! The prison guards can't hold out against this invasion for much longer! You'll have to relieve my men and try to hold out for as long as you can. There's still some power in the defense system available. Use the activation crystals located around the prison to trigger a discharge if the situation worsens." },
	["辛塔尔·玛菲奥斯博士"] = { "What is it? Can't you see that I'm busy?" },
	["辛德拉古灵"] = { "Do you know of the Highborne? The Shen'dralar?", "Leave this place, stranger, lest it consume you as it has all that it has touched.", "The Highborne ghosts that you see wandering through the courtyard and halls of Eldre'Thalas were slain, not by invading Gordok ogres or satyrs, but by the Prince himself!", "The Prince plotted to imprison a demon of immense power behind a grand force field. The pylons would channel latent energies into the field, keeping it operational. While imprisoned, Immol'thar would serve as a battery to the populace of Eldre'Thalas.", "The Shen'dralar were Queen Azshara's most revered arcanists. It was within these very walls that the Queen's most important demands were processed - often in secret. After the destruction of the Well and the subsequent lethargy that overcame the Highborne and lesser night elf sects, the Prince of Eldre'Thalas, Tortheldrin, began construction of the pylons that you see littering the halls of the west wing.", "The people were destroyed in order to preserve the Prince's immortal life and near limitless powers. The power once divided among thousands now funnels into the Prince and the Shen'dralar zealots. Those few remaining survivors are directly feeding power into the pylons in order to keep Immol'thar imprisoned. Should the demon break free of its bonds, it would surely destroy what little is left of this once great bastion of arcana.", "The siphoned energies would sustain the Highborne's magic, allowing those within the walls of Eldre'Thalas to feed their endless and growing magical pangs. Thousands of years passed and the power required to keep Immol'thar imprisoned while sustaining life within Eldre'Thalas, began to shift. The cost to keep Immol'thar bound grew to overshadow the rate at which energy could be siphoned and distributed. The once net gain turned to loss." },
	["辛德拉尔"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["辛德拉狂热者"] = { "Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre'Thalas.", "Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him.", "I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge.", "Keep your voice down, stranger. You do not want to disrupt the Master's meditations.", "Many have come to this sanctuary, few have left.", "The Lorekeeper is an ancient. He has served under our glorious Queen!", "The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince's lips. The Ashbringer could be found!", "We mustn't anger the Master. His is a wrath that is cruel beyond measure." },
	["辛特兰护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["辛特兰护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["辛琳妮亚·星光"] = { "If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!" },
	["达丽亚娜"] = { "If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them." },
	["达克霍尔上尉"] = { "Spinebreaker Post is a great place to be stationed! The Bleeding Hollow aberrations are so close you can smell their foul blood! What better place to gather vengeance from a clan that has forsaken its brethren and made a pact with demons?" },
	["达利安·辛格"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["达利尔上尉"] = { "Now that the deserters have taken over Lost Point, North Point Tower is the most distant of Theramore's outposts." },
	["达姆菲"] = { "The Sons of Lothar have been fighting a war without end. I'm amazed we've kept our equipment in as good a shape as it is!" },
	["达尔拉·哈瑞斯"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["达尔林·古斯丁"] = { "How can I help?" },
	["达尔洛克"] = { "Greetings, $c. You want Darrok to send you to Venture Bay?" },
	["达尔玛里"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["达尔萨莉·黑火"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["达库鲁"] = { "<Drakuru extends his bleeding hand through the cage and looks at you with anticipation.>", "Ey, mon! Good to be seein' ya again... $N, right? Yes, yes, of course. You and I gunna be real good friends. Drakuru know dese things. <A grin slowly spreads across the troll's painted face.>", "Time was when I'd pull yer heart out ya just ta see da look on yer face..." },
	["达库鲁大王"] = { "$n! I've been awaiting your return. What be takin' ya so long, mon? It be time to complete da conversion of da Blightbloods. Join me and witness the creation of our army!", "All in good time, mon. I be havin' more work for you to do soon...", "Another supplicant seeking the favors of da Lich King? Only da worthy be obtainin' da dark gifts...", "Darmuk's incompetence be hinderin' us no more! Patience, mon. Dere soon be more for you to do...", "Indeed you have, mon. Our stores of blight crystals be nearly sufficient!", "Now ya be knowin' everything, mon! Prepare yourself... we attack soon!", "Soon, $n! Soon ya be tastin' true power. Soon ya be rewarded for your dedication and service.", "With da chieftains out of da way, we be poised to make our assault! Soon, $n...", "Ya be on da path, mortal... Endure, and ya be gettin' great power!" },
	["达恩·准星"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Wot kin I do fer ye?" },
	["达恩·晨行者中尉"] = { "Welcome to the Farstrider Retreat. We are rangers sworn to defend our people from enemies both near and far." },
	["达扎拉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil. Tell me what you seek.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["达拉然幽灵司仪"] = { "It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old." },
	["达比雷教授"] = { "Ameer might be worried about what the Ethereum are doing but I'm squarely focused on the real danger here: Dimensius." },
	["达玛·蛮鬃"] = { "Fine beasts, aren't they? The wyverns we raise here are trained to handle the fiercest and strangest weather conditions Draenor has to offer. You'll find them dependable and hardy." },
	["达琳娜"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["达瑞尔·斯塔克"] = { "The place is a bit drafty... but what do I care? I'm dead." },
	["达瑞尔·瑞克努索"] = { "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I keep 'em fed, kid. Yep, Daryl Riknussun, at yer service.", "Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge. She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\"." },
	["达纳斯·刃歌"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?", "Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?", "I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child. I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["达纳苏斯冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["达纳苏斯勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["达纳苏斯卫兵"] = { "A budding herbalist are we? Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens. He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you.", "A mailbox? You have a letter to send, or perhaps have received one? I hope it's something good! There's a mailbox right outside of the Bank in the center of Darnassus.", "A time consuming, yet rewarding skill. Speak with Astaia in the Tradesman's Terrace and maybe you'll learn something useful.", "Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking. You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you. If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen's Terrace.", "As a culture we believe in letting nothing go to waste. When we are forced to slay a creature we take what we can to make sure its sacrifice was not in vain. If you wish to learn the proper way to take the skin of a slain beast, then seek out Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace.", "Astaia has fished up some curious treasures over the ages she has spent fishing. Why don't you go see her over in the Tradesman's terrace and have her show you some of them.", "Because the blade can never be too sharp nor the armor too tough a talented enchanter will always be needed. Such an enchanter is Taladan, who can show you how to properly weave enchantments to improve your weapons and armor. Seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace.", "Ever vigilant in their protection of the natural world, the druids are guided by Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm who resides in the Cenarion Enclave. You will find him and the other Druid trainers in the northern section of Darnassus.", "Feyden Darkin is on the second floor in the center of the Craftsman's Terrace.", "For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend. His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here. If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave.", "Has the sun risen already? There are just never enough hours in the night! Well, Saelienne will take good care of you. You can find her tending to her guests over in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.", "Here among the craftsmen of Darnassus, there is a millenium of knowledge for the benefit of your chosen craft. Now tell me, which craft do you find the most intriguing?", "Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication. I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path.", "I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior's Terrace. You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon.", "I'm flattered, but really I'm not interested... What? You want to know where to learn enchanting? Oh, how embarrassing! Well, you should... I'm sure you could... go see, um... Taladan! Yes, see Taladan over in the Craftsmen's Terrace!", "If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see. You will find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus.", "If you truly have the desire to learn this profession, then I would point you in the direction of Ainethil, a skilled alchemist at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus.", "In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us. If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you. Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsman's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more.", "In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us. If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you. Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more.", "In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them. Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same.", "It is Syurna that you seek if you are to follow the rogue's path. She dwells in the Cenarion Enclave down the spiraling path within the western most tree.", "It is Vesprystus that you seek. He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil. You will find him through the portal in western Darnassus that will take you to Rut'theran Village.", "Jocaste was the greatest of Hunters of her time. These days you can find her over in the Cenarion Enclave where she teaches those who are just starting down the Hunter's path.", "Lysheana can offer you the proper documents, she resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeasten Darnassus. May your fellowship bring glory to the Night Elves!", "Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?", "Oh, the ever-present obsession with material wealth. Well, fortune smiles on you, as you can find the auction house in the Tradesman's Terrace.", "One has opened up on the Tradesman's Terrace. If you take the path leading Southeast from the bank, it should be easy to find.", "Sildinair has trained many of the Sentinels who guard our beloved city. I am certain she can make a warrior out of the likes of you. Seek her out at the Warrior's Terrace near the entrance to our city.", "The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune. There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for. He's always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman's Terrace. Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left. Now, if you don't mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer.", "The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller. Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus.", "The power of Elune compels you! The power of Elune compels you! Go now! Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!", "The skill with which Telonis crafts armor is beyond compare. You should be grateful that he does not charge more for the knowledge he passes to others. Go now and seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeast section of Darnassus.", "There are those that attempt to follow the path of the Rogue, but only the night elves are truly embraced by the night. If you seek to walk the shaded path then find Syurna in the Cenarion Enclave.", "There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you'll find in the center of Darnassus.", "Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman's Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury.", "Through the milennia, Ilyenia Moonfire has mastered numerous weapons and now offers to train others in their use. You can find her at the Warrior's Terrace if you desire training.", "Vesprystus' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination. Seek him out in Rut'theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus.", "We plant the vegetables. Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit. The rabbit is devoured by the wolf. The wolf is slain by us. We take the meat and hide from the wolf's corpse. It's that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it. Now go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties.", "When you have not a healer to tend to your wounds, the knowledge of First Aid can be a lifesaver. I would consult Dannelor over at the Craftsmen's Terrace for instruction on this skill.", "With the garments that Me'Lynn tailors, one might think that her needle was blessed by Elune herself. Unless your needle is so blessed, you best pay her a visit and listen to her teachings. You can find her in The Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.", "You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers. I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage.", "You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin. He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather.", "You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city.", "You will find Sildinair at the Warrior's Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city.", "You will find a pair of draenei conversing with Tyrande Whisperwind in the upper level of The Temple of the Moon. They will know how to help you.", "You will find the the battlemasters gathered at the Warrior's Terrace.", "You would certainly be looking for Me'Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor. She resides at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus." },
	["达纳苏斯狂欢者"] = { "The lunar celebration this year is quite magnificent!", "They say these fireworks use the power of the moon!", "This beam of greater moonlight will send you to Darnassus." },
	["达纳苏斯的塞巴鲁斯"] = { "Zybarus thanks you from the bottom of his heart, hero. Without you, Zybarus would have died, or worse, Zybarus would have become one of them..." },
	["迅刀长者"] = { "Elder Bronzebeard can be found in the ancestral home of the Bronzebeards, Ironforge.", "Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind.", "Elder Skygleam can be found near the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara.", "Elder Starweave can be found at the coastal village of Auberdine in Darkshore.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.", "The village of Dolanaar atop Teldrassil is home to Elder Bladeleaf." },
	["迅矛酋长"] = { "You are no taunka. Why have you come to the sacred burial grounds of our warriors?" },
	["迈克尔·加勒特"] = { "How may I be of service?" },
	["迈安"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $c. Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?", "Greetings, $c. I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you...", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["迈尔斯·迪克斯特"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it." },
	["迈德兰努尔"] = { "It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making." },
	["迈瑞尔·普莱森斯"] = { "Looking for a tabard?" },
	["迈里恩"] = { "What a fine day! It inspires me to create a new design." },
	["运营主管哈莫弗朗"] = { "Relaxation is the key to being an efficient crew. Let the crew relax, and they'll perform better." },
	["运营主管奥格拉"] = { "Zippik would drive us straight into the Bluff if I wasn't here. Moron." },
	["运营主管布拉伯特"] = { "\"Iron Eagle.\" Hmph. It's a passenger ship, not a warbird! But hey, a job's a job, and I'll humor Captain \"Bombast\" so long as the prince is paying. In any case, welcome aboard." },
	["运营主管考伯纳特"] = { "If you like excitement, our captain's the best! I love this job!" },
	["远古海滩传送门"] = { "We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["远古海滩大使"] = { "We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["远古海滩特使"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩"] = { "$N, the Sons of Lothar have fought here, on the Hellfire Peninsula, for two decades. We are beset on all sides by indigenous orcs and hellish demons of the Burning Crusade, and though our hearts still beat fiercely, years of war have reduced our numbers. You, and the influx of Azeroth's new generation of heroes, are a welcome sight indeed!", "Ah, a new champion to aid our cause? What say you, $N?", "Many years ago, my men and I followed the wizard Khadgar and the paladin Turalyon to this world. Our sole aim was to annihilate the orcs and their vile kin. Yet something went terribly wrong in the final hours of our war. Ultimately, this dark world was ripped asunder - and my dear friends were lost to the void.", "Orcs. It seems I've been fighting them all my life. Twenty years ago we shattered the Horde and tore down the walls of their Hellfire Citadel. We drove the vile greenskins to the very brink! After that, other than a few skirmishes the broken orcs never again posed a threat to us. Until now.", "Romus informed me of the tragedies that beset my beautiful city. There are no fitting words for the sorrow I felt upon hearing of Lordaeron's fate - and the fate of my own, beloved Stromgarde. Twenty years ago, no one had heard of the 'Burning Legion'... Damn those cursed devils! Rest assured, $N; should I ever return to Azeroth, Stromgarde will once more rise as a force of reckoning. This I swear...", "The men and women of Honor Hold have shed such blood and have lost their youth in this monstrous land... and yet they still hold their spirits high! Now, you and your cohorts from Azeroth can help us turn the tide. You give us hope that we may one day return to our homelands.", "We, the Sons of Lothar, have remained here ever since - fighting... dying... praying that a day like today would come - a day when the Portal would open and our brothers would come to deliver us home. Overjoyed as we are, duty still calls. There is much to be done before we can depart this world and take our rest." },
	["远行者塞蒂娜"] = { "You're welcome to stay at the Farstrider Enclave for as long as you'd like, $c. We welcome any who would aid us in our endeavors in the Ghostlands." },
	["远行者斯图卡·天云"] = { "Keep your wits about you, $r, we're surrounded by the walking dead here." },
	["远行者索兰娜"] = { "We must maintain a state of vigilance, $c! Between Dar'Khan the Betrayer and his Scourge, and the Shadowpine trolls backed by the might of Zul'Aman, we're barely keeping our heads above water here. We really shouldn't have to be dividing our attentions! I hope you're here to help." },
	["远行者达斯金"] = { "Hello, $c. If you haven't already, you really should speak with Farstrider Solanna." },
	["远行者达玛·傲蹄"] = { "It pains me to see my ancestors disturbed from their graves. We must strike down the cursed spirit of your Force-Commander Steeljaw, the one who foolishly led his caravan through these sacred grounds." },
	["远风长者"] = { "Elder Snowcrown can be found in Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "Elder Windrun resides in the Crown Guard Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["迪克"] = { "Where's my spinner? I just had it here somewhere..." },
	["迪兹·斯诺班"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin." },
	["迪尔弗拉姆·火须"] = { "Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him.", "Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?" },
	["迪尔格·奎克里弗"] = { "We may have been suffering a drought but there's no shortage of meat! Care to browse my goods?" },
	["迪弗拉克"] = { "My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air." },
	["迪泰娜"] = { "Grab a net, young $c. Our people need sustenance!", "I haven't got anymore work for you, $N. I do want you to know that the red snapper we shared was something special that I'll never forget..." },
	["迪瑟德拉·维哈姆"] = { "I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea. Oh, what? Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor. It docks here from time to time." },
	["迪莫斯·丹尼斯"] = { "If you have to ask, you don't know me anywhere near well enough to be using that appellation.", "There are some who call me 'Tim,' but to my friends, I am 'the specialist.\\" },
	["迪诺"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $c. Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?", "Greetings, $c. I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you...", "Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my brother. Rest assured, his death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay for this. I'll see to it personally!", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["迷失者塞尔杜林"] = { "You lookin' for me?" },
	["迷雾行者长者"] = { "Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.", "I think Elder Splitrock has traveled to Maraudon in Desolace.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.", "You'll find Elder Grimtotem at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas." },
	["追踪者兰塞恩"] = { "The others look at this landscape and see only death, corruption, and adversity. None of those things are in short supply, true, but that view ignores the opportunities presented by our environment. I will not stand by and watch these opportunities go ignored, $c. With your help, we can demonstrate to the others here at Blood Watch just how to make use of the environment and its creatures." },
	["追踪者凯德"] = { "We may be working together, but that only increases the need for discretion. Once again, be mindful of your words and actions. I can guarantee we're far from the only ones out here." },
	["逐星长者"] = { "Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows.", "Winterhoof? I hear he's living it up in Booty Bay." },
	["通报者布兰丹恩"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["通灵学院学员"] = { "Be quiet! Can't you see the master is speaking?", "Be silent! I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!", "Did you bring your text books? Can I look on with you?", "Did you finish yesterday's assignment? If so, then sit by me!", "Did you forget your student's attire? Do you think fashion is more vital than the Scourge's domination?", "Spend less time rattling and more time listening.", "Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;. The master sees all...", "Watch your step in here, boy. The master sees all...", "Watch your step in here, girl. The master sees all...", "We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!" },
	["道克·米希匹克斯"] = { "Can I help you?" },
	["邓肯·库仑"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["邪咒师弗尔金"] = { "How may I help you?" },
	["邱碧特"] = { "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", "Pet families come in one of three types. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas. As your pet gains more experience, it can learn new talents just like you can, but at a slower rate. If you ever want to change your pet's talents, just come back to me.", "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue. Now then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?", "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?" },
	["部落战争使者"] = { "War is upon us, $N. It's time for every member of the Horde to answer the call and join the fight against the cowardly Alliance." },
	["部落英雄的灵魂"] = { "I wish it were true, $N, but it will take more than you alone to overcome the forces of Razelikh and his subordinates. Gather a suitable group of adventurers and would-be heroes and free my men of their eternal torture! Eighteen stones you must shatter. Fight hard and die with honor, $N.", "It's hard to imagine that so much death and despair could be confined to such a small area; yet beyond the swamp is a land plagued by chaos and destruction. Watch your step, adventurer. The Blasted Lands are the final resting place to far greater beings than you.", "My captors were cruel beyond measure, $N. They would alternate between Lieutenant Kirith and I, torturing one while the other watched. During a lull in the activity of an especially brutal day, Kirith told me what had happened to my men and a plan he had been formulating to free them from their masters. They suffered a fate far worse than death, or even the pain Kirith and I endured.", "Neither you nor I could possibly imagine the pain an individual suffers when their soul is ripped from their body. They are not dead and by no means are they alive. Instead, they walk the land, servants of those that bind them to this world. Lord Razelikh, demonic overlord of these lands, enslaved them all. Nine he took for his own, placing stones of binding near the Dark Portal. The remaining nine were divided up between his subordinates.", "Regret. It is all I have now. One bad decision resulting in several horrible outcomes. If only I had waited for those orders. Maybe they would have detailed the horrors that awaited us in those cursed lands! Maybe they were to redirect us to another detail? Ultimately, it was my fault. All of it was my fault.", "The archmage Allistarj of the Shadowsworn was granted three. Lady Sevine, warlock of the Shadowsworn was also granted three. The remaining three were given to Grol the Destroyer, lord of the Dreadmaul ogres of these blasted lands. You see, $N, without a soul, the body cannot be killed. The remnants of my men are now indestructible fighting units. Thankfully, they are bound in how far they can travel by the stones of binding.", "They are exactly what you need to destroy in order to free the regiment! As I had told you earlier, Kirith had a plan. Each of the servants does have a weakness. Punish their physical form in proximity of their stones until they are near the state of disintegration. It is at that point, and that point alone, that the stones of binding are vulnerable to attack. You must hurry to destroy the stones, however, as once the enslaved regain their composure, they will be invulnerable to harm once more.", "Thrall's Grasp they called us: Twenty of Thrall's most accomplished and honored soldiers. I had ordered the regiment to build an encampment here, on the border of the Blasted Lands, while we waited for our orders to arrive from Orgrimmar. Weeks passed without word from the warchief; the men grew restless. It was a judgment call, $N. I was young and ambitious, afraid of nothing. The battalion would set forth into the Blasted Lands under my command. A decision I would later regret.", "Would you believe that in my darkest hour, at the apex of my being, I failed. As I fled from the wanton destruction of the forces that overwhelmed us, the only sounds I could hear were the screams of my soldiers and the rapid beat of my own heart. A short while later, I returned to the Blasted Lands in hopes of rescuing my men and restoring my honor. Instead I was captured and beaten until dead. What I found out during my inquisition and subsequent torture was horrifying." },
	["醉酒的奴隶主"] = { "Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager? It's good stuff!", "I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom's up!", "It's all guns and flames until someone loses and dies." },
	["醉鬼拉里克"] = { "WUT YOU WANT!?" },
	["采炼师阿德里安娜"] = { "After countless failures of our agents to secure workable samples of Scourge blight for analysis, I've come up to the front lines myself to oversee the efforts. Like they say, if you want a job done right..." },
	["里夏·魔环"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["里普·派兹拉姆"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["里格·基泽尔顿"] = { "This just happens to be your lucky day; I just completed Super-Seller 680's maintenance. There are tons of items for sell at great low-low prices. Go ahead and see for yourself... my brother Cork thinks his Vendor-Tron 1000 will out sell my bot." },
	["里瑞亚·杜拉克"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior. Why don't you go do something safe, like read a book.", "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["里维伊"] = { "If you ever meet Witch Doctor Tor'gash, tell him his concoctions and charms don't work! I did exactly as he told me to and still Magasha has eyes only for Zurai. Don't believe a thing that sham witch doctor tells you!" },
	["里萨·卡勒菲克斯"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["里萨弗"] = { "You - come here. Are these blades not the finest quality? Surely you wish to purchase from me. You will not find such workmanship and care wrought into such weapons anywhere else, $r." },
	["野猪驯养员布莱格"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["野生龙鹰"] = { "<The dragonhawk appears to be unsettled by the commotion in the surrounding area.>" },
	["金井长者"] = { "Elder Bronzebeard can be found in the ancestral home of the Bronzebeards, Ironforge.", "Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge.", "Elder Silvervein can be found near Thelsamar in Loch Modan.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["金吉·斯比维尔"] = { "Pleased to meet you! I'm Gidge, the resident spellfire tailoring expert here in Shattrath. Not that there's any competition, but if you're interested in learning to be a spellfire tailor and haven't settled on a specialization, I can help." },
	["金矛长者"] = { "Elder Nightwind passes the days at the shrine in Jaedenar in Felwood.", "Last I knew, Elder Stonespire was at Everlook in Winterspring.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["钓鱼机器人5000型"] = { "*Whirr* *CLANK* I have been instructed to accept high quality rare fish and return valuable Nat Pagle fishing accessories. Fish Requested. *THUMP* *Buzz*" },
	["钓鱼者卡图姆"] = { "Fishing is just so pleasant, mon. You know? I owe my state of bliss to my mentor, the greatest angler in the whole world - Nat Pagle. Have you heard of him, mon? If you be looking for enlightenment, Nat Pagle be the one who gonna show you the way." },
	["钢铁之门首席考古学家"] = { "Ain't she a beauty? Want to take her for a spin?" },
	["铁匠卡里普索"] = { "Need something?" },
	["铁匠弗兰西斯"] = { "Come for some blacksmithing supplies, have ya?" },
	["铁匠斯拉提"] = { "If it's broke, Slagtree can fix it!" },
	["铁匠阿古斯"] = { "I'm sorry, I'm a bit busy right now making horseshoes for Verner Osgood in Lakeshire." },
	["铁匠霍尔萨"] = { "Hello, $n. Now that I've finished creating my anvil I can begin outfitting our troops. It's an important step, but there's still much to be done. More importantly for you, there are new things that I can create, which you may be interested in." },
	["铁炉堡冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["铁炉堡勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["铁炉堡守卫"] = { "A Cooking trainer is it? Well then, get yerself over to the Bronze Kettle on the northeastern side of The Great Forge. Daryl Riknussun will teach ye to make a mighty fine dish that's sure to put the life back in ye!", "A valuable skill First Aid is. Our resident trainer, Nissa Firestone, can show ye how it's done. Look for her on the southern side of The Great Forge at the Ironforge Physician.", "Ah, Braenna Flintcrag. She has magic hands, that one. Braenna is the one to see about Priestly matters. Ye'll want to travel north from the gates of Ironforge to the Hall of Mysteries. That's where ye'll find her.", "Ah, I believe Gimble Thistlefuzz is who ye'll be needing if yer looking to learn the Enchanter's profession. Ye'll find Gimble in his shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.", "Ah, nothing better than a priest to cure what ails ye. Of course a nice tall pint cures a lot of what ails ye too, but I don't think Braenna Flintcrag teaches brewing. I guess ye'll have to settle for some priest training over in the Hall of Mysteries instead.", "Ah, nothing quite like a ride on a gryphon, is there? The night elves can keep those hippo's of theirs, just give me a gryphon and the wind in me hair! Well now, I won't keep ye any longer, just head over to Gryth Thurden on the east side of The Great Forge and he'll get ye on yer way.", "An Alchemy trainer is what you need? Well, I just came from there, I did. Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather.", "Aye, everyone wants to ride the tram, it's a real hoot and a half. Well, if ye want to find the tram, it's located over in Tinker Town just east of the gates of Ironforge.", "Balthus Stoneflayer is the one to see about Skinning. If it can be skinned, he can teach ye how. Just walk yerself over to Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge.", "Between Bixi and Buliwyf, there ain't many weapons they haven't had the pleasure of slashing or smashing an orc with. You can find them hanging out at the Timberline Arms weapon shop if ye need some training.", "Brandur Ironhammer would be the one ye'd want to see. Ye can find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge.", "Do we have Mining trainers here? Where do ye think ye are!? Why you'll find one o' the best miners in all Dun Morogh at the Deepmountain Mining Guild on the northern side of The Great Forge. There, Geofram Bouldertoe will show ye the true art of mining.", "Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound? Then ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles. Ye'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge.", "Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound? Ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles. Ye'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge.", "Elise Brightletter is near the Great Forge adjacent to the Flight Master.", "Fimble Finespindle has a shop set up on the northwest side of The Great Forge. I wager he could show ye how to make some fine armor.", "First Aid? Well ye don't look hurt to me. If yer really interested in learning First Aid, then Nissa Firestone is the one to learn from. Go see her over by The Great Forge in her shop, The Ironforge Physician.", "Flowers and seeds and such? That would be Reyna Stonebranch's area of expertise. Ye can find her tending to her plants over at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge.", "Grimnur Stonebrand will tell ye some whoppers about the one that got away, but he's still one o' the best fishermen around. He's got a shop set up in The Forlorn Cavern called the Traveling Fisherman.", "I once heard ol' Grimnur say he fished up a sword. Or was it a swordfish? Damn that Grimnur, he's told so many fish tales I can't remember which is which. Well, why don't you go see him over in The Forlorn Cavern and have him tell you what it was.", "I overheard Regnus Thundergranite in the Hall of Arms bragging about a new trophy for his den the other day. If yer looking for training from a skilled hunter, Regnus is the one to see.", "If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be. Ye'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going. Oh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me.", "If yer thinking about forming a guild, then ye'll need to put it past Jondor Steelbrow o'er in the Ironforge Visitor's Center. Just head southeast from the gates of Ironforge to see him.", "Kelstrum is a loudmouth and a braggart... and if that weren't enough he's also one of the most skilled warriors ye'll ever meet! I tell ye, if ye're looking to be trained in the ways of a warrior, that's who ye should be talking to. I'm sure he can be found over in the Hall of Arms east of the Gates of Ironforge.", "Looking to take a ride on a gryphon, now are ye? Gryth Thurden is the one ye'll want to be seeing about that. Ye can find him on the eastern side of The Great Forge in the middle of Ironforge.", "Now why would ye be needing the services of one of those types? We get enough trouble out of that rogue, Hulfdan Blackbeard, over in The Forlorn Cavern, do I need to be turning my eye to you as well?", "Och! That Daryl Riknussun is a brilliant cook! He makes a chilli so hot ye could temper steel with it! I don't think he'll teach ye the recipe, but he'll certainly help ye to become a good cook. Ye'll find him at the Bronze Kettle o'er on the northeastern side of The Great Forge.", "Och! Ye seek training in the way of the warrior, do ye? Kelstrum Stonebreaker will put ye through yer paces! Just march yerself over to the Hall of Arms east of the gates of Ironforge.", "Oh, the tram, the tram... everyone wants to ride the tram. What happened to the good ol' days of flying on the back of a gryphon, gripping the saddle for dear life as you flew up high in the sky above? Bah! You go take the tram then... it's over in Tinker Town with the rest of the gnomish contraptions.", "Oh, you're looking for Springspindle Fizzlegear then. Why that little gnome and his gadgets... Let me tell you, if you're going to his shop in Tinker Town, keep your hands to yourself and don't pet any of his mechanical sheep! Exploding sheep... now why would you even make such a thing!?", "Over in the Hall of Arms you can find our resident stable master, Ulbrek Firehand. He'll make sure any pets ye have are well fed and rightly cared for.", "Skinning? The only thing ye look like ye could skin is yer own knee! Ha! Now why don't you go see Balthus Stoneflayer so he can teach you how to properly skin some animals. You'll find him in Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge.", "Sure ye don't want to be a Blacksmith? Well, if yer heart is set on Leatherworking, then you best talk to Fimble Finespindle over at his shop on the northwest side of The Great Forge.", "Taking care of animals is something that Ulbrek Firehand takes quite seriously. He usually hangs out with the hunters at the Hall of Arms if ye want him to look after a pet or two.", "That Jormund Stonebrow has a knack for the needle, he does. Should you be needing some training, then you'll find him at Stonebrow's Clothier on the northern side of The Great Forge.", "That wee wizardly lass, Bink, over in the Hall of Mysteries would probably be able to help ye out with any magical needs you have. The Hall of Mysteries is just north of the gates of Ironforge.", "The Inn? Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer? The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go. Ye'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.", "The bank? Oh, ye mean The Vault! No safer place to store yer valuables than The Vault. Ye'll find it just northeast of the entrance to Ironforge.", "The tinkerer's craft for you is it? No doubt ye'll want to go see Springspindle Fizzlegear in Tinker Town. Just head east from the gates of Ironforge, or follow the sound of the explosions.", "Well now, ye'll need papers to form a guild, and Jondor Steelbrow can help you get started with the process. He can be found over at the Ironforge Visitor's Center when yer ready to get started.", "Well now, you can find Farseer Javad in the area of The Great Forge, just a bit to the North on the East side.", "Well ye'd be sure to find some training in the magical arts over in the Hall of Mysteries, north of the gates of Ironforge. Juli Stormkettle can always be found there with her nose in a book.", "What do ye need directions to?", "Where better to look for a dark and brooding lot, than the dark section of Ironforge, aptly named The Forlorn Cavern. Thistleheart is sure to be found there, likely summoning some manner of vile creature to do his bidding.", "Where is the Auction House? Why it's right by the gates of Ironforge as you enter our fine city. Ye'll find it just across from The Vault.", "Which class trainer might ye be looking for?", "Which profession trainer would ye be looking for?", "Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants! Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he'd killed seven with one blow! Ye should pay him a visit at his store on the north side of The Great Forge an' see if he'll tell ye the tale!", "Ye'll find the battlemasters around the war table in the Hall of Arms.", "Ye've come to the right place $glad : lass;! People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith. Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself.", "Ye've come to the right place lad! People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith. Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself.", "Ye've come to the right place lass! People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith. Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself.", "Yer looking for an Alchemy trainer are ye? Just came from there, I did. Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather. ::sigh:: ...why o' why didn't I take the blue potion.", "You can find a mailbox right o'er by The Stonefire Tavern. It's just north of the gates of Ironforge.", "You can find the barber shop on the west portion of The Commons." },
	["铁炉堡巡山人"] = { "A Thunderbrew ale and a bit of Gremlock's cooking makes for a nice meal indeed. Ye really should hit him up for some training if ye want to be a cook.", "Ah, Stonebrow doesn't leave Ironforge much these days so if ye're looking to learn the tailor's profession ye'll have to go to see him up in Ironforge.", "All those official types reside in Ironforge. Ye'll be wanting to check out the Ironforge Visitor's Center for guild creation papers.", "Amazing to see little flowers persist in the cold of Dun Morogh... but ye won't find any herbalists out here. Ye'll have to go to Ironforge to get some training in that profession.", "Elise Brightletter is near the Great Forge adjacent to the Flight Master.", "First Aid may not make up for a priest's healing, but it's handy in a pinch. I recommend ye go talk to Thamner in the Thunderbrew Distillery and learn what ye can.", "Good ol' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg. I'm good as new I tell ye! I'm sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage.", "Gremlock doesn't always have the best of luck with cooking, but he does have some tasty recipies worth learning. Go chat him up in the Thunderbrew Distillery and see what he'll teach ye.", "I hear there's a shop up in Ironforge run by the gnomes that specializes in alchemy. You should go have a look.", "If ye ask me, I think Grif spends a little too much time with the animals. Still, nobody else knows the hunter's path quite like he does. Look for him outside the smithy in Kharanos.", "If ye need to get yer hands on some guild creation papers ye'll have to head up to Ironforge and visit the Ironforge Visitor's Center.", "If ye're looking to learn the profession of leatherworking, ye're gonna need to travel to Ironforge. I hear there's a nice shop near the Great Forge where ye can learn the profession.", "Ironforge is going to be your best bet for leatherworkers. If memory servers, there's a shop by The Great Forge that should meet yer needs.", "Nope, no alchemists out here in Dun Morogh. Ye best take a look in Ironforge for them... try the gnomes in Tinker Town.", "Nope, nobody who can teach ye herbalism out here. I think ye'll have better luck in Ironforge though.", "Not much fishing to be had around here, but what little there is to be had is Paxton's ye can be sure. Ye can find him fishing out on Iceflow Lake.", "Och! Now that's a skill worth knowing. Tognus beats the anvil with a fury ye don't see often. Why don't ye go talk him up and see what he can teach ye?", "Och! Now ye're talkin'! I bet Granis Swiftaxe could show ye a thing or two about swinging steel. He's over in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos at the moment.", "Och... a paladin? Well $glad : lass;, ye're in luck! Azar Stronghammer is back from training and is currently staying at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.", "Och... a paladin? Well lad, ye're in luck! Azar Stronghammer is back from training and is currently staying at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.", "Och... a paladin? Well lass, ye're in luck! Azar Stronghammer is back from training and is currently staying at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.", "Oh, a priest is it? Well good ol' Maxan is sure to be found having a drink in the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need a bit of training.", "Only a few spots to get any fishing done around here. Paxton knows them all and probably a few he won't tell ya about. Why don't ye go over to Iceflow Lake and see what he will tell ya.", "Oooh, an Inn is it? Well, ye just can't beat the Thunderbrew Distillery. Rest if ye must, but be sure to have an ale or two while ye're there.", "Surely ye didn't think ye would find a town without a resident miner about, did ye? Yarr can usually be found over at Steelgrill's Depot just outside of Kharanos.", "That Granis Swiftaxe could drink a fish under the table and yet his axe still swings true. However, if yer looking for training, ye best catch him while ye can understand him.", "That kind of magic is just bad news, I tell ye. I don't know why that Grimrizz has been allowed to set up outside the Thunderbrew Distillery of all places! You stay away from him, you here!", "The Thunderbrews run a fine Inn in Kharanos which bears their name. Stop in for a pint and a bit of rest.", "The nearest bank ye'll find is The Vault in Ironforge, $glad : lass;.", "The nearest bank ye'll find is The Vault in Ironforge, lad.", "The nearest bank ye'll find is The Vault in Ironforge, lass.", "There aren't any enchanters out here in Dun Morogh that I know of. Ye're going to have to visit Ironforge if ye want to learn the enchanter's profession.", "There's a mage at the Thunderbrew Distillery who might be able to teach you some new spells. I believe his name is Magis Sparkmantle.", "There's only one hunter around here I would have ye talk to, and that would be Grif Wildheart. Ye'll find him standing just outside the smithy in Kharanos.", "Warlocks... I don't care for their lot. Like that Grimrizz who's set up shop outside the Thunderbrew Distillery. The ale will probably go flat there because of him! Warlocks... bah!", "Well $glad : lass;, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos. She'll take good care of any pets ye might have.", "Well lad, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos. She'll take good care of any pets ye might have.", "Well lass, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos. She'll take good care of any pets ye might have.", "Well then, it seems we're both looking for Hogral Bakkan. He's a dwarf to be sure, so sooner or later he'll be heading for the Thunderbrew Distillery for an ale -- he might even be there now.", "Well, ye won't have much luck with finding a tailor out here. Ironforge is home to a quite a few talented tailors though. Why don't ye go ask a guard there.", "What do ye need directions to?", "Which class trainer might ye be looking for?", "Which profession trainer would ye be looking for?", "With all the screws that Bronk has been tightening, I think he's let a few of his own go if ye get me. All the same he's still got a good head for engineering the darndest devices. Ye should go pay him a visit over at Steelgrill's Depot.", "Ye can probably hear Tognus beating away on the anvil when yer in Kharanos. Although, if ye haven't cleared the wax out of yer ears recently, then why don't ye just have a look in the smithy.", "Ye looking for Hogral? Well did ye check the tavern? Och! If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn! Go have a look already.", "Ye should check over at Steelgrill's Depot for Bronk. When he's not tinkering with some odd device, he's usually chatting up the pilots about their steam tanks.", "Ye should take a look in Ironforge if ye have yer mind set on enchanting. I think I saw a shop over by the gryphon master last time I was up there.", "Ye sure ye don't want to learn to be a warrior? Well, it's yer hide on the battlefield. If ye really want to learn to waggle yer finger, ye best talk to Magis Sparkmantle in the Thunderbrew Distillery.", "Ye won't find a gryphon master just anywhere around Dun Morogh, $glad : lass;. Ye're going to have to go to Ironforge if ye want to take a gryphon somewhere.", "Ye won't find a gryphon master just anywhere around Dun Morogh, lad. Ye're going to have to go to Ironforge if ye want to take a gryphon somewhere.", "Ye won't find a gryphon master just anywhere around Dun Morogh, lass. Ye're going to have to go to Ironforge if ye want to take a gryphon somewhere.", "Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained.", "Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh lad, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained.", "Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh lass, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained.", "Ye'll surely find Maxan Anvol tossin' back a few in the Thunderbrew Distillery. Why don't ye go have yerself a pint and see if he'll teach ye something new." },
	["铁炉堡狂欢者"] = { "Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...", "The people in Nighthaven sure know how to party!", "These fireworks sure make a nice BOOM, don't you think?", "This moonlight will send you to Ironforge. But who'd want to leave this party?" },
	["铁环长者"] = { "Elder Bronzebeard can be found in the ancestral home of the Bronzebeards, Ironforge.", "Elder Goldwell spends his time in the village of Kharanos in Dun Morogh.", "Elder Morndeep spends time at the Ring of Law in Blackrock Depths.", "Elder Silvervein can be found near Thelsamar in Loch Modan.", "Elder Stonefort has taken to the dungeons of Blackrock Spire.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["铜须长者"] = { "Elder Bladeswift wanders the paths of Darnassus atop Teldrassil.", "Elder Goldwell spends his time in the village of Kharanos in Dun Morogh.", "Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind.", "Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["银月城冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["银月城勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["银月城卫兵"] = { "A cow woman who claims to be a druid has set up camp within Silvermoon. She's no doubt grazing on our planters as we speak.", "Blood Knight Noellene awaits young trainees within the northeast building of the square.", "Celoenus is our resident expert on the summoning of demons. He resides in the Falconwing Square Inn, no doubt on the second floor.", "Delaniel keeps a delightful cook named Quarelestra on staff. You'll do well to learn from her. Naturally, you'll find her in the Falconwing Square inn.", "Delaniel keeps her inn well in the southeastern corner of Falconwing Square. Good food, fine wine, soft beds... what more could one ask for?", "For those who prefer to rely on mundane methods of mending the flesh, Kanaria keeps a tidy station within the Falconwing Square inn.", "Garridel teaches the arcane arts within Falconwing Square; you can find her on the second floor of the inn.", "I know of a local alchemist. Sheynathren, I believe his name is. When last I saw him, he was heading off to Saltheril's Haven, no doubt to engage in one of his ridiculous parties.", "I know of a local alchemist. Sheynathren, I believe his name is. When last I saw him, he was heading off to Sartheril's Haven, no doubt to engage in one of his ridiculous parties.", "If priestly knowledge is what you seek, Ponaris is your man. He works with the others on the second floor of Delaniel's inn.", "If you're looking to register a guild, I would suggest inquiring within the walls of Silvermoon City itself.", "Look no further than Saltheril's little celebration if you're after the enchanter Eredania. She received her invitation a few days ago.", "Mathreyn is skilled in the barbaric practice of skinning, if that is truly your wont. He supplies Sathein with hides; you can find them both just southwest of the Magister's Gate.", "Our resident jewelcrafter, Aleinia, can be found within Delaniel's establishment in Falconwing Square. She might be looking for an apprentice.", "Sathein finds the lynx hides in Eversong perfect for his creations. You should speak to him - he stands with Mathreyn just southwest of the Magister's Gate.", "Skymistress Gloaming stands just outside the Magister's Gate near Silvermoon proper, tending to the dragonhawks.", "Some rangers seem to be unable to look after their beastly charges themselves. If you simply must stow such a thing somewhere in town, Anathos will take it off your hands. She waits and works in Falconwing Square, outside the inn.", "Such a dangerous and unpredictable profession cannot reliably be practiced among our pristine woods without calamitous consequences. You might try Silvermoon City itself, however; the walls are strong enough to weather the blasts.", "The farstriders keep a smith at their retreat in the eastern portion of Eversong. Arathel might be able to help you.", "The good sempstress is of late occupied at Saltheril's Haven; her prowess with a needle and thread is assuredly appreciated there.", "The miners can be found within Silvermoon City, no doubt close to the odiferous forges where they smelt their gains.", "The rangers take their lessons from Hannovia, a farstrider who stays in the northeast building of Falconwing Square.", "There is a fisherman within our grand city... if spending time with pungent, wet, flopping abominations is your idea of a pleasant day.", "There's a building in the northeast of Falconwing Square... within, you'll most likely find Tannaria, a woman well skilled in remaining out of sight.", "What path do you wish to pursue?", "Which profession do you seek to learn?", "Who better to have tending one's floral arrangements for a party than the botanist Tyniarrel? I'm sure Saltheril pays him in wine.", "You can find the scribe, Zantasia in the Court of the Sun.", "You seek something in our fair land?" },
	["银月城守卫"] = { "Ah, seeking the masters of the arcane? You can find Quithas and the other magisters within the Sunfury Spire.", "Alestus is a master at the... messier way of mending wounds. If learning first aid is your aim, seek him out on the Walk of Elders, near the entrance to the Royal Exchange.", "Along the southeast end of the Walk of Elders, Lynalis has set up a fine leatherworking stand. She'll train you... for a fee.", "An old choice... but I suppose I'm not one to judge. Danwe is the one you're after; his engineering stand lies near the Court of the Sun, on the path to Farstriders' Square.", "Bemarrin teaches the trade of blacksmithing in Farstriders' Square. While a somewhat... dirty trade, I suppose it has its merits.", "Botanist Nathera has a keen eye for finding herbs, and I imagine she might impart her wisdom to the likes of you. You'll find her with the alchemists in an alcove of the Court of the Sun.", "Do you mean the Silvermoon City Inn, or the Wayfarer's Rest tavern?", "If digging in the dirt is the sort of pastime you find enjoyable, go share your insanity with Belil in Farstriders' Square. I'm certain he'd be happy to see he's not the only crazy one.", "If jewelcrafting is what you seek, you'll find Telia's shop on the south end of the Royal Exchange.", "If you're seeking a bank in the eastern part of the city, look no further than the Royal Exchange. It lies along the north wall therein.", "Keelen's tailoring shop in the northwest corner of the Bazaar has a loom like you describe.", "Lady Liadrin, matriarch of the Blood Knights, has the Knights' headquarters in an enclave in Farstriders' Square. You'll need to speak to Champion Bachi there if you are looking for instruction. Be respectful while there if you value your head.", "Oh. You're seeking one of... them. Well, if you truly want to waste your time speaking with those backward individuals, you'll find the rangers in Farstriders' Square. Zandine can take care of you.", "One of the druids? Our people don't walk that path... but you are in luck. A tauren woman - at least, I believe it's a woman - has set up a modest residence on the north end of the Walk of Elders. Harene Plainwalker is her name.", "Shalenn tends the animals within the city and prevents them from running amok while their masters continue to fritter their lives away. She stands in Farstriders' Square, just outside the rangers' hall.", "Skymistress Gloaming and her bats are just outside and to the west of the Shepherd's Gate.", "Sylann, one of the finest cooks in the city, can be found upstairs in the Wayfarer's Rest tavern. You can purchase cooking supplies from her assistant there, too.", "Tandrine is the guild master of Silvermoon. Her residence is along the Walk of Elders, close to the Magister's Gate.", "The Bank of Silvermoon can be found within the Bazaar. Seek it out in the southeast corner.", "The Blood Knights in Farstriders' Square graciously allow space within their halls for Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon. While her training is not cheap, you'll appreciate her expertise.", "The Royal Exchange auction house can be found in the eastern part of the city, just south of the training area for the blood knights and rangers.", "The Silvermoon City Inn, located in the Royal Exchange, is run by a talented woman named Velandra. I'm told that the renowned vinemaster can sometimes be found there, as well.", "The Wayfarer's Rest Tavern is located between the Walk of Elders and the Bazaar. You can reach it from either location.", "The alchemists are located in the Court of the Sun; you'll find Camberon eager to teach you anything you might want to know about the art of brewing potions.", "The battlemasters take their ease deep within the halls of the Blood Knight enclave in Farstriders' Square. While somewhat... crude, they have their redeemable traits.", "The enchanter Sedana is currently accepting apprentices, I believe. You'll find her in one of the alcoves within the Court of the Sun.", "The more agile among us can sometimes be difficult to spot, but nonetheless, you'll probably run across the rogue Zelanis and his cohorts deep within Murder Row.", "The priests of our fair city can be found within the Sunfury Spire. Seek out the lady Belestra.", "The summoning of demons is a dangerous practice, but the resulting power can be immense. Our resident expert is Alamma, who watches over the warlocks within Murder Row.", "The tailor Keelen is always seeking more curious students to teach his delicate craft. His shop is somewhat difficult to uncover at first, but it's just north of the auction house in the Bazaar. You'll find him on the lower level of the building.", "The waters of Quel'thalas are teeming with fish; I take it they caught your eye? Drathen is quite experienced with the tricks of the fishing trade, and can be found on the Walk of Elders near the Royal Exchange.", "The western auction house can be found in the middle of the Bazaar, just west of the Walk of Elders.", "Tyn is quite the talented skinner; she produces the finest lynx hides I've yet seen. If you wish to learn from her, you'll find her on the southeast end of the Walk of Elders.", "We have an abundance of mailboxes in our fair city. The one by the Royal Exchange Bank should certainly fit your needs.", "We have two auction houses within Silvermoon. Which would you prefer?", "What path do you wish to pursue?", "Where in our fair city do you wish to go?", "Which profession do you seek to learn?", "You can find the scribe, Zantasia in the Court of the Sun." },
	["银月大使帕拉·晨歌"] = { "Greetings, $r! I trust this day finds you well?" },
	["银月大使欧诺·炎伤"] = { "Greetings, $r. I am Ambassador Sunsorrow of the sin'dorei, or blood elves as we are commonly known. I have high hopes that this new bond between us and the Horde will be mutually beneficial.", "I've heard something of your exploits, $N. I know that while you're here in Forsaken lands that you'll comport yourself with dignity and as a true hero of the sin'dorei!", "Just a small songbook that I thought you might like to have. It contains the lyrics to a song known as the Lament of the Highborne; the one that Lady Sylvanas glamoured from the air." },
	["银松森林护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["银翼大使"] = { "$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch. But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills. As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf. Will you join the battle?" },
	["银脉长者"] = { "Elder Goldwell spends his time in the village of Kharanos in Dun Morogh.", "Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["银色医师"] = { "I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way." },
	["银色士兵"] = { "Make it quick... the fighting here is grim. I need to stay sharp.", "Oh good, reinforcements!", "Thank the Light for you!", "What are you doing out here?", "You a new recruit? That's not standard issue armor.", "You have a message for me?" },
	["银色神官帕尔崔丝"] = { "Welcome to our little chapel of the Light. Please, take a seat. Enjoy a respite from the world's ills." },
	["银色黎明军官加鲁什"] = { "Well met, friend. I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil! For the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!", "Well met, friend. I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil! For the Dawn, my brother!", "Well met, friend. I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil! For the Dawn, my sister!" },
	["银色黎明军官普尔哈特"] = { "Well met, friend. I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is simple - fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil! For the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!", "Well met, friend. I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is simple - fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil! For the Dawn, my brother!", "Well met, friend. I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is simple - fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil! For the Dawn, my sister!" },
	["银色黎明军需官哈萨娜"] = { "The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c. I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn. As you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush. Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items. As you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you." },
	["银色黎明军需官莱斯巴克"] = { "The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c! The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Dawn. As you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart. Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items. As you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you." },
	["铸甲匠霍尔冯"] = { "It's my passion, you know. In life and in death, armorcrafting is what I love. Please, treat me as if I were a living draenei, stranger. Let me know what it is to feel again... Allow me the honor of repairing your items." },
	["镇长埃罗恩·钝鼻"] = { "Greetings, $n." },
	["长者亚尔特恩"] = { "Elder Chogan'gada can be found in Utgarde Pinnacle.", "Elder Lunaro is at the Ruins of Tethys in Grizzly Hills.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.", "You'll find Elder Whurain at Camp Oneqwah in Grizzly Hills." },
	["长者伊加苏"] = { "Elder Arp spends time at the D.E.H.T.A camp in Borean Tundra.", "Elder Pamuya is just outside Warsong Hold.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Last I heard, Elder Sardis was venturing to Valiance Keep." },
	["长者伊萨·麦蹄"] = { "Elder Bloodhoof can be found at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.", "Elder Darkcore can be found in the Undercity.", "Elder Darkhorn can be found among the red rocks of Orgrimmar.", "Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge.", "Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["长者伍雷恩"] = { "Elder Beldak can be found at the Westfall Brigade Encampment in Grizzly Hills.", "Elder Chogan'gada can be found in Utgarde Pinnacle.", "Elder Kilias can be found inside Drak'Tharon Keep.", "Elder Lunaro is at the Ruins of Tethys in Grizzly Hills.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Utgarde Keep is where you'll find Elder Jarten." },
	["长者努尔根"] = { "Elder Fargal looks over Frosthold in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Stonebeard resides at Bouldercrag's Refuge in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Yurauk can be found in the Halls of Stone.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["长者卢纳罗"] = { "Elder Beldak can be found at the Westfall Brigade Encampment in Grizzly Hills.", "Elder Chogan'gada can be found in Utgarde Pinnacle.", "Elder Kilias can be found inside Drak'Tharon Keep.", "Elder Skywarden can be found near Agmar's Hammer in Dragonblight.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Utgarde Keep is where you'll find Elder Jarten." },
	["长者哈尔卡克"] = { "Frenzyheart can be vicious, but we good people. You see if you stay long, we friends with smart and strong just fine. We just don't like dumb." },
	["长者基里亚斯"] = { "Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Ohanzee is located in Gundrak.", "Elder Tauros found his way to Zim'Torga in Zul'Drak.", "Last I knew, Elder Nurgen was in Azjol-Nerub.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["长者塞克卡尔"] = { "<The arakkoa ghost reaches out toward you as though to try to identify you. You get the impression that it cannot see you clearly.> Rokkaram, is that you?", "Forgive me for questioning you, my son. My sight isn't what it once was, but the raven has blessed me with a long life. Soon, it will be time for you to take my place. I have taught you all I know. My only regret is that I didn't prove worthy enough to recover our sacred Book of the Raven.", "The true believers have lived in shame since the day our treacherous cousins in Skettis stole the book from us, shattered its tablet, and buried the fragments in their wretched city! Pray that the raven will choose you to restore it, my son. Be faithful and remember always the prophecy, \"From the dreams of his enemies shall the raven spring forth into the world.\"" },
	["长者墨尔希"] = { "Elder Pamuya is just outside Warsong Hold.", "Elder Skywarden can be found near Agmar's Hammer in Dragonblight.", "Elder Thoim has spent many years at Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight.", "Last I knew, Elder Nurgen was in Azjol-Nerub.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake.", "You'll find Elder Whurain at Camp Oneqwah in Grizzly Hills." },
	["长者奥哈齐"] = { "Elder Muraco is just outside Camp Tunka'lo in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Stonebeard resides at Bouldercrag's Refuge in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Yurauk can be found in the Halls of Stone.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["长者安格雷兹"] = { "We must search for survivors. If anyone is still alive, we must at least try and get them back..." },
	["长者尤尔雷"] = { "They have no respect for the dead, $r. The ogres must be taught a lesson." },
	["长者尤拉克"] = { "Elder Fargal looks over Frosthold in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Muraco is just outside Camp Tunka'lo in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Stonebeard resides at Bouldercrag's Refuge in the Storm Peaks.", "Last I knew, Elder Nurgen was in Azjol-Nerub.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["长者帕姆亚"] = { "Elder Arp spends time at the D.E.H.T.A camp in Borean Tundra.", "Elder Bluewolf in trapped within the battle for Wintergrasp.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Last I heard, Elder Sardis was venturing to Valiance Keep." },
	["长者库甘达加"] = { "Elder Lunaro is at the Ruins of Tethys in Grizzly Hills.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake.", "Utgarde Keep is where you'll find Elder Jarten.", "You'll find Elder Whurain at Camp Oneqwah in Grizzly Hills." },
	["长者库纳尼"] = { "The land is in great upheaval! The Dark One rides forth again with his San'layn, the dragons fight in their great Nexus War, and the vrykul are reawakened. Your people sail north on your wooden ships to fight them and one another, and we Kalu'ak are caught in the middle. And now some great evil has been done so that the land explodes with the magical power of the world. We must find a safe haven where we will have a chance to survive. These two ambassadors make my head hurt... perhaps you can help my people, $r?" },
	["长者库鲁提"] = { "Good. Be sure they understand. Now, I would appreciate it if you would leave my temple in peace.", "I humbly welcome you to our temple, spirit.", "So we're to trust people who would insult us with this deception? Do the draenei think so little of us that they must resort to trickery to get our attention? We're aware of their desire to 'redeem' us, but my people want none of their redemption. We are capable of standing on our own and we will pursue our destiny as a proud and separate people. Carry this message to your allies.", "Treat with the draenei, the people who turned their backs on us while we suffered? I think not. A true spirit does not speak thus! Reveal yourself, impostor. Who sent you?" },
	["长者杉德雷"] = { "Elder Arp spends time at the D.E.H.T.A camp in Borean Tundra.", "Elder Bluewolf in trapped within the battle for Wintergrasp.", "Elder Wanikaya can be found at Rainspeaker Rapids in Sholazar Basin.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["长者法迦尔"] = { "Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Muraco is just outside Camp Tunka'lo in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Stonebeard resides at Bouldercrag's Refuge in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Yurauk can be found in the Halls of Stone.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["长者瓦尼卡"] = { "Elder Arp spends time at the D.E.H.T.A camp in Borean Tundra.", "Elder Bluewolf in trapped within the battle for Wintergrasp.", "Elder Pamuya is just outside Warsong Hold.", "Elder Sandrene has traveled to Lakeside Landing in Sholazar Basin.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["长者穆图"] = { "Since landing here I have seen horrors that had previously only haunted my darkest nightmares, but nothing could have prepared me for what lies beyond the mist. <Mootoo nods.> Through that fog, not more than a few yards from us, stand the bloodthirsty creatures known as Kvaldir. None have returned from the fog and few that were originally at the landing when the mist rolled in have escaped. The area has since been condemned by Hellscream. Enter at your own risk..." },
	["长者穆希特"] = { "The Kvaldir are without mercy, $N. But I cannot abandon sacred Kaskala. If we don't abandon the spirits, the spirits will not abandon us either." },
	["长者穆拉克"] = { "Elder Fargal looks over Frosthold in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Kilias can be found inside Drak'Tharon Keep.", "Elder Ohanzee is located in Gundrak.", "Elder Stonebeard resides at Bouldercrag's Refuge in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Yurauk can be found in the Halls of Stone.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["长者索伊姆"] = { "Elder Skywarden can be found near Agmar's Hammer in Dragonblight.", "Go to Stars' Rest in Dragonblight and you will find Elder Morthie.", "Last I knew, Elder Nurgen was in Azjol-Nerub.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake.", "You'll find Elder Whurain at Camp Oneqwah in Grizzly Hills." },
	["长者萨迪斯"] = { "Elder Arp spends time at the D.E.H.T.A camp in Borean Tundra.", "Elder Igasho was last seen exploring within The Nexus.", "Elder Pamuya is just outside Warsong Hold.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake.", "You'll find Elder Northal inside the Transitus Shield in Coldarra." },
	["长者诺塔尔"] = { "Elder Arp spends time at the D.E.H.T.A camp in Borean Tundra.", "Elder Igasho was last seen exploring within The Nexus.", "Last I heard, Elder Sardis was venturing to Valiance Keep.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["长者贝尔达"] = { "Elder Kilias can be found inside Drak'Tharon Keep.", "Elder Lunaro is at the Ruins of Tethys in Grizzly Hills.", "Elder Tauros found his way to Zim'Torga in Zul'Drak.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake.", "You'll find Elder Whurain at Camp Oneqwah in Grizzly Hills." },
	["长者阿图伊克"] = { "I am Atuik, chieftain of the Kalu'ak of Kamagua." },
	["长者陶鲁斯"] = { "Elder Beldak can be found at the Westfall Brigade Encampment in Grizzly Hills.", "Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks.", "Elder Kilias can be found inside Drak'Tharon Keep.", "Elder Lunaro is at the Ruins of Tethys in Grizzly Hills.", "Elder Muraco is just outside Camp Tunka'lo in Storm Peaks.", "Elder Ohanzee is located in Gundrak.", "Elder Skywarden can be found near Agmar's Hammer in Dragonblight.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?" },
	["门卫艾恩多尔"] = { "There is nothing to see here. Move along.", "This does not concern you. Be on your way." },
	["间谍大师萨罗迪恩"] = { "For years I was convinced we were doing the right thing in Silvermoon - working to reach Outland so we could be reunited with Kael. Had I known what Kael'thas had in store for us, I would've stayed right in Falconwing Square." },
	["间谍格利克萨"] = { "$C, hold your attack, this is just a disguise! I'm a spy working for the Lower City coalition out of Shattrath City. I hope you're here to help!" },
	["防御者墨尔顿"] = { "Tread carefully, $r. These corpses here are all that remain of my best men." },
	["阴暗刽子手"] = { "<He leans in closer.> Just between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights. You know what I mean?", "<She leans in closer.> Just between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights. You know what I mean?", "Did you hear that they lost total control of Murmur in the Shadow Labyrinth?!", "Hey there, you must be the new recruit! Good to meet you! Any word from the Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun on whether we've regained control of Murmur yet?", "I hope this place pans out as a forward base for Shadow Council operations. I know it sounds weird, but I kind of miss the Shadow Labyrinth.", "I joined up because they said they'd pay my way into the academy. My uncle says that I can go next season!", "If you're interested, a couple of us are going into Shattrath for drinks later.", "Interested in joining up for the leather ball league? We play Monday through Wednesday, mostly. You're welcome to join us after this shift. We're going to toss it around.", "They don't pay us enough for this. But this ruined village sure beats skulking around inside of Auchindoun." },
	["阴暗劳工"] = { "What's it look like I'm doing? I'm fixing the place up - all on my own I might add - so that we can move in! With a base of operations out here in the forest, it'll be easier to keep track of what Shattrath, Allerian, Stonebreaker and the Cenarion druids are all up to. Our base in Auchindoun is just too inconvenient for that. Wait a minute, do I know you?", "Yeah, what do you want? Can't you see I'm busy here? The Shadow Council isn't paying me by the hour!" },
	["阴暗召唤者"] = { "<He leans in closer.> Just between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights. You know what I mean?", "<She leans in closer.> Just between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights. You know what I mean?", "Did you hear that they lost total control of Murmur in the Shadow Labyrinth?!", "Hey there, you must be the new recruit! Good to meet you! Any word from the Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun on whether we've regained control of Murmur yet?", "I hope this place pans out as a forward base for Shadow Council operations. I know it sounds weird, but I kind of miss the Shadow Labyrinth.", "I joined up because they said they'd pay my way into the academy. My uncle says that I can go next season!", "If you're interested, a couple of us are going into Shattrath for drinks later.", "Interested in joining up for the leather ball league? We play Monday through Wednesday, mostly. You're welcome to join us after this shift. We're going to toss it around.", "They don't pay us enough for this. But this ruined village sure beats skulking around inside of Auchindoun." },
	["阴暗新兵"] = { "Practicing! Soon I'll be good enough to join the other summoners and take my turn inside the Shadow Labyrinth at Auchindoun. I hope that I'll get the chance to summon something big! Maybe something as big as Murmur, though I wouldn't lose control of him!", "Yes? Darn it all, now I'll have to start over from scratch!" },
	["阴暗顾问"] = { "And what is it exactly that you think I can do for you? Can't you see that I'm very busy here discussing matters of import with our illustrious leader? Be quick about your business or I'll have you beaten, dog!", "Well, I was just giving our leader here a progress report on how everything is proceeding according to plan. It should only be a few more weeks and we'll have this place back in shape. We may want the Shadow Council to only staff the village with orcs, however. That way we can make an ancestral claim and work undercover. Wait a minute. Do I know you? What's your name?" },
	["阴沉的利亚森"] = { "There exist in Outland demonic presences much more powerful than anything we'd ever seen in the old world. Great power shall come to those who do not shy away from it, but learn to harness and master its strength." },
	["阿亚娜·远途"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c." },
	["阿克莱德"] = { "Be warned, mortal, it is exceptionally rare that one of the lesser clans in this citadel would hold such an item. Your search could take decades. I recommend you destroy these beasts without impunity.", "Before his banishment, Deathwing was attempting to create impure offspring. Half breeds that would not only be immune to the innate natural powers and abilities of their Aspects but also under the complete control of Deathwing. It seems that where his father failed, Nefarian may have succeeded - at least partially. It was Ysera, Aspect of Dreams, who saw the abominations and forced us to act. If these 'Chromatic' dragonkin exist, they must be destroyed.", "Deathwing, or Neltharion as he was once known, was the Aspect that embodied the strength of the world - granted almost limitless power over this mortal realm by the Titan shaper known as Khaz'goroth: Forger of the world. Through treachery and deceit, the foul one convinced the four other Aspects to imbue an item, known as the Demon Soul, with their powers - greatly weakening them, forcing a division among the once great Aspects.", "In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r. The onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw. Through it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world.", "Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz. <Vaelan laughs.> Shall I continue?", "Indeed. The item was ultimately destroyed and Deathwing nearly slain by the combined and renewed power of the four remaining Aspects. Where Deathwing is now is unknown. What we do know, however, is that one of his progeny, Nefarian, rules this citadel and wishes to continue where his father left off.", "It is not our way, nor would it be possible. Nefarian is guarded by ancient wards, as old as the Aspects themselves. It is what prevents me from entering the inner sanctum of this citadel. The dark magic prevents any of the other flight to enter without being ordained... unless.", "It is possible for one, not of dragon kind, to obtain the Adorned Seal of Ascension and pass through the protected barrier. While possession of such an item would surely destroy me, perhaps you could utilize it and lower the barrier.", "Perhaps I should tell you why I am here. Do you know of the Aspect, Deathwing? Or of his progeny, Nefarian and Onyxia?", "You must find one amongst the wretch in the lower portion of this citadel that has attained an Unadorned Seal of Ascension. It is a great honor for one of the lesser beings to obtain this item, as it is the first step in gaining access to the upper citadel and becoming one of Nefarian's elite guardsmen - the Blackhand legion. Find such an item and return it to me so that I may examine its properties. I will know how to proceed once my inspection of the seal is complete." },
	["阿兹米"] = { "Well met, I'm Azimi! I often make the walk out here to sell the men fresh fruit and water. Are you hungry, or perhaps thirsty?" },
	["阿兹雷比"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿努尼克"] = { "Many changes come to the land and water: you, them... much change. Kamagua's way of life is threatened by these changes. What will you do?" },
	["阿勒瑞克·霍克金斯"] = { "While Varimathras is, uh... away, I've been assigned to assist Captain Bragor in his duties." },
	["阿卡玛"] = { "To many of my people I am known as a traitor... as Illidan's lapdog. It is best that they continue to think that for now." },
	["阿历克斯顿·克罗姆"] = { "Can I offer you a drink? I promise you its aged like none other!", "Rest your weary feet, we have all the time in the world...", "Welcome to the Taverns of Time!" },
	["阿古塔斯·莫莱恩"] = { "May the light guide your path and aid you in your journeys. If you need any assistance browsing, I will be right over here." },
	["阿基巴德"] = { "Both Hanashi and Sayoc can train you in the use of one and two-handed axes. They can be found in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar.", "Fist weapons are taught by Sayoc, the orc weapon master in Orgrimmar. He spends his days in the Valley of Honor.", "I suppose you are here to be trained in the use of a new weapon? Make it fast, I'm very busy!", "I'll tell you where to go, provided you tell me what interests you.", "Maces are taught by Ansekhwa, found on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Our gunnery instructor is Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "Sayoc and Hanashi, Orgrimmar's weapon masters, are true artisans of the thrown weapon. They train willing students in the Valley of Honor. For pure finesse in the art, however, Ileda of Silvermoon's Farstrider Square cannot be beaten.", "Staves are taught by Hanashi, the troll weapon master in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, and Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master who trains on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.", "The weapon masters in the Valley of Honor within Orgrimmar, Sayoc and Hanashi, can teach you how to shoot a bow. Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon found in Farstrider Square, is also an expert." },
	["阿奎欧斯"] = { "Greetings, young shaman. Make yourself at home within my reef.", "Together we will deal with this corruption of the water." },
	["阿姆伯尔"] = { "If you're looking for information that the Cenarion Circle might have archived somewhere, then I'm the one to talk to. Then again, you need to know what information you're looking for first before I can really help you. See how that works? Brilliant!" },
	["阿娜索丝"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿尔德恩·河风"] = { "It's a testament to our race's tenacity that Fairbreeze Village still stands. We shall never concede defeat to the Scourge ever again." },
	["阿尔提·灰手"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿尔泰德"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿尔索恩·风歌"] = { "Welcome to the Evergrove, $c. Timeon and I have been studying the arakkoa of Blade's Edge for some time now, and we've found some alarming differences between them and their cousins in Terokkar." },
	["阿尔萨斯"] = { "Gather your senses quickly, we must press on.", "This isn't getting any easier. Stratholme is burning. We must brave the Scourge and the flames to reach Mal'Ganis. Prepare yourselves." },
	["阿弗拉沙斯塔兹"] = { "Queen Alexstrasza has placed me in charge of the defense of Wyrmrest Temple. As you know, Malygos had his forces destroy a nearby ley line anchor. The forces of the dragonflight then redirected that power to the Azure Dragonshrine. The blue dragons are using that power to strengthen themselves; so much so that they dare attack the temple itself! They're starting to win. Are you here to help us, $r?" },
	["阿彻鲁斯"] = { "I am Achelus, chief expeditionary officer of Blood Watch." },
	["阿德温·凯伦"] = { "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.", "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise." },
	["阿扎尔·战锤"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid." },
	["阿托尔的灵魂"] = { "I... died. Why am I still here? Is there no great hunting ground that I ascend to? No... I must first complete my task. Before I can leave this world, the second part of the Cipher of Damnation must be recovered." },
	["阿托尔，欧鲁诺克之子"] = { "Ar'tor's lifeless body remains suspended in mid-air by demonic magic. They take from him, even in death..." },
	["阿拉希护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["阿拉希护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["阿拉希盆地传送门"] = { "This is a portal to the Arathi Basin battleground." },
	["阿拉玛尔·格里姆"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further. Move along please.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["阿拉珊蒂丝·银空"] = { "\"Darnassae?\" The night elf druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her. Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles. She points at you and smiles once more. She finally motions several times down the path to the north. Perhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further up the road?", "I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant. The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently. All are a vital part of Felwood's ecosystem.", "There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them. I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me. You will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss.", "These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse! Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves. If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!" },
	["阿拉瑟尔"] = { "Do you wish to learn the blacksmithing profession or is there something else you wish to tell me?" },
	["阿拉索联军大使"] = { "While exploration in these new lands is no doubt important, you mustn't forsake Azeroth! We need you now more than ever in the fight against the Defilers. Those resources must be secured!" },
	["阿拉辛"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿文纳萨"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿斯佳莉"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿斯图"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["阿斯坦娅"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["阿斯塔利·逐星"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $N?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["阿斯托·哈德恩"] = { "What do you want, $c? I'm running late, and my employer doesn't look kindly on tardiness.", "Yes, I am. What's it to you?" },
	["阿斯拉·瑞克斯"] = { "Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye'?" },
	["阿曼德·克伦威尔"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["阿曼萨加德"] = { "Are you certain? There is no turning back once I wipe the knowledge of the talents you have learned from your mind.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "We are what the cold wind carries. The icy chill of despair... The cold embrace of death..." },
	["阿曼蒂中尉"] = { "Greetings, $N. My fellow Sons of Lothar and I have been stuck on this miserable world for close to twenty years now. We held on as best we could, but it still amazes me that the threats we face today are just the shadows of our past failures. Perhaps you will help us atone for them?" },
	["阿格图·血拳"] = { "The days we've spent here in Azshara are not among our best and most glorious, but we are still young and blood still courses through our veins--we shall find victory here. It is only a matter of time." },
	["阿格玛大王"] = { "It is from this throne that I issue the command of Hellscream. His word is life and his word is death." },
	["阿泰卡"] = { "Cursed giant-men! If they want a fight, a fight they'll get!" },
	["阿瑞苟斯"] = { "The world is indebted to you and your allies, $N." },
	["阿米什·蛮锤"] = { "By Muradin's beard, $c. This land is on the brink of annihilation. I cannot imagine anyone survived here since the end of the second war." },
	["阿米尔雅·风心"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["阿米希尔·迷雾行者"] = { "The extent of the corruption in Outland is truly astonishing, $c. The Cenarion Circle hopes to understand how these creatures have managed to survive. Studying this broken, tortured land and its inhabitants may yet teach us how to heal ailing parts of our own world." },
	["阿纳克洛斯"] = { "It is we who must make the first strike. We cannot be allowed to repeat the mistakes of the past..." },
	["阿纳斯上尉"] = { "This post is secure, $r. The enemy has been cleared from the area for some time now." },
	["阿莱克"] = { "What are you staring at, $r?" },
	["阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者"] = { "Greetings, my $r friend. You honor me with your presence. How may I help you?", "Only time will tell..." },
	["阿萨纳"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["阿诺克"] = { "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall." },
	["阿诺德·利兰"] = { "Welcome to Stormwind. Took a long time to rebuild her but it was well worth it. So are you visiting, or are you here on business?" },
	["阿达尔"] = { "<A soothing light fills you as you approach the naaru. Slow musical chimes echo within your mind and, though a word is not uttered, you feel an assurance of safety. You are welcome in Shattrath City.>" },
	["阿里森·迪维"] = { "Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?", "You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["阿雷亚斯塔·刃歌"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?", "Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?", "I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child. I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["阿雷贡"] = { "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!", "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts. To better yourself you will need to seek him out.", "I can teach you how to cook!", "Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge. She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\"." },
	["附魔师安蒂亚拉"] = { "I can instruct you in enchanting. Interested?" },
	["除草者格林萨姆"] = { "Here lie the remains of Weeder Greenthumb, one of Watcher Jhang's druid companions. By all appearances he was killed quick and clean while trying to make his escape from the Slave Pens." },
	["陶拉努克宗母"] = { "I'm very busy right now, $r. Please leave me alone." },
	["随从托克"] = { "Greetings, $N. This is the workshop of Keeper Mimir." },
	["隐士奥泰尔"] = { "Leave at once, stranger! I have no business with you.", "You're back already! What can I do for you now?" },
	["雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅"] = { "Glory to Stormwind and King Wrynn!" },
	["雅尔拉"] = { "The Exodar's vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here.", "We control access to the Exodar's storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?" },
	["雅文·刺鬃"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I do not have the knowledge you seek.", "Tauren have a passion for hunting; it is something that runs deep with our kind.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["雇佣兵亚兹尔"] = { "You look familiar..." },
	["雪冠长者"] = { "Elder Farwhisper can be found wandering the streets of Stratholme.", "Elder Graveborn spends time near Brill in Tirisfal Glades.", "Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.", "Elder Windrun resides in the Crown Guard Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["雪峰长者"] = { "Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["雷克斯·皮希姆"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["雷克萨"] = { "The search for my people. Our struggle against the Alliance. The war with the ogres and their gronn masters. All of these things weigh heavy upon my shoulders, $c. Even I can use some help from time to time." },
	["雷兹拉克"] = { "Try to ignore the firm, feathery behinds of the harpies... the creatures are really quite deadly!" },
	["雷加希"] = { "Horrible... just horrible! We were minding our own business on our way from Area 52 in Netherstorm and they shot us down! I knew we shouldn't have taken that shortcut to get to Terokkar Forest!" },
	["雷加纳德·弧炎"] = { "Good day, $N. If you require my services as an auctioneer, I regret to inform you: no. Only grand master engineers possess the minimum intellectual capacity to interface with my superior functions. More importantly, why are you still talking to me?" },
	["雷吼长者"] = { "Elder Pamuya is just outside Warsong Hold.", "Last I heard, Elder Sardis was venturing to Valiance Keep.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["雷安诺·戴维斯"] = { "Tailoring can come in very handy. I once had to sew my arm back on." },
	["雷布拉特·碎地者"] = { "Can you hear it, $c? The elements cry out that this land is almost dead. The Drakkari are stealing the power of their gods by killing them just to defend themselves against the Scourge. They are short-sighted and will be their own undoing in the end.", "I've been expec... <Rimblat coughs.> Excuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring." },
	["雷布里·斯库比格特"] = { "Hello! You're just the person I was looking for. Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!" },
	["雷布里的亲信"] = { "I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale. Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?", "I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale. Oh, you're not the waiter?", "I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale. Oh, you're not the waitress?", "You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?", "You looking at me, laddy?", "You looking at me, lassy?" },
	["雷恩·米克基尔"] = { "Thank the Light the Defias don't know the first thing about diving!" },
	["雷戈·水炉"] = { "With some of the technology that was recovered by bold gnomes venturing into Gnomeregan, I have managed to construct my greatest invention: The Matter Transporter! All I need now is a skilled Gnomish Engineer to build a powerful beacon attuned to the transporter." },
	["雷戈萨·死门"] = { "We have our duties, $c. Duties to the Horde." },
	["雷格努斯·雷石"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Wot kin I do fer ye?" },
	["雷格菲兹"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["雷沃·霜翼"] = { "Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way. My name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts. These cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one. I will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves." },
	["雷眉长者"] = { "Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind.", "Elder Rumblerock passes the years in a cave atop Dreadmaul Rock in the Burning Steppes.", "Elder Skychaser looks out over Westfall from atop Sentinel Hill.", "Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["雷矛大使"] = { "$N, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever. The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?" },
	["雷米勒"] = { "I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?" },
	["雷纳·石枝"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["雷纳多·加林纳"] = { "Hey, $gmister:miss;. You look like a $C with discerning tastes in wine. I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can't refuse...forget about it!", "Hey, miss. You look like a $C with discerning tastes in wine. I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can't refuse...forget about it!", "Hey, mister. You look like a $C with discerning tastes in wine. I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can't refuse...forget about it!" },
	["雷耶克"] = { "One day, Rejek be mighty warrior." },
	["雷菲克"] = { "You have reached the limits of my knowledge, but there is more yet to learn. Across the sea, in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind City, a great tailor dwells. His name is Georgio Bolero, and he will train you now, I think. Go and speak with him." },
	["雷萨安"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["雷角长者"] = { "Elder Dreamseer resides in Gadgetzan in Tanaris Desert.", "Elder Primestone has spent many years in the Crystal Vale in Silithus.", "Elder Ragetotem spends her days at the Valley of the Watchers in Tanaris Desert.", "If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Zul'Farrak in Tanaris Desert is Elder Wildmane's home." },
	["雷酒学徒"] = { "We Thunderbrews take pride knowing that we are the best brewhouse in all the realms." },
	["雷锤长者"] = { "Elder Bladeswift wanders the paths of Darnassus atop Teldrassil.", "Elder Bronzebeard can be found in the ancestral home of the Bronzebeards, Ironforge.", "Elder Rumblerock passes the years in a cave atop Dreadmaul Rock in the Burning Steppes.", "Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["雷霆崖信使斯塔德尔"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["雷霆崖冠军"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["雷霆崖勇士"] = { "Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?", "Are you sure you are ready to fight me?", "It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?", "You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge." },
	["雷霆崖守卫"] = { "A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force. Krumn will help you to achieve this. You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts.", "A follower of the arcane are you? Hmph! Very well then... you can find them around the Pools of Vision underneath the Spirit Rise.", "Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky. Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost. He will steer you toward where you're going.", "Ah, you seek the wisdom of Ansekhwa. Look for him on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Weapons.", "Ahh, you will need to make your way over to the Hunter's Hall then. Several great hunters like Holt Thunderhorn can be found there on the Hunter Rise.", "Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine. The Hunter's Hall is what you seek. It sits atop the Hunter Rise.", "Aspiring to join our ranks one day? Sark Ragetotem can help you on your way. He's in the Hunter's Hall.", "Brek Stonehoof can be found at Stonehoof Geology on the lower rise and can teach you the proper way to harvest precious ores and gems.", "Check out Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise then. Teg will be more than happy to help you in whatever way he can.", "Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other. You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers. She has a natural way with the needle.", "Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us. I only hope that we can be as helpful to them. Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.", "Don't blame you for taking up fishing. Mulgore has some the best fishing spots in Southern Kalimdor and Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise has all of the gear you'll need to take advantage of it. Tell Kah Mistrunner that I sent ya!", "Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother. Mooranta can show you the way. Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.", "Father Cobb will be the one you want to talk to. He can be found under the Spirit Rise in the Pools of Vision cave.", "First Aid is always a nice skill to have. Many a time during battle has it saved my hide. Visit Spiritual Healing on the Spirit Rise. Pand Stonebinder can teach you all you need to know to save your hide as well.", "Go see Una at Thunder Bluff Armorers then. It can be found on the middle rise.", "Go to the Hunter Rise. You will find the battlemasters there.", "Greetings honored one. Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise.", "I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago. You'll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.", "Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit. You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise.", "It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff. Search near the bank. It is not far from there.", "It is the assistance of Bulrug that you need. You will find him outside on the lower rise standing between the inn and the Thunder Bluff Bank.", "Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal.", "Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism is the one you want to talk to then. He can be found on the middle rise.", "Krumn is the bull you are looking for. He can be found on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Civic Information.", "Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true. Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages. Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid.", "Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.", "Looking to learn how to work an anvil and hammer, eh? Karn Stonehoof can teach you how. He has a smithy set up on the lower rise by the pond.", "Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature. Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise. Seek out his wisdom.", "Mooranta can help you learn skinning. She can be found just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.", "Nature provides all that we need. Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise.", "Seek out Poshken Hardbinder in The Pools of Vision, below the Spirit Rise.", "Seek out Turak Runetotem in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise.", "Strong of body and spirit. There can be no stronger combination! Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter's Hall.", "Tepa is renown for her clothwork. She can be found at Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.", "The Earth Mother calls and you answer. You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise.", "The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them. You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology.", "The Hall of Spirits is where our shamans call home. You can find it on the Spirit Rise. May your ancestors watch over you.", "The Thunder Bluff Bank can be found on the lower rise.", "The Wind Rider Roost is atop the totem stairway in the center of town.", "The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff. Search near the bottom of the Windrider's Tower. May your ancestors watch over you.", "The concern that you show for the welfare of your animal companions is commendable. Bulrug, on the lower rise, can help you with that. Seek him out between the bank and the inn.", "The herbs found in nature can be a powerful ally when combined with respect. You will want to seek out Bena at her alchemy shop on the middle rise to further your training.", "The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature. Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how.", "Then head over to Bena's Alchemy on the middle rise and talk to Bena herself. She will be able to help you master the art of potion brewing.", "There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner. Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here. Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise. Drat... now I am hungry.", "Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls. You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.", "What are you looking for?", "Which profession?", "Which trainer do you seek?", "You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.", "You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste. Aska Mistrunner will show you how. She has a kitchen on the high rise.", "You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.", "You'll find Krendle Bigpockets near the zeppelin's perch on the western edge of Spirit Rise. I'm not fond of the goblin contraption flying through here... but it will take you to Orgrimmar if you can stand it." },
	["雷霆崖狂欢者"] = { "Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...", "I don't know how these fireworks work, but they sure are pretty!", "I love the Lunar Festival! It's a great place to let your hooves kick up dust!", "This moonlight will take you to Thunder Bluff. Use it when you want to leave the festival." },
	["霍勒"] = { "'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!", "Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!", "Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.", "Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!", "Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!", "Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!", "If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!", "Season's savings to you and yours!" },
	["霍卢斯"] = { "You no make dis your home. Maybe you want eat someting?" },
	["霍夫丹·黑须"] = { "Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "He grows fatter and more corrupt with each passing day. Ye can smell the stink comin' off o' his body. He be dirty, an' I dun just mean he be needin' a wash. Enough babblin' from Hulfdan. Where did ye come from and how can me help ye, $c?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["霍尔伦克"] = { "Drakes is my business, $N. I'm authorized to sell them to our highest ranking officers." },
	["霍巴肯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits." },
	["霍拉斯·奥德尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Hrm? Oh. Pardon me if I seem distracted; I fear for the men of Northwatch. I should have sent some of my students to aid them. Now, how may I help you?", "Hrm? Oh. Pardon me if I seem distracted; I fear for the men of Northwatch. I should have sent some of my students to aid them...", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["霍拉鲁"] = { "Hello, $c. I am what is referred to as one of the Broken. Like the Lost Ones, though not as badly as they, we were afflicted with fel energies that transformed us from our original draenei forms." },
	["霍格拉尔·巴坎"] = { "Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["霍纳克·格里莫德"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["霍纳斯"] = { "Chu'a'lor's been saying good things about you, $N. If you want, we have a couple of special ogre brews for sale. They're really tasty!", "What can we say, $N? $G Dude : Dudette;, anything that we have in the store is yours to purchase! Right on!", "What can we say, $N? Dude, anything that we have in the store is yours to purchase! Right on!", "What can we say, $N? Dudette, anything that we have in the store is yours to purchase! Right on!", "You having a good time here with us in Ogri'la? We have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night. We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you! So, as you're out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have. Good luck out there, $g man : chicky;.", "You having a good time here with us in Ogri'la? We have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night. We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you! So, as you're out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have. Good luck out there, chicky.", "You having a good time here with us in Ogri'la? We have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night. We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you! So, as you're out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have. Good luck out there, man.", "You're like something of a revered figure around here, $g man : kitten;. Seems like everyone's talking about you. That's cool. Let's see if there's something in stock that you're interested in. We have a lot of nice stuff.", "You're like something of a revered figure around here, kitten. Seems like everyone's talking about you. That's cool. Let's see if there's something in stock that you're interested in. We have a lot of nice stuff.", "You're like something of a revered figure around here, man. Seems like everyone's talking about you. That's cool. Let's see if there's something in stock that you're interested in. We have a lot of nice stuff." },
	["霍莱伊·马绍尔"] = { "Oh, hello there! I'm Hol'anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions. My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty. It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!" },
	["霜狼兽栏管理员"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["霜狼大使"] = { "Strength and honor, $c. We need eager soldiers like you in Alterac Valley; the territory of the Frostwolves must be defended! Will you return to Azeroth and lend your aid?", "You need to be stronger, $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley." },
	["霜脉斥候"] = { "<The Frostborn Scout attempts to rise to his feet as you approach, but stumbles back to the ground, clenching an obviously painful wound in his side.>", "A pack of harpies came up from the valley. A big one named Sirana led them... I didn't have anywhere to escape. They haven't been this aggressive for a long time... I didn't expect it... I let my guard down... it's my own fault.", "I don't think that's going to happen, $G lad:lass;. I've lost a lot of blood... there's no way I'm making it back.", "I don't think that's going to happen, lad. I've lost a lot of blood... there's no way I'm making it back.", "I don't think that's going to happen, lass. I've lost a lot of blood... there's no way I'm making it back.", "It's a little late... for that... $G lad:lass;. <The Frostborn Scout coughs up some blood on the snow.> Get... that wench in charge for me... <The Frostborn Scout slumps over as he breathes his last breath.>", "It's a little late... for that... lad. <The Frostborn Scout coughs up some blood on the snow.> Get... that wench in charge for me... <The Frostborn Scout slumps over as he breathes his last breath.>", "It's a little late... for that... lass. <The Frostborn Scout coughs up some blood on the snow.> Get... that wench in charge for me... <The Frostborn Scout slumps over as he breathes his last breath.>" },
	["韩迪尔"] = { "Ah, you wish to train abroad? I will direct you. Tell me which weapon has sparked your interest.", "Both Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace of Darnassus and Bixi Wobblebonk of the Timberline Arms in Ironforge can show you how to use throwing weapons properly.", "If you seek training in weapons, I can provide.", "Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, or Buliwyf, the dwarf weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, can train you in the use of fist weapons.", "Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can train you in the use of bows.", "Staves are taught by both Woo Ping, the master found at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, and Ilyenia Moonfire, who trains the night elves on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus.", "The dwarven weapon master Buliwyf can train you in both one and two-handed axes. He's found in the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.", "The man to talk to about gunnery is Buliwyf, found in the Timberline Arms within Ironforge.", "Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind." },
	["韩里尔"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["顽皮的米恩兹"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["顾问瓦尔文"] = { "If it is a matter of import that you wish to speak on, $c, it may be more appropriate to seek an audience with Dame Auriferous. I warn you though, she is very busy and you may be in for quite a wait." },
	["顾问索雷伦"] = { "It is so good to see you, $g brother : sister;! This place gives me the creeps. While you're here, be sure to avail yourself of the many opportunities that these so-called Forsaken are providing.", "It is so good to see you, brother! This place gives me the creeps. While you're here, be sure to avail yourself of the many opportunities that these so-called Forsaken are providing.", "It is so good to see you, sister! This place gives me the creeps. While you're here, be sure to avail yourself of the many opportunities that these so-called Forsaken are providing.", "Well met, $r. I am here as a resource of advice for the High Executor to make use of as he will. I am confident that together we can forge the Horde into something that is even stronger than before and turn back the Scourge menace once and for all!" },
	["顾问菲埃拉"] = { "I must have made a misstep somewhere to be assigned here." },
	["顾问萨苏恩·誓日"] = { "Hello. I trust that this day finds you well?", "It's so good to see another sin'dorei $g brother : sister;! As you can imagine, there's not much in the way of conversation around here.", "It's so good to see another sin'dorei brother! As you can imagine, there's not much in the way of conversation around here.", "It's so good to see another sin'dorei sister! As you can imagine, there's not much in the way of conversation around here." },
	["顾问达斯多恩"] = { "Just remember, $N, it's in our best interests that you do as much as possible for these... these people." },
	["预言者努波顿"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Greetings, $r.", "I had been fortunate to find an oasis and made the decision to stay there until I received an answer. So there I sat, moving only when absolutely necessary, living off of the creatures that would come near the pool. Such was my pride. As I said, decades passed without an answer. But I can remember a particularly beautiful sunset one evening. A warm zephyr blew across the land and I was sure that I heard a voice, but no one was around. As you can imagine, I thought that I was finally losing my mind.", "I returned to my people and was greeted with smiling faces and outstretched arms, mostly from the Broken. The prejudices against us from many draenei had continued in my absence. But it was as if they knew that I was coming, and I soon found out why. Velen, the prophet and leader of all of the draenei, had seen my return in one of his visions and was there to greet me as well. He asked to speak with me in private and as I related my story to him, he nodded and smiled, for this too he had foreseen.", "It is a good day to be alive and one with the elements.", "It spoke to me of secrets and power, and also of truths. The Light had not forsaken the Broken! The fel energies that the orcs had wielded long ago against the draenei had infused us, causing a break in our ability to be heard by, or perhaps to hear, the Light. The same that had been responsible for the degradation of our bodies. But our spirits were not broken, and the air offered to me another path, through which I might deliver my people.", "It taught me the path of shamanism, which in a way is just another facet of the Light. Joining the wind was the water of the oasis, the fire from my camp and the earth upon which I sat. All had something to say. Over the next few years they taught me what it was to call upon and be one with the elements of the world. And they told me that the worlds of all of the stars in the sky, even this one, are made up of these elements. But the day came when I felt that I had learned enough to leave.", "My story? It is kind of you to ask. Very well. Long ago on the planet Draenor - the remains of which are now known as the Outland - all of the draenei lived in peace. But then the Burning Legion came, and they corrupted the orcs with their fel magics. With no other option we fought to survive, but exposure to these fel energies had horrible effects upon some of us, over time transforming us into the Broken like me, or worse, the seemingly mindless Lost Ones. Shall I go on?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The fel energies also had the side-effect on the Broken and the Lost Ones of cutting us off from the Light. At the time I did not know exactly why, but as a vindicator I insisted on finding out. I decided to make a pilgrimage to do just that. And so it was that after the war came to its fateful end, I journeyed into the desert of the fragmented planet, beseeching the Light to return to us. But decades passed, and the Light never answered my prayers. Is this something that you wish to hear more of?", "There was something strange about that wind; it didn't stop. For weeks it blew across the land, waxing and waning, but never ceasing. And all the time the voice continued, though I could not understand it, nor did I know where it was coming from. My time in solitude had taught me how to calm myself and look inward. This I did in order to keep my sanity. And that is when I began to understand the voice. It was coming from the wind itself and it had much to say!", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Velen urged me to take a leadership role amongst the Broken. But more importantly, he asked me to teach shamanism to all; Broken and draenei alike. I accepted. We knew then that given the prejudices of some that this would be a difficult proposition at best. There are those that despise the Broken because we are a frightening reminder of the past. And there are others who believe the way of the shaman to be a blasphemy against the Light. In any case, that is my tale." },
	["预言者巴萨扎德"] = { "Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration." },
	["领航员兰德尔森"] = { "Sorry, but we'll have to speak some other time. Farewell." },
	["领航员哈奇"] = { "The captain's great! We get time to relax when we dock. Those are the times I look forward to the most." },
	["领航员斯巴希斯"] = { "Not right now, $gpal:sugar;... I got things to do. See ya around.", "Not right now, pal... I got things to do. See ya around.", "Not right now, sugar... I got things to do. See ya around." },
	["领航员梅拉"] = { "I've little time for talk, sorry." },
	["领航员泽匹克"] = { "I'm going deaf. That big green harpy won't shut up for five seconds. I know how to drive this thing, all right? I'm not an idiot!" },
	["领航员菲尔维兹"] = { "You can't blame me for our mishaps... I can't even see where I'm going! Though maybe that means you can blame me... No! Wait! I can dock this ship just fine... It's gotta be the orders the captain issues! Maybe he likes pushing us to our limits and testing out our survival and repair skills." },
	["风之先知希尔·灰角"] = { "The natural beauty of these hills belies a great darkness below. Tread carefully, friend." },
	["风之图腾长者"] = { "Elder Bloodhoof can be found at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.", "Elder Darkhorn can be found among the red rocks of Orgrimmar.", "Elder High Mountain is at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.", "Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens.", "Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.", "Elder Wheathoof is enjoying the vistas above Mulgore at Thunder Bluff.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar." },
	["风怒长者"] = { "Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["风暴之眼传送门"] = { "This is a portal to the Eye of the Storm battleground.", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["风暴之眼使者"] = { "Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?", "The mana cells within the Eye of the Storm are a precious thing; we cannot afford to lose them to the draenei! You there! Make yourself useful and aid us in the fight!", "You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["风暴峭壁护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["风暴峭壁护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["风路长者"] = { "Elder Farwhisper can be found wandering the streets of Stratholme.", "Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.", "Elder Snowcrown can be found in Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.", "I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.", "The Stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages." },
	["飞艇管理员萨匹塔"] = { "My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn't tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn't die weeks before it stopped moving." },
	["飞行员玛沙"] = { "We wouldn't have crashed if Hemet could learn how to avoid shooting through the ailerons when he's trying to bag game on the ground! No worries though, I'll have her fixed up quick enough." },
	["飞行员维克"] = { "I know an ace when I see one. Thanks again for saving my life!", "Nice day for flying, isn't it?" },
	["飞行管理员加尼斯·日翼"] = { "No greater freedom than to soar through the skies, $c. What can I do for you today?" },
	["飞行管理员玛克索"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["食焰大师"] = { "Behold, the Flames of Summer!", "Careful, don't get burned!", "Enjoying the Fire Festival?" },
	["食焰者"] = { "Behold, the Flames of Summer!", "Careful, don't get burned!", "Enjoying the Fire Festival?" },
	["首席工兵布拉斯特菲兹"] = { "Radiation?! No, you don't need to worry about that! Sheesh, the things that people believe these days. So, what do you think of our operations down here? State of the art, baby! You better believe it." },
	["首席技师波尔维克"] = { "Got somethin' that needs tightening, $r?" },
	["首席技师考伯克拉"] = { "The secret to goblin engineering has nothing to do with keeping things from exploding. It has everything to do with directing the explosions exactly where you want them." },
	["首席抄写员巴里加"] = { "I think I saw them take him over by the north side of the abbey, near the archery targets.", "I think he's on the south side of the abbey.", "I think they have her down near the gallows.", "Oh good, you're here to rescue me. Now let me out of here!" },
	["首席药剂师哈瑞斯"] = { "We plaguebringers tend to be slightly more practical than the average apothecary. After all, we deal with the logistics of deploying the plague. That doesn't mean our theoretical background isn't rock solid. We just prefer... hands on tasks." },
	["首席药剂师米德尔顿"] = { "We will ravage the living... I mean the Scourge, of course." },
	["马丁·林塞"] = { "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin." },
	["马丁·费尔本"] = { "Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $N, for I know human weaknesses intimately." },
	["马修·胡柏"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["马克"] = { "<sniff's himself, and winces> That there be the smell of adventure, $c!", "Agreed. Budd's scraped together rif-raf from all over creation. Seems when there's free booze to be had, there be plenty of folk willin' to set aside their differences.", "Aye, ya never know who's gunna join next, or who be dyin' next for that matter. My advice? Don't be gettin' too attached to anyone.", "Beats me, kid. I'm new to the crew. I've had my fill of troll-killin' and grog drinkin, I can tell ya that. Only thing left to see is the treasure Budd keeps promisin'...", "Budd's crew, ye mean? Aye, he be no respecter of persons. He'll take on anyone who can work a shovel. 'cept them undead. Budd hates 'em. Scared of 'em, likely as not.", "Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me.", "What can a guy like me be doin' for a $r like you at a time like this?" },
	["马克·菲尔森"] = { "G'day mate! Sit an' have yerself a sip, won't yeh?" },
	["马克·迪沃"] = { "Say, you happen to see that arch in the lake to the west? I wonder where that goes? I should go divin\" over there." },
	["马克希米林"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c.", "It is wise that you humble yourself before me $N in your desire for more warlock knowledge.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["马克萨恩·安沃尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I hope the Light is with you, $N. Is there anything I can do for you today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["马卡鲁"] = { "I can instruct you in mining. Interested?" },
	["马哈尼"] = { "Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?" },
	["马尔什医生"] = { "With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won't be too soon." },
	["马尔罗什"] = { "Are you here for training? Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time.", "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind, $c. Find your own trainer before you anger me.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["马尔萨·奥列斯塔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["马拉凯·克罗斯"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?" },
	["马斯托克·维尔西斯"] = { "If you want to know about the comings and goings of caravans and merchants here in Splintertree Post, then I am fortunately the orc you are looking for. Unfortunately for you though, I don't like people. If you want something, make it quick." },
	["马杜克·布莱克波尔"] = { "I sense a disturbance, lurking around you...", "You don't look like a student...", "Your future is clouded. Concentrate, and ask again.", "Your mind is unfocused. Are you hiding something from me?" },
	["马杜克镇长"] = { "Some were spared the anguish that memories provide." },
	["马林·诺格弗格"] = { "Living out here in the desert is rough! I get so thirsty standing outside in this heat.", "Well, now that you mention it, yeah, I did see something I thought was a little strange yesterday afternoon! I was running past some old troll ruins southeast of here; well, I wasn't really running, more like hopping... The sand's so hot! Anyway, so I was hopping past the ruins, when I noticed a camp set up there. Seems like a funny place to set up camp, if you ask me... I would have poked around a little more but one of those crazy big vultures chased me off." },
	["马格兰"] = { "I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain." },
	["马瑞斯·格兰治"] = { "Do I look like I have the time or energy to coddle every tourist that wanders through my door? Tell me what you need, and make it quick." },
	["马童霍拉提奥"] = { "When I grow up I want to be a stable man!" },
	["马迪亚斯·肖尔大师"] = { "Welcome to SI:7 headquarters, $N." },
	["马里恩·考尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it." },
	["马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤"] = { "Our caravans go out 'bout twice a day, but I'll be damned if the Scourge haven't gone out of their way to stop Didier and his mules from getting shipments to the front lines. Craziest thing I've ever seen. If only we had the heroic adventurin' types to help protect the shipments..." },
	["马雷克·铁心"] = { "Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it. You look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!", "Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it. You look up to the challenge, lad!", "Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it. You look up to the challenge, lass!", "You've become quite the hunter, $N! Not only have you proven your skills, you also bested Daryl, which gets you extra points in my book! You're welcome here any time." },
	["驭风者雅胡布"] = { "You come to learn how to ride?" },
	["驯兽者维里迪斯"] = { "Among ethereals, certain members deal specifically with flesh and beings of flesh. Those individuals are known as flesh handlers." },
	["驯鹰大师希达尔格"] = { "Greetings, $r. I am Hidalgo, master of the hunt and world class falconer. This killing machine that you see perched atop my shoulder is Excelsior. You might be thinking to yourself, \"What does a falconer even do?\" Well I'll tell you what we do - we hunt! Falconry is the art of using a bird of prey to hunt and catch game. Perhaps you are interested in learning to hunt with a trained raptor? Hidalgo can teach you such things!", "Welcome back, $N." },
	["驯鹰者德蕾娜·河风"] = { "Here's to hoping not all of Outland is as barren as this region. This is quite a change from the green grasslands and forests of Eversong." },
	["驯鹿梅森"] = { "'Ello, $c! Ya ready ta head on down to Venture Bay and crack some Horde skulls?", "Around this reindeer's neck is a tag with the Smokywood Pastures logo on it and a name - \"Metzen\". Metzen looks at you with sad, forlorn eyes. It is almost as if the reindeer has been immobilized by some unseen force.", "Metzen's eyes light up with reindeer joy as you sprinkle the dust on him. He shakes his antlers at you and breathes out a heavy sigh of what sounds like relief. Around you, magical energy begins to swell. It would seem that something's about to happen!" },
	["骑兵杜尔库"] = { "The dead rise from our very own crypt!", "What are you still doing here? Go back to town!", "You made it $g lad:lass;! I thought you were a goner for sure!", "You made it lad! I thought you were a goner for sure!", "You made it lass! I thought you were a goner for sure!" },
	["骑士队长德洛斯彻"] = { "Come to make yourself useful?" },
	["骑士防御者祖纳德"] = { "Hello, are you here to learn about the conflict in Bloodmyst?", "I am the leader of the Blood Watch defenses. What can I help you with?", "The Defenders are here to protect Blood Watch from the Sunhawk threat.", "The Defenders of Blood Watch protect this outpost from any threat.", "We serve the light unquestioningly. Perhaps you might be a bit more curious about our purpose?", "We've recently heard word of a creature of immense power being summoned near the Vector Coil. Fear not, should anything threaten the town, we will give our lives to protect it." },
	["骑士领主布拉德瓦罗"] = { "Welcome to the headquarters of the Blood Knights, the defenders of Quel'Thalas, the faithful servants of Silvermoon, and the true masters of the Light." },
	["骑手萨拉纳尔"] = { "Look at what you have done, death knight! You have brought glory to the Scourge!", "We will take everything from them, death knight." },
	["骨肠"] = { "Awww... look at da purty lil' gool. Jump, lil' gool! Jump! Ha, ha, ha... Attsa guud lil' gool." },
	["骷髅王克尔多"] = { "I have traveled far in search of a way to ultimately defeat the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin, but that loin-clothed lummox Adam Eternum hounds my every move. Still, if slayers such as you were to return to Azeroth, perhaps we could defeat the Alliance once and for all!", "Thank you for the offer, $c. Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin." },
	["高内克"] = { "The Valley of Trials will temper even the weakest into a warrior worthy to join the Horde. Those who cannot rise to its tests will be left to bake in the scorching desert sun." },
	["高尔博德·钢手"] = { "Greetings $g lad : lass;, if you're looking for the best deals you'll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you've come to the right place.", "Greetings lad, if you're looking for the best deals you'll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you've come to the right place.", "Greetings lass, if you're looking for the best deals you'll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you've come to the right place." },
	["高尔巴格"] = { "Mhrrumph rummrhum phurr!", "Mphmm rmphhimm rrhumghph?", "Rmmurphum mmph hmrphum!", "Umphrum mmphur, murruphru..." },
	["高尔特上尉"] = { "Do your part in keeping the Scourge at bay, soldier! Report all suspicious activity and kill first, ask questions later!" },
	["高尼尔·石趾"] = { "If you ask me, there's no greater profession than a miner. And if you ask me, there's no greater miner than a dwarf!" },
	["高山长者"] = { "Elder Bloodhoof can be found at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.", "Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens.", "Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.", "Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens.", "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor... Is it so different now?", "Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar." },
	["高德雷克"] = { "I honor my ancestors in the time-honored shamanistic tradition. We must never forget the sacrifices that they have made so that we can be here. And we, in turn, must make the necessary sacrifices so that our descendants will have a future. What brings you to me, $c?" },
	["高洛姆·沃法"] = { "You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience." },
	["高级执行官乌洛斯"] = { "Don't bother me with trifles!" },
	["高级执行官安希尔姆"] = { "I've been in the military my whole life. I've fought in many wars, under many banners - but they've always been other people's battles. Not this time. Every Forsaken soldier you see here has come for one reason alone. Arthas must be killed." },
	["高级执行官德灵顿"] = { "Welcome to the front lines, $c. While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they'll find no such luxury afforded to them here. This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here. If you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there." },
	["高级执行官玛尔伦"] = { "$R, report! What news of significance do you bring? Be quick about your business... Dame Auriferous and I are in the middle of a strategic discussion." },
	["高级执行官达萨利亚"] = { "You will speak when spoken to." },
	["高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特"] = { "Lives depend on the actions we take here. Be quick with what you have to say, $c." },
	["高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩"] = { "Through the valleys and peaks of Mount Hyjal, across the shifting sands of Silithus, against the Legion's dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see. We are 7th Legion." },
	["高级指挥官埃雷特"] = { "<The lord-commander fixes you with a stare before going on.> I was getting to that. Indeed, when High General Abbendis landed her forces on Northrend, she changed their name to the Scarlet Onslaught. It was not long before Admiral Barean Westwind presented himself to her at New Hearthglen in the Dragonblight. From all accounts, she wasn't expecting him. Nor was she expecting that he would undermine her authority and take the reins of command away from her. Likely you were involved with her demise, but no matter. Once she was dead, the admiral made a mysterious exit and we lost track of him.", "<The lord-commander flashes a rictus grin, looking you up and down discerningly.> That's what I wanted to hear.", "As I said, we lost track of him, but this is something that I'm sure you will be able to figure out for me. My suspicion is that he's down there somewhere, but my spies that have returned haven't been able to place him anywhere on the island. The Forsaken at Venomspite did a good job of sabotaging New Hearthglen, but the Onslaught forces that are present down there are the battle-hardened remnant from that place. Unfortunately, they picked up better equipment along the way, as well as gryphons taken from fools somewhere. What I'm trying to say is that this isn't going to be a stroll in the countryside, $N, even for you.", "Very well, but if I were you, I would pay attention and not just blindly nod my head at what I heard. It begins, as all good stories do, with betrayal. Oh, it's not that we were betrayed... not at all. The Lich King raised us death knights above all others. Rather, it was we who betrayed him with the help of Highlord Darion Mograine. In the final fight at Light's Hope Chapel in the Plaguelands, with the simpletons moments away from annihilation, Tirion Fordring helped Mograine break the Lich King's hold upon him and all of the rest of us that were present.", "With the Lich King fleeing in fear of Fordring armed with the Ashbringer, we were able to easily wrest Ebon Hold from the remaining Scourge forces. That didn't settle things between us and the Scarlet Crusade, however. As the Forsaken have learned the hard way, the Scarlets cannot seem to differentiate between us and the Scourge. We think on our own, we have our own motivations, we have almost all of the qualities of the living, and yet to them, we are no different than the mindless slaves of the Lich King. Mistakenly they think we will roll over and play dead.", "Yes, the Lich King will fall to our might. We will have our final revenge. But first, we will see to it that the plague known as the Scarlet Onslaught comes to an end once and for all!" },
	["高级监工玛德拉普"] = { "<Mudlump is polishing his boots.>" },
	["高贵的莫里乌斯"] = { "A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. The place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Alliance and Horde quarters, in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Adventurers turn in their Emblems of Heroism or Valor in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary.", "Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.", "Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave.", "Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters.", "Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers. There are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center.", "Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others. They can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran.", "Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel.", "Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need.", "If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types.", "Jepetto Joybuzz' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Jepetto Joybuzz's Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.", "Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran. The city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer.", "Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek.", "Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!", "Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran.", "Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger. Were you lost? Is there something I might help you find?", "Portals to the various capitals and battlegrounds can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary.", "Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies. If you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.", "Runeweaver Square is a park at the very heart of Dalaran.", "Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant.", "That would be Cartier & Co. Fine Jewelry in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.", "The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city.", "The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide.", "The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing.", "The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.", "The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.", "The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers.", "The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.", "The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor.", "The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran.", "The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers.", "The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran.", "The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran.", "The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing.", "The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.", "The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing.", "The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying. She can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran.", "The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center. The Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts.", "The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Horde cities and battlegrounds.", "The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel.", "There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north.", "There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing.", "There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?", "There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers.", "There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there.", "There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. Look for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in he shapes of axes and shields.", "There is well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers.", "Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran. There is an inn there, as well as portals to the various Alliance cities and battlegrounds.", "Welcome to Dalaran, traveler. Is there something I might help you find?", "What sort of armor?", "What sort of trainer were you trying to find?", "What sort of weapons?", "Which profession trainer were you looking for?", "Which vendor where you seeking?", "You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran.", "You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran. Just mind the Mooreheads' black cat...", "You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran.", "You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.", "You'll want to visit Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.", "You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran. I am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen." },
	["高赫尼"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace. In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my brother. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.", "Welcome, my sister. If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you. There will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you. You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms. It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place." },
	["高达克·枪猎"] = { "You ever tried on Synthebrew Goggles? They're surprisingly uncomfortable!" },
	["高阶修士兰德雷"] = { "<The high abbot studies you a moment and then smiles.> Very well, I know a place, child. You just kiss my ring and let me know when you are ready.", "Then meet me at the entrance to the abbey. I'll be along in short order.", "Yes, my $g son : daughter;?", "Yes, my daughter?", "Yes, my son?" },
	["高阶十字军艾德拉德"] = { "The true crusader is more than just a hero in the battle against evil... he is an exemplar, a rallier to the cause, a champion in the eyes of all his people. As High Crusader, it is my duty to task such men and women with worthy quests." },
	["高阶奥术师西瓦"] = { "You stand before a master of the Arcane. One would be unwise to challenge me. Many corpses have been left ablaze in my wake." },
	["高阶牧师劳瑞娜"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.", "I trust the Light is with you, $N. Is there something that I can I help you with?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["高阶牧师洛汉"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "I hope the Light is with you, $N. Is there anything I can do for you today?", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["高阶牧师玛多妮尔"] = { "The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!", "The time has come, my brother in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!", "The time has come, my sister in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!", "We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day! We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can.", "With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment. This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were! Check with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons. I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!" },
	["高阶督军乌洛"] = { "Only a fool would mock the appearance of my battle-garb. This raiment of well-worn steel is from an ancient place of learning!" },
	["高阶神谕者索乌塞"] = { "This the Great Rain Stone. We keep it safe and bring it shinies and it take care of us. Have more shinies for stone maybe?" },
	["高阶祭司奥戈鲁"] = { "I came to this land to cleanse troubled spirits, but after the attack I fear that my mission has failed. So many have been taken by the wastes. Please, you must help them." },
	["高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克"] = { "Frenzyheart will take land for own. Big-tongues will leave or we kill them good." },
	["高阶附魔师巴尔杜兰"] = { "Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?" },
	["高顿·温德哈姆"] = { "Greetings, and welcome. I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you." },
	["鬼翼"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["魔导师伊东尼斯"] = { "Dar'Khan thinks we'll roll over for the Scourge without putting up a fight. We shall prove him wrong, $N." },
	["魔导师伊拉斯塔"] = { "Sun's Reach is ours. Kael's dogs are on the run... it is time to put them out of their misery!" },
	["魔导师伊蕾比娅"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["魔导师克拉妮·嘉兰诺德"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["魔导师兰德拉·晨行者"] = { "It is shameful that we sin'dorei have lost so much of what we used to call home. It shall not be long before we regain our strength and retake our southern lands back from the Scourge!" },
	["魔导师卡尔琳达"] = { "My husband's been missing for days. We went on this pilgrimage together; we were supposed to finish it together. All this worry has gotten me tapping into mana crystals more often than I really should." },
	["魔导师卡拉狄丝"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["魔导师哈尔蕾奈"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["魔导师哈瑟尔"] = { "What is your business here, $c?" },
	["魔导师坎迪瑞斯"] = { "The Ghostlands will not be won back by military force alone, $N. That's where we magisters come in. Our guile and knowledge of the arcane are unmatched." },
	["魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷"] = { "On behalf of the Sunreavers, I welcome you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing." },
	["魔导师塞雷杜恩"] = { "Did the Scryers send you to contact me? You do not look like a Scryer at all." },
	["魔导师奎尔林提斯"] = { "Where could she possibly be? I sent my apprentice, Shatharia, to the Underlight Mines to the west quite some time ago. We need those ore samples back, and fast or our experiment is going to fail!", "Without delivery of the Underlight ore in such a timely fashion, our research would have failed. Just wait until Shatharia shows her head here again. I've got some interesting tasks for her, you can be sure of it!" },
	["魔导师戴伦尼斯"] = { "Sin'dorei and Forsaken share a common goal in the Ghostlands, $N. Together we shall defeat the Scourge and who knows... perhaps the Forsaken will be valuable allies in our quest to reach Outland." },
	["魔导师提尔加纳"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["魔导师欧德夏"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["魔导师泰罗努斯三世"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["魔导师瑟伊拉"] = { "This is the gateway that Kael's armies used to retreat to the Sunwell. Some of his lapdogs remain here; the Legion has rewarded them in a most... unusual way." },
	["魔导师瓦伦萨斯"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["魔导师索迪耶尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["魔导师艾洛娜"] = { "$N! I hope you're ready to get to work, because there is much for you to do here on Sunstrider Isle. Ever since the destruction of the Sunwell by Arthas and the Scourge, we have been a race adrift on a sea of uncertainty. We teeter on the edge of oblivion. This will change, $c, and you will learn and aid our recovery at the same time. The Outland awaits us!" },
	["魔导师艾米妮尔"] = { "Many an advantage can be gained from getting to know your enemy. Take that lesson to heart, $N. The more we learn about the Scourge the better prepared we are to defeat them." },
	["魔导师艾雷达妮娅"] = { "Can you not see that I am busy here?", "Do not waste my time. What is it you want?", "Yes? What do you want?" },
	["魔导师菲亚琳"] = { "Leaving Kael'thas was the best thing any of us ever did. His followers are too blind or too scared to realize where he's leading them. We, however, are not." },
	["魔导师菲莉丝塔"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["魔导师萨瓦林"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["魔导师达"] = { "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces! The next battle begins in $4354k.", "Greetings, $c. The Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle. The next battle begins in $4354k." },
	["魔导师达斯米尔"] = { "Greetings, $c." },
	["魔导师达斯维瑟"] = { "I hope that Loralthalis is alright, $c. Maybe I should go up to Duskwither Spire myself? Maybe I should have done that in the first place?" },
	["魔导师阿利迪斯"] = { "What is it you want? I'm not one for small talk." },
	["魔导师阿斯塔洛·血誓"] = { "Kael'thas and his felbloods be damned! All we've worked for is gone, but they're fools to think we won't fight back. Already, Lady Liadrin seeks a new source of power for our order. We will not be destroyed so easily." },
	["魔网监护者凯丹尼斯"] = { "Our Sanctums syphon arcane power from ley-line currents that traverse our lands invisible to the naked eye. With the Sunwell gone, they provide us with a steady and reliable source of energy." },
	["魔网监护者薇兰妮亚"] = { "Could night elf saboteurs be behind this? I doubt it. With the load we've been putting on the West Sanctum it was only a matter of time until something went wrong.", "My job consists of one task and one task only: ensuring that the West Sanctum runs smoothly. You'll have to excuse my temper but, as you can see, the situation here is a bit out of hand." },
	["鲁伯特·鲍什"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c.", "It is wise that you humble yourself before me $N in your desire for more warlock knowledge.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["鲁伯特上尉"] = { "Truly, the horrors here surpass those we've endured in the Plaguelands. The Scourge are more powerful now than ever before." },
	["鲁克"] = { "I can instruct you in alchemy. Interested?" },
	["鲁克·驯风者"] = { "Where would you like to fly to?" },
	["鲁克·鹰爪"] = { "Alas, only champions of Darnassus may purchase what I have to offer." },
	["鲁坎·考迪尔"] = { "If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way." },
	["鲁埃克·硬角"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?", "Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.", "Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.", "You seek further instruction in the manipulation of the naaru's power, $n?" },
	["鲁埃姆"] = { "I've never seen so many different kinds of mushrooms in one place. Given enough time, I'm sure I could find a use for all of them." },
	["鲁姆普斯"] = { "Sometimes those damnable blood elves stop by and require some inane reagent or poison. I must keep my stock of such items full at all times lest Lord Illidan get word of the Dragonmaw not cooperating... <Rumpus swallows hard.> We don't want that..." },
	["鲁安达"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?", "I would train you, but you are no warrior.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["鲁库阿"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, brother, but I cannot train you.", "We are one in the Light, sister, but I cannot train you." },
	["鲁恩托格·蛮锤"] = { "Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf. I've never had so much time in the air!" },
	["鲁特加尔·雕石"] = { "Are you daft? Who else would I be talking about? Yes, the girl - Mistress Mar'alith. Anyhow, she was back and not in too good of a mood. That's when the demands started flowing.", "Bronzebeard's gone missing again! That dwarf sure didn't get any of his brother's good senses.", "It sure is! Those hives were abuzz with various silithid that were none to happy to see us. Everything was going fine until we came across a glyphed crystal in Hive'Regal. She was drawn to it like a moth to a flame! She put her pretty little cheek up against the crystal and instantly entered a trance like state. Naturally, this worried my crew. We picked her up and carried her out of there with a quickness!", "She demanded that we immediately head back to Hive'Regal! Brann would have none of that sass. He told her that there's no way we would go back into those hives without an army backing us up. It had gotten far too dangerous. The number of those stinking insects seemed to have tripled from when we first ventured into 'em. That's when Natalia lost it!", "We took her to the Commander with hopes that the druids of the Circle could fix her up. Sure enough, they were able to wake her up. We figured our business with the Circle was done and we could get back to work. A few weeks passed and everything was going fine. Brann was still around back then so we had a bit of order in our work structure. Then one day, out of the blue, she appeared back at our camp.", "What do you mean what do I mean? She went nutso! The girl went straight crazy on us. Now ordinarily I don't hit girls but after I recovered from the blackout, I was pretty damned angry. Brann, Rutgar, me and the monkey went positively orc on her! It's a miracle we were able to fend her off. She seemed almost possessed!", "Who knows? Anyhow, that was the last I saw of her. Maybe Frankal can give you better information. Not to steer off topic here as I'm sure the work you're doing for the Commander is important, but we're onto something huge here. HUGE! Our requests to Ironforge for an army have so far fallen on deaf ears. Apparently we're stretched too thin in protecting the realm or some such nonsense. Once you take your report back to the Commander, come back down here with some friends. We need your help!", "You best have a seat then, this is gonna be a long one. When we initially arrived in Silithus, Mistress Mar'alith was the first of the night elves from Cenarion Hold to join the expedition. Our routine was nothing out of the ordinary: Form a party to venture into the various hives and search for lost artifacts." },
	["鲁玛·天母"] = { "The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r." },
	["鲁玛克"] = { "Fish so delicious. You come learn fish? Eat fish? Mmmmm..." },
	["鲁瓦格"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "I don't train your kind $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory, unhindered by the timidness of the Warchief.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?" },
	["鲁纳尔兰"] = { "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic." },
	["鲁莉尔蕾"] = { "My sisters and I welcome you, $r." },
	["鲁诺克·蛮鬃"] = { "We compete not only for glory, but to bring honor to our ancestors and to our people." },
	["鲁雷斯大使"] = { "Good day to you, $c. I'm waiting to hear from one of the High Thane's advisors about an audience. It was a struggle just to get the opportunity to present my credentials. I've heard the Wildhammer described as 'wary of outsiders,' but that's proven to be quite an understatement. Hopefully, things will improve once I've had the opportunity to meet with Featherbeard, whom I'm told favors closer ties with the Alliance." },
	["鲍尔·蛮鬃"] = { "We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $N. While everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies." },
	["鹰风酋长"] = { "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother. May your ancestors watch over you $c." },
	["麦依兹·拉齐卡"] = { "I can teach you fishing skills.", "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.", "Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\". That is sure to help you increase your skill." },
	["麦克尔"] = { "Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.", "Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions." },
	["麦克斯·克希姆"] = { "All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?", "You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time." },
	["麦尔斯·威尔什"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "Elune be with you, $c.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?" },
	["麦希"] = { "'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!", "Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!", "Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.", "Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!", "Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!", "Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!", "If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!", "Season's savings to you and yours!" },
	["麦拉·黎明之刃"] = { "I WILL have my revenge!" },
	["麦拉斯"] = { "I should find some hired help; I don't like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I'd much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies." },
	["麦洛克斯"] = { "We are all pieces of a much larger puzzle, $N. Just as you guide the piece of a puzzle to its destination, so too are we guided by another. And perhaps they who guide us are themselves guided by an even greater force." },
	["麦迪文的回音"] = { "Now that you have bested me, test your skills against each other! Take control of either king to begin play.", "To pass beyond my Hall, you must defeat me in a game of skill! Control your king when you are ready to begin..." },
	["麦酒学徒"] = { "You won't find a better brew in Azeroth." },
	["麦雷姆·月歌"] = { "I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing. There seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse." },
	["黎娜·斯图瓦"] = { "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?", "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?" },
	["黎明长者"] = { "Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["黑手酋长"] = { "<Warchief Blackhand towers over the field.>" },
	["黑暗游侠玛尔拉"] = { "Make it quick, $r. I am weary and have no time for pleasantries.." },
	["黑暗游侠莉安娜"] = { "By the will of Sylvanas, our enemies will fall.", "It is those two cannons along the wall that are slowing us down. Without their protection our forces would be able to rush their fortification without taking any losses. It's either take out those cannons or wait until they run out of ammunition. Anselm's choice, I suppose.", "It will be a matter of hours before the Alliance in the Derelict Strand are crushed. They are surrounded and outnumbered.", "The stranded Alliance sailors know they're going to die, yet they fight us tooth and nail. Impressive and pathetic at the same time." },
	["黑暗牧师杜斯滕"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?", "Yes, $c?" },
	["黑暗牧师贝里尔"] = { "Congratulations, your mind has been expanded.", "The Dual Talent Specialization allows you to keep two active talent sets. You will be able to easily switch between these two specializations. When you switch between sets, you will also gain access to a second glyph pane and a second set of action bars. Switching cannot be performed while in combat, and will consume your available resources.", "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew. The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done. It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining. Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $N? Training perhaps?", "Yes, $c?" },
	["黑暗缚灵者加科因"] = { "Yes, $c?" },
	["黑暗骑士阿尔蕾"] = { "The Fleshwerks is the heart of the Scourge's ghoul, abomination, and flesh giant production. If we can take it out, the Lich King will be greatly weakened." },
	["黑曜石长者"] = { "Elder Graveborn spends time near Brill in Tirisfal Glades.", "Elder Highpeak watches over the Hinterlands from a hill near its center.", "Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.", "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake." },
	["黑海岸护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["黑特雷尔"] = { "The death of our flesh marked the birth of our spirit and our sacred task." },
	["黑色新娘"] = { "Go, $N, into Arathi Basin! Slay, SLAY, as you've never slain before!", "Thank you for the offer, $c. Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin." },
	["黑铁酿酒师"] = { "Don't bother me, $c! I have two whole cauldrons of bubbling brew here and I must ensure they taste just right! If they don't, then Master Coren Direbrew will flay and boil me!", "I wouldn't do this on any other day, but... I'm thirsty and I hate drinking alone. Bottoms up!", "It's shaping up! But it needs more kick. Yep, you guessed it... Let's wash yesterday's socks in the cauldron... Mmmh, delicious!", "Not bad, not bad... But it's missing spice! How about adding scorpid venom? Yes! That'll fix it right up!", "Oh... I'm feeling groggy...", "This is getting good! It really warms the stomach! And $N, I have to say, you're a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!", "This is getting good! It really warms the stomach! And $N, I have to say, you're a sharp dressing fellow!", "This is getting good! It really warms the stomach! And $N, I have to say, you're a sharp dressing lass!", "This is good stuff! But I think it's a little flat. Let's round it out with a few squishy basilisk eyeballs...", "This is good stuff! But it's a little weak. I think I'll add a little more garlic breath to it..." },
	["黑锋观察者"] = { "What I do for the Argent Crusade now should only be viewed as fulfillment of an obligation. A payment, if you will. The Highlord freed me from the grasp of the Lich King and laid before us all the path to salvation. With that said, it must be understood that our methods differ - greatly. I and the Knights of the Ebon Blade will help the Argent Crusade lay their foundations within Icecrown and then we will part ways. The payment made in full. A different destiny awaits us." },
	["齐格莉德·冰魂"] = { "Do not bother me, pest. I am studying the inept fighting of these so-called combatants. I will best them all, and then I will be elevated to serve the Lich King." },
	["龙喉工头"] = { "You'll find plenty to do here, $N." },
	["龙眠神殿防御者"] = { "Greetings, $r. I have been expecting you.", "Greetings, $r. If you are interested in helping with the defense of the temple, please speak with Lord Afrasastrasz inside.", "Very well, let's go!" },
	["龙骨荒野护火者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
	["龙骨荒野护焰者"] = { "Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame? Remember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can. The Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them." },
};

McodeSTCN_NPC_MENU = {  -- NPC 收敛索引·菜单：中文名 → 该 NPC 的 MENU 词典键
	["UNUSED Nicole Morris"] = { "I'd like to stable my pet here.", "I'm looking for a lost companion.", "I've lost Miniwing.", "I've lost my Jubling.", "I've lost my Prairie Chicken.", "I've lost my Smolderweb hatchling.", "I've lost my sprite darter hatchling.", "I've lost my wolpertinger.", "I've lost my worg pup." },
	["World Stable Master"] = { "I'd like to stable my pet here.", "I'm looking for a lost companion.", "I've lost Miniwing.", "I've lost my Jubling.", "I've lost my Prairie Chicken.", "I've lost my Smolderweb hatchling.", "I've lost my sprite darter hatchling.", "I've lost my wolpertinger.", "I've lost my worg pup." },
	["“万能钥匙”帕兹克·派洛特"] = { "I've lost my Shadowforge Key.", "I've lost my key to Scholomance." },
	["“咸鱼”约翰·索普"] = { "Let me browse your goods." },
	["“国王”唐金"] = { "How do I form an arena team?" },
	["“外乡人”库特·阿尔博森"] = { "I need some booze, Coot." },
	["“小专家”丹尼克·布莱沙弗"] = { "I would like to fight in an arena." },
	["“小个子”洛戈克"] = { "I want to browse your goods.", "Make this inn your home." },
	["“曲奇”米维克索斯"] = { "Let me browse your wares, Cookie.", "Teach me how to cook, Cookie." },
