	["艾米鲁尔·冬风"] = { "Admiral Keller sent me, Emilune. Please send me to Westguard Keep!" },
	["艾索雷葛斯之魂"] = { "A minnow? The oceans are filled with minnows! There could be a hundred million million minnows out there!", "Alright. Where?", "But...", "By Bronzebeard's... um, beard! What are you talking about?", "Come again.", "FINE! And how, dare I ask, am I supposed to acquire an arcanite buoy?", "Fish? You gave a piece of what could be the key to saving all life on Kalimdor to a fish?", "How did you know? I mean, yes... Yes I am looking for that shard. Do you have it?", "I'm all ears.", "Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?", "You put the piece on a minnow and placed the minnow somewhere in the waters of the sea between here and the Eastern Kingdoms? And this minnow has special powers?", "You're insane." },
