	["诺甘农的看门人"] = { "Activate secondary defensive systems.", "Anything else I should know about the Earthen?", "Confirmed.", "Dwarves!!! Now you're telling me that dwarves originally came from the Earthen?!", "I think I understand the Creators' design intent for the Earthen now. What are the Earthen's anomalies that you spoke of earlier?", "I will access the discs now.", "So... the Earthen were made out of stone?", "These dwarves are the same ones today, yes? Do dwarves maintain any other links to the Earthen?", "This is a lot to think about.", "Troggs?! Are the troggs you mention the same as the ones in the world today?", "What are the anomalies you speak of?", "What happens when the Earthen destabilize?", "What high-stress environments would cause the Earthen to destabilize?", "What is a \"resilient foundation of construction\"?", "What is a \"subterranean being matrix\"?", "Who are the Creators?", "Who are the Earthen?", "You mentioned two results when the Earthen destabilize. What is the second?" },
